translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_f49f5cbe:

    # p "Alright, but, there's an eagle sitting there, {i}and?{/i}"
    p "行吧，但那儿明明就蹲着一只鹰，{i}所以呢{/i}？"

# game/script day12.rpy:6788
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_1981cd3d:

    # p "It probably just got caught up in the storm and needs to rest. Don't get me wrong, that's cool to see, but why the rush?"
    p "它多半是遇上暴风雨受了困，停下来歇歇脚而已，我不是觉得这不稀奇，反倒挺难得的，可犯不着这么着急赶路吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:6794
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_757e9a57:

    # s "How can you not be excited about a fucking eagle?!"
    s "你怎么能对一只他妈的鹰不感到兴奋？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:6796
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_38b9b1da:

    # s "It's like {i}this{/i} big!"
    s "它有{i}这么{/i}大！"

# game/script day12.rpy:6798
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_ae5f1bc9:

    # "Samuel turns around as [he] continues to walk backwards, spreading [his] arms to show the size of it."
    "Samuel转过身，倒着往后走，同时张开双臂，比划出它的个头大小"

# game/script day12.rpy:6802
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_6260f248:

    # s "And they want to try to feed it."
    s "而且他们想试着喂它"

# game/script day12.rpy:6804
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_55d17ef4:

    # s "It's going to be a hoot.{w} Trust me, stuff like this always is."
    s "这事准保有意思，{w}相信我，这种事向来都不会无聊"

# game/script day12.rpy:6806
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_cd35f812:

    # "He ducks past a crossbeam even when walking backwards, not even a glance needed to avoid it."
    "他就算倒着走，也能顺势低头躲过横梁，连看都不用看一眼就能避开"

# game/script day12.rpy:6808
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_1dddf7dd:

    # "Probably knows every inch of this ship by heart."
    "大概对这艘船的每一寸都了如指掌"

# game/script day12.rpy:6812
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_fd1c4f3b:

    # "You repeat it just a moment later as your party makes its way to the stairs."
    "在你们一行人走向阶梯时，片刻之后你又重复了一遍。"

# game/script day12.rpy:6816
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_44cec285:

    # j "Must be, if you're dragging us back out into the rain."
    j "那肯定是了，不然也不至于又拖着我们淋雨出去"

# game/script day12.rpy:6820
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_52b2a2e8:

    # s "{i}Him{/i} I'm dragging out because he deserves it after today."
    s "我就是要拖着{i}他{/i}去，谁让他今天折腾了我们，活该跟着受罪"

# game/script day12.rpy:6822
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_43ac4f0f:

    # s "You, though... I guess, you I'm just bringing along because it's funny to hear you moan about it, Jules."
    s "但你就不一样了…… 说实话，我带上你，纯粹就是想听你一路唉声叹气抱怨，还挺有意思的，Jules"

# game/script day12.rpy:6826
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_974df823:

    # s "Maybe I just really love hearing you moan about it, Jules?"
    s "也许我只是真的很爱听你抱怨呢，Jules？"

# game/script day12.rpy:6828
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_c11a33cf:

    # j "Very funny."
    j "真有意思"

# game/script day12.rpy:6830
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_22028310:

    # j "Do you know how easily we lizards get cold?{w} I'm not just moaning about it because it's oh so much fun."
    j "你知道我们蜥蜴有多容易受冻吗？{w}我抱怨可不是觉得好玩闲得慌。"

# game/script day12.rpy:6832
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_9ce5e922:

    # p "Do you really think our fur is some magical \"never-get-cold\" magic?{w} All it does out in the rain is get soaked and heavy-"
    p "你真以为我们一身毛是什么‘永远不冷’的灵丹妙药？{w}在大雨里它只会吸饱了水、沉重得像铅块一样——"

# game/script day12.rpy:6836
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_7d4b0152:

    # s "Will you two stop moaning already?"
    s "你们俩能别抱怨了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:6838
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_ffd8f01d:

    # s "You're sailors. I got some important information for you. You're going to get wet..."
    s "你们可是水手。我有条顶要紧的常识告诉你们：你们注定会淋成落汤鸡……"

# game/script day12.rpy:6840
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_cfa0b856:

    # s "I didn't realize that whoever recruited you never told you about it."
    s "我还真没看出来，当初招你的人，居然从没跟你提过这事"

# game/script day12.rpy:6842
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_7fc491ef:

    # "Sam finishes the sentence with a turn on [his] heel and hurries up the stairs out into the wall of rain, followed by you, and reluctantly, Julian."
    "Sam说完话猛地转身，快步冲上楼梯，扎进漫天密雨里，你跟在后面，Julian则一脸不情不愿地紧随其后"

# game/script day12.rpy:6856
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_6d5d4ff0:

    # "You peer over at an inquisitive, but seemingly unsuspecting Nomax, and answer in a similarly hushed whisper."
    "你转头看向满脸好奇且丝毫没有起疑心的Nomax，同样压低了声音，小声低声回应"

# game/script day12.rpy:6858
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_9ac7da83:

    # p "Sorry, Jules. But I don't think this is really the time for me."
    p "抱歉，Jules，但我觉得现在真不是时候"

# game/script day12.rpy:6860
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_0d724a51:

    # j "Really?"
    j "真的假的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:6862
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_d20b7929:

    # "He waits for a few seconds, hoping you might change your mind."
    "他等了几秒钟，希望你可能改变主意"

# game/script day12.rpy:6864
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_bb6021aa:

    # j "Understood."
    j "明白了"

# game/script day12.rpy:6866
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_0881e22b:

    # "You see Julian's muzzle in your periphery as he pushes past you, propping himself up on his elbows."
    "你眼角余光扫到Julian的口鼻，他从你身边挤了过去，用双肘支撑起身体"

# game/script day12.rpy:6875
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_655dcd87:

    # j "No secrets."
    j "没有秘密"

# game/script day12.rpy:6877
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_30e24757:

    # n "Sounds awfully like you're keeping a secret."
    n "听起来倒像是你在隐瞒什么秘密"

# game/script day12.rpy:6879
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_45050385:

    # "He pries a little further, tipping his head to the side."
    "他进一步打探，把头歪向一边"

# game/script day12.rpy:6883
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_19c78358:

    # j "Nosy, aren't you?"
    j "很爱打听吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:6885
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_bbf7043f:

    # n "You two whisper to each other and then you tell me there are no secrets. It's hardly my fault that that makes me curious."
    n "你们俩偷偷咬耳朵，还跟我说没什么秘密，换谁都会好奇，这可不能怪我"

# game/script day12.rpy:6894
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_4941cc3a:

    # j "Well, fine, do you want the innocent version or the true one?{p}Actually never mind, I asked [name] if he wanted to join."
    j "行吧，你想听客套敷衍的说法，还是实话实说的版本？{p}算了不提了，我就是问问[name]，看他愿不愿意一起来"

# game/script day12.rpy:6898
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_50050a4c:

    # "Julian shrugs dismissively and shoots you a quick glance before continuing."
    "Julian无所谓地耸耸肩，迅速扫了你一眼，接着便继续开口"

# game/script day12.rpy:6900
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_b09d34fb:

    # j "But he's not feeling it.{p}You're in luck, and that snout of yours will remain saddeningly unused."
    j "但他没兴趣，{p}算你侥幸，可惜你这张嘴，终究没机会派上用场了"

# game/script day12.rpy:6908
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_90108a28:

    # "Nomax looks as if he regrets his curiosity immediately. He doesn't manage to utter a real answer and just gives an uncertain chuckle in return."
    "Nomax刚好奇完就立马后悔了，他一时不知该如何作答，只能含糊地讪讪干笑两声"

# game/script day12.rpy:6918
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_846384f1:

    # "A few knocks on the door interrupts you, all three heads turning towards it."
    "门外传来几声敲门声，打断了你们的对话，三人同时扭头朝门口望去"

# game/script day12.rpy:6920
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_667ddea1:

    # p "I guess I saved us some embarrassment."
    p "我想我帮我们免去了一些尴尬"

# game/script day12.rpy:6922
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_af8a16b2:

    # j "Or maybe they just want to join, and you just made sure someone will leave very disappointed."
    j "也说不定人家只是想入伙而已，你这么一做反倒注定有人要失望而归了"

# game/script day12.rpy:6926
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_aa1035be:

    # "Another round of knocking follows, a little more insistent this time, with the door almost getting pushed open by them."
    "紧接着又是一阵敲门声，这次来得更急切，门外的人差点直接把门给推开"

# game/script day12.rpy:6928
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_a7632675:

    # s "Yo, Jules, [name], I can hear you in there. You got to come see this!"
    s "嘿，Jules，[name]，我听见你们在里面了，赶紧出来看看这个！"

# game/script day12.rpy:6935
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_2d55155c:

    # j "I can't promise anything, but at least you'd only have to deal with my hauntings until the end of your journey."
    j "我没法给你任何保证，但起码你只需要被我缠着，熬完这段旅程就行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:6937
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_de2db79d:

    # j "The others?"
    j "其他人呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:6941
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_a7e59b3a:

    # j "No escape."
    j "同样无处可逃"

# game/script day12.rpy:6951
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_8eb3f12b:

    # "A sudden knock grabs your attention, and the heads of the other two turn to the door just the same."
    "忽然一阵敲门声吸引了你的注意，另外两人也不约而同转头看向门口"

# game/script day12.rpy:6960
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_de9b1f1b:

    # j "Speaking of hauntings."
    j "说到纠缠"

# game/script day12.rpy:6969
translate Chinese day12_julian_seedmorocco_4e287f18:

    # s "Yo, Jules, [name], you in there? You got to come see this!"
    s "嘿，Jules，[name]，你们在里面吗？赶紧出来看看这个！"

# game/script day12.rpy:6981
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_5f4e3798:

    # j "See what?"
    j "看什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:6985
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_ef1e6f62:

    # s "Well, whatever, get a move on, you've got to see this!"
    s "哎呀不管了，麻溜点挪步子，你们必须亲眼瞧瞧这个！"

# game/script day12.rpy:6987
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_7951b481:

    # p "See what?"
    p "瞧什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:6989
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_ed103216:

    # "You begin to feel a bit stupid shouting through the door and turn to Nomax."
    "隔着门这么大声嚷嚷你自己都觉得有点傻，于是转头望向Nomax"

# game/script day12.rpy:6991
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_2391bdcd:

    # p "Can-... can he come in?"
    p "他——他能进来吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:6993
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_83dffa0c:

    # n "Of course."
    n "当然"

# game/script day12.rpy:6998
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_b6c8259b:

    # p "Sam, you can come in-"
    p "Sam，你可以进来的——"

# game/script day12.rpy:7004
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_1946608c:

    # "Samuel pushes the door open in a hurry and steps through it excitedly, though thoroughly soaked."
    "Samuel慌忙推开房门，兴冲冲走了进来，尽管整个人已经淋得浑身湿透"

# game/script day12.rpy:7006
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_e04eb98b:

    # "Immediately a puddle forms where [he] stands, [his] fur hanging off of [him], soaking wet as [he] beckons you all to follow."
    "他脚下立刻积出一滩水，皮毛湿哒哒地贴垂在身上，浑身湿透，他抬手示意你们全都跟他走"

# game/script day12.rpy:7019
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_ef740eca:

    # s "Oh, just come on, will you? Or they'll do it before you get back."
    s "赶紧走吧行不行？再拖下去，不等你们回去，他们就先动手了"

# game/script day12.rpy:7021
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_71a75ae6:

    # p "Do what?{w} Just spit out what you want."
    p "做什么？{w} 有话直说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7023
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_e0945742:

    # s "They want to try to feed an eagle on deck!"
    s "他们想在甲板上喂一只鹰！"

# game/script day12.rpy:7025
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_c9294660:

    # p "Feed an eagle?"
    p "喂鹰？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7029
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_74c8c2aa:

    # s "Or hawk,{w} falcon,{w} I don't bloody know! Ask him!"
    s "要么是鹰，{w}要么是隼，{w}我他妈上哪知道！你直接去问他！"

# game/script day12.rpy:7033
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_86fe52dd:

    # "[He] gestures to Nomax."
    "他指向Nomax"

# game/script day12.rpy:7037
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_3d763b2e:

    # j "He's a botanist.{w} Plants, Sam."
    j "他是植物学家，{w} 植物，Sam"

# game/script day12.rpy:7041
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_96077f57:

    # p "Sam, he's a botanist. Well, I guess they are somewhat adjacent fields, but I'm not sure that means he's an expert on eagles and hawks..."
    p "Sam，他是植物学家，嗯，这两门专业顶多算沾点边而已，可这不代表他就懂老鹰或者是隼类这些啊"

# game/script day12.rpy:7045
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_ccc36db1:

    # n "Yes, my expertise lies in the plant kingdom, and I must admit that, yes, I would probably have trouble distinguishing between those birds."
    n "没错，我专攻植物领域，老实说，我确实不太分得清这些鸟类"

# game/script day12.rpy:7049
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_2d149088:

    # s "Will you just move already?!"
    s "你们到底走不走？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:7063
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_11b1d716:

    # "Julian jumps up from the bed and slips past Samuel to the door."
    "Julian从床上跳起来，轻巧绕过Samuel，快步走到门口"

# game/script day12.rpy:7065
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_ab93d434:

    # j "You sold me, sounds like I should see this."
    j "你说服我了，听起来我该去看看"

# game/script day12.rpy:7069
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_8f0bd2f6:

    # j "Get your behind up here, [name]."
    j "快把你的屁股挪过来，[name]"

# game/script day12.rpy:7071
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_5967efdf:

    # p "You're just going to leave him?"
    p "你就这么把他丢下？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7075
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_dc838dd6:

    # j "Leave him?"
    j "丢下他？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7081
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_83894e70:

    # "Julian looks back at Nomax and demonstratively scans him for two or three seconds."
    "Julian回头望向Nomax，刻意上下打量了他两三秒钟"

# game/script day12.rpy:7083
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_681ed30f:

    # j "He is a big boy and got two legs.{w} He can come along if he wants to."
    j "他都长大了，又不是没长腿，{w}想去的话跟着一起来就行"

# game/script day12.rpy:7085
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_299a18f4:

    # j "The eagle won't stay forever and I want to see it."
    j "那只鹰不会永远待在那儿，我想去看看"

# game/script day12.rpy:7088
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_3061771c:

    # p "I can't just leave him, though."
    p "不过，我不能就这么丢下他"

# game/script day12.rpy:7090
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_d32be5ab:

    # "Nomax stands up and encourages you to go alone with a wave of his hand."
    "Nomax站起身摆了摆手，示意你一个人去就好"

# game/script day12.rpy:7094
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_5a93ec11:

    # n "No, please, you two go ahead. An eagle sounds rather exciting, and I am not at risk of running away."
    n "不用了，你们俩先去吧，老鹰这事听着就挺有意思，我也不会随便跑掉的"

# game/script day12.rpy:7096
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_3b3a648c:

    # "He picks up one of the used cups to give it a quick visual inspection, before then lifting the can to see if any tea remains."
    "他拿起一只用过的杯子，快速看了一眼，接着提起茶罐，检查里面还剩没有茶水"

# game/script day12.rpy:7098
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_2d234673:

    # n "Besides, I have to clean up the tea set anyway."
    n "再说，反正我也得收拾茶具"

# game/script day12.rpy:7100
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_c9e3d6df:

    # s "You don't want to come along?"
    s "你不想一起来吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7104
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_4e1836b5:

    # n "Uh, I am afraid I have not packed for stormy weather, and I do not think that it is a good idea for me to go out on deck right now."
    n "呃，我没带能应付暴风雨的衣物，现在这个时候去甲板上，实在不太合适"

# game/script day12.rpy:7106
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_7fb3457c:

    # n "Nor am I feeling too sick right now, but I fear that if I move around, it might just make it worse again."
    n "我现在倒也不算很难受，但就怕四处走动折腾，情况又会重新加重"

# game/script day12.rpy:7110
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_16453d65:

    # n "But, you two can tell me how the feeding went."
    n "不过，你们俩可以告诉我喂食的情况"

# game/script day12.rpy:7116
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_2f4627b0:

    # p "Do you mind us leaving to see that?"
    p "你介意我们离开去看那个吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7118
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_0c83af3f:

    # n "Of course, I will still be here later."
    n "当然不，我晚些时候还会在这里"

# game/script day12.rpy:7120
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_8b32c644:

    # "As you get up from the bed, you realize that Julian and Samuel have already left, and you jump to your feet to chase after them!"
    "你从床上坐起来，发现Julian和Samuel已经走了，立刻一跃而起，追了出去"

# game/script day12.rpy:7124
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_dab67343:

    # p "Alright, I will. Thank you very much for the tea, Nomax."
    p "好吧，我会的，非常感谢你的茶，Nomax"

# game/script day12.rpy:7129
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_5cfe6e4b:

    # s "Shall we?"
    s "我们走吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7131
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_99828026:

    # "Samuel is already halfway through the door, anxiously waiting for you to get moving."
    "Samuel整个人已经半个跨出门外，正着急等着赶紧出发"

# game/script day12.rpy:7133
translate Chinese day12_transition_from_nomax_to_outside_e932ec9e:

    # "You quickly hop to your feet and hurry after [him] through the door and to the open deck."
    "你立刻跳起来，紧随他身后出门，直奔露天甲板而去"

# game/script day12.rpy:7165
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d3880163:

    # "Staying below deck for a moment longer was too much."
    "在甲板下多待一刻都难以忍受"

# game/script day12.rpy:7167
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_88e0bdcf:

    # "They all just went along like nothing happened. And well, for most of them, nothing did happen. But that was your point. This was hardly the camaraderie you'd dreamed of finding. Each moment of indifference stung."
    "他们全都装作没事人一样照常度日，说实话，这对大部分人来说，确实什么都没发生，但这正是你在意的地方，这根本不是你梦寐以求的伙伴情谊，旁人每一次的冷漠都像针扎一样难受"

# game/script day12.rpy:7169
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b9154f75:

    # "What a fool you'd been."
    "你真是个傻瓜"

# game/script day12.rpy:7171
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e668a5a9:

    # "The sour turn of that dream felt real enough to make you curl your tone, but there weren't really words for what you wanted to say."
    "梦想急转直下的酸涩太过真切，连你的语气都不由得带上怅然，可心里那份感受，却怎么也找不到合适的话来形容"

# game/script day12.rpy:7173
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_c019c3d0:

    # "So, you grind your teeth and clench your fists."
    "于是，你咬紧牙关，握紧拳头"

# game/script day12.rpy:7177
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_51715a13:

    # "Pain lances up your arm sharply. You stop tensing just as quickly, but the pain turns to a dull throb that's slow to fade. Still, it felt oddly satisfying, in some bitter way."
    "尖锐的刺痛猛地窜上手臂，你立刻停止用力，可刺痛转为沉闷的钝感，迟迟消不下去，但说不清为何，这份痛楚在苦涩之余，竟有几分莫名的释然"

# game/script day12.rpy:7179
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_33aded7c:

    # "You just wanted some space."
    "你只是想要一点空间"

# game/script day12.rpy:7181
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_fb614c18:

    # "Storm be damned."
    "去他妈的暴风雨"

# game/script day12.rpy:7183
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_36e1ad89:

    # "It wasn't like the ship rolled about that much anymore. Surely this wasn't much for a seasoned sailor?"
    "船已经没那么大幅度摇晃了，这点风浪对老水手来说根本算不上什么吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7185
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_631a594c:

    # "You climb through the bowels of the ship, ignoring the flickers of activity that in turn, ignore you. Glimpses of fur in various sodden states, the roll of dice, the cackle of bets made and won and lost."
    "你在船舱底层缓步穿行，无视身边各处零星的动静，旁人也全然懒得理会你，满眼尽是皮毛湿漉的身影，骰子叮咚作响，赌徒们随着输赢起落，一阵阵狂笑喧嚷"

# game/script day12.rpy:7187
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b35bd47a:

    # "No one cares to stop you."
    "没人在意你，没人阻拦你"

# game/script day12.rpy:7198
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f235cd7e:

    # "You grab the hatch overhead with your good hand and give it a few awkward shoves, before popping it open only to be greeted by a wall of heavy rain."
    "你用还没受伤的那只手抓住头顶舱门，别扭地推了好几下，猛地将它掀开，瞬间就被扑面而来的瓢泼大雨迎面罩住"

# game/script day12.rpy:7201
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_bb2e7c4a:

    # "You grab the hatch overhead and give it a satisfying shove, only to be greeted by a wall of rain pelting your face."
    "你抓住头顶舱门，猛地将它掀开，瞬间就被扑面而来的瓢泼大雨迎面罩住"

# game/script day12.rpy:7203
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ab38ed28:

    # "But... It is quiet out there."
    "但是……外面很安静"

# game/script day12.rpy:7205
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_c819fb6b:

    # "Wonderful."
    "太好了"

# game/script day12.rpy:7207
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_1cbdf0e0:

    # "You slip out and close the hatch behind you. It's still dark out here, barely a ray of sunshine breaking through the thick, heavy clouds that streak across the sky."
    "你悄悄走出舱口，顺手关上身后的舱门，外面依旧天色阴沉，厚重乌云漫布长空，几乎见不到一丝阳光穿透云层"

# game/script day12.rpy:7209
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_1ab16aa0:

    # "Your paws are immediately wet as the comfortably warm water runs over the deck. Here and there, the rain collects across the deck in a number of shifting pools, reflecting what little daylight pierces the clouds."
    "温热的雨水淌过甲板，你的脚掌立刻就湿了，甲板各处积着片片晃动的水洼，浅浅倒映着穿透云层的微弱天光"

# game/script day12.rpy:7211
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_80b0c9ad:

    # "For a moment you just stand there."
    "有那么一会儿，你就单单只是站在那里"

# game/script day12.rpy:7213
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_dc8052df:

    # "Lost in the silence, the roar from the storm and sea."
    "万籁俱寂间，只剩狂风暴雨与大海在呼啸咆哮"

# game/script day12.rpy:7215
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_fd9c3166:

    # "No voices."
    "没有人声"

# game/script day12.rpy:7217
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e63be3f6:

    # "No other sounds, or other scents."
    "没有其他声音，也没有其他气味"

# game/script day12.rpy:7219
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_9d7bee72:

    # "Just you, and your thoughts."
    "只有你，和你的思绪"

# game/script day12.rpy:7221
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a7aea639:

    # "The rain keeps pelting your body. In but a minute you're soaked to the core, causing your fur to sag and fall over your eyes. Occasionally the world blurs as a big drop of water falls in front of them, but you don't mind."
    "暴雨不停拍打着你的身躯，转瞬之间便淋得通透湿透，毛发湿重垂落，遮住眉眼，偶尔雨珠挡在眼前，视线一片朦胧，你却毫不在意"

# game/script day12.rpy:7223
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6a5894b1:

    # "You watch masts shift above you as you balance yourself on the rolling deck, while the ship pitches between the waves."
    "海浪跌宕，船身起伏，你在摇晃的甲板上稳住重心，仰头望着上方桅杆不住摇摆晃动"

# game/script day12.rpy:7225
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_213698e9:

    # "Only a small portion of the sails remain in place, pulled tight by the wind and dragging the ship through the storm."
    "仅剩一小部分船帆还完好绷立，被狂风扯得紧绷，拖着整艘船在风暴中破浪前行"

# game/script day12.rpy:7230
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_c0f7d37d:

    # "You take one step forward."
    "你向前迈出一步"

# game/script day12.rpy:7232
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6f54ddd5:

    # "Then another, finding a delicate balance as you feel your way through the pitch and roll of the ceaseless waves."
    "你又踏出一步，稳稳拿捏住微妙平衡，在波涛不停的起伏颠簸中，凭感觉缓步前行"

# game/script day12.rpy:7236
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8357eed4:

    # "It's more your instinctual, feline grace than any seafaring skill, but it feels like a reminder of what perhaps could have been. If only it'd turned out differently."
    "这并非是航海技能，而是猫科动物天生一般的灵动身姿与本能优雅，这一瞬却莫名提醒着你，本该拥有另一种人生，只可惜世事没能如愿改写"

# game/script day12.rpy:7238
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_2fbde076:

    # "Still. What's done is done. You just move with the sway, going nowhere in particular, just following the movements of the storm, and the ocean beneath you."
    "事已至此，覆水难收，你任由身体跟着船身晃动，没有特定去向，只是任凭风暴与身下大海的起伏顺势而动"

# game/script day12.rpy:7240
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_de7ab9fd:

    # "You'd heard sometimes that there was solace to be found in surrendering to things much larger than yourself, and perhaps the ocean at least would offer such cryptic comfort."
    "你曾有耳闻，向远超自身的宏大事物低头顺从便能寻到内心的安宁，或许这片大海，总能给到这般玄妙又隐晦的抚慰"

# game/script day12.rpy:7242
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_aa35fa95:

    # "You walk past the main mast, letting your hand run along the waterlogged lines secured at its base."
    "你行过主桅杆，伸手缓缓抚过桅底固定着的湿漉漉的绳索"

# game/script day12.rpy:7244
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_4571b147:

    # "All neatly tied and put together with such practised precision. Could you have done that so quickly, and without a second thought?"
    "一切绑扎得整整齐齐，手法娴熟，你不禁自问，自己能否也做得这般迅捷，而且毫不犹豫？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7246
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_09663a9b:

    # "As you move around the front of the secured jolly boat, a hint of white linen catches your attention."
    "你绕到拴牢的小艇前方，忽然瞥见一抹白色亚麻布的踪影"

# game/script day12.rpy:7248
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_51c2cffa:

    # "Was it a hastily cached sail?"
    "是匆忙藏起来的船帆吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7250
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_9ed4bb95:

    # "The idea that someone could have been so sloppy with their sheetwork and not have gotten chewed out burned at the back of your throat."
    "一想到有人可能在帆缆作业上如此马虎却还没被骂个狗血淋头，一股无名火涌上你的喉咙"

# game/script day12.rpy:7252
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_bf762688:

    # "You lean down and look under the upturned boat..."
    "你俯身看向那艘翻倒的小船下面……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7258
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_22df9496:

    # "... And come face to face with Wolf."
    "……与Wolf打了个照面"

# game/script day12.rpy:7260
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_cca84f4f:

    # "Dripping black fur, snarl and all."
    "黑毛湿透淌水，周身戾气尽显，低吼嘶吼分毫不减"

# game/script day12.rpy:7262
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ab7d2390:

    # p "What the hell are {i}you{/i} doing here?!"
    p "你他妈在这儿干什么？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:7266
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_23f5011c:

    # "He calmed down quickly, eyes flicking between invisible points as he concluded that you probably weren't here to cause him trouble."
    "他迅速冷静下来，眼神在虚空中来回扫视，暗自断定你应该不是来招惹麻烦的"

# game/script day12.rpy:7268
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b9cfe4c1:

    # w "Resting."
    w "休息"

# game/script day12.rpy:7270
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_fb83acd6:

    # p "Out here?{w} In a storm?!"
    p "在这儿？{w} 在暴风雨里？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:7272
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_574f67f8:

    # "You want to laugh, but you do a fine job holding back any hint of derision. Not that Wolf would tolerate you doing so anyway."
    "你忍不住想发笑，却极力压下所有讥讽的神色，说到底，Wolf本就绝不会容忍你这般嘲弄他"

# game/script day12.rpy:7274
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_77c9bbbf:

    # "He looks at you as if you're the odd one. Even with the boat as a cover he is dripping wet just the same, with no way to escape the spray of the waves as they slosh about between the deck and the gunwale."
    "他看你的眼神，反倒像是在觉得你古怪反常，即便躲在小艇后方遮雨，他照样浑身湿透滴水，海浪在甲板与船舷间拍荡飞溅，根本避不开漫天浪花水雾"

# game/script day12.rpy:7278
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_eb124775:

    # w "It was pleasantly quiet until just now."
    w "到刚才为止还挺安静的"

# game/script day12.rpy:7280
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f54376e9:

    # p "Of course..."
    p "当然了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7282
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_1ce246b6:

    # "Perhaps his company would be just the right thing right now?"
    "或许此时此刻，有他作伴反倒刚刚好"

# game/script day12.rpy:7284
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b54e5043:

    # "The thought of being cooped up under the boat isn't looking so bad. Certainly better than taking the full force of the storm."
    "躲进船底暂避风雨，似乎也未尝不可，总好过硬生生直面风暴的猛烈冲击"

# game/script day12.rpy:7286
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_c7db7799:

    # "At least it beat heading back inside and facing the other's questions."
    "至少比回到舱内面对其他人的盘问强"

# game/script day12.rpy:7288
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_489c3a8b:

    # p "Mind if I join? {w}I'll shut up, too."
    p "介意我凑过来吗？{w}我也保证闭嘴不说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7292
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a4a0fbba:

    # "You quickly add the second part as soon as you notice his features sharpen slightly into a grimace."
    "一注意到他的脸色微沉、眉头皱起，你立刻机灵地补上了后半句。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7294
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6bbaefd9:

    # "Even with your peace offering, it still takes a few seconds before he allows you to join. His acquiescence is barely perceptible among the whistle and spray of the storm."
    "即便你主动递出了橄榄枝，他也依然沉默了几秒才默许你靠近。在暴风雨的呼啸与水雾中，他的默许微弱得几不可闻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7309
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_221886e4:

    # "You duck under the gunwale of the overturned boat and scoot underneath it. Though now being underneath here you realize that it's not exactly a spot with a wealth of options for comfortable seating."
    "你矮身钻过翻倒小艇的船舷，挪到船底下方避身，可进到里面才发现，这里空间逼仄，根本没什么舒服落座的余地"

# game/script day12.rpy:7311
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_4f0c453e:

    # "Especially for you..."
    "尤其对你而言……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7313
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e6b6c55f:

    # "You try to slowly lean back against the wooden frame, but the nail prodding your lower back just hurts too much that you realize you can't sit like that."
    "你想缓缓靠向木架，不料铁钉死死顶着后腰，刺痛难耐，只好放弃这般坐姿"

# game/script day12.rpy:7315
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_c6277d9c:

    # "Instead, you lean forward."
    "于是你向前倾"

# game/script day12.rpy:7319
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ecfab4b0:

    # "You duck under the gunwale of the overturned boat and scoot underneath it. The wooden frame it's attached to isn't exactly comfortable to lean against, and you feel a nail prodding your lower back, but you make do."
    "你俯身钻过翻倒的船舷，躲到小艇底下，支撑的木架靠着并不舒服，还有铁钉顶着后腰，你也只能凑合着忍了"

# game/script day12.rpy:7326
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_2cade12a:

    # "For minutes the two of you just sit there."
    "数分钟里，你们就这样静坐着"

# game/script day12.rpy:7328
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_12f8b3f7:

    # "Not a single word exchanged."
    "没有交换只言片语"

# game/script day12.rpy:7330
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e72539d2:

    # "Just huddled up underneath the boat, almost lost among the sea."
    "只是蜷缩在船底，几乎湮没于茫茫海天之间"

# game/script day12.rpy:7334
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_bf558472:

    # "You feel over the back of your injured hand, squeezing your knuckles to test if the pain continues to flare up, and stopping immediately when it does."
    "你摩挲着受伤的手背，轻握指关节试探痛感是否还会发作，一旦疼意涌上，当即停住不动"

# game/script day12.rpy:7336
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_1a595e9c:

    # "You notice movement in your peripheral vision when Wolf looks at what you're doing, though of course staying stumm as he does."
    "你眼角余光察觉到异动，Wolf正望着你的一举一动，但全程却缄口不言"

# game/script day12.rpy:7338
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a51e8f79:

    # "The impact of every single raindrop resonates through the wooden dome above you. Isolated in a way, but not entirely removed from it all."
    "雨滴逐一敲打头顶木质棚顶，声声回荡，你有几分与世隔绝之感，却又并未彻底抽离这风雨人间"

# game/script day12.rpy:7340
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_5e7ee176:

    # "All your senses are flooded with the sensations of the weather."
    "所有感官都被天气的触感浸透"

# game/script day12.rpy:7342
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_92b703b2:

    # "The sting of saltwater in your eyes. The smell of it too. Muddled with the freshwater scent of the rain. The faint smell of the pitch and tar waterproofing the boat's hull. And of course, the strong smell of wet fur—yourself, and Wolf."
    "海水咸涩刺目，咸腥气息萦绕鼻间，混着雨水清润的气息，船壳防水的沥青焦油，飘着浅淡焦味，更有浓重的湿毛气味，萦绕在你与Wolf的身上"

# game/script day12.rpy:7346
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_bc0030e3:

    # "You stretch out one of your legs briefly, before hurriedly deciding to reverse course once you feel the rain hitting it."
    "你短暂伸开一条腿，雨水一淋到腿脚，便立刻慌忙收回"

# game/script day12.rpy:7348
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_dbbff5f3:

    # w "{alpha=0.3}Why are you here?{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.3}你为什么来这儿？{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:7355
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_3c719703:

    # "He whispers it at first, and only gets your confused look in return. After all, you had promised not to disturb him further."
    "起初只是耳语，只换来你困惑的眼神，毕竟你承诺过不再打扰他"

# game/script day12.rpy:7357
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_36b9a3a7:

    # w "Why are you here?"
    w "你为什么来这儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7359
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ff26a69b:

    # "The repetition makes it clear to you that yes, Wolf did actually want to talk."
    "他再三做出暗示，你已然了解，Wolf确实是想开口交谈"

# game/script day12.rpy:7361
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_4a0d09a3:

    # p "Oh... Same as you I suppose.{p}Getting away from the others."
    p "……想来我跟你也一样，{p}只想躲开其他人静静待着"

# game/script day12.rpy:7365
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_81608c29:

    # w "Hmm..."
    w "哼……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7367
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_4a875baf:

    # p "Yeah..."
    p "是啊……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7374
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b282744c:

    # "You leave it at that, still unsure whether he actually really wanted to talk, or was just trying to be kind. Considering how things had gone for you, it wasn't entirely surprising."
    "你就此打住，依旧分不清他是真心想交谈，还是仅仅出于客气，以你一路走来的经历而言，有这种顾虑也不足为奇"

# game/script day12.rpy:7376
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6c6160aa:

    # "Almost half a minute passes before he speaks up again."
    "沉寂近半分钟后他才再度开口"

# game/script day12.rpy:7380
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_284b1e61:

    # w "That doesn't sound like you."
    w "这可不像你"

# game/script day12.rpy:7389
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_5f815775:

    # p "What do you mean?"
    p "你这话是什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7391
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_2943d406:

    # p "You know yourself that I enjoy some quiet moments."
    p "你也应该知道我也喜欢独处时光"

# game/script day12.rpy:7395
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_3b162d84:

    # w "Maybe..."
    w "也许吧……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7397
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_4a941175:

    # w "Though, so far you usually used them as an excuse to talk to me."
    w "只不过到现在为止，你向来都是拿这些当借口，借机跟我说话"

# game/script day12.rpy:7401
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_2bbe40f6:

    # w "But seeing you walk around on your own?{w} That's new."
    w "但看你这般独自四处走动？{w}倒是很少见"

# game/script day12.rpy:7403
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_267cb05c:

    # w "Then I ask again, why are you here?"
    w "那我再问一次，你为什么来这儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7407
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_84d491f2:

    # p "Perhaps..."
    p "或许……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7409
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e3de2bb4:

    # w "Then, why are you here?"
    w "那么，你为什么来这儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7412
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f1850ce5:

    # "You sigh and rest your head on your shoulder."
    "你叹息着将头靠上肩膀"

# game/script day12.rpy:7415
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_9ad13434:

    # "You sigh and let the back of your head bump against the wood you are leaning against."
    "你轻轻叹了口气，后脑顺势往靠着的木架上轻轻一靠"

# game/script day12.rpy:7417
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a01ae304:

    # p "Today has been fucking awful, Wolf."
    p "对我来说今天糟糕透了，Wolf"

# game/script day12.rpy:7419
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_984fee75:

    # p "That's why I'm here."
    p "所以我来这儿"

# game/script day12.rpy:7421
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_15ec01ba:

    # "Again, Wolf lets the silence stretch out between the two of you."
    "Wolf再度缄口不言，任由沉默在你们二人之间慢慢弥漫开来"

# game/script day12.rpy:7423
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_80fd8ef9:

    # "First he flicks an ear. Then he takes a short breath, biting his lip, one fang slipping free."
    "他先抖了下耳朵，跟着短促吸气，轻咬唇角，一枚獠牙微微露了出来"

# game/script day12.rpy:7427
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e5cfb391:

    # w "The storm?"
    w "因为这场风暴？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7429
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_5a6320eb:

    # "He sniffs the air between you cautiously."
    "他谨慎地嗅了嗅你们之间的氛围"

# game/script day12.rpy:7431
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d08ad1c2:

    # "At first it feels futile. It's cold and wet, the salt from the spray cutting through anything else."
    "起初只觉得徒劳无益，四下阴冷潮湿，飞溅浪花的咸腥凛冽，盖过了所有别的知觉"

# game/script day12.rpy:7433
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_dec968e7:

    # "Then on your next breath, you become acutely aware of the pungent scent of wet canine. On your next breath after that, you realize you're not in such a great position to talk."
    "再一次呼吸，浓烈刺鼻的湿漉漉狼兽气息清晰钻入鼻尖，紧跟着下一瞬，你意识到眼下这般处境，并不适合开口说话"

# game/script day12.rpy:7437
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_329e0c56:

    # p "No..."
    p "不……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7439
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_054fa83d:

    # "Wolf dips his muzzle—just once, and slowly, in a reserved nod."
    "Wolf垂下口鼻，只缓缓颔首一下，神色拘谨而含蓄"

# game/script day12.rpy:7441
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_9d6e6332:

    # w "The ship?"
    w "因为这艘船？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7443
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ba4e32ba:

    # "You take a deep, fortifying breath. He actually really seems to want to talk to you about it."
    "你深吸一口气，稳住心绪，他看上去是真的打算和你好好谈谈这件事"

# game/script day12.rpy:7445
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_7122c843:

    # "You frown and rub your head."
    "你皱眉揉了揉额头"

# game/script day12.rpy:7447
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_0cf1e895:

    # w "You said you wanted to get away from everyone."
    w "你说过你想远离所有人"

# game/script day12.rpy:7449
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_281ffc4a:

    # "Huddled inside the boat, rain and water... It feels like the perfect moment too. After all, if anyone was going to probably agree with what you had to say, you'd put your money on Wolf."
    "蜷缩躲在船下，雨声潺潺，水汽弥漫……此刻恰好是最合适谈心的时刻，说到底，若有谁能理解并认同你的想法，你最笃定的人便是Wolf"

# game/script day12.rpy:7451
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_0fbe65b5:

    # p "I'm done with it all, Wolf."
    p "我真的受够了，Wolf"

# game/script day12.rpy:7453
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d1201a8c:

    # p "It was a mistake to go along with all this."
    p "当初跟着上船就是个错误"

# game/script day12.rpy:7455
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_00ea78cf:

    # p "And I just wish I'd realized that sooner."
    p "真希望我能早点明白这点"

# game/script day12.rpy:7459
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ddd3eb9e:

    # w "And...?"
    w "然后……？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7461
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_3aa8d651:

    # "Wolf raises an eyebrow."
    "Wolf挑起眉梢"

# game/script day12.rpy:7463
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_2f8dc545:

    # "He seems to be implying what you'll do with that realization, rather than trying to console you, or get you to see it from someone else's point of view."
    "他意在点破你醒悟之后该作何选择，既不刻意出言安慰，也不劝你站在他人角度看待这件事"

# game/script day12.rpy:7465
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b1245651:

    # "You bite your lip again and nod. You can respect that, at least."
    "你再次咬唇点头，至少这点值得尊重"

# game/script day12.rpy:7469
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6af480ba:

    # "Wolf leaned forward slightly and sniffed again, confirming his interest."
    "Wolf微微向前倾身，又轻嗅了一下，摆明了他心生兴致"

# game/script day12.rpy:7473
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_00715417:

    # p "I decided to leave."
    p "我决定离开"

# game/script day12.rpy:7475
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6ae3c233:

    # p "Next port, I'll be gone."
    p "下个港口就走"

# game/script day12.rpy:7477
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_81608c29_1:

    # w "Hmm..."
    w "唔……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7479
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_dd842e80:

    # "For a moment, you can't help but wonder whether he'll point out that Arthur in fact made that decision for you. Your tone should have at least made it clear enough that there was more to it."
    "一时间你忍不住暗自思忖，他会不会点破其实是Arthur替你做了抉择，单凭你方才的语气，理应足以让人听出这事背后另有原委"

# game/script day12.rpy:7481
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_33e41156:

    # "Wolf raises an eyebrow. At first it would have been imperceptible, but perhaps it was the days spent together in the confines of a ship that meant you could now see past his stoic front."
    "Wolf轻轻抬了抬眉，起初那细微神情几乎无从分辨，许是连日同船相守，你已然能透过他淡漠木然的外表读懂他暗藏的神色"

# game/script day12.rpy:7483
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a8b0ac66:

    # "Somewhat, at least."
    "至少应该能看出些许端倪"

# game/script day12.rpy:7485
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_c357efaf:

    # w "It's not running away."
    w "这不是逃避"

# game/script day12.rpy:7487
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6816e772:

    # w "It's your decision."
    w "是你的决定"

# game/script day12.rpy:7489
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_bf32d513:

    # p "Hmph... Exactly."
    p "哼……正是"

# game/script day12.rpy:7491
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ffa98f4f:

    # p "At least you're not trying to talk me out of it."
    p "至少你没打算劝我回头"

# game/script day12.rpy:7493
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_726b92bb:

    # "Wolf slowly tilts his head. Like he's pointing out he barely talks anyway."
    "Wof缓缓歪头，仿佛在说他本来话就少"

# game/script day12.rpy:7495
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_060f5748:

    # "But as you let the familiar silence fall comfortably between you, he actually takes a breath."
    "你任由那份熟悉的沉默安然笼罩二人，他却缓缓深吸了一口气"

# game/script day12.rpy:7497
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f86ab785:

    # w "I thought you were going to be like Julian. When I first saw you."
    w "初见遇见你时，我以为你会像Julian那样"

# game/script day12.rpy:7501
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_131981f8:

    # w "Loud."
    w "聒噪"

# game/script day12.rpy:7503
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f4476db1:

    # w "Chirpy."
    w "轻浮"

# game/script day12.rpy:7505
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_0a0812b6:

    # "He growled softly."
    "他低声咕噜着"

# game/script day12.rpy:7507
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ada6db54:

    # w "Annoying."
    w "烦人"

# game/script day12.rpy:7509
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_93fcad63:

    # "He whispered."
    "他轻声道"

# game/script day12.rpy:7511
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a619fee5:

    # w "Naive."
    w "天真"

# game/script day12.rpy:7513
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_5f815775_1:

    # p "What do you mean?"
    p "你这话是什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7517
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_2e66d8e9:

    # w "What's a ship for?"
    w "船是用来做什么的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7521
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ae5f223f:

    # w "Takes you from one place to another. They're not a place that you seek to stay."
    w "载人从此处到彼处，不是让人久留之地"

# game/script day12.rpy:7523
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_3b21d334:

    # w "If you don't know where you're going, well..."
    w "若不知去向何方，那么……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7525
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_0704ae0b:

    # w "The ship takes you."
    w "船便载着你漂"

# game/script day12.rpy:7527
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_25f91902:

    # p "Is the Cape Colony where you want to go?"
    p "开普敦殖民地就是你想去的地方吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7529
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b5faa073:

    # "Wolf flicks his ears."
    "Wolf抖了抖耳朵"

# game/script day12.rpy:7531
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d12416c7:

    # w "I didn't say that."
    w "我没这么说"

# game/script day12.rpy:7533
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_49ec1100:

    # p "If you're not going there, aren't you just going wherever the ship takes you?"
    p "若不去那里，不就只是船漂到哪就去哪？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7537
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_3e2f2ba0:

    # w "I didn't say that either."
    w "我也没这么说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7539
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ac0ed9c2:

    # p "Then where are you wanting to go?"
    p "那你想去哪儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7541
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_7c4c04d7:

    # "Wolf sighs, shaking his head. His body sways with the rhythm of the ship, but there's an extra looseness to his movement that makes you wonder whether he's rolling his head back and forth deliberately, weighing up whether to tell you."
    "Wolf叹了口气，微微摇头，他身形顺着船的摇晃节律起伏，动作透着几分闲散随性，不由得让你疑心，他这般缓缓晃头，是故意为之，正在纠结要不要对你坦白"

# game/script day12.rpy:7543
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_54283233:

    # "It almost looks like the ocean is trying to cajole the truth out of him."
    "仿佛连大海都在怂恿他说出真相"

# game/script day12.rpy:7547
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e55002e6:

    # w "Getting away from somewhere is just as good."
    w "逃离某个地方同样有意义"

# game/script day12.rpy:7549
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_437d1f1b:

    # w "You probably haven't noticed it, but it's there."
    w "你也许没有注意到，但它就在那儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7553
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ad283a96:

    # w "Tension. Building everywhere."
    w "无处不在累积的紧绷感。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7555
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e040c4c9:

    # p "On this ship?"
    p "在这艘船上？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7557
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a78adde8:

    # w "The world."
    w "整个世界。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7559
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_164e818f:

    # w "Like... black powder flowing through an hourglass. Just waiting for the spark to ignite the pile."
    w "就像……黑火药在沙漏里流动。只等一颗火星点燃整堆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7561
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_672979ed:

    # p "That's oddly poetic. Morbid, but yeah, poetic."
    p "这话有种古怪的诗意。病态，但没错，有诗意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7563
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_1062ca79:

    # w "Just because I don't like to talk much, doesn't mean I don't appreciate words when they're used well."
    w "我只是不爱多说话，不代表我不欣赏用得好的词句。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7565
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d88e05c8:

    # w "It won't stop at just one revolution.{w} Not with how things are."
    w "它不会止步于一场革命。{w} 以眼下的局势，不会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7567
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_748f5400:

    # p "Are you talking about France?"
    p "你是在说法国的情势吗？"
    #世界观在1791年，这时候法国大革命

# game/script day12.rpy:7569
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_1abe1c2d:

    # "He doesn't answer."
    "他没有回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7571
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8899981d:

    # w "Perhaps a ship is the safest place after all."
    w "也许归根结底，船上才是最安全的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7573
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8f9e57ea:

    # w "Anyway, poetic, yes.{p}I suppose you'll be keen to make land soon."
    w "总之，诗意，没错。{p}我猜你很快就要急着上岸了吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7575
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f183219f:

    # p "And be done with it all."
    p "然后把这一切都了结。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7577
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_46b94b50:

    # w "I thought you'd have made some friends at least. Be sad, a little."
    w "我还以为你至少交到几个朋友了。多少该有点难过吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7579
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_10f8be9d:

    # p "Come on, Wolf. Even you have warmed up in your time here."
    p "得了吧，Wolf。就算是你，在这里待了这些日子，也该有点人味儿了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7581
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8b9fe93c:

    # p "We're talking here, after all."
    p "毕竟我们这会儿都在一起说话了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7583
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_4334e5c8:

    # w "Here... Skeins of fate trawled together by wind and sail, for a brief moment."
    w "就在此地……命运千丝万缕，被海风船帆打捞交织，只相守片刻浮生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7585
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b551c5db:

    # "Wolf shrugs, drawing attention back to the bizarre situation, huddled under a boat while the storm is blowing all around them."
    "Wolf耸了耸肩，把注意力重新引回这荒唐的处境：他们蜷在一艘小船底下，风暴在四周呼啸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7587
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8b4aee2d:

    # w "If I'd really warmed up, I wouldn't be out here."
    w "如果我真的融入了就不会在这儿了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7589
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_7b5c1ba3:

    # p "You're still talking to me."
    p "可你还不是在跟我说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7593
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6dccd283:

    # w "Don't get annoying."
    w "别招人烦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7595
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_3511167b:

    # "He grunts."
    "他咕哝了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7599
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_be8266bb:

    # w "You'll still regret it more than I, if I were to stop talking."
    w "如果我真的闭嘴了，你会比我更后悔的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7601
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_07d249bd:

    # p "Hmmm."
    p "哼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7603
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_c1592053:

    # "You take a moment to watch Wolf quietly. A huddled mass of wet black fur, something about his current situation suggesting more than just his usual reserved nature."
    "你静静凝望Wolf片刻，一身乌黑湿毛蜷缩成团，他眼下这般模样早已不只是寻常的沉默寡言那般简单。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7605
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_5bfd10c6:

    # "Always a cold front. Short looks, and shorter words."
    "总是一副冷锋过境的样子。目光短，话更短。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7607
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f05135f0:

    # "There's no way he could keep up such a cold all the time. Wolves were pack animals, right? But you aren't exactly in the mood to try and divine whatever could be behind all that black fur. It wasn't like he'd ever tried to fit in."
    "他不可能一直这么冷冰冰的。狼是群居动物，对吧？可你现在也没心情去揣测那身黑毛底下到底藏着什么。毕竟他从来没试着融入过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7609
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e58c9045:

    # "Still, it felt like it was worth a moment to ask his opinion. He'd always seemed more practical than the others, and versed in the wider world too."
    "不过，还是值得花点时间问问他的看法的。他总显得比旁人更务实，也更了解外头的世界。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7611
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8b6d5087:

    # p "Wolf?"
    p "Wolf？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7615
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_77ad85f1:

    # w "Hm?"
    w "嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7617
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f8a336bc:

    # p "Do you have any advice?"
    p "你有什么建议吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7619
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e61a2808:

    # "You ask, not really focusing on anything in particular. The subject was obvious—Wolf picked up on that."
    "你问道，目光并没真正落在什么具体的东西上。话题显而易见，Wolf也听出来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7621
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_03de4a90:

    # "But with how everything had worked out, you felt like he was the only one you really wanted to hear from. He was just as green a sailor as you, but he'd managed to keep his head down."
    "事到如今你心里只想听他一个人的见解，他和你一样都是新手，却一直懂得安分守己。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7625
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8a1186e9:

    # w "It's a bit late for that now, don't you think?"
    w "你不觉得现在问这个有点晚了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7627
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d8e5685c:

    # p "I'm not talking about the ship. It's about what comes next."
    p "我说的不是船上的事。我说的是接下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7629
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a03c98b5:

    # w "Get real, quick. You know what your mistake was here, right?"
    w "现实点，赶紧的。你知道自己在这儿错在哪儿，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7631
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_cb9c14d4:

    # "Wolf pauses, staring into your eyes. To make sure you understood his point."
    "Wolf顿了顿，直视你的眼睛，确保你听懂了他的意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7635
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_4f3a4bda:

    # w "You clouded your eyes with some romantic vision of roaming the seas, and only then woke up and realized how hard it is."
    w "你眼里蒙着一层在海上漂泊的浪漫幻想，然后才醒过来，意识到这有多难。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7637
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_086dd128:

    # w "Maybe if you'd snapped out of that, focused on the reality of what lay right in front of you, maybe you'd have made better choices."
    w "也许你要是早点从那种幻想里清醒过来，把注意力放在眼前的现实上，也许就能做出更好的选择。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7639
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_c1cee1aa:

    # w "You might feel hard done by, but once you're off this ship, the ones who pushed you off aren't going to think a moment more about you."
    w "你也许觉得自己受了委屈，可一旦被赶下船，那些排挤你的人根本不会再为你有片刻牵挂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7641
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_745a5a14:

    # w "I mean, have you even considered for a moment what Morocco is even like? I bet you expect it to be a sunnier version of home."
    w "我是说，你到底有没有哪怕想过一下摩洛哥是什么样子？我打赌你觉得那就是个阳光更足的老家。。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7645
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_277645fb:

    # p "Wolf!"
    p "Wolf！"

# game/script day12.rpy:7647
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d76039e9:

    # "You give him a warning hiss, taken aback by his comment. Hopefully he was just in a sour mood from the storm, but if he wanted you gone he could just say. Or stop talking."
    "你被他的话惊了一下，发出一声警告似的嘶声。希望他只是因为暴风雨而心情不好吧。但如果他想让你离开，大可以直说。或者干脆别说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7649
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_5c038b40:

    # w "You asked for my advice. I'm not going to sugar coat it."
    w "是你问我要建议的。我可不会给你裹糖衣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7651
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_44f7101e:

    # p "I'm not that naive. I know it's nothing like home, but I wasn't exactly given a choice on where I'd be stepping off now. So if you have some actually helpful advice that I can use in the future..."
    p "我没那么天真。我知道那里跟老家一点都不像，可我现在在哪儿下船，也由不得我选。所以你要是真有什么将来用得上的建议……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7653
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6eacf95e:

    # w "Well, I can't say I know much more than you. I know the Barbary pirates used to sail from those shores, but that's mostly died out by now, I think."
    w "嗯，我可说不上比你多懂多少。我知道巴巴里海盗以前从那些海岸出航，但我觉得到现在基本已经没落了。"
    #https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barbary_corsairs

# game/script day12.rpy:7657
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a0e8873c:

    # w "Not that I'd think you'd be that naive to try and join up with them."
    w "倒不是说我以为你会天真到想去投奔他们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7659
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6373a6d4:

    # "Wolf smirked."
    "Wolf扯了扯嘴角。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7661
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_19af7edb:

    # p "Don't think anything like that is my intention for even a second."
    p "别以为我有过哪怕一秒钟那种念头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7665
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_508328ae:

    # w "Yeah, I can smell that at least. But I'm sure there's dangerous people from all sorts there."
    w "是啊，至少这个我闻得出来。不过我敢说那儿什么样危险的人都有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7667
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_dae5b4a8:

    # w "You need to get sharp at spotting how the world is, what you need from it to get where you want to go. Otherwise, they'll just take advantage of you at best, I'm sure, because you should know everyone else is trying to get where they want to go too."
    w "你得练出眼力，看清世界是什么样，明白自己要从它那儿得到什么，才能去到想去的地方。否则，他们顶多会利用你，我敢肯定，因为你该知道，别人也都在往自己想去的地方奔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7669
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_2eb3fb58:

    # w "Tough luck if you happen to be in their way."
    w "你要是正好挡了他们的路，那就自认倒霉吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7671
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8954de92:

    # "He sighs and shakes his head, the sound half-like a mournful howl. Almost like he'd been itching for the chance to sing for weeks on end."
    "他叹了口气，摇摇头，那声音半像一声哀伤的嚎叫。几乎像是他憋了好几周，早痒痒着想唱上一嗓子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7673
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_de8f5a35:

    # w "You can bet there'll be much harder men than Arthur that you'll have to deal with when you make land."
    w "你可以打赌，等你上岸，要应付的人里会有比Arthur难缠得多的家伙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7675
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_042a194c:

    # "He pauses for a moment, sniffing."
    "他停了一下，嗅了嗅。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7679
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a786d0f9:

    # w "I mean, do you even have a plan when you get there?"
    w "我是说，你到了那儿，到底有没有个计划？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7686
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_1379bc67:

    # "Instead, you go back to focusing on your surroundings. It feels like the storm might be easing, giving more of a respite even if the rain continued unabated."
    "于是你重新留意起四周。风暴似乎正在减弱，哪怕雨势丝毫不减，也总算让人多喘了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7688
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8ef85aec:

    # "Wolf remains silent as you consider his question. You have some ideas, more or less fleshed out on a feeling rather than any knowledge of what might actually lie ahead."
    "Wolf沉默着，你则思量着他的问题。你有些想法，多少已经有了轮廓，但更多是凭感觉拼出来的，而不是因为了解前方究竟有什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7690
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_9b6fa10d:

    # "Perhaps you'd take some time to see the sights. Even if it was an exile, the way Bandile had spoken about the bazaars and spice markets made your imagination coil in delight."
    "也许你会花点时间看看风景。就算这是流放，Bandile说起那些集市和香料市场时的样子，也让你的想象愉悦地翻腾起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7692
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8245be9a:

    # "Practically, you're sure that you could at least find another ship taking hands. Apply some of what you'd learned and keep your head down until eventually you could maybe find your way... home?"
    "实际点说，你确信至少还能找到另一艘招水手的船。用上你学到的一些本事，低头干活，直到最终也许能找到回去的路……回家？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7694
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_171594f0:

    # "You weren't sure about that last bit, but the rest of it seemed sound."
    "最后那一点你不太确定，但其余部分听起来还算靠谱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7698
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f2ebd1c5:

    # "But would any ship be looking for an already marked sailor?"
    "可哪一艘船，还会愿意招收一个已有污点的水手？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7700
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ee22673f:

    # "You still tell Wolf—in small details at least—given the way he'd pricked his ears up at you in expectation. But you leave out your ambivalence about home, and add a final question."
    "你还是告诉了Wolf——至少讲了些细枝末节——毕竟他竖起耳朵，满怀期待地望着你。但你略去了自己对“家”的矛盾心情，最后又加了一个问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7707
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_12195d04:

    # p "Why don't you come ashore, too?"
    p "你为什么不也一起上岸呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7711
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_5191b6ee:

    # w "You're doing it again. Not learning. Talking, not listening."
    w "你又来了。就是不长记性。光顾着说，不肯听。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7713
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b91e73d1:

    # "Wolf growled, frustrated at repeating himself."
    "Wolf低吼了一声，对自己不得不重复一遍感到恼火。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7715
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e5cdbbbc:

    # w "It should be clear to you that's not something I'm considering."
    w "你应该很清楚，我根本没在考虑这种事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7717
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e696c819:

    # p "You're just here for the money, right? But surely there's better paying ships there."
    p "你只是为了钱才待在这儿，对吧？可那儿肯定有给钱更多的船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7719
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_58402d2a:

    # w "Yeah, exactly."
    w "对，没错"

# game/script day12.rpy:7721
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_fd147e8c:

    # p "But you can get money from many places, I bet."
    p "可挣钱的地方多的是，我敢说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7723
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_02a2be28:

    # "From what you'd come to know of Wolf, even in your twelve short days with him, it was clear he could handle himself just about anywhere. Money... felt like a convenient reason."
    "从你对Wolf的了解来看——哪怕只和他相处了短短十二天——很明显，他在哪儿都能照应好自己。钱……感觉只是个方便的说辞。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7725
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_5475771f:

    # p "Be real with me, at least once, Wolf."
    p "跟我说句实话吧，哪怕就一次，Wolf。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7729
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d89339fd:

    # p "I've done you some favor in the past. I think I've earned a bit of earnestness from you, don't you think?"
    p "我以前帮过你一些忙。我觉得自己该从你这儿换来一点真心话，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7733
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_436ddca1:

    # w "Showing your ass when you lost the dice game wasn't what I'd call a favor."
    w "你掷骰子输了以后丢人现眼，我可不会管那叫帮了我的忙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7735
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_3bf0ea8e:

    # "You look away in shame at having that moment being brought back up again..."
    "那段糗事被重新翻出来，你羞得移开了目光……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7737
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_3f3a7be1:

    # p "That's not what I meant, I meant fixing your shirt."
    p "我不是指那个，我是指我帮你补衬衫的事"

# game/script day12.rpy:7739
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8d8b6c2c:

    # w "Which you only did because you hoped to get something out of it."
    w "你那么做，不过是希望从中得到点什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7743
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_774bdf1f:

    # w "Such as?"
    w "比如？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7745
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_51ffc9c6:

    # p "Fixing your shirt for one."
    p "比如帮你补衬衫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7749
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_0e514c36:

    # p "Or how about when I gave you my dinner?"
    p "那我把我的晚餐让给你那次呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7751
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_67c89a68:

    # w "That was because you lost a bet, not because of your good nature."
    w "那是因为你输掉了一场赌局，不是因为你心地善良。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7753
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_91fa4e65:

    # w "And I remember you bemoaning it at the time."
    w "而且我记得你当时还抱怨来着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7755
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_3074caf7:

    # p "Or how about yesterday, when you needed me to help hold the planks in place for Konrad?"
    p "还有昨天，你让帮忙扶着木板给Konrad干活，这事儿你忘了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7757
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_4d502259:

    # p "The others might take what you said as an answer, but I don't think that you're so mercenary that you'd just take the coin and leave it at that."
    p "别人可能信了你的鬼话，但我可不觉得你那么爱钱，拿了钱就想就此作罢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7761
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_911b08fb:

    # p "The others might take that as an answer, but I don't think that you're so mercenary that you'd just take the coin and leave it at that."
    p "别人可能信了你的鬼话，但我可不觉得你那么爱钱，拿了钱就想就此作罢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7765
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_fee56700:

    # w "Then you've got a lot to learn still."
    w "那你还得好好学着点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7767
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_70797f28:

    # "Wolf tenses and swings his head around to face you. You're suddenly conscious how threatening he actually could be if he put his mind to it."
    "Wolf 猛地转头，眼神锐利地盯着你。你这才意识到，他要是真想动手，威胁可不小。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7769
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_64136066:

    # "Big enough to grab you if he really wanted to..."
    "块头够大，真想抓你的话，轻轻松松..."

# game/script day12.rpy:7771
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_75c540f5:

    # p "Perhaps."
    p "也许吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7773
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_006f5cc8:

    # p "But I don't think I'm wrong here."
    p "但我觉得这次我没说错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7775
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8c68eb34:

    # p "At least not entirely."
    p "至少没全错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7779
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_9a40c457:

    # p "You're running. From... someone?"
    p "你在跑路。躲着...什么人？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7781
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b9d5af0f:

    # p "Something?"
    p "什么东西？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7785
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_9abb7d76:

    # w "It's funny to see you trying to snatch the dark."
    w "看你拼命想抓住黑暗的样子，真有意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7787
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b875af24:

    # p "Fine."
    p "知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7793
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_0914e34b:

    # p "But I know it doesn't make sense for someone supposedly so in it for the money to carry around an unspent coin."
    p "但要说你真是个见钱眼开的家伙，身上揣着个硬币不花，这说不通啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7795
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6a88a576:

    # "You blink at him expectantly, suggesting that you hadn't forgotten that coin with the fleur de lys he carried about so quickly. It also felt like a fitting rebuttal to his earlier lack of confidence in you just moments earlier."
    "你满怀期待地看着他，意思是说你可没忘了他带着的那枚百合花饰的硬币。 这也算是对他刚才不信任你的一个小小的反击。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7797
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_373b570c:

    # w "It's called savings. Nor is there much to spend it on out here."
    w "这叫存钱。再说这鬼地方也没啥可花的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7799
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_2c50ae00:

    # w "Bad luck that you won't be around in port to see me spend it either."
    w "可惜你没机会在港口看到我挥金如土了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7801
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_fa881020:

    # p "And then there's that fife. An instrument you keep but barely play. It's surely worth quite a few coins if you were to sell it..."
    p "还有你那横笛。你留着它，却不怎么吹。要是卖了，肯定能换不少钱..."

# game/script day12.rpy:7803
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_09414dd8:

    # p "Perhaps if only you could part with it."
    p "就看你舍不舍得了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7807
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_1c9e9065:

    # p "But I know it doesn't make sense for someone supposedly so in it for the money."
    p "但要说你真是个见钱眼开的家伙，那这事儿就更说不通了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7809
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_06fa1826:

    # p "After all, why would you have kept the fife around rather than just selling it?"
    p "毕竟，你干嘛留着横笛不卖呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7814
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_862fe746:

    # w "I have been playing it enough since Julian's lessons. But even if I wouldn't have, that's not the point."
    w "自从 Julian 教我之后，我练得可勤了。 就算我不吹，那也不是重点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7816
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8ec9e97a:

    # w "I don't sell it because it was a gift. Or do you go around selling gifts you have received?"
    w "我不卖是因为这是礼物。 难道你会把收到的礼物都卖了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7821
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_16ab2b5d:

    # w "Because it was a gift. Or do you go around selling gifts you have received?"
    w "我不卖是因为这是礼物。 难道你会把收到的礼物都卖了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7823
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e6672b94:

    # w "Besides, I need to have something to do around here when I'm not working or having people annoy me with their questions."
    w "再说了，我不干活，也没人烦我的时候，总得找点事儿干吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7827
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e287695a:

    # w "A piece of wood shoved between your lips is a good way to get people to shut up."
    w "嘴里塞根木头，是让别人闭嘴的好法子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7829
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f4b6bfe8:

    # p "I'm as surprised as any that you let Julian touch it, never mind try and teach you."
    p "你居然能让 Julian 碰你的横笛，还教你吹，我跟你说，我比谁都惊讶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7831
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e6a94519:

    # w "He's not as annoying when he's got his mouth shut around it making music."
    w "他要是闭上嘴巴，用横笛吹点曲子，就没那么烦人了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7833
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f72deddd:

    # p "You still let him play it though, wolf."
    p "结果你还是让他玩了，是吧，狼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7835
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a8772f67:

    # w "Everyone's free to form their own thoughts about each other."
    w "每个人都有权利在心里评价别人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7837
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b0ba889c:

    # w "I just don't announce them to others."
    w "我只是不会直接说出来罢了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7839
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d57d4e00:

    # p "I'm just saying-"
    p "我是说——"

# game/script day12.rpy:7843
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_ea16384e:

    # w "You wanted my advice?"
    w "你不是想听我的建议吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7845
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_277daa02:

    # "Wolf snarls. A warning, given he showed only half his teeth."
    "狼低吼了一声。只是露出半边牙齿，这已经是在警告你了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7847
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_5e36f37b:

    # w "Know when to shut up. There's no way I'm going with you."
    w "给我闭嘴。我不可能跟你走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7849
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_7f55edd3:

    # w "You don't believe my reason, you barely listen, and you clearly don't know how to keep yourself out of trouble—even when you had someone like Samuel to try and keep you on side."
    w "你不信我的说辞，也懒得认真听，还完全不懂得避祸安分，就算有Samuel帮你撑腰也毫无用处"

# game/script day12.rpy:7851
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a19bf282:

    # "It takes you a moment to realize your mouth is hanging open, and a moment more to shut it with a hiss."
    "你愣了一下才意识到自己还张着嘴，然后才嘶嘶地闭上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7853
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_56dc2a0f:

    # w "What more do you want? A hug? My shoulder to cry on?"
    w "你还想要什么？要我抱抱你？还是借你肩膀哭一场？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7855
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_1e0ebda3:

    # "He growls again, trying to get you to snap out of it."
    "他又低吼了一声，想让你振作起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7859
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_734379d1:

    # w "Don't you get it? Life's fucked and unfair, and no one's going to give a toss about your tears when it comes to it."
    w "你搞清楚点！生活就是这么操蛋，这么不公平，到时候根本没人会管你的眼泪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7861
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_57ccdd7d:

    # "Wolf looks away, taking a deep breath. He clenches his jaw shut, the muscles on his face taut as he holds his tongue."
    "狼移开视线，深吸一口气。他咬紧牙关，绷着脸，一言不发。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7863
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_80418f63:

    # w "They will see you as weak and they'll be drawn to it—real monsters, not like anyone else on this ship."
    w "他们会认定你软弱，继而被这份脆弱所吸引，那是真正的豺狼，跟船上任何人都不一样"

# game/script day12.rpy:7865
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f71c75ae:

    # "He clearly wants to say more, and from the feeling in the air between you, it isn't just about your situation at all."
    "他显然还有话想说，而且从我们之间的气氛来看，这事儿恐怕不只是关于你自己的处境。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7867
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8c61d86f:

    # "In all the days you've both been on the ship together he'd progressively thawed, dropping glimpses of the person beneath it all."
    "在你们同船共处的这些日子里，他身上的坚冰渐渐消融，偶尔会流露出掩藏在外壳下的真实内心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7869
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d7b1ac9a:

    # p "Wolf..."
    p "Wolf……"

# game/script day12.rpy:7871
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_cc045ad6:

    # p "I was just hoping to learn-"
    p "我只是想学点东西——"

# game/script day12.rpy:7873
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_7dcf718e:

    # w "What?"
    w "啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7875
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a364857e:

    # w "Learn, what?"
    w "学什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7877
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d00bf258:

    # "It struck you that in this moment, if you touch the wrong nerve he could easily just send you overboard. In seas like this, you'd be gone. And would anyone really question it?"
    "你突然意识到，要是现在你哪句话说不对，他可能真会一脚把你踹下海。在这种海况下，你可就没命了。而且就算你死了，真的会有人过问吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7879
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_71671c3b:

    # "Arthur certainly wouldn't turn the ship around to search for you."
    "Arthur肯定不会掉头回来找你的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7881
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_c93a7424:

    # p "How to survive."
    p "学怎么活下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7883
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_8b4cdc9b:

    # "You shrug, trying to describe more to the vague sense that had always surrounded Wolf."
    "你耸耸肩，想尽量说清楚你一直觉得笼罩着狼的那种模糊不清的感觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7885
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f2aaaeda:

    # p "Because you certainly seem to be better at it than me."
    p "因为你看起来确实比我更擅长这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7889
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_19a549e7:

    # w "I wasn't always."
    w "我以前也不是这样的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7891
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_87b29bae:

    # "A slow, mournful sigh clawed its way up from his throat."
    "一声压抑的、悲伤的叹息从他喉咙里挤了出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7895
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_efc2379a:

    # w "I was... a bit like you. Once. Lost, a bit clueless perhaps.{w} Certainly in need of help, and to be taught how to keep my head above water."
    w "我也曾经……有点像你。也曾经迷茫过，可能还有点笨手笨脚。{w} 当然也需要别人的帮助，需要别人教我如何在逆境中求生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7897
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d48c6e78:

    # w "New. Learning the ropes. Grappling with a life unfamiliar to me. But I learned quickly, and found that to every lesson I learned there were two options—either to accept the way of things and survive, or not."
    w "那时初来乍到，学着适应，在陌生的生活中挣扎着，但是我悟性不低，很快看清现实，每一次抉择只有两条路，顺从规则以求活路，或是一意孤行走向末路"

# game/script day12.rpy:7901
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_0d322603:

    # "His eyes light up as he reaches back through the misty past. A ghost of a smile teases at the corners of his mouth, haunting him with the memories of better times while his eyes water."
    "回忆起那些往事，他的眼睛里闪着光。嘴角浮现出一丝怀念的微笑，美好的回忆让他动容，眼眶也湿润了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7903
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_b56972eb:

    # w "I didn't just survive after long. I found a family. They took me in, taught me how to make sense of the world. It wasn't always comfortable, but it was what we had to do, and when that became the reason why I'd have a full belly, it made the choice much easier."
    w "后来，我不只是活了下来，还找到了家人。他们接纳了我，教会我如何在这个世界上立足。日子当然不会总是舒舒服服的，但这已经是我们能做到的最好的了。而且当“为了能吃饱饭”成为我坚持下去的理由时，一切都变得简单多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7905
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_15fd3be2:

    # "You're certain he's choosing his words carefully, speaking slowly, almost chewing each word before spitting it out."
    "他好像在字斟句酌，每个字都要在嘴里嚼烂了才吐出来，生怕说错什么似的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7909
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e8af962c:

    # w "But we were happy. We had each other, and when the world gave us nothing, we took it."
    w "可咱那会儿开心啊。有彼此就够了，世界不给咱的，咱就自己去抢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7913
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_497405c5:

    # "Wolf shakes his head, his face turning cold and icy once again."
    "Wolf 摇了摇头，脸色又变得冰冷起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7915
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_acafe163:

    # w "And then before we knew it, it was..."
    w "然后，在我们意识到之前，就已经..."

# game/script day12.rpy:7919
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_a6208f1d:

    # w "You said you wanted my advice, right?"
    w "你不是说想听我的建议吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7921
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_4d31ee09:

    # "He throws back his head, half-laughing."
    "他向后仰着头，像是要笑出来，但又没完全笑出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7925
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_f0a1437e:

    # w "Don't get attached again, kid. You're lucky to get off so easy from all this."
    w "别再动感情了，小子。这次能这么轻松脱身，你就烧高香吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7929
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_7d76ded5:

    # p "How is this getting off easy?"
    p "这还叫轻松脱身？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7931
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_13e5d377:

    # p "I'll be carrying these scars for... I don't even know, perhaps the rest of my life."
    p "这些疤，我怕是要背一辈子了...我也不知道，也许到死都消不掉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7933
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_dd73a010:

    # w "The flesh will heal and fur will grow over them."
    w "肉会长好，毛也会长出来盖住的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7935
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_65ab0356:

    # p "Even then, I'd hardly call it getting off easy."
    p "就算那样，我也觉得这根本算不上什么“轻松脱身”。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7937
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_21e04741:

    # w "Under a different leadership you might never have left the ship again."
    w "换个船长，你可能就再也下不了船了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7939
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_9bd0da94:

    # w "Any time you can avoid that, I'd call it getting off easy."
    w "只要能避免那种情况，我就觉得算是“轻松脱身”了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7946
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_51b95a58:

    # "He flicks an ear dismissively as the distant clang of the ship's bell announces the time for the current watch."
    "他无所谓地抖了抖耳朵，远处传来“铛铛”的钟声，报着时辰，提醒着现在是哪个倒霉蛋在值班。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7948
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_2a67f2b2:

    # "Thankfully it wasn't yet time for you to get back to it, and so you could stick around a little longer. Though perhaps sitting in the wet, exposed deck wasn't the best idea."
    "幸好还没轮到你，还能多待会儿。不过，就这么坐在又湿又冷的甲板上，也不是个好主意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7950
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_bdd989a0:

    # p "Speaking from experience?"
    p "听起来像是有经验之谈啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7952
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e3481d94:

    # "Wolf grunts."
    "Wolf 哼了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7954
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_737ff256:

    # w "You should try and at least make sure you get your last bit of pay before heading onward."
    w "你最起码也得把剩下的工钱拿了再走吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7956
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_75bc4b32:

    # p "Wolf... I'm not trying to be difficult."
    p "Wolf...我不是故意找茬。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7958
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_53883277:

    # "You reach out and grab his hand."
    "你伸出手，抓住了他的手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7960
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_e1df6f0f:

    # p "Are you sure? That you want to stay here?"
    p "你真的想好了吗？要留在这里？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7962
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_d15addab:

    # w "Why would I want to come with you?"
    w "我凭什么要跟你走？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7964
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_0d70878c:

    # w "I tried giving you my advice kindly, because at least you were kind to me. But that doesn't mean I'll abandon everything just for you."
    w "我好声好气地跟你说这些，是因为你至少对我还不错。但这不代表我会为了你放弃一切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7966
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_94232f5a:

    # p "Wolf... I thought."
    p "Wolf...我以为..."

# game/script day12.rpy:7968
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_6c0a960c:

    # w "Keep telling yourself that. You'll find it's the same for the rest of the crew if you go asking. You can't eat kind words, or whatever it is you think it is that you've got between each other."
    w "你还是自己骗自己吧。你去问问船上其他人，他们也一样。好听话又不能当饭吃，或者说，你以为你们之间有什么真情实感吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:7970
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_de6b77eb:

    # "He grunts and shakes his head as he slips out from the jolly boat and heads off into the ship, escaping from you and the worst of the all-permeating wetness."
    "他嘟囔着，摇着头，从舢板上跳了下去，头也不回地钻进船舱，好像要逃离你，逃离这无处不在的湿冷。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7980
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_35f05e3e:

    # "You're left cold in contemplation, trying to figure out your next move when you hear Samuel call your name and wave you over."
    "你独自一人，在寒意中发愣，琢磨着下一步该怎么办，这时 Samuel 喊你的名字，朝你招手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7982
translate Chinese day12_decideleave_wolf_5d7ea795:

    # s "We're starting shortly. Why don't you head down and get your hands on the bilge pumps, that should get the rain off your fur too."
    s "要开工了。你赶紧下去，把舱底抽水泵捣鼓捣鼓，也能把身上的雨水弄干。"

# game/script day12.rpy:7998
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_cffb390f:

    # "You drag your paws along the rough, wet deck, letting your claws tug and catch against the planks."
    "你拖着爪子，在粗糙湿滑的甲板上蹭来蹭去，指甲刮过木板，发出刺耳的声响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8003
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_9375c40b:

    # "Wolf's words ring in your ears, rather than the distorted echoes of whatever Samuel was yapping on about. Something about ships. Sails. Storms."
    "Wolf 的话一直在你耳边盘旋，盖过了 Samuel 那些乱七八糟的嘟囔。什么船啊，帆啊，暴风雨啊..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8009
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_59c582f4:

    # "You don't need to know more about that to survive now. You've endured enough to know how to survive by now."
    "你现在不需要知道那么多也能混下去。你已经经历的够多了，知道该怎么活下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8011
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_178c63ed:

    # "How to grit your teeth through the pain."
    "无非就是咬碎牙往肚里咽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8013
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_6d3608b1:

    # "So you nod along and make the right noises, trying to at least pass as functional. It was a shame that Samuel kept trying. Surely [he] could direct [his] effort elsewhere..."
    "所以你只能点头附和，装作正常的样子。真可惜 Samuel 还在那白费劲。他肯定能把精力用到更有用的地方..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8017
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_56d61b08:

    # "You don't need to know more about that to survive now. So you nod along and make the right noises, trying to at least pass as functional. It was a shame that Samuel kept trying. Surely [he] could direct [his] effort elsewhere..."
    "你现在不需要知道那么多也能混下去。所以你只能点头附和，装作正常的样子。真可惜 Samuel 还在那白费劲。他肯定能把精力用到更有用的地方..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8019
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_c29ca5d1:

    # "Or talk to you about something useful besides this ship."
    "或者跟我聊点和这条破船无关的事儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8021
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_ec91e40d:

    # "You set your jaw, blocking out the sounds as best you can."
    "你咬紧牙关，尽力隔绝那些噪音。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8026
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_0006ef03:

    # "Only Morocco matters. Focus on that."
    "只有摩洛哥才是正经事。盯紧了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8028
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_419ce471:

    # "Seeking to not expend your energy on pointless tasks, you keep your progress across the deck slow, enough to delay the task, but not enough to seem actively disobedient."
    "为了避免在无意义的事情上浪费精力，你故意放慢脚步，既能拖延时间，又不会显得明目张胆地偷懒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8032
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_0b196071:

    # "Survival is always about enduring."
    "活着就是硬撑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8036
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_414d1695:

    # "Survival is always about conserving energy."
    "活着就是省劲儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8038
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_348fabde:

    # "Still, it's surprising that you don't feel bad about slacking either. It's not like the others were busting a gut trying to save you, and once you started pulling at that thread, it all began unraveling."
    "让人意外的是，你竟然一点也不内疚。反正其他人也没想着救我，而且一旦想起这事儿，就越想越气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8040
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a2798628:

    # "That, and working the bilge pumps could smother even the fiercest of flames burning with silly romance about the sea."
    "再说，成天抽舱底水，也能把那些对大海的无聊幻想都给浇灭了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8042
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_dd2f7829:

    # "That stench..."
    "这味儿..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8047
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_cec460e5:

    # "You shudder."
    "你打了个哆嗦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8049
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_717a9db9:

    # "At least that wouldn't be your future for much longer."
    "至少这种日子不会太久了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8051
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_b0e734ab:

    # "Your thoughts turn quickly, preoccupied more with planning once you get to shore. What do you need to do? Knowing anything about the port would be good for starters, but you try to swallow the bile rising in your throat."
    "你赶紧转移注意力，开始计划上岸后的事情。得先做点什么呢？最好先打听一下港口的情况，但你还是恶心得想吐。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8053
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_56a0cfb0:

    # "You just need to know where to make easy coin. And, if things were to ever get desperate enough..."
    "你现在只想知道在哪能轻松搞到钱。还有，如果实在走投无路..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8055
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_edec46fa:

    # "Stealing is easy when it's about not starving."
    "为了活命，偷东西根本不算事儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8060
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a4f7f578:

    # "You stop mid-step, flicking your whiskers. "
    "你突然停下脚步，撇了撇胡子。 "

# game/script day12.rpy:8062
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_487b808e:

    # "The moral... flexibility that you'd just felt troubles you but again, what choice did you have? "
    "刚才那股没节操...的灵活劲儿让你有点不安，但话说回来，还有别的选择吗？ "

# game/script day12.rpy:8064
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_232052b8:

    # "Survival, [name]."
    "活着，[name]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8066
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_cb109fc1:

    # "You swallow and focus on the reality of the situation. "
    "你咽了口唾沫，强迫自己面对现实。 "

# game/script day12.rpy:8068
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_c5fa9c38:

    # "Of course you'll do what you need to do. It's a no-brainer."
    "那还用说，肯定是怎么活下去怎么来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8070
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_8565a685:

    # "You start moving again with renewed determination. "
    "你重新迈开脚步，下定了决心。 "

# game/script day12.rpy:8072
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_d73f7b82:

    # "It crosses your mind that from the way Wolf had spoken to you, he'd probably made these choices before."
    "你突然想到，听 Wolf 的口气，没准他以前也这么干过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8074
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_448cfc00:

    # "Perhaps you should pick him more for answers, before you go."
    "临走前再套套他的话，没准能问出点什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8079
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_15f736ba:

    # "Unsupervised, you take the long way down, moving towards the stern of the ship. It's more sheltered back here, relatively, from both the orientation of the ship and by design of its steeper, sweeping sides. Presumably a design attempt to shelter whatever unfortunate soul might have to hold onto the helm during a storm."
    "趁着没人管，你特意绕远路，往船尾那边溜达。那边更隐蔽，一来是船的朝向问题，二来也是因为船尾的结构设计得更陡峭。估计是为了让倒霉蛋在暴风雨里能抓得更稳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8081
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_68634af8:

    # "You've already overshot the last stairwell down below the decks, but everyone else is so preoccupied with their tasks that you take a moment to look around more—a mix of curiosity, but also a ploy to run down time a bit more."
    "你早已走过下舱的最后一道扶梯，旁人各司其职，你趁机环顾四周，既是心生好奇，也借机拖延时间"

# game/script day12.rpy:8083
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_23b4e089:

    # "The weather has taken more of a toll here than other parts of the deck. Some patches of debris litter the gunwale, stacked behind the last jolly boat this side of the ship."
    "这边的破损程度比其他地方更严重。一些碎片堆在船舷边上，都快把这侧的救生艇给挡住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8085
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_195de36e:

    # "Whoever is responsible for the flotsam surely deserves a lashing. Crammed behind the boat's canvas, you spot a stray oar, two smashed lanterns, and other nautical scraps you lack the experience to identify."
    "这堆垃圾谁负责啊，该打。小艇的帆布后面塞着一根不知道从哪儿来的船桨，两盏摔烂的灯笼，还有一些我叫不上名字的航海垃圾。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8087
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_d5e3acd0:

    # "No wonder Samuel was so agitated about inspecting the masts and sails."
    "怪不得Samuel那么急着检查桅杆和风帆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8089
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_71f93a4f:

    # "Before you leave, you spot a sharp curved beak peeking out from behind the debris."
    "你正要离开，突然瞧见一道锋利的弯喙从杂物堆后伸了出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8094
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_ea5af76c:

    # "You do a double take."
    "你猛地一怔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8096
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_3b45b842:

    # "Was it another member of the crew? "
    "是船上的其他伙计吗？ "

# game/script day12.rpy:8098
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_137929a8:

    # "You rush forward, anxious to see that they were alright, though as much to save your own skin. "
    "你赶紧跑过去，想看看他们是否安好，不过更多还是为了自己能脱身。 "

# game/script day12.rpy:8100
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_ebb85d45:

    # "Please, no..."
    "别这样..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8102
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_4b94d72e:

    # "If someone has been injured, you'll only suffer more for it."
    "要是有谁受伤了，你也得跟着遭殃。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8104
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_ef2c6f61:

    # "The thought disappears quickly as you pull away at the clutter and canvas. Instead of an injured crew member, you come close to a large, wild bird of prey, sheltering there from the storm."
    "你一把拨开杂物和帆布，这念头也随之烟消云散。映入眼帘的不是受伤的船员，而是一只体型巨大的野生猛禽，正躲在这里避雨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8106
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_26e53f17:

    # "Before you have a moment to inspect it more closely, it comes to life, hissing and jabbing that powerful beak towards your face."
    "你还没来得及仔细观察，它就突然活了过来，嘶嘶叫着，用那有力的喙朝你脸上招呼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8108
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_363ac489:

    # "You leap back, heart racing while the beast hisses and jabs at you. Defensive, but definitely pissed off. Vicious enough to convince you to think twice about going anywhere near it." with vpunch
    "你猛地向后一跳，心都快蹦出来了，那野兽一边嘶叫，一边朝你乱啄。它充满戒备，而且很不爽。凶悍得让你不得不掂量掂量，还敢不敢靠近它。" with vpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:8110
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_464b64a3:

    # "You take a moment to watch it warily, the two of you in a standoff as the rain falls around you. At a distance, you can see it's a large bird of prey, but the patterns on its feathers are meaningless to you."
    "你稍稍定了定神，小心翼翼地观察着它，你们俩就这么僵持着，雨水淅淅沥沥地落在周围。隔着一段距离，你能看出这是只大型猛禽，但它羽毛上的花纹，你是一窍不通。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8112
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_71a1f9dd:

    # "It seems to reluctantly accept your presence, watching you with sharp yellow eyes and that even sharper break—and talons—at the ready. It must be sheltering from the storm, but your sympathy towards it is limited. "
    "它似乎勉为其难地容忍了你的靠近，锐利的黄眼睛死死盯着你，甚至更锋利的尖喙与利爪也随时准备应战。它必定是在躲避风暴，但你对它的同情也仅此而已。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8114
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_5b881953:

    # "For one it's dangerous, and two, it'll probably somehow be your fault if someone does get hurt by it, anyway."
    "一来它很危险，二来，万一真有人被它伤着了，搞不好还得赖你头上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8116
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_882b4803:

    # "Setting your jaw, you do your best to try and shoo it off, pulling at a loose end of rope, dragging away the remaining covers. It hisses angrily and makes quite a display, but despite this the bird doesn't fly away."
    "你咬咬牙，使劲想把它轰走，拽着一根松散的绳子头，拖走剩下的遮盖物。它生气地嘶嘶叫着，虚张声势地折腾了一番，但这鸟就是不飞走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8118
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_ee0e9e39:

    # "You're so focused on keeping your eyes, and attention, on the osprey, that you only dimly hear Torres approach behind you."
    "你目光紧盯着鹗鸟，全然投入，只模糊听见Torres从身后走近"

# game/script day12.rpy:8123
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_515ab5d4:

    # t "Hey, last I heard the bilge wasn't up here-oh-hey!"
    t "嘿，我记得污水处理又不在这边——噢——嘿！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8130
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_8aef2df7:

    # "Torres ruffles his feathers abruptly and lets out a long, shrill cry. He swoops closer, laughing and patting you on the back."
    "Torres突然抖了抖身上的水，发出一声又细又尖的叫声。他笑着猛扑过来，拍了拍你的背。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8132
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_6c6668c6:

    # t "Oh, that's a rare sight!"
    t "噢，这可真是稀罕事儿！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8134
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_bd77217c:

    # "He points a talon at the osprey, now hissing loudly and spreading its wings defiantly at you, trying to make itself appear even bigger."
    "他抬爪指向鹗鸟，对方厉声嘶叫，张翼相抗，刻意展翼撑大身形，尽显凶态"

# game/script day12.rpy:8136
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a9a37699:

    # "With a wingspan like that, it wasn't hard."
    "就这翼展，想不大都难。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8138
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_424a1db4:

    # p "Fucking hell."
    p "他妈的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8145
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_2139c2b0:

    # "You take a step back, ending up behind Torres."
    "你往后退了一步，躲到了Torres身后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8147
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_b148f4f4:

    # p "What the fuck is that monster doing here?"
    p "这他妈的怪物跑这儿来干嘛？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8151
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_57fe173b:

    # t "It could be injured. Or most likely exhausted."
    t "可能是受伤了。或者八成是累坏了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8157
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_5405de6b:

    # "Torres leans closer, cocking his head from side to side."
    "Torres凑得更近了，脑袋歪来歪去地打量着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8159
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_866f9a01:

    # t "Poor lad. Looks like it's been here for a while."
    t "真可怜。看起来它在这儿待了挺久了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8161
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_0fbfd321:

    # p "You think? What makes you the bird expert? How can you tell?"
    p "你觉得？你算哪门子鸟类专家？你怎么看出来的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8163
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_ea20fc87:

    # t "You can see the same as me, cat."
    t "你看到的跟我一样，蠢猫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8165
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_cffce258:

    # "Torres hisses, shaking off the obvious association that as a fellow avian..."
    "Torres嘶嘶地叫着，似乎想要摆脱别人把他当成同类的想法..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8167
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_674eddaa:

    # "It sounds almost exactly like the beast in front of you both."
    "这声音听起来几乎和你们面前的野兽一模一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8169
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_35966a05:

    # "It's an absurd similarity, enough to make a laugh pull at the back of your throat. You only manage to swallow it because you think quickly enough to realize the situation with the bird is the only reason why he probably hasn't shouted at you to get back to work."
    "这还真是离谱的相似，你差点就笑出声了，但硬生生给憋了回去。转念一想，或许是因为有这只鸟在，他才没冲你嚷嚷着让你回去干活。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8171
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_c519341a:

    # p "Sorry. I was just... startled."
    p "对不住，我就是...吓了一跳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8173
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_cf0de3a6:

    # t "Understandable."
    t "understandable。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8175
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a98fb39a:

    # "Torres gives a high, shrill whistle. It actually seems to calm the bird down, slowly folding away its impressive wings."
    "Torres吹了声尖锐的口哨。嘿，还真管用，那只鸟渐渐安静下来，缓缓收拢了它那慑人的翅膀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8177
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_aaf52847:

    # t "Poor lad's was probably out fishing and got caught in the storm."
    t "可怜的家伙，大概是出海捕鱼，结果遇上了风暴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8179
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_3a9d9947:

    # t "You know what we had to do to prepare the ship, eh?"
    t "你也知道，为了让船能顺利出海，咱们都得做些什么，嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8181
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_e22b1cb3:

    # "He turns around to look at you, gesturing for you to come a little closer—but slowly."
    "他转过身看着你，招手示意你再靠拢一些——但动作要慢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8188
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a6eb0728:

    # t "Sails and wings are similar, in some ways. He probably got blown off course, or drenched so bad he can't fly right until he gets the chance to dry out."
    t "船帆和羽翼在某些方面挺相通的。它大概是被暴风吹偏了航线，或者羽毛被雨水彻底泡透了，在晾干之前根本飞不起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8190
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_27563e83:

    # t "If we weren't about, I'm sure he'd have drowned."
    t "要是咱们的船正好不在附近，我敢打包票它准得淹死在大海里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8194
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_88448fab:

    # "Torres gives another comforting whistle."
    "Torres又吹了声口哨，像是在安抚那只鸟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8196
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_f91175a3:

    # p "I should tell Arthur that..."
    p "我该把这事儿告诉Arthur……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8198
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_95d9d995:

    # "You mutter, taking a deep sigh. For a moment you watch the predator."
    "你咕哝着，深深叹了口气，盯着那只猛禽看了一会儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8200
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_7c1aeb4f:

    # "Torres, meanwhile, is equally as thoughtful. Murmuring something soothing in Spanish between his low trills."
    "与此同时，Torres也在沉思着什么，用带着颤音的低语，用西班牙语安慰着那只鸟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8202
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a5270e6d:

    # t "See? He's not so bad..."
    t "看见了吧？它没那么可怕……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8204
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_b40b2704:

    # p "That doesn't make its beak any less sharp. Or those talons."
    p "但它的喙依旧锋利，爪子也一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8206
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_90fea735:

    # "You harrumph, preferring to keep your distance, and hope not to open yourself up to anymore \"cat and bird\" jibes."
    "你嘟囔了一声，还是想离它远点，免得再被人拿“猫和鸟”这事儿打趣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8208
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_991a01bb:

    # t "I'm sure he'll be fine if we just leave him be... a little understanding and all... "
    t "只要咱们别去打扰它，它自己会没事的……多给它点理解就好…… "

# game/script day12.rpy:8212
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_b9075ec8:

    # t "Even better if we had something to feed him."
    t "要是能喂它点吃的就更好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8217
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_36be44de:

    # "He takes a step back and half turns towards you, keeping one eye on the osprey as he searches about for some scraps."
    "他退步侧身望向你，一眼紧盯鹗鸟，一边四处翻找残食"

# game/script day12.rpy:8219
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_0cde9b50:

    # t "We haven't spoken much, have we?"
    t "咱们好像没怎么说过话，是吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8221
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_7f87d117:

    # "You shake your head. Not exactly invested in making new connections here now."
    "你摇摇头，我现在可没心情在这儿认识新朋友。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8225
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_305e0a0f:

    # t "You're [name], aren't you? The one that Arthur..."
    t "你是[name]，对吧？就是Arthur……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8227
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_2172180d:

    # "He gives an awkward shrug, ruffling his feathers."
    "他有些尴尬地耸了耸肩，抖了抖身上的羽毛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8229
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_1a846bc0:

    # p "Yeah, that one."
    p "对，就是我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8231
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_9e99f013:

    # p "If you came to chew me out-"
    p "如果你是来兴师问罪的——"

# game/script day12.rpy:8235
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_8e2c8f63:

    # "Your defensive grunt is cut off by a quick whistle."
    "你那句带着防备的话被一声突如其来的口哨打断了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8237
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_f16aa8ea:

    # t "No, no no!"
    t "不，不不！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8239
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_b02c9698:

    # t "I mean, I'd heard what happened but I didn't really think..."
    t "我是说，我听说过这件事，但也没想到……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8241
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_e80f5281:

    # "He sighs."
    "他叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8243
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_217fc60f:

    # t "It's sad news. I heard of course that you're leaving us next port."
    t "真是个令人难过的消息。我听说了，你下个港口就要离开了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8245
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_5337f397:

    # p "Kind of you to put it that way. But I don't see the point in hanging around for long."
    p "你这么说真是抬举我了。不过，我可不想在这儿久待。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8249
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_40c35dc0:

    # t "Your punishment probably didn't set a great tone for you in the first place."
    t "你受的处分，一开始就挺让人难受的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8251
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_82ea0abb:

    # t "It felt rash to me, for what little it is worth. I don't know the specifics, and I don't care to be frank. But a warning should have been enough for new blood, not getting brought up for a dozen."
    t "说实话，我觉得这事儿太草率了，虽然我人微言轻。我不太清楚具体情况，也没兴趣知道。但对一个新来的，警告一下就得了，犯不着上报这么多次吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8253
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_9b614d87:

    # p "You can say that again."
    p "可不是嘛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8255
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_d6e41668:

    # t "No harm in that. Sailor's life isn't for everyone. Mostly pretty boring, and most don't take too kindly being all cooped up on a boat like this."
    t "这倒也没什么。水手这行，不是谁都能干的。大部分时间都挺无聊的，而且很多人受不了成天被困在船上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8262
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_893a6adf:

    # "You glance back at the osprey."
    "你回头瞥了一眼那只鹗"

# game/script day12.rpy:8264
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_35831bf6:

    # p "That why you haven't done me in for slacking off?"
    p "所以你才睁一只眼闭一只眼，没管我偷懒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8271
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_cd91ee8e:

    # t "No, well, in part."
    t "也不能完全这么说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8273
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_1939486d:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8275
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_5f666502:

    # t "But everyone cuts corners where they can... "
    t "谁不是能偷懒就偷懒呢... "

# game/script day12.rpy:8277
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_66a761f9:

    # t "Whatever. I don't know what they're thinking—giving you your marching orders, never mind expecting to get any work out of you in the next few days..."
    t "无所谓了，搞不明白他们怎么想的——既然都让你滚蛋了，却还想着让你这几天能帮上什么忙……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8279
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_05af7817:

    # p "If it's even that."
    p "如果真有几天的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8281
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_9e428a92:

    # "If the osprey is anything to go by, you expect you can't be that far off land by now."
    "以这只枭的样子来看，想来这会儿离陆地也该不远了吧"

# game/script day12.rpy:8283
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_6dd28fdd:

    # t "It's a shame, lad."
    t "真是可惜了，小伙子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8287
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_d5d64d97:

    # "Torres sighs."
    "Torres叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8291
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_cfa93c95:

    # t "I remember you from that first night at dinner..."
    t "我还记得登船第一天晚上吃晚饭时的你……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8293
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_50ec5e34:

    # t "You see a lot of folks come and go on these ships, drifting through on the current. Sometimes you can just tell that they're just working the crossing, or will be gone next port with no questions."
    t "在这船上，来来往往的人我见多了，都是过客。有些人一看就是混个过路，或者下个港口就溜了，谁也不知道他们去哪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8297
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_cf248697:

    # t "I didn't get that with you. The way you got on with everyone that night—including Bandile's cooking..."
    t "可我在你身上却没看到那种隔阂。那天晚上你跟所有人都打成了一片——甚至对班迪尔的手艺都赞不绝口……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8299
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_b4f5d5ab:

    # t "I just thought you'd be with us for longer."
    t "我还以为你能跟我们一起干更长时间呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8303
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_1939486d_1:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8305
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_e5c89d9d:

    # t "Guess I was wrong."
    t "看来我错了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8309
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_991bdc57:

    # t "It's always a shame to lose a member of the crew."
    t "失去一个船员，总是让人觉得遗憾。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8311
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_0fbe74d4:

    # p "Don't make it sound like I died. He's the one who decided to cast me off."
    p "别搞得好像我死了似的。是他要赶我走的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8313
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_8dee75d8:

    # "You shake your head. His pity isn't going to change anything."
    "你摇摇头。他的同情改变不了什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8315
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_8f6bc6d9:

    # p "I'm glad to be getting off this ship, away from whatever demons that horse is chasing."
    p "我巴不得赶紧下船，离那个疯子远远的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8317
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_74209ad9:

    # "You do your best to swallow the angry hiss that pulls at your lips, if only really not to startle the wild beast nearby."
    "我竭力压下怒火，免得吓着附近的鸟兽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8319
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_6f0a1700:

    # "Torres takes a breath, nodding quietly."
    "Torres深吸一口气，轻轻地点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8321
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_827ea194:

    # t "I take it you've never been to Morocco then?"
    t "这么说，你还没去过摩洛哥？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8323
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_3b6e2035:

    # p "Do I look like it?"
    p "我看起来像去过吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8325
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_adb4e332:

    # t "No, not at all."
    t "一点也不像。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8327
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_d675f679:

    # "He waves his hand away from you, as if trying to make some gesture of peace."
    "他朝你挥挥手，似乎想表达某种和平的姿态。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8331
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_b0700710:

    # t "It's quite the place, you should know. But, to make your way around there, you've got to have the right skills, knowledge..."
    t "这地方可不简单，你得心里有数。不过想在那儿吃得开，你必须得有两把刷子，懂得多……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8333
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a2e46988:

    # "You give the foppish falcon a beady eye in turn, bemused that somehow he still went about preening himself in every idle moment, despite the rain."
    "你不甘示弱，也眯起眼睛打量着这只臭美的猎鹰。真搞不懂，都下着雨呢，他还抓住一切闲工夫梳理羽毛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8335
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_eba8ca31:

    # "You don't know how to take his comment, really. Perhaps he is just trying to wind you up—you don't really know the guy."
    "你真搞不懂他这话什么意思，也许他就是想气你——你又不了解他"

# game/script day12.rpy:8337
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_c151e987:

    # "He's always been somewhere else, on a different watch."
    "他总是四处跑，值不同的班。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8339
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_02998181:

    # p "Is this where you tell me it's not so bad?"
    p "现在你要跟我说其实也没那么糟吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8343
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_8c990784:

    # t "If you want."
    t "你要是想说，就说呗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8345
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_89d1fb1d:

    # "You think you see the corners of his beak lift into a smile."
    "你好像看到他的嘴角微微翘起，像是在笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8347
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_2a8a09cf:

    # t "I've only been twice. The other time beyond that doesn't count, as I stayed aboard the ship."
    t "我就去过两次。有一次不算，因为我压根儿没下船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8349
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_d2ded92b:

    # p "A sailor missing shore leave?"
    p "水手会错过靠岸休假？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8351
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_6e0e66cb:

    # t "Some folk still have to stay behind to keep an eye on things. The extra pay didn't hurt, but still..."
    t "总得有人留下来照看船上的事儿。多给的钱当然是好，不过……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8353
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_06e44220:

    # "He gives a wistful whistle."
    "他惋惜地吹了声口哨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8355
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_493aeecf:

    # t "The main difficulty is the language, I'd imagine, but then again I'm not one to talk to you about that."
    t "主要难处还是语言吧，不过说起来，我好像也没资格跟你说这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8357
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_06198716:

    # "The falcon gives a high-pitched whistle."
    "那猎鹰尖声吹了声口哨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8359
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a780470c:

    # t "It's not so easy when you've got a beak, I'll say. But I've mastered a few words, and you know, that can be the difference to getting into the local's good graces..."
    t "长了张鸟嘴，说话就是不方便，不过嘛，我还是掌握了几句，你知道，有时候就靠这几句话，就能讨得当地人的欢心……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8361
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_b1e39ffe:

    # p "I've always known when to say my \"pleases\" and \"thank yous.\""
    p "我一直都知道啥时候该说“请”，啥时候该说“谢谢”。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8363
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_5dea97ae:

    # "As if showing some grace in travels wasn't obvious."
    "好像出门在外讲点礼貌不是天经地义的一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8367
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_8e9597be:

    # t "You know how to say it in their tongue though, eh?"
    t "你知道用他们的话怎么说，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8369
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_eff31aa4:

    # p "No, but I have a feeling that you will tell me?"
    p "不知道，不过我觉得你会告诉我的，是吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8373
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_f968ce7d:

    # t "Well, we did break bread together, I suppose..."
    t "哎，说起来，咱们也算是一起吃过饭的人了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8375
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_ef8ca6eb:

    # t "How could I forget that animated spring in your step?"
    t "我怎么可能忘了你当时那轻快活泼的脚步？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8379
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_8c1ad21f:

    # "He shakes his head, looking down at the deck and the water sloshing about and your feet."
    "他摇摇头，看着甲板、晃荡的海水，还有你的脚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8381
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_bc709a48:

    # t "I know you've made your mind up about leaving, but for what it's worth, I'd have hoped things would have turned out differently-"
    t "我知道你铁了心要走，但说句实在话，我还是希望事情能有别的转机——"

# game/script day12.rpy:8383
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_aeed2b32:

    # p "Now's not the time to get sentimental."
    p "现在可不是多愁善感的时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8385
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_9e89ac5c:

    # "The rainwater soaking your fur steals away any potential warmth between you."
    "被雨水浸透的皮毛，把咱们之间那点儿热乎劲儿都给浇没了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8389
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_18b5fa2d:

    # t "There's no better time like the present!"
    t "机不可失，时不再来！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8391
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_7227c9f4:

    # "He laughs, slapping you on the back."
    "他笑着拍了拍你的后背。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8393
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a8d6a3af:

    # t "I know Samuel is a good one, but I just wonder, if you had been my charge-"
    t "我知道Samuel那小子不错，但我就是寻思，当初要是你归我管——"

# game/script day12.rpy:8397
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_68f9de7d:

    # p "What, if you'd taken me under your wing?"
    p "咋，你要是罩着我？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8399
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_1e50002d:

    # "Torres rolls his eyes, giving a good natured groan. You can't help but feel his efforts pull a smile to your face."
    "Torres翻了个白眼，挺无奈地哼了一声。你忍不住笑了出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8401
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_f0eaf390:

    # t "I don't know, but maybe, maybe..."
    t "我说不好，不过也许，也许……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8403
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_1939486d_2:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8407
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_b5859050:

    # t "I just remember this cat so enthralled by the salmon on that first night, and the asparagus..."
    t "我只记得那只猫，第一晚上就对鲑鱼着了迷，还有芦笋…"

# game/script day12.rpy:8409
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_635923a9:

    # t "It's a shame, that's all. And while I can't convince an officer of anything, I can at least try and help you on your way."
    t "真是可惜了。虽然我没法说动长官做什么，但至少能帮你在路上顺顺利利的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8413
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_c23bd11a:

    # t "You're angry at Arthur, I get it—justifiably so. But that doesn't mean everyone else on this ship is out to get you."
    t "你在生Arthur的气，我明白——这合情合理，毕竟换了谁都会生气，可这不意味着Conway号上的每一个人都跟你过不去"

# game/script day12.rpy:8415
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_5d2e0383:

    # t "I'm only trying to help in what way I can. It's not like I'll be leaving the ship with you, but it's something."
    t "我也就只能帮上这么点忙了。我又不能跟你一起跑路，但总比什么都没有强。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8417
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_e9595b68:

    # "You grunt, wiping a bit of snot from your nose as the rain keeps pouring down. You're starting to feel the cold creep in, numbing you, but you feel that this is the least bit of hardship to come."
    "雨还在下，你哼了一声，抹了把鼻涕。你开始觉得冷了，手脚都麻木了，但也觉得这只是接下来要面对的苦难里，最微不足道的一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8420
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_58192986:

    # "Endure, and so on."
    "撑下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8423
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_bcb157b3:

    # "Better toughen up now, and so on."
    "现在就得变强。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8425
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_872cacab:

    # "And at least all this rain helps wash out the salt crusting your fur, without wasting precious freshwater."
    "而且好歹下这么大雨，能帮你把毛上的盐都冲干净，省得浪费淡水了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8427
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a46fec74:

    # p "Fine, go on."
    p "行吧，去你的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8429
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_d01648fa:

    # "You sigh, folding your arms. You're about to say sorry though."
    "你叹了口气，抱起胳膊，但你都要准备道歉了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8431
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_fb3262cf:

    # t "Well, I'm a Spaniard if the name and accent hadn't fooled you, but that doesn't mean I don't know my way around a little Moorish."
    t "嗨，要是我的名字和口音还不够明显的话，我是个西班牙人。但这不代表我不懂一点摩尔语。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8433
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_0a7a539a:

    # "You flick your ears about, but between the rough howl of the storm, the constant patter of rain, and the light, air trill that followed the end of the falcon's every word, it was hard to catch the resemblance."
    "你动了动耳朵，但是暴风雨太大了，又是呼啸，又是噼里啪啦的雨声。而且那只猎鹰说话的时候，带着那种轻飘飘的颤音，实在很难听出什么相似之处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8437
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_f3f8bf37:

    # t "Of course, my time among all you English speakers has dulled things somewhat, but I grew up close to Cadiz."
    t "害，跟你们这些说英语的人混久了，是有点迟钝了。但我从小就在Cadiz附近长大。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8439
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a75cbc50:

    # "He picks up on your lack of familiarity with those sharp eyes."
    "他倒是挺敏锐，一眼就看出来你不太懂这些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8441
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_6d0bd9f1:

    # t "Quite the important city about as far as you might go."
    t "那可是个很重要的城市，大概是你最远能去的地方了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8445
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_1939486d_3:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8447
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_ead2f1cb:

    # t "As a fledge I grew up on tales of the city's greatness, home to stories about the Spanish Treasure fleet and many other things."
    t "我小时候听着那些关于Cadiz的故事长大的，什么西班牙珍宝舰队啊，可多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8449
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_13fd6ceb:

    # t "Anyway, I learned ships and the like there because that was the done thing, but fortunately for you, being so close to North Africa, it wasn't uncommon that my work would involve a thing or two with your soon to be locals."
    t "反正我在那学的就是船上的事儿，没办法。不过幸运的是，Cadiz离北非近，我干的活儿，多多少少也和你们这些“未来的当地人”有点关系。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8451
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_a0d718c3:

    # t "Which is a fancy way of saying I can speak a little of the local lingo."
    t "换句话说，我略懂一点当地话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8453
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_deb40804:

    # t "Darija isn't that bad, once you get around the rules. I reckon you'll be good at it."
    t "Darija没那么难，摸清了门道就行。我觉得你能学会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8455
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_842052ed:

    # p "I don't think there's time-"
    p "我觉得没时间——"

# game/script day12.rpy:8457
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_6b139fd6:

    # t "Oh! You misunderstand, I know only a few phrases. If you want a true native, Rajeeyah is the one you should be speaking to."
    t "哦！你误会了，我只会说几句。真要找个当地人，你该去找Rajeeyah。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8459
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_b53891c4:

    # "You look around the deck, noting the lack of interest anyone was paying in you both."
    "你看了看甲板四周，发现没人对你们俩感兴趣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8461
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_48b05bb7:

    # p "A few phrases wouldn't hurt. You got the time?"
    p "学两句也没坏处。你有时间吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8463
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_4d3b1fbd:

    # "Torres shrugs, going back to preening himself."
    "Torres耸耸肩，又开始梳理羽毛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8465
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_410ee597:

    # t "Don't worry about it. You never know, it may just impress the right people enough to keep you safe."
    t "别担心。说不定就能给什么大人物留下好印象，保你平安。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8467
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_393a13a6:

    # t "Now, listen closely and repeat after me."
    t "好了，仔细听着，跟我念。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8469
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8471
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_78ff0e34:

    # t "\"Ahlan.\""
    t "“Ahlan。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:8473
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_111bd8ab:

    # t "Go on. \"Ahlan.\""
    t "说啊。“Ahlan。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:8475
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_395f0556:

    # "You try your best to mimic the sound, struggling with the entirely unfamiliar intonation."
    "你尽力模仿着这个发音，但是这个音调你完全没接触过，太难了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8479
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_8fa1145b:

    # "The falcon picks up on your negativity, shaking his head and encouraging you further."
    "猎鹰看你不太情愿，摇了摇头，鼓励你继续。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8481
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_3b954c5e:

    # t "No, good, good! Try a little bit more."
    t "不，好，好！再多来一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8483
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_ddf2b07c:

    # "You give it another go, trying to sound out the unfamiliar word. But you seem to say it well enough for Torres to get in a flap, nodding encouragingly."
    "你又试着念出这个生词。你念得还不错，Torres看起来挺激动的，连连点头鼓励你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8485
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_7426a80b:

    # t "Good, very good."
    t "好，很好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8487
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_dc65c135:

    # p "What did I just say?"
    p "我刚才说的是什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8491
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_086cc754:

    # t "Hello, of course! There's other ways too—and if you're trying to be more polite, it's \"salamu alikum.\""
    t "当然是打招呼！不过还有别的讲法——要是想更客气体面些，就说‘萨拉姆·阿莱库姆’。"
    # 译注: 摩洛哥阿拉伯语问候语 Salamu alaykum（愿平安与你同在）。

# game/script day12.rpy:8493
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_2696a2ce:

    # "He starts getting a bit carried away, blurring the line between being helpful and puffing out his chest feathers and showing off."
    "他开始有点飘了，简直是在显摆，都分不清他是在帮忙还是在炫耀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8497
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_4174ccb2:

    # t "\"Shokran\" means thank you."
    t "“Shokran”是谢谢的意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8499
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_5dea97e1:

    # t "\"Aafak\" means please, and you'd be surprised how much you can get by with that."
    t "“Aafak”是请的意思，你会发现“请”这个词有多好使。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8501
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_d4a949f4:

    # "You do your best to commit the words to memory, but you can't help but wonder how accurate any of this was, given his admitted lack of expertise."
    "你努力把这些词记住，但又忍不住嘀咕，他说的这些靠不靠谱啊，毕竟他自己也承认不太懂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8503
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_46fddc26:

    # "You're certain Rayjeeah would be the better teacher, but given she isn't here now, this will have to make do."
    "要是雷吉亚在就好了，她肯定教得更好，但她现在不在，只能凑合着听他的了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8505
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_455b5d24:

    # "A wheeling cry brings you back to the present as osprey flaps away from you both, settling on the railings close to you."
    "一声盘旋而过的啼鸣将你拉回当下，那只枭扑扇着翅膀从你俩身边飞开，落到了近旁的栏杆上"

# game/script day12.rpy:8507
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_fcf2d31a:

    # "No longer hidden from view, the beast instantly attracts the other's attention, who, to your surprise—and irritation—instantly drop whatever it is they were doing and flock around the bird, eager to get a closer view."
    "那野兽不再藏于视线之外，立刻引来了旁人的注意，令你又惊又恼的是，他们当即丢下手头的一切蜂拥围向那只鸟，个个争先恐后，只想看得更真切些"

# game/script day12.rpy:8509
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_dd009d82:

    # "Despite the supposed importance of their tasks, a few even catch sight of the spectacle from the mast above, swooping down the rigging, and running across the deck without the slightest concern."
    "也不知道他们那些活儿有多重要，有几个家伙甚至从桅杆上看到了，直接顺着绳索滑下来，在甲板上跑来跑去，一点都不在意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8511
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_3caf0b5f:

    # "In the rush you spot Samuel, Julian, and Wolf, as well as a few other familiar faces. Even the old lynx Konrad takes a break from his repairs, walking over with a wry smile on his face."
    "你在人群里看到了Samuel、Julian，还有Wolf，和其他几个熟面孔。就连老猞猁Konrad也停下了手里的活儿，带着一丝无奈的笑容走了过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8541
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_16dd3e6c:

    # "As some sort of order starts to form from the chaos, Samuel takes the lead, darting nimbly between the others in the race to get in front."
    "好歹是稍微有了点秩序，Samuel带头，在人群里窜来窜去，想抢到最前面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8543
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_da3421f6:

    # "[He]'s there before you can even scramble down the stairs from the helm, holding everyone's attention between [himself] and the increasingly agitated bird."
    "你还没从舵柄那儿跑下楼梯，他就已经到了，他和那只越来越躁动的老鹰吸引了所有人的目光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8545
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_50b4f708:

    # "If you'd thought it looked fierce before, it now looked positively vicious."
    "要是你之前觉得它够凶了，现在简直是凶相毕露。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8549
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b08622eb:

    # j "Maybe we should leave it be? I don't think I'd be so happy about us harrying it, if I were it."
    j "或许咱们该由着它去？要换作是我，被这么围观骚扰肯定也高兴不起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8551
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d28e69a4:

    # s "Oh come on Jules! Not every day you get to see something like this up close."
    s "哎，我说Jules！这种场面可不是天天都能见着的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8556
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_fb080aa8:

    # s "Who's up for a friendly wager? Anyone?"
    s "有没有想打个赌的？来来来，有没有？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8558
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_adfe4287:

    # "A jumbled series of replies comes back over the drum of the wind and rain, but the nods, claps, and excited flicks of tails speak clearly enough."
    "大家七嘴八舌地回应着，声音都混在风雨里了，不过看他们又是点头又是拍手，还兴奋地甩着尾巴，就知道他们有多激动了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8560
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ded15f5d:

    # s "Who bets they can get closer to the beast than me?"
    s "谁敢跟我赌，看谁能比我更靠近那只鸟？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8562
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c8b5256c:

    # "A few contenders in the crowd raise their hands, bringing cheers and approving smacks on the back. Julian looks torn about it, while Wolf just lurks further back, his expression unreadable as usual."
    "人群里有几个家伙举起了手，引来一片欢呼和拍背。Julian看起来有点犹豫，Wolf则退到了后面，还是一如既往地让人看不透。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8564
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_0e626497:

    # "Samuel, meanwhile, has a wild smile stretched across [his] muzzle. Despite the rain, [he]'s relishing the first bit of fun in days—the added dash of danger, and chance to win the respect of the crew making it all the more appealing."
    "与此同时，Samuel则咧开了一抹狂放的笑意，不顾雨水倾泻，[he]正享受着数日来头一遭的乐子，险中添趣，还有赢得全船敬重的机会，让这一切愈发诱人"

# game/script day12.rpy:8566
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_48938fe2:

    # sail "How about you get it to feed from your hand?"
    sail "要不你让它从你手里吃东西？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8568
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_31564e81:

    # "Someone shouts, tossing a fish towards the maned wolf's feet."
    "有人喊道，顺手把一条鱼扔到了鬃狼的脚边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8574
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4d7fbf48:

    # "[He] scoops it up with a paw, grinning."
    "他咧着嘴，用爪子捡起了鱼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8576
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_11d30f28:

    # s "Better yet!"
    s "这主意更好！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8580
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_898a21e5:

    # "[He] takes the bait and places it in his muzzle, wincing slightly at the taste."
    "他还真上钩了，把鱼叼了起来，不过好像不太喜欢那个味道，微微皱了皱眉头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8584
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_726513bd:

    # k "Ok, ok, come ere me to place ya bets!"
    k "好了好了，都来我这儿下注啊！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8598
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_286de888:

    # "Konrad calls out, setting himself to the side as a trusted figure to manage it all."
    "Konrad站到一边喊道，摆出了一副可靠的样子，要负责管好这件事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8600
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2388220c:

    # k "I think a day's rum seems fair for starters."
    k "我觉得先拿一天的朗姆酒当彩头挺合适的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8606
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_8566c4a8:

    # s "Make it two!"
    s "翻倍！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8608
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2e358166:

    # k "Aye, he says two. Are ya going to take that?"
    k "没错，他要两天。你应不应？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8610
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f5e52fed:

    # "He nods approvingly as a few of the other sailors agree, raising the stakes until an entire week's rum is pledged as a reward."
    "他满意地点点头，其他水手也跟着起哄，不断加码，最后有人承诺拿出一整周的朗姆酒当奖赏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8616
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_53c932be:

    # k "What says our expert?"
    k "你这个行家怎么看？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8620
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ecb49043:

    # "Konrad chuckles, turning to Torres for his opinion. He just shrugs, and points between the bird's talons and its beak. It's hard to choose which one was the most deadly, but you're certain that either would cut deep."
    "Konrad笑着看向Torres，想听听他的意见。Torres耸耸肩，指了指那鸟的爪子和喙。俩玩意儿都致命，实在难分伯仲，不过他敢肯定，不管哪个都能开膛破肚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8622
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5eb1baef:

    # t "With weapons like those, you should at least offer some coin too."
    t "这么厉害的家伙，光有朗姆酒，不得再加点赏钱啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8624
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_3b7229bb:

    # "You're surprised that he could endorse something so reckless, given your previous conversation."
    "想起之前和他聊过，你还挺惊讶他会赞同这么胡闹的事情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8626
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_11a633be:

    # p "Why didn't you say something?"
    p "你倒是吱一声啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8628
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9b6fee67:

    # t "And open myself up to the obvious jokes?"
    t "嫌不够他们笑话我的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8630
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_323623f7:

    # "Torres cocks his head to the side."
    "Torres歪着头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8634
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_19167a72:

    # t "Oh, come off it. They just want a better look. This fella's the most exciting thing we've seen in weeks."
    t "得了吧。他们就是想凑近点看。这家伙可是咱们这几个礼拜以来见过的最刺激的玩意儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8636
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b0d6cf45:

    # p "But someone could get really hurt."
    p "可是真会有人受伤的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8638
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1a694d99:

    # "You try to swallow the feeling that if that did happen, it'd all be your fault."
    "你想压下心头那股感觉——要是真出了事，肯定都得怪你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8640
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_be1869f0:

    # "Somehow."
    "鬼知道为什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8642
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4d653195:

    # t "And? They could also fall off the rigging tomorrow or have a line snap on them."
    t "然后呢？他们明天还可能从索具上摔下来，或者被崩断的缆绳抽中呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8644
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_7a57432c:

    # t "They aren't fledglings anymore. They can weigh up the risks themselves—it's up to them if they think it's worth the risk."
    t "他们又不是刚出窝的雏鸟了。他们完全能自己掂量风险——值不值得冒这个险全凭他们自己决断。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8646
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_43433bef:

    # "You watch silently as coins slip between hands, and bets are placed on which contender is judged to have the best chance."
    "你默默地看着水手们你来我往地传递着硬币，纷纷下注，赌谁能笑到最后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8648
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_239c8d4c:

    # p "How come you're not there then?"
    p "那你怎么不去？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8652
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_8a1c768d:

    # t "They'd complain I have an unfair advantage."
    t "他们会说我占便宜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8656
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9fe6d289:

    # t "And I don't want to make a mess of myself."
    t "我可不想把自己弄得灰头土脸的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8661
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c1502678:

    # "He trills quietly, shaking his head."
    "他轻轻地哼了一声，摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8679
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_20a8614b:

    # "Despite his words and your current feelings about the ship, you can't smother the spark of concern, even if it's more self-preservation. You push closer through the crowd, finding surprisingly little resistance as most have wisely concluded its best to keep their distance."
    "尽管他这么说，也顾不上你现在对这条船有什么看法，你还是忍不住担心起来，就算更多的是为了自保。你挤进人群，发现大家都很自觉地让开了路，看来他们都明白离远点比较好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8681
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a4eb7414:

    # "By the time you break through, you're just in time to see Julian dancing that fine line between egging the crew on and trying his luck. He's already showing off, turning his back to the beast at the exact moment it lunges towards him."
    "你好不容易挤进去，就看到Julian正在作死，一会儿怂恿船员，一会儿自己也上去玩命。他已经开始炫耀了，就在那怪物扑过来的一瞬间，他居然还敢背对着它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8686
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4a2ca850:

    # "You pull Julian back just before those heavy talons swoosh through the air where his head used to be." with hpunch
    "就在那对铁爪子要扫过他脑袋的时候，你一把把Julian拽了回来。" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:8688
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_72e04f7d:

    # p "Are you mad?"
    p "你有病吧！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8692
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_0dc2af8e:

    # "He snaps angrily as you tumble over each other."
    "他恼火地吼了一声，两人一块儿摔倒在地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8694
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_54ad3a15:

    # j "What was that for?"
    j "你抽什么风？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8696
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_38160b1f:

    # "He hisses angrily, trying to shrug off the laughter from the experienced hands."
    "他气急败坏地低吼着，想挣脱开，免得被那些老家伙们嘲笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8698
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_0d259b5f:

    # p "To keep you from losing an eye!"
    p "为了不让你被啄瞎一只招子！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8703
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a03c924f:

    # "You snarl back, expecting that he'd be at least somewhat grateful. Instead he struggles back, as if you'd touched him like a leper."
    "你恶狠狠地顶回去，还以为他至少会有点感激。没想到他却像躲麻风病人一样，使劲往后挣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8705
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_dcd8cc22:

    # j "Get off!" with hpunch
    j "滚开！" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:8707
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b0d839f1:

    # p "Fuck's sake, think before you act!"
    p "他妈的，用你的猪脑子好好想想再行动！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8714
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_800fbc5f:

    # p "I didn't think that you would throw your last remaining shred of sense overboard just because you've gotten off."
    p "我真没想到你一发泄完，就把仅剩的那点理智都喂了鲨鱼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8716
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_8d10582d:

    # j "Oh shut up, you sound like you think you're god's gift to earth."
    j "哦，你给我闭嘴吧，说的好像你是老天爷赏给人间的宝贝似的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8718
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2c8494c4:

    # j "I don't need you telling me what to do just because of earlier. Allowing me to visit him doesn't give you authority over me."
    j "别以为刚才的事就能让你对我指手画脚。准我去探望他，可不代表你就成了管束我的长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8721
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a2f50923:

    # p "You literally want to be down in the sick bay, getting chewed out by Arthur for goofing around?"
    p "你是真想跑到医务室，然后因为瞎搞被Arthur臭骂一顿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8723
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_313b7822:

    # j "I don't need you telling me what to do."
    j "用不着你来教训我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8730
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_959eee75:

    # "He turns around at just the right time to watch another of the crew attempt the same move. He's not so lucky, and instead reaps the unceremonious reward of a slash through his clothes—and fortunately nothing more."
    "他恰好这时转过身来，正瞧见另一名船员试图照搬同样的动作，那人的运气可没这么好， 他衣服被划开一道口子——但所幸仅此而已"

# game/script day12.rpy:8732
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4ff5e8dc:

    # "A chorus of nervous laughter erupts around you, leaving Julian's attempt forgotten."
    "你周围爆发出一阵紧张的笑声，大家都忘了Julian刚才的尝试。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8734
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b062803a:

    # p "Seems like you do."
    p "看来你就是需要人管。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8738
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_81dfc60e:

    # "Julian stiffens for a moment, scratching his shoulders. He glances back at the rest of the crew, who, having witnessed his moment of glory slip by, now cheer on the next contender without a second thought."
    "Julian僵了一下，挠了挠肩膀。他回头看了看其他船员，他们见他出丑，早就把目光转向了下一个挑战者，欢呼雀跃。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8740
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1ec7fa45:

    # "It seems like they've entirely forgotten him."
    "看来他们已经完全把他给忘了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8744
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_461ae549:

    # j "Sorry. I just..."
    j "对不起，我只是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8746
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e80f5281:

    # "He sighs."
    "他叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8748
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_7e78c35d:

    # j "Thanks, I guess. Shame you won't have my back for much longer."
    j "谢了，不过……可惜你很快就不能罩着我了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8750
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_cbfde8b0:

    # p "Well... you don't have to stay if you don't want to."
    p "嗯……如果你不想留下，也没人逼你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8754
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9f975748:

    # j "What's that supposed to mean?"
    j "你这话什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8773
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_7b3d476e:

    # p "You know Arthur's shtick is all bullshit."
    p "你知道Arthur那套理论就是放屁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8777
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_788d4a00:

    # j "You did fall asleep."
    j "你就是睡着了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8779
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1615de72:

    # p "Because I'd had nothing to do but work, work, work. But that's hardly the point."
    p "还不是因为我除了没日没夜地干活，什么都不能做。但这根本不是重点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8781
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_171f6bb5:

    # p "What I'm saying is, is this really what you want? Just a minute ago you were willing to let a bird almost shred you to ribbons just to get one bit closer to the crew?"
    p "我是说，这真的是你想要的吗？就在刚才，为了能离那些水手们近一点，你差点被那只鸟给撕成碎片？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8783
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_289f533c:

    # p "They forgot about you in the next instant."
    p "结果呢，他们转眼就把你忘了个干净。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8787
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e0102519:

    # "It doesn't feel so bad to point out that they were back on the next contender, barely even recognising that Julian had failed to keep up."
    "看到他们立刻又去给下一个挑战者加油，压根儿没人注意到Julian掉队了，我心里倒是好受了点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8789
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_24fd2e3f:

    # j "Do you even know what you're going to do in Morocco?"
    j "你知道自己去摩洛哥要干什么吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8791
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b81a15af:

    # "Julian shoots back."
    "Julian反问道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8796
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ffaff898:

    # j "{cps=5000}Do you even know what you're going to do in Morocco?{/cps}" nointeract
    j "{cps=5000}你知道自己去摩洛哥要干什么吗？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:8803
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c3417f25:

    # p "Getting exactly what you and Nomax were up to earlier."
    p "还能有什么好事，不就是你和Nomax刚才在做的那点事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8806
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ddbbb316:

    # p "What every sailor does when they get to shore."
    p "所有水手上了岸都会做的事。 "

# game/script day12.rpy:8808
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_363d0f26:

    # "You grin, trying to goad his imagination."
    "你咧嘴一笑，想引诱他展开想象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8812
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e33a3be6:

    # p "Imagine the possibilities of unlimited shore leave, and as yet unknown {i}delights{/i}."
    p "想象一下，无限的岸上假期，还有还不知道有什么好玩的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8814
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f16eac1d:

    # j "Is this really the time to think about sex?"
    j "现在是想那种事的时候吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8816
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4748e85e:

    # p "With you around? It's hard not to."
    p "有你在，我可没法不想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8818
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_20e69950:

    # j "I enjoyed it as well, but I bet you won't even be thinking about us anymore after a few days."
    j "我也很开心，但我敢打赌，过不了几天你肯定就把我忘到脑后去了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8821
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_468e0842:

    # p "Imagine the possibilities of unlimited shore leave. Food, drink, and who knows what other {i}delights{/i}."
    p "想象一下，无限的岸上假期。吃的、喝的，还有谁知道有什么乐子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8823
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_8dec86f3:

    # j "Yeah sure, I bet you won't even be thinking about us anymore."
    j "是是是，我打赌你肯定早就把我忘了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8825
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b1da839c:

    # p "I wouldn't necessarily have to..."
    p "我也不是非得怎么样..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8829
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_206a2447:

    # "Julian frowns."
    "Julian皱起了眉头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8831
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f207d852:

    # j "What do you mean by that?"
    j "你这话什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8833
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_11eccfdf:

    # p "Well, I may be leaving, but what's really stopping you if you decided that this ship's not your thing?"
    p "就算我要走了，但你要是觉得这条船不怎么样，还有什么能拦得住你呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8837
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f008502d:

    # j "Do I really have to explain to you again that I {i}cannot{/i} leave?"
    j "我不是跟你说过了吗，我{i}不能{/i}离开！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8839
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_bba6eb98:

    # p "Yes yes, your old man. I know, but would he actually know though?"
    p "是是，你老爹。我知道，可他真能知道吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8841
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d581ef2b:

    # "You press."
    "你追问道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8843
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_cb94ed3b:

    # p "There's plenty of other ships there, and you're already more experienced than me and Wolf..."
    p "那么多船呢，再说你现在可比我和Wolf有经验多了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8845
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b89d62ec:

    # "You flick your tail."
    "你晃了晃尾巴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8847
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b962db92:

    # p "It's simple, you just got yourself {i}promoted{/i} onto a better ship."
    p "简单，你就当自己升职了，跳槽到了一艘更好的船上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8851
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_3bae8353:

    # p "All the old man knows is that he's got an ambitious son, who is eager to take an opportunity when it arises."
    p "你老爹就当他有个雄心壮志的儿子，特别会抓机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8853
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_30f19993:

    # p "Eh? Doesn't sound too bad if you phrase it like that, does it?"
    p "呃？按你这么一说，听起来倒也不赖，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8855
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_bfc0e4c2:

    # p "That is, of course, after a decent stay in the city, sampling everything it has to offer."
    p "当然了，前提是在城里好好玩上一阵子，把好东西都体验一遍。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8859
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_20c524e0:

    # p "Including {i}you{/i} again, if given the chance."
    p "要是有机会，也包括再跟你鬼混一次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8861
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_6667fbd3:

    # p "I tell you, at first I was terrified, but now I can't help but look forward to making my own way, being in charge of my destiny..."
    p "跟你说，一开始我害怕死了，但现在我特想自己闯出一片天，掌握自己的命运..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8863
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_0550d2f3:

    # "You watch closely as Julian goes quiet, considering your words. No doubt working through the alluring delights such freedom could entail, but more importantly, just being free himself..."
    "你 внимательно 仔细观察着 Julian 沉默不语，似乎在琢磨你说的那些话。毫无疑问，他正在考虑自由能带来什么好处，更重要的是，他自己也能获得自由..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8865
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5d89bfa5:

    # j "Maybe..."
    j "也许吧……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8867
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1a8da0c3:

    # p "Maybe? Come on."
    p "也许吧？ 算我求你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8869
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_76812e37:

    # j "I said maybe."
    j "我说也许。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8871
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d7b11cc8:

    # "He shrugs for a moment, waving his hand in circles while he turns about, thinking on the spot."
    "他耸了耸肩，原地转了个圈，手也跟着比划，好像在临时抱佛脚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8877
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2728735b:

    # p "I don't know."
    p "不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8879
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_59f541e5:

    # "You sigh, shaking your head."
    "你叹了口气，摇摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8881
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_6c65f8fd:

    # p "I'm trying to figure it all out, get some advice... I dunno."
    p "我想把这些都搞清楚，也想听听你的意见... 我也不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8883
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_29984842:

    # p "Everyone else who could help is either busy, or doesn't want to get involved."
    p "能帮上忙的人，不是忙得不可开交，就是不想掺和。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8887
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c53b5e01:

    # j "Even though they know Arthur's a bit..."
    j "就算他们都知道 Arthur 有点..."

# game/script day12.rpy:8889
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_21d16d6d:

    # "Julian whistles and makes a choice expression with his hands."
    "Julian吹了声口哨，意味深长地比了个手势。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8893
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a0cdf6ca:

    # p "Yeah."
    p "可不是嘛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8895
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e158ce1e:

    # "You rub your temples with your paws, trying to massage out the knot of tension building in there."
    "你用手揉搓着太阳穴，想把脑子里那团乱麻给揉开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8897
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2a3258e6:

    # p "I'm not sure what there is to do there. Other than maybe just finding a passing ship and trying to barter my way home, if I'm lucky."
    p "我也不知道能做什么。要说有什么，也就是看看能不能碰上一艘顺路的船，想办法搭个便船回家，如果我够幸运的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8899
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4006f139:

    # "You give a fatalistic shrug."
    "你无奈地耸耸肩，听天由命。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8901
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_75b64a81:

    # p "It's not like I can say I'm a great sailor."
    p "我又不是什么了不起的水手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8903
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1a54c233:

    # j "Why would you want to go back home?"
    j "你为什么要回家？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8905
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c496b0e1:

    # "You're caught off guard by the comment. Enough that it takes a few moments for you to process."
    "你没料到他会这么问，一时语塞，愣了好一会儿才反应过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8909
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d223cd49:

    # p "Why wouldn't I?"
    p "我为什么不回？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8913
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b6446303:

    # p "What other choice do I have?"
    p "我还有别的选择吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8915
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_939e975d:

    # j "Come on. You left that place for a reason. Is this really worse than what you left?"
    j "得了吧。你离开那鬼地方总有个理由的。难道这儿比你当初逃离的地方还糟？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8919
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_26613ae4:

    # p "Yeah Julian, it's really not that bad. You know, if I don't think too hard about the scars across my back. Or about the first mate who has it out for me."
    p "是啊，Julian，其实也没那么可怕。只要我不去想我背上的那些伤疤。或者那个老跟我过不去的大副。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8921
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e59913c9:

    # p "But aside from that it's all dandy."
    p "除了这些，一切都好得很。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8923
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ed84651d:

    # p "Come on, I don't really have another choice but to leave and head back home."
    p "算了吧，我真的没别的选择，只能一走了之，回家去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8927
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5e398b2e:

    # p "I'd rather not. But I don't have any other options."
    p "我也不想啊。但我没得选。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8931
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4a985753:

    # j "Sure you do!"
    j "怎么会！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8933
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_03603d0f:

    # "He shakes his head, frowning, a smile forming across his face."
    "他摇摇头，皱着眉，嘴角却忍不住露出了笑意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8935
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_6fc4fe09:

    # j "So it didn't work out here, fine! I bet with all the ships going in and out of that port, laden with spice and whatever else they ship through here, there'll be plenty of demand for help!"
    j "所以说，在这儿混不开是吧，行！我跟你打赌，那港口里进进出出的船只那么多，满载着香料和其他乱七八糟的玩意儿，肯定到处都缺人手！"

# game/script day12.rpy:8939
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_23ddcfc0:

    # j "After all, they took us on with no experience! At least you now can claim to know a thing or two about what's what on a ship."
    j "说到底，当初他们招我们的时候，咱们可都是没经验的！最起码现在你也能吹嘘自己对船上的事儿懂个一星半点了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8941
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1c353a85:

    # p "Like not falling asleep on watch?"
    p "比如值班的时候不能打瞌睡？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8943
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d0ec50ae:

    # "You laugh half-heartedly."
    "你勉强笑了笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8947
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_94836889:

    # j "Yeah, like that."
    j "对，就比如这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8951
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e6637396:

    # "He laughs only for a short while, not wholly appreciating the darker sense of humor."
    "他没笑多久就停了，似乎不太能欣赏这种黑色幽默。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8955
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_fa235295:

    # p "I doubt they care for someone who is already showing the signs of being a troublemaker. At least in the eyes of a captain."
    p "我怀疑他们根本不在乎一个已经有惹事精潜质的人。至少在船长眼里是这样的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8957
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c4e29603:

    # j "Well don't end up in bed with the captain on your first day then. You don't have to apply while you're topless, you know."
    j "那你可别第一天就爬上船长的床。跟你说，应聘的时候不用脱衣服，知道不。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8959
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_70b92fcd:

    # "You eye him silently, not as convinced as he is."
    "你默默地看着他，心里远没有他那么乐观。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8961
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5438af2c:

    # j "Trust me. One great big port city, bustling with all sorts of people going about."
    j "相信我。那可是个大港口城市，人来人往，热闹得很。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8964
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_442e9b01:

    # j "But think about it. One great big port city, bustling with all sorts of people going about."
    j "好好想想。那可是个大港口城市，各种各样的人都有，熙熙攘攘的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8966
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b7cdb41b:

    # j "I'm sure you're someone who is able to make the best out of it."
    j "我肯定你这样的人，一定能混出个名堂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8968
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ca3b7c81:

    # p "I'm not so sure."
    p "我可没那么有把握。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8970
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_fbe9ae2a:

    # p "This is all easy enough for you to say. What would you do if you were in my position?"
    p "你倒是说得轻巧。要是你处在我这个位置，你打算怎么办？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8972
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d7b11cc8_1:

    # "He shrugs for a moment, waving his hand in circles while he turns about, thinking on the spot."
    "他耸了耸肩，原地转了个圈，手也跟着比划，好像在临时抱佛脚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8978
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_6b391c4b:

    # p "I will figure it out when I get there."
    p "到时候再说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8980
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d4af9f6a:

    # "You return a dismissive shrug."
    "你不以为然地耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8984
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_8fca078c:

    # j "Yeah, great plan..."
    j "呵呵，真是好主意……"

# game/script day12.rpy:8986
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f9ea0f91:

    # p "What do you expect? It's a port I've never been to before... More than that, it's a {i}kingdom{/i} I've never been to."
    p "你还指望什么？我又没去过那个港口…… 不止如此，那还是我从未去过的{i}kingdom{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8988
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_cff2de72:

    # p "Do you want me to lay out a 10-point plan of action?"
    p "难不成你还想让我拟出一份十条行动纲领？"

# game/script day12.rpy:8990
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e14bc031:

    # "He frowns and shakes his head."
    "他皱着眉头，摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8992
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_dd63a0a0:

    # j "No, but if you don't even know what you're doing yourself, then please don't try to lecture me on what I should or shouldn't do."
    j "不，你要是自己都不知道在干什么，就别在这儿对我指手画脚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8994
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ad8e67af:

    # p "First thing will probably be to try and figure out when the next ship heading north is going to pass by."
    p "首先得搞清楚下一班北上的船什么时候来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:8996
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9e4710c4:

    # p "Until then... I don't know."
    p "在那之前……我也不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9000
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a58aba3d:

    # p "Arthur mentioned that it's a busy enough port and it should see a ship going that way within a month."
    p "Arthur说过，这港口挺繁忙的，应该一个月内就能看到有船往那边去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9002
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4356421c:

    # p "By then you'll probably be enjoying the sun of the southern hemisphere."
    p "到那时，你大概已经在南半球享受阳光了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9004
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_fc55a99e:

    # p "What would you do if you were in my position?"
    p "你要是我，会怎么做？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9006
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d7b11cc8_2:

    # "He shrugs for a moment, waving his hand in circles while he turns about, thinking on the spot."
    "他耸了耸肩，原地转了个圈，手也跟着比划，好像在临时抱佛脚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9025
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e21f0614:

    # "A disappointed jeer ripples over the deck, interrupting things before you can get an answer out of Julian. You both turn to catch a glimpse of the osprey swooping away off the ship, settling on a piece of flotsam that, despite its size, offers sanctuary from the crew."
    "一阵失望的起哄嘘声在甲板上散开，在你从Julian口中套出答案前打断了交谈。你们俩回过头，只见那只鱼鹰振翅脱离了船舷，掠过水面落在一块漂浮物上，那片残骸虽小，倒足够庇护它免受水手们的打扰。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9045
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5db88332:

    # "With the osprey gone, the rest of the crew filter back to their tasks, and it seems you two being the only idle hands left, you attract the most attention and draw the shortest straw."
    "鱼鹰一飞走，其余水手纷纷散去各干各的差事，而你们俩成了唯二游手好闲的人，自然招来了最多的目光，抽中了最烂的下下签。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9052
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a5275607:

    # s "[name]?"
    s "[name]？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9060
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4c8f102b:

    # "Samuel grunts, barely pausing to clamber towards the rigging for the mid-mast."
    "Samuel嘟囔着，头也不抬地爬向中桅的索具。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9065
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5f48767a:

    # s "Get down and work the bilge. We'll have taken on plenty of water, so someone's got to give it a good working."
    s "下来，去底舱抽水。咱们进了不少水，得有人好好干活才行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9067
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a6420c8e:

    # s "May as well be you."
    s "你去正好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9071
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_29bdf034:

    # "He pauses for a moment, eyes flicking between you both."
    "他顿了顿，目光在你俩之间转悠。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9077
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ff73e2dc:

    # s "Actually Julian, you go with him too. He'll probably need a hand."
    s "这样吧，Julian，你也跟他一起去，他可能需要搭把手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9079
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_022d4ab2:

    # "The memory of stale, rancid sea-water that's been able to tickle through the ships decks, sloshing about and picking up all the smells and detritus you could just about expect... is not a pleasant aroma."
    "回想起那些从各层甲板渗漏下去、在船底晃荡并裹挟了你能想到的所有污秽残渣的死海水……那股腐臭陈馊的恶臭绝不好闻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9083
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5e9c4ed6:

    # "You accept it because that's what you were meant to be doing before the commotion, but roping Julian into it feels like a bit of a low move."
    "你认栽领命，因为这本就是你引起骚乱前该干的活计，但把Julian也拖下水未免显得有些不厚道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9085
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_43cc34db:

    # p "Really?"
    p "真的假的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9087
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5ce757e1:

    # "You feel bolder to speak out, given you won't be about much longer."
    "知道自己待不长了，说话也硬气了不少。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9089
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a9529338:

    # p "I get that you might want to punish me, but Julian doesn't need to deal with that stink."
    p "我知道您想罚我，但Julian没必要跟着遭这份恶臭的罪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9093
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e501c88c:

    # s "Punish Julian?"
    s "惩罚Julian？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9095
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_89ab3f30:

    # s "Since when do you view working on a ship as punishment? It has to get done, and it's easier to get done when it's shared. Besides, I've got nothing else for you to do up here right now."
    s "你从什么时候开始把船上的苦活当成惩罚了？事情总得有人做，两个人分担更轻松。再说了，眼下甲板上我也没别的事派给你们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9097
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_69aaafef:

    # "[He] gestures about the mostly clear deck."
    "他指了指基本空荡荡的甲板。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9101
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_cac5af82:

    # s "And the two of you won't end up completely knackered after working the pump for long."
    s "而且两个人轮班抽泵，你们也不至于累得彻底趴下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9103
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_864e8180:

    # j "That's hardly reassuring."
    j "听起来一点也不让人放心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9107
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a4f173b4:

    # "The maned wolf rolls his eyes, climbing halfway up the rigging."
    "长鬃狼翻了个白眼，爬到索具一半高的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9109
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_520bfe39:

    # s "Hey Julian, can I get in on that?"
    s "嘿，Julian，算我一个呗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9111
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_8733a13d:

    # j "I'm sorry?{w} In on what?"
    j "啥？{w} 算你啥？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9113
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a6d37d0c:

    # s "You know, whatever it is that pays you for complaining. You two must have gotten an {i}amazing{/i} deal with how much you're doing that over just working the damn ship."
    s "别装了，就是那种靠抱怨就能捞钱的活儿。你们俩肯定谈成了{i}天价{/i}合同，抱怨的时间都他娘的比干活还多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9117
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2e006cb6:

    # j "Alright, alright..."
    j "行吧，行吧..."

# game/script day12.rpy:9119
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1fd5e477:

    # "Julian replies saltily, flicking his tail about and folding his arms."
    "Julian不耐烦地回答，尾巴甩来甩去，抱紧了胳膊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9121
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_dee7e09c:

    # p "Come on..."
    p "别废话了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:9123
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_deadd189:

    # "You grunt, gesturing for him to follow. It's a rotten deal, but better to have him around than not."
    "你咕哝着，示意他跟上。这活儿是够烂的，但总比少个人强。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9125
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_724af958:

    # j "Let's get this shit over with."
    j "赶紧把这鬼事儿给办了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9148
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_303e7b0e:

    # "You follow Julian down through the bowels of the ship, trying to memorize the scent of fresh open air. With the ship still hunkered down to ride out the storm, there's precious little air flow between the decks, and as you move through and further down, the smells get progressively worse."
    "你跟着Julian往下走，一路深入船舱底部，拼命记住甲板上新鲜空气的味道。为了抗住风暴，船身紧紧地压低着，甲板之间的空气流通很差，越往下走，味道就越刺鼻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9150
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_68251072:

    # "Every now and then a particularly unpleasant smell punches out from the crowd—the acidic hint of vomit, or the foul, watery mix of saltwater gone rotten—greets your senses."
    "时不时有特别难闻的气味从混杂的异味中突袭而来——酸腐的呕吐物，或是海水变质后的腥臭馊水味——刺激着你的感官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9152
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b150c109:

    # "No wonder Wolf spent most of his time up on the deck. The smell by now must have driven him mad."
    "怪不得Wolf成天待在甲板上。这味儿时间长了，能把人熏疯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9154
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_8c0f7320:

    # "The bilge pump itself is dark and dingy; a small room between the ship's sections, filled with only a single lantern that flickers from behind a thick glass screen. It does little to illuminate the room, and gives it a sickly hue."
    "底舱抽水泵所在的舱室阴暗污秽，那是夹在船体各舱段之间的一处狭窄隔间，仅靠一盏隔着厚玻璃罩忽明忽暗的提灯照明。微弱的灯火根本驱不散黑暗，反而将四下映照出一层病态的惨绿。"
    # 译注: bilge pump（舱底抽水泵），用于排出积聚在船底恶臭污水的泵机，舱底抽水是船上最脏最累的苦差。

# game/script day12.rpy:9159
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d5aaf425:

    # "The smell, unfortunately, is just as bad as you expect it to be."
    "果然，这味道比想象的还要糟糕。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9161
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e87e5e08:

    # j "Fuck..."
    j "靠..."

# game/script day12.rpy:9163
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9cafe351:

    # "You both take a moment to try and recover, covering your nose and mouth with your cold wet shirt like you're breathing poison."
    "你们俩停下来缓了口气，用湿冷的外衣死死捂住口鼻，仿佛每吸一口空气都在吞咽剧毒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9165
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1a7404a9:

    # "It's a pungent aroma, that's for sure."
    "真是刺鼻的味道，没跑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9167
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_215ec8c7:

    # j "I'd rather take my chances on the rigging any day."
    j "我宁愿每天都在桅杆上玩命。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9169
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_07f2b3a7:

    # "Julian replies with a dry heave, eventually steadying himself."
    "Julian干呕了一声，这才稳住身子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9171
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_24617196:

    # p "It's not so bad if you breathe through your mouth."
    p "要是用嘴呼吸，就没那么难受了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9175
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_de8a9fe7:

    # j "I'm fine... it's just..."
    j "我没事... 就是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:9177
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2a9dd5f4:

    # j "If I pass out, don't leave me alone here."
    j "要是我昏过去了，可别把我一个人扔这儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9179
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_bd098969:

    # p "Let's just get this over with..."
    p "赶紧干完拉倒..."

# game/script day12.rpy:9186
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_45e447a1:

    # "You push forward and grab the handle of the pump, taking a measured but deep breath through your mouth."
    "你往前一步，抓住水泵的把手，用嘴深吸了一口气，尽量稳住。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9188
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_91cc54b1:

    # "Fuck. The smell really isn't any better, regardless, but eventually it deadens your senses. At least enough to just about block it out while you get into a rhythm working the bilge."
    "操。 还是臭得要死，但闻多了也就麻木了。起码能让你在抽水的时候稍微忽略一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9190
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_82c6bb02:

    # "You decide the only salve is to try and forget your current surroundings entirely."
    "你觉得现在唯一的解脱，就是彻底忘记身处的环境。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9192
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5cb793f7:

    # p "So... what would you do if you had free reign to do whatever?"
    p "话说... 要是想干啥就干啥，你最想干嘛？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9196
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5c160b3a:

    # j "I already told you-"
    j "我不是跟你说过了吗——"

# game/script day12.rpy:9198
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c51f4f25:

    # p "That's dodging the question if ever I saw it."
    p "这算盘打得，当我傻啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9202
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_217ef5b4:

    # j "I don't want to sound insensitive."
    j "我就是怕说出来你不爱听。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9204
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_7fdc65ee:

    # "He shrugs, becoming still for a moment. Perhaps it's your surroundings, or his misfortune getting sucked into this, but you've not really seen Julian like this before."
    "他耸耸肩，突然安静下来。也许是这鬼地方的影响，也许是他倒霉被卷进这事儿，你还从没见过Julian这副模样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9206
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c7d7ff70:

    # "He just seems... despondent, yet also... hopeless?"
    "他看起来... 既沮丧，又... 绝望？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9208
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c973cacb:

    # "Crushed between opposing ideas of who he should be, without a say in the matter."
    "他应该成为什么样的人，各种互相冲突的想法压得他喘不过气，自己还根本没得选。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9210
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_713aecd4:

    # p "It's ok. Whatever you say, it's not going to change anything for me, is it?"
    p "没事。随便你怎么说，对我来说都一样，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9214
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f35cd9d1:

    # j "How should I know, from the way you've been acting?"
    j "我怎么知道？就你最近那德行？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9216
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_20cc780c:

    # j "You've not been yourself at all since that fuck up on weather watch. And I get, like, being salty that you did fuck up, but if you ask me, you're dodging a bullet."
    j "自从你上次在天气预报上搞砸了之后，你就一直不对劲。我知道你搞砸了肯定会不高兴，但要我说，你这是躲过一劫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9218
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e80f5281_1:

    # "He sighs."
    "他叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9224
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5d791383:

    # j "Don't you agree?"
    j "你觉得呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9228
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_14a765c5:

    # j "If that's what Arthur is like when it's a minor screw-up, I don't want to see what he's like when there is a major screw-up."
    j "要是Arthur只是出点小错就那样，我可真不想看到他犯大错的时候会怎么样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9230
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c8073ada:

    # p "Ah, yeah... I get with your father and all... not much of a choice to escape."
    p "唉，是啊……我懂你和你老爹那事儿……也没啥选择的余地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9236
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f4193e40:

    # j "Yes, and it's me who has to stay here with the short-fused ass."
    j "是啊，结果就我得跟这一点就炸的家伙待在一块儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9238
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_15679b64:

    # j "Who knows how long until I'm the next one to stand by the rigging waiting for a dozen?"
    j "谁知道我还要多久才会成为下一个站在帆缆旁边等着挨鞭子的人？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9240
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_00c4a289:

    # j "Or do you imagine that that's a fun thought to have in the back of my mind every day for the next year or two while I'll be working under him?"
    j "还是你觉得每天都想着接下来一两年都得在他手底下干活，会让我很兴奋是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9244
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_185d56c7:

    # j "Yeah. There I was thinking about maybe having a horse to myself all alone among the currents of the lonely ocean."
    j "唉。我原本还想着，没准能有自己的一条船，独自漂在孤零零的大海上呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9246
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_be8a38bf:

    # "Even his jokes are getting worse."
    "现在连他讲的笑话都越来越烂了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9248
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_459d0a1c:

    # p "Fuckable is the last thing that comes to mind when I think about Arthur."
    p "一想到Arthur，我脑子里最后才会蹦出“想上他”这种念头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9250
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_06ac1576:

    # "He shakes his head, flicking his tail as he takes a steady breath and keeps working the pump."
    "他摇了摇头，尾巴甩来甩去，深吸一口气，继续抽水。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9254
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e7237138:

    # p "Hardly. There's nothing fun about leadership that's gone nuts."
    p "扯淡。领导要是疯了，那可一点意思都没有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9258
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_3f2771b5:

    # p "But you are right, there's nothing fun about crazy."
    p "不过你说的对，疯子确实没什么意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9260
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_12215411:

    # "Perhaps it is the dark, oppressive feel of your shared surroundings, but in the creaking depths of the ship, you can't help but feel trapped."
    "也许是因为周围环境太黑暗压抑了，在这艘吱吱作响的破船深处，你总觉得被困住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9262
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c2f186e2:

    # p "But you're actually a good sailor. I'm sure you'll be fine."
    p "其实你是个好水手，我相信你肯定没问题的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9266
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_777bd6f1:

    # j "No matter what the idiot may have told you, you did fine. {w}And look how much good it did you."
    j "不管那个白痴跟你说了什么，你干得挺好的。{w} 结果呢，对你有啥好处？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9268
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f862e701:

    # j "I'm just waiting to be the mate's {i}'ire of the week.'{/i}"
    j "我现在就等着当大副本{i}周的倒霉蛋{/i}了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9272
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_defefdf3:

    # j "What if I'm not though?"
    j "要不是呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9274
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e1171d26:

    # "You try to shift him away from such thoughts."
    "你想让他别再这么想了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9276
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_66bfeccc:

    # p "Cheer up. Can't dwell on things that haven't happened yet... I hear from the rest of the crew that Morocco's not the worst port to come into."
    p "振作点。别老琢磨还没影儿的事……我听其他船员说，摩洛哥那港口还不错呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9280
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_db8134d8:

    # p "If you're unable to fulfill the equine's desires, then I bet there's plenty of fine, arabian stallions to satisfy-"
    p "如果你没法满足你那“马”的欲望，我敢说有很多骏俏的阿拉伯种马能伺候好你——"

# game/script day12.rpy:9283
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4129369d:

    # p "If you're unable to fulfill your equine's desires, then I bet there's plenty of fine, arabian stallions to satisfy-"
    p "要是你满足不了自家那匹骏马的欲望，我敢说摩洛哥肯定有大把纯种阿拉伯种马能满足——"

# game/script day12.rpy:9285
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_00144147:

    # "You wink, snapping your fingers."
    "你眨了眨眼，打了个响指。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9291
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d66cb9d0:

    # j "So you see me go whoring my way through all the brothels they have to offer? Drown my misery that way?"
    j "你的意思是让我去逛遍那里的窑子，借酒浇愁？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9294
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_da752ab3:

    # j "I suppose I wouldn't mind a little more fun even after his ass."
    j "我觉得就算在他之后，我也还是想找点乐子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9298
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_385b6443:

    # j "I suppose I could go whoring my way through all the brothels they have to offer."
    j "我想我可以去逛遍那里的窑子，借酒浇愁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9300
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ce4ede02:

    # j "And I suppose, if I didn't have to come back-"
    j "而且我想，要是我不用再回来就好了——"

# game/script day12.rpy:9302
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5042db2a:

    # p "Realistically."
    p "现实点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9306
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d476644b:

    # j "OK, I'd go to a few brothels. Get out whatever sour stuff's in my system from my time on this ship, and then try again."
    j "行吧，我打算先去几趟窑子，把在船上憋的那些鸟气都泻了，再考虑别的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9308
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5175adf9:

    # j "There's got to be some other reputable ships there. Maybe a few crisscrossing the Mediterranean if I still needed to learn the ropes."
    j "那儿肯定还有其他靠谱的船。如果还需要学点本事，也许可以找几艘在地中海往返的船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9310
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_7f4b9869:

    # p "The way I'm imagining it, you don't have a father trying to mold you into a navy man."
    p "我寻思着，你又没有个当海军的爹逼着你干这行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9312
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5616ab61:

    # "You add, trying to steer him away from such a narrow view."
    "你赶紧岔开话题，想让他别这么死脑筋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9314
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c12241b7:

    # j "Then I'll stay ashore longer and sample the exotic... How did you call it? {i}Delights-{/i}?"
    j "那我就多在岸上待几天，好好尝尝异国...你咋说的来着？ {i}“欢乐-{/i}”？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9316
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_dd640195:

    # p "You've been on the same pay as me."
    p "你那份饷银跟我一样多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9320
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_8cce3d13:

    # j "I've been taking more chances with the dice than you—and am quicker to get in on any bets as well."
    j "我赌骰子比你敢下注——押注时也比你果断。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9322
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_78e89ce3:

    # "He smiles and shrugs his shoulders, basking in the opportunity to kinda say \"I told you so\" about the osprey earlier."
    "他咧嘴一笑耸了耸肩，十分享受就刚才鱼鹰的事向你炫耀‘我早就警告过你’的得意劲儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9326
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_193721af:

    # j "You should always look out for ways to make a little more on the side-"
    j "你得想办法多捞点油水。-"

# game/script day12.rpy:9328
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ef60c85a:

    # p "I don't know why I asked you. Of course you wouldn't give a reasonable answer."
    p "我也不知道为啥问你，你肯定说不出啥正经玩意儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9330
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9fd2bf77:

    # j "No?"
    j "没有吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9334
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_11c5acd7:

    # j "You were the one who started talking about delights. I thought it sounded perfectly reasonable! The very thought of having the delights of an entire foreign, exciting port to explore is something not to squander."
    j "还不是你先提的“欢乐”。我觉得这主意挺好啊！好不容易到了个有异国情调的港口，不好好享受一番，那不白来了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9338
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_68441ced:

    # j "I thought it sounded perfectly reasonable! The very thought of having the delights of an entire foreign, exciting port to explore is something not to squander."
    j "我觉得这主意挺好啊！好不容易到了个有异国情调的港口，不好好享受一番，那不白来了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9340
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c14cfb4f:

    # "At least he resists the jibe at your expense about it perhaps just being wistful dreams."
    "哼，他总算没挖苦你，说这些只是白日做梦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9342
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2e310906:

    # j "Shore leave's pretty much all everyone's really been talking about."
    j "大家伙儿现在就盼着靠岸休假了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9344
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_afa649c2:

    # j "But really, what else do you think a bunch of bored sailors would talk about?"
    j "不过说真的，你还能指望一帮闲得蛋疼的水手聊些啥？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9346
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a18a41c6:

    # "While it's for different reasons, you can't help but feel your spirits lifted further by Julian's excited demeanor. He's certainly looking forward to the prospect of shore leave; the chance to stretch his legs and cut loose away from the prying eyes of the officers."
    "虽然大家期待的原因不尽相同，但Julian那兴奋劲儿，也着实感染了你。他可是盼这一天盼很久了，终于能有机会下地溜达溜达，还能躲开那些长官的监视。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9348
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_af9c383c:

    # "You can't help but think with perhaps the right nudge, he might consider taking it a bit further."
    "你心里琢磨着，要稍微拱拱火，说不定他能玩得更开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9350
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d66d3c4d:

    # p "It's ok, I get it. It does sound like you're terribly excited for it."
    p "没事儿，我懂。听你这口气，是真挺激动啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9352
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_84f9de83:

    # p "Shame all good things must come to an end, right?"
    p "天下没有不散的宴席，是吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9356
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_3e1be255:

    # j "Oh, I'm hoping it'll be a long stopover. I've been trying to cajole some of the right folks that might hold some say in such matters."
    j "哦，我倒是希望多停靠一阵子。我一直在想方设法游说那些能在这事儿上说得上话的人物。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9358
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d5e9c36f:

    # "Julian nods, appearing rather pleased with himself."
    "Julian点点头，看起来对自己挺满意的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9360
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ac168974:

    # j "For one, I think that passenger might wish to spend some time exploring the local flora, which means more time in the fauna for us."
    j "你想啊，说不定有乘客想花点时间逛逛本地的植物园，这样咱们就有更多时间观察这里的动物了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9362
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_291c3b43:

    # p "I don't think they will delay the ship's schedule for him."
    p "我不觉得他们会为了他耽误船期。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9366
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1e94399c:

    # j "Who knows. He looks posh enough for them to maybe bend over backwards for him."
    j "谁知道呢。他看起来那么阔气，说不定他们会为了他鞍前马后地伺候着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9368
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_69996df5:

    # p "I doubt it."
    p "我看不像。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9370
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_cd88fdd4:

    # p "Besides, he might also be in just as much of a hurry to get back on the sea and get all this wretched seafaring over with."
    p "再说了，没准他也一样急着赶紧回到海上，好结束这该死的航海之旅。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9372
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9d4bb908:

    # j "Konrad's not given his official report on any repairs the ship might need-"
    j "Konrad还没提交船只维修的正式报告。-"

# game/script day12.rpy:9374
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2e0c8a99:

    # "You resist the urge to make the obvious complaint about the pump. The fact that you're still both here speaks for itself."
    "你强忍住抱怨水泵的冲动。其实，咱俩还在这儿，就说明问题有多严重了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9376
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_930924a6:

    # p "No guarantees though from those possibilities, right?"
    p "不过，这么说来，那些可能性也没什么保证，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9378
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_906e17e8:

    # "Julian pauses, scratching his chin."
    "Julian停下来，挠了挠下巴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9380
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1c7fa5f1:

    # j "Who knows, Nomax might refuse to step back aboard altogether after that storm."
    j "谁知道，搞不好Nomax那场风暴之后，压根就不想再上船了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9382
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_47694c03:

    # p "Then they most certainly won't wait for him."
    p "那他们肯定不会等他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9384
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_812797f4:

    # p "But I doubt it. He wouldn't have set foot on this ship in the first place if he didn't need to get where he's going."
    p "但我不太相信。如果他不是非去不可，一开始就不会登上这条船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9388
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e276aee1:

    # j "Or... he might continue south by foot. What an adventure that might be..."
    j "或者……他可能徒步继续南下。那会是多棒的冒险啊……"

# game/script day12.rpy:9392
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f9423224:

    # "Julian pauses from the work, looking off wistfully into the shadows. As uninspiring as it was, the darkness here provided an empty canvas upon which you could paint brighter dreams."
    "Julian停下手里的活，若有所思地望着阴影处。虽然这地方看着实在没什么意思，但黑暗也算是一张空白的画布，让人可以在上面描绘更美好的梦想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9394
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ab732843:

    # "You can practically see him dreaming—his eyes distant as they swim through all various details."
    "你几乎能看见他在幻想——眼神飘忽，仿佛正游历各种细节。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9396
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_cb8741aa:

    # p "Nice wall, isn't it?"
    p "这面墙不错吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9398
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ff35066a:

    # j "Very pleasant."
    j "确实不错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9400
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_cf1548b3:

    # p "Is it the grain that does it for you? Or the signs of wear?"
    p "你是喜欢它的纹理？还是岁月的痕迹？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9404
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d9d00eb4:

    # j "The grain.{w} There's this arc, it kind of looks like a little smile."
    j "纹理。{w} 这儿有道弧线，看起来像个小小的微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9406
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e59c8a7a:

    # p "A smile? If you're thinking about more cheerful adventures rather than being stuck on this ship... I don't blame you."
    p "微笑？你要是想着更开心的冒险，不想困在这艘船上... 我也能理解。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9408
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f5519d77:

    # p "I guess there's plenty of proof that this adventure isn't all it's cracked up to be."
    p "看来有很多证据表明，这次冒险并没有吹得那么好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9412
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_7399225a:

    # j "Yeah... well... all jokes aside, if I was to see the world, I wouldn't want to watch it sail on by. I'd want to take my time. To actually, you know, experience it and have enough time to enjoy the place."
    j "是啊... 嗯... 玩笑归玩笑，要我看世界，我可不想只是看着它从眼前溜走。我想慢慢来，真真切切地去体验，有足够的时间好好享受。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9414
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ab3d7bb3:

    # j "The music, food and so on."
    j "音乐啊，美食啊，等等。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9416
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_6fb7aef0:

    # p "So... what if you decided to seize it?"
    p "那么... 要是你决定抓住这个机会呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9418
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5659c1b5:

    # j "Come again?"
    j "你说什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9420
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5e1c4c1e:

    # p "I mean... I'm just saying, it'd be good to have an adventurous and optimistic soul like you by my side. You've helped me feel much better about it all."
    p "我是说... 我只是觉得，要是有像你这样爱冒险又乐观的人在我身边就好了。你让我感觉好多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9424
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9e29125d:

    # p "I hadn't even thought about the brothels until you mentioned it."
    p "要不是你提起，我都忘了还有妓院这回事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9428
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2d3f530a:

    # "Julian shakes his head, sighing deeply, as if trying to shake off the idea."
    "Julian摇摇头，深深叹了口气，好像要把这个想法甩出去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9430
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_38e9225a:

    # j "Look, [name]..."
    j "听着，[name]......"

# game/script day12.rpy:9432
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_45dac07d:

    # "He hesitates."
    "他犹豫了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9441
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_983a483c:

    # p "I know, I know, you can't."
    p "我知道，我知道，你不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9443
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_84e04802:

    # j "I could say the same about you, but we're both making the best out of what we've got."
    j "我也可以这么说你，但咱们都在尽力而为。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9445
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d0924d45:

    # "He snaps back, looking away and working the pump angrily. The wet slosh of water sounds for several minutes until he's breathing heavily, having put his frustration to better use."
    "他突然顶了一句，转过头去，使劲地抽着水泵。哗啦啦的水声响了好几分钟，直到他气喘吁吁，总算是把沮丧劲儿用到了正地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9447
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e4509c6c:

    # "Even though it was a nerve, you can't help but feel, rightly or wrongly, that Julian isn't being totally honest. With you, but also with himself."
    "就算这话有点戳人，你还是忍不住觉得，不管对不对，Julian并没有完全说实话。对你，也对他自己。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9451
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_cde92cc7:

    # p "No."
    p "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9453
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_50734dba:

    # "You shrug, trying to draw a line under things."
    "你耸耸肩，想把这事儿翻篇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9455
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_71aaa2dc:

    # p "The whole business with Arthur, having to leave—that's his decision."
    p "Arthur那档子事，不得不离开——那是他的决定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9457
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5611b04b:

    # p "But what happens after that; is mine. And I'm going to keep things that way, too."
    p "但之后会发生什么，由我说了算。而且我会一直这样坚持下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9459
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_c74cdba3:

    # "You don't exactly feel it as emphatically as you just said, but there was something about taking control, owning what would happen next that felt like a good two fingers up to that horse."
    "虽然你可能没自己说的那么强烈，但掌控局势，掌握接下来会发生的事情，感觉就像是对那破事狠狠地鄙视了一番。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9461
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_358c49b1:

    # p "But like, I'm saying now, I'm not letting others make decisions for me again."
    p "但我是说，我现在要说的是，我不会再让别人替我做决定了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9463
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_983f4b6f:

    # p "Next time I'll be on one of these things, it'll be fully on my own terms."
    p "下次我再干这行，一切都得由我说了算。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9467
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9cb23886:

    # j "Good luck with that if you think that'll be so easy."
    j "你要觉得那么容易，祝你好运咯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9469
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_3fe9bb13:

    # j "Is this where you tell me that I'm just afraid of the unknown?"
    j "你现在是要告诉我，我只是害怕未知吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9471
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5960d5a8:

    # "Julian replies, a cynical tone cutting sharply through."
    "[name]带着尖刻的语气说道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9473
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_00ec8c31:

    # p "I think you are."
    p "我觉得你就是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9475
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d62177f3:

    # p "Allowing everything to be dictated for you."
    p "任人摆布。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9477
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_10fcccbc:

    # j "You haven't really told me much about where you left, but whatever lack of responsibility that lets you pack up and leave, and wander off wherever must be awfully fucking nice."
    j "你从没怎么跟我细说过你的家乡，但那种能让你拍拍屁股卷起铺盖、毫无顾忌浪迹天涯的洒脱，想想都他妈叫人羡慕。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9479
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_0c7a1366:

    # "You let go of the bilge pump, holding your paws up in surrender."
    "你松开了舱底抽水泵，举起双手，做了个投降的姿势。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9481
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_7306af9d:

    # p "I'm not trying to-"
    p "我不是想——"

# game/script day12.rpy:9483
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_88bbdc13:

    # j "No? You could shut up and get on with your work, rather than let me do all of it for you."
    j "不是吗？你倒是闭嘴，干你的活去，别什么都让我来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9485
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_45f8ac35:

    # j "Just because you're lucky enough to leave and do fuck knows what with yourself, doesn't mean you can make me pick up your slack."
    j "别以为你走了狗屎运，能出去鬼混，就想让我来擦你的屁股。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9490
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_6fe82a61:

    # "You bite your lip and take a deep breath, pushing Julian off the pump and working it yourself."
    "你咬着嘴唇，深吸一口气，把[name]从泵上推开，自己干了起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9494
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9b18bfd4:

    # "At first he's reluctant to leave you working it out of spite, but soon enough he sits down on the deck, catching his breath as your own becomes increasingly ragged."
    "一开始他还想赌气不让你碰，但没过多久，就一屁股坐在甲板上喘气，而你自己的呼吸也越来越粗重。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9496
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e92017d4:

    # "You can tell from every breath of the close air around you—beyond the unpleasant smell of the bilge—that the fiery tint to his scent diminishes."
    "从周围沉闷空气的每一次呼吸中——除了舱底难闻的气味——你能察觉到他气息中那股火气正在消退。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9500
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a23e5744:

    # "You keep going until your arms are heavy and your back begins to protest. It's hard to breathe in the close air, but you take it as a form of penance for upsetting him."
    "你一直坚持着，直到手臂发酸，后背也开始抗议。密闭的空气让人难以呼吸，但你觉得这是惹恼他的补偿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9505
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_166dddb1:

    # "You keep going until your arms are heavy like lead. It's hard to breathe in the close air, but you take it as a form of penance for upsetting him."
    "你一直坚持下去，直到你的手臂像铅一样沉重。在密闭的空气中呼吸很困难，但你把它当作让你心烦意乱的一种忏悔形式。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9507
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d054b289:

    # "Even if you're right."
    "就算你说的对吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9511
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_276c29d2:

    # p "Ah, what am I saying...{w} It's probably going to be boring as sin."
    p "哎，我这是说的什么鬼话……{w} 估计会无聊透顶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9513
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_dc94d8cf:

    # p "Sailors busy loading the ships. Officers doing what they do best—making their lives miserable."
    p "水手忙着装船。军官干着他们最拿手的事——让别人日子不好过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9515
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a7801944:

    # p "I can try all I want, but it won't change the reality of things."
    p "我再怎么努力，也改变不了现实。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9519
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_83eae570:

    # "He avoids your eyes."
    "他避开了你的目光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9521
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5d89bfa5_1:

    # j "Maybe..."
    j "也许吧……"

# game/script day12.rpy:9523
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_74d72118:

    # j "So much for me making you feel better, huh?"
    j "我还想让你好受点呢，结果就这？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9525
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e6429384:

    # "You laugh wearily as you let your weight sink onto the handle of the pump."
    "你疲惫地笑了笑，把全身的重量都压在了水泵的把手上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9527
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1b7e379a:

    # p "Maybe I'll be too busy chasing meals out there to get bored, and before I know it, I'll be on another ship already."
    p "也许我光顾着找吃的，都忘了无聊了，说不定不知不觉就上了另一条船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9529
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_23bff0c0:

    # p "You can dream, right?"
    p "做梦可以吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9531
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_66fb21e6:

    # j "Someone has to..."
    j "总得有人做梦……"

# game/script day12.rpy:9533
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_cfd5028e:

    # p "What are your plans for the port?"
    p "你对港口有什么打算？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9535
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a7686b76:

    # j "I don't know. I'll just take it as it comes."
    j "我不知道，走一步看一步吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9537
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_bd9b9d96:

    # p "Inspiring."
    p "真鼓舞人心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9539
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_20b83123:

    # j "It's going to be strange with you gone."
    j "你走了以后，我会不习惯的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9543
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_8608c28e:

    # j "I'll do whatever I'm ordered to do during it, and after that? Who knows."
    j "我只会做好他们吩咐的事。之后？谁知道呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9545
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b2bff5dd:

    # j "Can't do much with Wolf, can I? And you were the only other new deckhand."
    j "“狼”那家伙我搞不定，而且就你一个新来的水手能说上话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9547
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e7e2f2a6:

    # p "You always have Samuel, Konrad, Torres and all the rest of the crew."
    p "你还有Samuel、Konrad、Torres，还有其他的弟兄们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9551
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_64337402:

    # p "And with me gone, I guess the passenger is fair game again as well."
    p "我走了，那乘客不就又成了你们的目标了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9553
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_27bd2ec5:

    # j "True, perhaps it's not all bad."
    j "这么说来，倒也不全是坏事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9555
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_6b927c93:

    # p "So you really?... You know."
    p "你真做了那种事？... 你懂的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9557
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_aab39d88:

    # "You look over to him and he nods with the same mischievous grin."
    "你看着他，他也带着那副坏笑点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9559
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_fb7a90d2:

    # j "Sure did, I guess I should thank you for it. It surely warmed me up alright. Bent him over his bed and, well, you know."
    j "当然干了，我想该谢谢你。确实让我浑身暖和。把他按倒在床上，然后，嗯，你懂的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9563
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e48e904c:

    # j "I guess."
    j "知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9565
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_7d127fe5:

    # p "Step aside, I'll take over for a moment."
    p "闪开，让我来顶一会儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9570
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_9bd8b689:

    # "You push him off the pump and begin to settle into your own rhythm."
    "你把他从水泵那儿推开，开始按自己的节奏打水。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9572
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_77e13581:

    # "At first he's reluctant to leave you working it, but soon enough he sits down on the deck, catching his breath as your own becomes increasingly ragged."
    "他一开始不太情愿让你接手，但很快就一屁股坐在甲板上，一边喘着粗气，一边看着你越发急促的呼吸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9574
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b24f0b1f:

    # "He fans himself some cool air as he watches you."
    "他一边扇着风，一边打量着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9578
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_53ad7602:

    # "Slowly but surely your arms start giving out under the strain and your back begins to burn anew. It's hard to breathe in the close air, but you take it as a form of penance for... everything, really."
    "渐渐地，你的胳膊开始吃不消了，背上也火辣辣地疼。空气闷得让人喘不过气，但你觉得这是赎罪，为了... 真的，为了所有事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9582
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e2d8a126:

    # "Slowly but surely your arms start giving out under the strain. It's hard to breathe in the close air, but you take it as a form of penance for... everything, really."
    "渐渐地，你的胳膊开始吃不消了，背上也火辣辣地疼。空气闷得让人喘不过气，但你觉得这是赎罪，为了... 真的，为了所有事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9588
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_fa65f125:

    # p "The wood grain really looks like a smile."
    p "这木头的纹理，真像一个微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9590
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2f15c26b:

    # p "At least I think I see it? Over there, next to that little hole, right?"
    p "至少我是这么觉得。就在那边，那个小洞旁边，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9594
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_3d5be2f8:

    # "You know there's no point in trying to convince him, so instead you change the subject."
    "你知道说服他也没用，就换了个话题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9596
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_a5284b0c:

    # j "Yeah. It's sideways.{w} Muzzle on your side, then the nose, and eyes on the right."
    j "是啊，横过来看的。{w}枪口在你这边，然后是鼻子，眼睛在右边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9598
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_799f771a:

    # "Thankfully he goes along with it."
    "幸好他没抬杠。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9600
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_108ac60f:

    # p "It looks like he's got a weird single tooth sticking out"
    p "他好像还长着一颗歪歪扭扭的龅牙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9602
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ad66d4b0:

    # "You chuckle as your brain begins to paint more details on the dark wall."
    "你嘿嘿一笑，脑子里开始在黑漆漆的墙上描绘出更多的细节。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9604
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b8973856:

    # j "So do you when you smile. I'd be careful about talking trash to our friend Mr. Woody over there."
    j "你笑起来也是啊。我劝你最好别在“木头先生”面前说他坏话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9606
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_baadacf7:

    # "Your lips slip down to cover your teeth, just in case."
    "你赶紧抿起嘴唇，盖住牙齿，以防万一。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9608
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_7db18340:

    # "He notices and playfully pushes your head down over the pump."
    "他发现了你的小动作，就笑着按你的头，让你冲着水泵撅嘴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9610
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_4b814e5e:

    # j "Don't. It suits you."
    j "别这样。挺适合你的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9614
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_034ddfd1:

    # p "Are you just trying to be nice so I'll offer you to take a break? Or is Nomax your target again?"
    p "你只是对我好，好让我主动提出让你休息一下？还是说Nomax又是你的目标？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9618
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_78dd75e3:

    # p "Are you just trying to be nice so I'll offer you to take a break?"
    p "你对我这么好，是不是想让我主动让你歇会儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9620
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b89a29e4:

    # j "Did I plan on that? No. But if you're offering, I won't say no."
    j "我本来没想过。但你要是主动提出来，我肯定乐意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9624
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_cc041620:

    # j "... To both."
    j "... 两个都是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9626
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_dd00c28a:

    # "You see his lips curl into a smirk."
    "你看到他嘴角扬起一抹坏笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9628
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_2da76a7a:

    # j "Was I nice enough?"
    j "我够意思吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9630
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ca61a625:

    # "You close your eyes and bring your paw up to rub your temples, trying to look like it's something that requires thoughtful consideration."
    "你闭上眼睛，抬起手掌揉了揉太阳穴，装出一副正在认真思考的样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9632
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_ced6ba65:

    # p "Hm..."
    p "嗯..."

# game/script day12.rpy:9634
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5bfe08a6:

    # p "Yes, you were. Step aside, I'll take over for a moment."
    p "够意思，一边去，让我来顶一会儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9639
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_32e1ecef:

    # "You guide him off the pump and begin to settle into your own rhythm."
    "你拍了拍他让他从泵柄上退下来，换上自己握紧手柄，逐步调整到自己的抽动节奏中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9641
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_d0223fda:

    # "He's happy to surrender the pump to you and sits down on the deck, catching his breath as your own becomes increasingly ragged."
    "他乐得把水泵交接给你，一屁股瘫坐在甲板上喘息歇息，而你的呼吸则随着每一次重力压泵变得愈发粗重急促。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9643
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_b24f0b1f_1:

    # "He fans himself some cool air as he watches you."
    "他一边扇着风，一边打量着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9647
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_081d19b1:

    # j "Do you only mean taking over the work, or the bit about Nomax as well?"
    j "你说的“顶替”是指工作，还是说也包括 Nomax 那档子事？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9649
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_787441c1:

    # p "You really?... You know."
    p "你...真的...知道啦？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9651
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_aab39d88_1:

    # "You look over to him and he nods with the same mischievous grin."
    "你看着他，他也带着那副坏笑点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9653
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_1bc38e39:

    # j "I guess I should thank you for it. It surely warmed me up alright. Bent him over his bed and, well, you know~"
    j "那我还得谢谢你。这法子真暖和。把他按在床上，然后，嘿嘿，你懂的~"

# game/script day12.rpy:9657
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_53ad7602_1:

    # "Slowly but surely your arms start giving out under the strain and your back begins to burn anew. It's hard to breathe in the close air, but you take it as a form of penance for... everything, really."
    "渐渐地，你的胳膊开始吃不消了，背上也火辣辣地疼。空气闷得让人喘不过气，但你觉得这是赎罪，为了... 真的，为了所有事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9661
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e2d8a126_1:

    # "Slowly but surely your arms start giving out under the strain. It's hard to breathe in the close air, but you take it as a form of penance for... everything, really."
    "渐渐地，你觉得胳膊越来越没劲儿。空气闷得喘不过气，但你还是咬牙坚持，就当是为过去种种赎罪吧...唉，什么都算了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9666
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_460c4fab:

    # "Eventually, Julian takes hold of the lever again, tapping your paw to make room."
    "最后，Julian 再次抓住压杆，拍了拍你的手，让你让开点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9668
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_70bf108e:

    # j "Come on. Five more minutes and I reckon we should be done."
    j "加把劲。再有五分钟，估计就差不多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9670
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_e80f5281_2:

    # "He sighs."
    "他叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9672
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_5839fcf6:

    # j "I don't want to see you drop."
    j "我可不想看你累趴下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9676
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_f444557b:

    # "He takes a sharp breath."
    "他深吸了一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9678
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_696579b3:

    # j "I can't carry you up the stairs to Rajeeyah anyway."
    j "反正我也背不动你爬楼梯回 Rajeeyah 那儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9680
translate Chinese day12_leave_eagle_feeding_pt2_8f56ccce:

    # "You don't look up from the task, but you can tell he's smirking away."
    "你没抬头，也能感觉到他正在一旁偷偷坏笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9695
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c384746b:

    # "Despite Julian's prediction, it takes far more than five minutes to clear enough bilgewater to be able to call the job done."
    "Julian 估摸着五分钟就能搞定，结果清理舱底污水的时间远远不止。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9697
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_993394bd:

    # "As the two of you alternate working the pump, your idle chat turns to solitary exchanges, then to a few occasional grunts, then to nothing but the silent work of muscles."
    "两人轮流抽水，一开始还闲聊几句，后来就变成了自言自语，再后来就只剩下偶尔的咕哝声，最后只剩下肌肉无声的律动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9728
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e8302f54:

    # "By the time you make your way back on the deck, talking is the last thing either of you has on your mind."
    "等你们拖着步子重新爬回甲板时，开口说话成了你们脑子里最不想碰的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9730
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e4f28321:

    # "A bed though.{w} Now that would be something."
    "要是有张床就好了...{w} 那才叫享受。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9732
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_41667d59:

    # "The fresh, salty air hitting your face is as welcome as a lover's caress, even if accompanied by a light rain. You hope it takes at least some of the stink of bilgewater away."
    "带着咸味的新鲜空气扑面而来，就像爱人的抚摸一样令人舒爽，即便还伴着淅淅沥沥的小雨。希望至少能冲走点舱底污水的臭味。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9734
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0b3dc427:

    # "Julian takes a deep breath."
    "Julian 深吸了一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9736
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_02e01d02:

    # j "I'm gonna just... yeah..."
    j "我得...歇会儿..."

# game/script day12.rpy:9744
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_b9fc302c:

    # "You nod and watch him shuffle away to wherever he's heading to. Maybe just more fresh air, or a change of clothes. He resisted the smell and fatigue up until the very end. A proper soldier."
    "你点点头，看着他摇摇晃晃地走开了，也不知道要去哪儿。也许只是想呼吸点新鲜空气，或者换身衣服。他一直强忍着臭味和疲惫，真是个好样的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9750
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_244992eb:

    # "You head towards the port side, passing under shrouds dripping with water from a rain that feels lighter than before you started working the pump."
    "你朝左舷走去，从被雨水打湿的帆索下穿过，感觉雨也小多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9752
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d69b56a2:

    # "The mast stands monolithically behind you. Sailors hurry to their various tasks, but you need a minute."
    "高大的桅杆巍然耸立在你的身后。水手们忙着各自的活计，而你需要歇息片刻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9757
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_bbacd37a:

    # "You lean on the gunwale, catching your breath. Your arms don't ache as much as you feared, but you know you'll be feeling the worst of it tomorrow."
    "你靠在舷墙上，喘着粗气。手臂倒没有想象中那么酸痛，不过你知道，难受的还在后头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9759
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_038a2f25:

    # "A part of your brain chides you for letting yourself be idle in plain view. Another feels the rain starting to lightly soak your fur. The rest doesn't care at all."
    "脑海中有一个声音在责备你光天化日之下偷懒。另一个声音告诉你雨水开始打湿你的皮毛了。剩下的声音则表示无所谓。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9761
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5bb436b4:

    # "You're just too tired."
    "你真是累坏了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9763
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_4e5d2e8d:

    # "The rain's finally starting to let up."
    "雨总算小了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9765
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_35f9b120:

    # "It's beginning to look almost pleasant with the gentle light breaking through the clouds at the horizon."
    "地平线上，温柔的光线穿透云层，景色渐渐变得赏心悦目起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9767
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_57dc5f2d:

    # "You scan the deck for the solitary osprey, but can't make out its shape anywhere in sight."
    "你扫视甲板寻找那只孤独的鱼鹰，但在视线范围内任何地方都辨认不出它的身影。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9769
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_ad89141a:

    # "Maybe it had enough time to rest up and try to fly back to shore, daring the last few gusts of winds and splashes of water against the feather on its wings."
    "也许它已经获得了足够的休息时间，并尝试飞回岸边，冒着最后几阵强风和水花拍打着它翅膀上的羽毛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9771
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c72c375b:

    # sailmussel "Admiring your work?"
    sailmussel "欣赏你的杰作呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9776
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_de1bd1ed:

    # "You turn around. There's no one here beside you."
    "你转过身。除了你之外，这里空无一人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9778
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_a4a42fdc:

    # "Great."
    "妙极了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9780
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_925c45b5:

    # "Hearing voices."
    "出现幻听了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9782
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_dbfdd4a9:

    # "Might as well, why not?{w} It's not like things can get any worse for you. At least you'd have an excuse for it all."
    "不妨这样，为什么不呢？{w} 事情对你来说也不可能变得更糟了。至少你还能为这一切找个借口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9784
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0f9ce7ad:

    # sailmussel "Bloody hell. Deaf as they say, huh?"
    sailmussel "真是活见鬼。真像他们说的那样耳背，是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9791
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2a9b3e03:

    # "You're startled by a figure dropping right in front of you from the shrouds above."
    "你被一个从上方缭绳上直接落到你面前的身影吓了一跳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9793
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_635f3856:

    # "It's a sailor you haven't gotten the chance to know yet. Two more days, and you wouldn't have been able to."
    "这是一个你还没机会认识的水手。再过两天，你就没机会认识了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9795
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_31f6aca3:

    # "You seem to remember him from around the ship. You think you saw him among the crowd betting on the osprey. But you've never exchanged a word before."
    "你似乎记得在船上见过他。你觉得自己在赌鱼鹰的人群中看到过他。但你们之前从未交谈过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9797
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0d3887e1:

    # p "Excuse me?"
    p "你说什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9799
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e833f535:

    # sailmussel "I said... admiring your work? That what you're doing here?"
    sailmussel "我说……欣赏你的杰作呢？这就是你在这里做的事情吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9801
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e74e9ca9:

    # p "I don't..."
    p "我不..."

# game/script day12.rpy:9803
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_ef981db6:

    # sailmussel "Yes you do."
    sailmussel "不，你就是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9805
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_a34f1f10:

    # sailmussel "You're the guy who was asleep on watch, eh?"
    sailmussel "你就是值更打瞌睡的那个家伙，哈？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9812
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_34d9fdfb:

    # "He steps forward."
    "他向前走了一步。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9814
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_82e5a7d5:

    # sailmussel "[name], isn't it? Yeah, your name's gotten around lately."
    sailmussel "[name]，不是吗？是啊，你的名字最近传开了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9816
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_ca8686a3:

    # sailmussel "You have any idea what your little princess' sleep could have cost us? It's sheer luck that we're still afloat."
    sailmussel "你知道你这位小公主的睡觉可能会让我们付出什么代价吗？我们还能漂浮在这里真是纯粹的运气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9818
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_4f77ceba:

    # "It's one thing to hear criticism from your superior. Another hearing it from the people you got to know."
    "听到上级的批评是一回事。听到你认识的人的批评又是另一回事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9820
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_1541e279:

    # "But hearing it from a member of the crew you don't know... It somehow pierces deeper."
    "但听到一个你不认识的船员的批评......不知何故，它刺得更深。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9822
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8ed70a70:

    # "Like the entire crew is talking to you."
    "就像整个船员都在对你说话一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9824
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_1e2032eb:

    # "You feel tired. Your arms ache, and they'll ache worse tomorrow. You stink of bilgewater and sweat, and you don't know how long it's going to be before you'll be able to do anything about any of it."
    "你感到疲惫。你的手臂酸痛，而且明天会更痛。你身上散发着舱底水和汗水的恶臭，而且你不知道还要过多久才能摆脱这一切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9828
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_de925342:

    # "And as if that's not enough your goddamn hand still sends an unpleasant burning sensation up along your arm."
    "似乎这还不够，你该死的手仍然沿着你的手臂传来一种令人不快的灼烧感。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9830
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0e24447d:

    # "More so now, after you've just aggravated it again by working the bilge pump."
    "尤其是在你刚才死命压了一通底舱抽水泵后，那处肌肉的酸痛更甚从前。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9832
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_514a90db:

    # "You open your mouth to defend yourself, but no words come out."
    "你张开嘴想为自己辩解，但说不出话来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9834
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d29f83a9:

    # "You feel helpless. Too exhausted for this shit right now."
    "你感到无助。现在太累了，不想应付这些破事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9843
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0ef7ee94:

    # "It's too much. There's nothing you can say because there's nothing you could defend yourself with."
    "压力太大了。你什么也说不出来，因为你找不到任何可以为自己辩护的理由。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9845
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_a97902bc:

    # "Not in his eyes."
    "在他眼里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9847
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_218d3533:

    # "He wouldn't care that Arthur pushed you to exhaustion."
    "他才不会在乎Arthur是不是把你操练到精疲力尽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9849
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d37977d9:

    # "That's what you tell yourself, but you can tell he wouldn't care about hearing it."
    "你只是这么安慰自己，但看得出来他根本不在乎。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9851
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_29ceb040:

    # "And his words, they {i}sting{/i}."
    "他的话，句句{i}带刺{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9858
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_93c99e55:

    # "You take a step towards the sailor, feeling your right fist starting to itch..."
    "你朝那个水手走近一步，感觉右拳头都硬了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:9864
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e03573e6:

    # "... but before you can do anything stupid, you're stopped in your tracks by a familiar figure stepping between the two of you."
    "……但你还没来得及犯傻，一个熟悉的身影就站到了你们中间，拦住了你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9873
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_66aea482:

    # w "[name]?"
    w "[name]？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9875
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_b136e7a8:

    # "You come to a stop just a hair's width from Wolf's chest."
    "你在距离Wolf胸膛仅一发之差的位置堪堪刹住脚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9882
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5cd67255:

    # w "Your help is needed."
    w "我们需要你的帮助。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9884
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8aad90a6:

    # p "Help? With what? What help? "
    p "帮忙？帮什么？ "

# game/script day12.rpy:9888
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0f62a71a:

    # "He stares straight at you, dark fur and the usual unreadable expression on his face."
    "他直直地盯着你，黑色的毛发，脸上还是那副让人捉摸不透的表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9890
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_30bfe5b7:

    # w "...{i}Your{/i} help."
    w "……{i}你{/i}的帮助。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9892
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_ef775eab:

    # "Your paw drops to your side, splayed open. Whatever animosity you may have felt, it just evaporated like snow in the sun."
    "你的爪子无力地垂在身侧，张开着。你心中所有的敌意，都像阳光下的雪一样，瞬间消融。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9894
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_eb820bc8:

    # "You hope shame won't replace it."
    "你只希望，涌上心头的不是羞愧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9896
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5bc809cb:

    # sailmussel "Hey, big guy! Didn't anybody teach you any manners?"
    sailmussel "嘿，大块头！没人教过你什么叫礼貌吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9898
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e09061c8:

    # "He doesn't even give the sailor the light of day and ignores the provocation."
    "他根本没把那个水手放在眼里，对挑衅也置若罔闻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9905
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_7e5f5dc4:

    # "You sit there and take it."
    "你就这么忍气吞声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9907
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e65bb4b0:

    # sailmussel "Nothing to say for yourself? Huh?"
    sailmussel "哑巴了？嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9914
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_23487ec8:

    # "The sailor steps forward with his arms outstretched, clearly aiming to get a reaction out of you."
    "水手张开双臂，向前逼近，显然是想激怒你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9916
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_815c0b1c:

    # sailmussel "What, grew a conscience at last? Feeling responsible for what you did?"
    sailmussel "哟，终于良心发现了？开始为自己做过的事后悔了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9918
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_fe417c63:

    # "There's anger in his words, but not as much vitriol as you'd expect. He's frustrated, but it's a frustration coming from a place of fear, not malice."
    "他的话语中带着愤怒，但却没有想象中那么恶毒。他很沮丧，但这种沮丧源于恐惧，而非恶意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9920
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_abafaebe:

    # "He's not aiming to hurt you, you think. He's venting."
    "你觉得，他不是想伤害你，只是在发泄情绪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9925
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_352454cb:

    # "But he's still inching closer and closer."
    "但他还在一步步逼近。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9930
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_993b1069:

    # sailmussel "Why so silent? Practicing for your next watch already?"
    sailmussel "怎么，哑巴了？在为下次值班做准备呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9932
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d9f05877:

    # "You wince. That last one cut deeper than the rest."
    "你疼得咧了下嘴。最后一句话，句句诛心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9934
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_37ed7fdb:

    # "These men, they all put their safety in your hands. He's right on that. And there's..."
    "这些人的安危，都掌握在你的手中。他说得没错。而且……"

# game/script day12.rpy:9936
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_89bd56db:

    # "Your train of thought is interrupted by a low snarl."
    "你的思绪被一声低沉的咆哮打断。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9942
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5b024554:

    # "The sailor turns around, as you both finally take notice of the shadow that's been standing behind him this whole time."
    "水手转过身，这时你们才注意到，一直站在他身后的那个身影。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9947
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_66aea482_1:

    # w "[name]?"
    w "[name]？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9949
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5cd67255_1:

    # w "Your help is needed."
    w "我们需要你的帮助。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9956
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_1690655e:

    # "The sailor sizes Wolf up, with the two standing pretty equal in height."
    "水手上下打量着Wolf，两人身高相仿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9963
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_53471d6b:

    # sailmussel "His help?"
    sailmussel "他帮忙？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9965
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5ac9d472:

    # sailmussel "For what?"
    sailmussel "帮什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9967
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_7de6b946:

    # sailmussel "He hasn't exactly done anything worth writing home about."
    sailmussel "他可没做什么值得大书特书的事情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9969
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_45414878:

    # sailmussel "Besides, you are?"
    sailmussel "话说回来，你是哪位？"

# game/script day12.rpy:9974
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_887f1304:

    # "Wolf just stares at him, his mouth shut, eyes sporting his usual impenetrable expression."
    "狼只是盯着他，紧闭着嘴，眼神依旧深不可测。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9976
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_b4e7983d:

    # "The rain has reduced down to a trickle."
    "雨已经变成了涓涓细流。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9978
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_fa8b769c:

    # "The tiger sustains his gaze for a few more interminable seconds. After a heavy weighing of options, he decides to relent."
    "那老虎般的家伙又持续地盯着他看了几秒钟，在心里权衡了一番，最终还是让步了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9980
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_ea3cc55a:

    # sailmussel "Eh, he's not worth it.{w} And you should keep that in mind, puppy."
    sailmussel "切，不值得我浪费时间。{w} 你也最好记住这一点，小鬼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9987
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c4e3fc99:

    # "Wolf doesn't reply. He just stares daggers as the unknown sailor leaves, following him with his head until the man is safely below deck. "
    "狼没有回答，只是狠狠地瞪着那个陌生的水手离开，眼睛一直追随着他，直到那人安全地进入甲板下。 "

# game/script day12.rpy:9989
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8b9a9c82:

    # "At least you think that was him staring daggers. It's been almost two weeks of sailing in the same crew and his expressions still look mostly the same to you."
    "至少你是这么觉得的。同在一个船队里待了快两周了，他看起来几乎一直都是这副表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9993
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5e268a48:

    # "Not that it matters in any significant way. Soon, you'll be ashore; even if you did manage to make him open up, none of it would have made much of a difference."
    "不过也没什么大不了的。很快就要靠岸了，就算你真能让他打开心扉，也不会有什么改变。"

# game/script day12.rpy:9995
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_f9e6b439:

    # "You feel a heavy weariness coming over you. This time, it's not just physical."
    "你感到一阵强烈的疲惫感涌上心头，这次不仅仅是身体上的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10003
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_b0558381:

    # "As you were immersed in thought, Wolf has made his way to the gunwale, right next to where you were hoping to get some rest just a few minutes ago."
    "你沉浸在思绪中，不知不觉狼已经走到船舷边了，就在几分钟前你还想去那边休息一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10005
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_7cb9e6b6:

    # "He's not leaning against it or gazing absentmindedly at the water, though. He's staring right at you."
    "然而，他既没有靠在船舷上，也没有漫无目的地看着水面，而是直勾勾地盯着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10011
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_30ee0db1:

    # w "I thought that you would be wiser than that after what you've been through, you know?"
    w "经历了这么多事，我还以为你会更聪明一点，懂吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10015
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_81202b66:

    # w "I didn't take you to be this damn stupid."
    w "真没想到你竟然蠢到这种地步。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10017
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_09aa1d8f:

    # w "I have better things to do than to play the ship's nanny."
    w "我可没空在这里当保姆，管你这些破事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10021
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_b8327d08:

    # w "And if you want to get beaten and strung up for a dozen again so badly, then wait until you're on shore, so that I don't have to deal with your mess."
    w "如果你那么想找打，想再被吊起来抽一顿，那就等到靠岸之后，别给我惹麻烦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10025
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_6db7170c:

    # w "And if you want to get beaten up so badly, then wait until you're on shore so that I don't have to deal with your mess."
    w "要是你真皮痒欠揍，就等上了岸再去讨打，省得我还得在船上收拾你的烂摊子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10027
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c0e55d47:

    # "You look away. He's right. That was a moment of weakness you shouldn't have let happen. Another one in a long list."
    "你躲开了他的视线。他是对的，刚才真是太软弱了，不该发生这种事。又多了一条罪状。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10031
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d8e99c7b:

    # w "Stupid.{w} Immensely stupid."
    w "愚蠢。{w} 蠢透了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10033
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_220aa811:

    # w "Don't make me play Samuel here. You should know better."
    w "别逼我像Samuel一样管你。你该懂点事了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10035
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c0e55d47_1:

    # "You look away. He's right. That was a moment of weakness you shouldn't have let happen. Another one in a long list."
    "你躲开了他的视线。他是对的，刚才真是太软弱了，不该发生这种事。又多了一条罪状。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10037
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_a55e9de3:

    # p "I know."
    p "知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10041
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_fdae898e:

    # "He nods. An acknowledgement of your patience, perhaps. Or maybe something else."
    "他点了点头，也许是认可了你的耐心，又或许是别的什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10043
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_92dc9593:

    # p "Thanks."
    p "谢谢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10047
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5f3f6d40:

    # "Wolf shakes his head subtly, and this time, just this time, you can grasp his intention clearly. \"I didn't do it for you,\" he's saying."
    "狼不易察觉地摇了摇头，这一次，也只有这一次，你清楚地理解了他的意思。“我不是为了你才这么做的，”他在说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10051
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c3c30e40:

    # w "He's right. It's not worth it."
    w "他说得对，不值得。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10053
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_6d1f70f9:

    # "It's your turn to shake your head. That's not what the sailor said."
    "轮到你摇头了。水手可不是这么说的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10055
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d2486381:

    # p "He didn't say it's not worth it. He said {i}I'm{/i} not worth it."
    p "他说的不是“不值得”，他说的是“{i}你{/i}不值得”。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10057
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_4a60d681:

    # "You don't know if Wolf said that to protect you from your own thoughts or because he simply misheard the sailor."
    "你不知道狼说那话是为了保护你，不让你胡思乱想，还是他根本就没听清那水手说了什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10059
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_207a961d:

    # "Wolf says nothing. He just stares."
    "狼什么也没说，只是盯着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10061
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_89f0a190:

    # p "What he said about the crew...{w} was that true? Do they all hate me?"
    p "他说的关于船员的事......{w} 是真的吗？他们都讨厌我？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10065
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_77ad85f1:

    # w "Hm?"
    w "嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10067
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_f669761a:

    # w "You're asking {i}me{/i} that?"
    w "你问{i}我{/i}？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10069
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d0185b5e:

    # p "I might ask the others, too."
    p "或许我也会问问其他人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10071
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8337703c:

    # w ". . ."
    w ". . ."

# game/script day12.rpy:10077
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_69f16644:

    # w "Does it matter? You'll be gone anyway."
    w "重要吗？反正你都要走了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10079
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_fc7d4d52:

    # "Perhaps it doesn't..."
    "也许吧..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10081
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_7456d11a:

    # w "And yes, anyone who causes trouble tends to draw the ire of their compatriots."
    w "那是自然，谁没事找事，肯定惹人嫌。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10083
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d6bb4804:

    # "There it is. It probably really is a good idea that you're leaving as there is little left to mend here. Once the crew turns against you it's difficult to win back their favor."
    "又来了。离开这艘船或许真是个明智的抉择，毕竟在这里几乎已没有什么值得挽回的余地。一旦全船水手开始排挤你，想再赢回人缘简直难如登天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10085
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_ced6d221:

    # "Crew...{w} You wonder if you ever had the right to call the {i}Conway{/i} crew your crew. It feels more like you just got close to a few individuals rather than being part of a whole."
    "船员... {w} 你真能把{i}Conway{/i}号上的人当成自己人吗？感觉更像是你只跟几个人比较熟，根本没融入集体。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10089
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0eb9e14c:

    # w "Some do. Those who are the cause of the crew being rushed to all hands on deck always draw ire, but they've all been through this stuff before. The experienced ones, at least."
    w "当然会。谁没事老让大家手忙脚乱地跑到甲板上，肯定招人烦，不过他们也都习惯了。至少那些老水手是这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10091
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8f92ca76:

    # p "For someone trying so hard to avoid socializing, you sure have a read of what's going on."
    p "你这人明明不爱社交，却门儿清啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10095
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_07decea8:

    # w "I'm a good listener."
    w "我擅长倾听。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10097
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_f5a117df:

    # p "Are you though?"
    p "是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10101
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_3b03714f:

    # w "It pays to keep your ear to the ground. How about that?"
    w "消息灵通总没错。你说呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10103
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_3165bc14:

    # "So it does. You wonder if you ever had the right to call the {i}Conway{/i} crew your crew. It feels more like you just got close to a few individuals rather than being part of a whole."
    "确实如此。你真能把{i}Conway{/i}号上的人当成自己人吗？感觉更像是你只跟几个人比较熟，根本没融入集体。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10105
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_61cebc23:

    # "The few that got close to you, you befriended. Kind of. But at best you'd call that a circle of acquaintances, rather than a crew. Not that those thoughts matter much now."
    "跟你走得近的，你就算朋友了。勉强算是吧。不过最多也就是个熟人圈子，算不上什么团队。当然，现在想这些也没用了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10107
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_63b06859:

    # "You made up your mind. No sense obsessing over missed chances and connections."
    "你心意已决，就别再纠结那些错失的机会和关系了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10111
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_1574ae10:

    # "Meanwhile, silence has fallen between the two of you as it did many times before. It's what he's comfortable with."
    "像往常一样，你们俩又陷入了沉默。他倒是挺享受这种状态。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10113
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e0011fdb:

    # "One thing is amiss, though."
    "不过，总觉得哪里不对劲。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10115
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_00d975bc:

    # p "Why are you here?"
    p "你来这儿做什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10119
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2d154042:

    # w "To save you from yourself, apparently."
    w "估计是为了防止你自寻死路吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10123
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c072f3ad:

    # w "It's a ship.{w} Where do you expect me to be?"
    w "这是在船上，{w} 你想让我在哪儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10125
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d184131a:

    # w "And I'd rather you don't start any further trouble."
    w "我可不想你再惹是生非。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10127
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c9897032:

    # w "I prefer my days to be uneventful."
    w "我就喜欢安安静静地过日子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10129
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_316f520b:

    # w "But before you get any ideas. I was heading towards the stern. You two were in the way."
    w "别多想。我只是要去船尾，你们挡着我的道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10131
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2b5d824f:

    # p "Still... you didn't need to do that.{w} Thank you."
    p "其实...你没必要这么做的，{w} 谢了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10133
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_37617f88:

    # "Wolf sniffs. You wonder if the smell of your previous task would be significantly harder for a canine nose to stomach."
    "Wolf 嗅了嗅。你猜他能不能闻出你之前干的那些事儿，那味道对狗鼻子来说是不是太刺激了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10137
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8337703c_1:

    # w ". . ."
    w ". . ."

# game/script day12.rpy:10141
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_7cef0b60:

    # w "Save your breath. You look like you need all of it."
    w "省点力气吧，看你都喘成什么样了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10143
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_697a1c99:

    # w "And you still got two days of work before we go our separate ways."
    w "而且在我们分道扬镳之前，你还有两天活儿要干。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10145
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_f079c0a6:

    # "Cold, as usual. Impenetrable, almost caustic. Only a scant few days left with him, and you still have no idea how to take half the things he says."
    "还是一如既往地冷淡，难以接近，简直刻薄。只剩下最后几天了，我还是搞不懂他到底想说什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10147
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2df60da3:

    # "But he did come to you. He still didn't want you to be harmed, even if he tries to downplay it. And that must mean something, you think."
    "不过他还是来找你了。他还是不想让你受伤，虽然他嘴上不承认。这肯定意味着什么，你觉得。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10149
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_469cd171:

    # "Maybe."
    "也许吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10153
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_125a49f1:

    # p "So... this is it, then? No way I can persuade you to join me?"
    p "这样啊... 没得谈了吗？我没法说服你跟我一起走？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10157
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0de2bb48:

    # w "Stop trying. It won't change my mind."
    w "别白费力气了，我不会改变主意的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10159
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d3a0dd08:

    # p "Of course, It does feel worth thinking about out loud, at least."
    p "唉，说出来总比憋在心里好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10161
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_63e00013:

    # "And maybe worth trying, you think. But you're less and less sure of that."
    "或许值得一试，你心想道。但你越来越没底了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10163
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_03515c0f:

    # p "Is there anything that could make you change your mind? Anything at all?"
    p "有什么能让你改变主意吗？什么都行吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10165
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2fdf5998:

    # p "Hypothetically, of course."
    p "当然，这只是假设。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10169
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_3c4dd014:

    # "Wolf sighs. His answer comes much quicker than you expected."
    "Wolf叹了口气。他的回答比你预想的要快得多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10171
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_4309ad3a:

    # w "No."
    w "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10173
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_a35afe06:

    # p "You said you joined this ship to earn some money. What about-"
    p "你说你上船是为了挣钱。那要是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10175
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d72072d3:

    # w "I said stop trying."
    w "我说了别再试了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10177
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_32a1df72:

    # w "I'm going to keep working on this ship. I'll take the money and that's that."
    w "我会继续在这艘船上干活。我会拿到钱，就这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10179
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2100d70f:

    # w "Why are you so insistent? What do you think you'd gain from it?"
    w "你为什么这么执着？你觉得你能得到什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10181
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5c4387fb:

    # "Your ears perk to attention at the question, hearing a question coming from him by itself is already feeling out of the ordinary, but it does leave you pondering."
    "这个问题让你竖起了耳朵，光是听到他主动提问本身就感觉不寻常了，但这确实让你陷入了沉思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10183
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_fda37072:

    # "Why, exactly?{w} Why Wolf?"
    "到底为什么？{w} 为什么是Wolf？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10185
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5a305522:

    # "There are other people you could try to persuade onboard. Sure, not many, but there are."
    "船上还有其他人或许能被你说动。虽说屈指可数，但总归还有希望。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10187
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_416a0a76:

    # "Well... you know the superficial reason.{w} He's new here. He's not tied in with the others, and quite frankly, to you it doesn't appear like he actually {i}wants{/i} to be here."
    "嗯……你知道表面上的原因。{w} 他是新来的。他跟其他人没什么瓜葛，而且坦白说，在你看来他似乎并不{i}真的想{/i}待在这里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10191
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_3d771917:

    # "You were hoping you'd have a chance."
    "你一直希望能有机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10193
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_1537ad75:

    # "But... there's a deeper, and at the same time more obvious reason."
    "但是……还有一个更深层，也更显而易见的原因。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10202
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_300701d2:

    # p "I..."
    p "我……"

# game/script day12.rpy:10204
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_7017cb84:

    # p "I think I'm scared."
    p "我想我很害怕。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10206
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_265d92f7:

    # p "I think...{w} I thought I made up my mind."
    p "我想……{w} 我还以为我已经下定决心了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10208
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8ace0892:

    # p "I thought that I'm just going to leave. Head held high, strong, being above anything that piece of shit can throw at me. But..."
    p "我本以为自己能昂首挺胸地离开，坚强地面对一切，不被那个混蛋击垮，但是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10210
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e886f27b:

    # p "What am I going to do after that?"
    p "之后我该怎么办？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10212
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0699673f:

    # p "I don't know what my options are, I don't know the language. I might be able to find a ship to take me on, he said the harbor is busy enough to have a ship take me back within a month, but that feels like a game of chance."
    p "我甚至不知道该怎么办，而且我语言不通。也许能找到一艘船把我带走，他说港口挺繁忙的，说不定一个月内就能有船送我回去，但这简直就像赌博一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10214
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_cd4739b2:

    # p "I'll be tossing the dice on my entire future. That's...{w} terrifying, Wolf."
    p "我要把我的整个未来都押上去。这……{w} 太可怕了，Wolf。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10216
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_3861f93f:

    # p "I need to do something before it's time."
    p "我必须在一切发生之前做点什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10220
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8fb94331:

    # p "As much as I like games, that's far too dangerous a bet for me."
    p "游戏再好玩，对我来说，这场赌局也太危险了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10224
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_451cf9e5:

    # w "And you don't want to get caught with your pants down."
    w "而且你也不想被打个措手不及吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10226
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_bae90025:

    # w "Metaphorically."
    w "只是打个比方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10228
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10230
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_14cf221e:

    # p "That's why I don't want to do it alone."
    p "所以我不想一个人做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10232
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d9e59aba:

    # w "Hm..."
    w "嗯..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10234
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e95f2791:

    # "By now, you know better than to wait for him to elaborate."
    "现在你很清楚，别指望他会详细解释。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10236
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2d6b320a:

    # p "I take it that that is all you have to say."
    p "我猜这就是你想说的全部了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10238
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_670470a1:

    # w "I'd say you got it right."
    w "你说的没错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10242
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_7ab6e909:

    # w "You're expecting romanticism where there is none."
    w "你想的太浪漫了，根本没有那回事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10244
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e1cf7c28:

    # w "What do you expect to happen when you can persuade someone to come ashore with you? That you just leave this ship hand-in-hand and become one happy family?"
    w "你以为你能说服别人跟你上岸，接下来会怎样？咱们手拉手离开船，从此变成幸福一家人？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10246
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_a58b920e:

    # w "The type of person you are looking for are few and far between, and I don't see how after not even two weeks you'd trust {i}anyone{/i} on here to be {i}that{/i} type of person."
    w "你找的那种人，少之又少。我实在想不明白，这才不到两礼拜，你怎么就相信船上{i}随便哪个阿猫阿狗{/i}会是{i}你想要的那种{/i}人了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10250
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8356c6f8:

    # w "Your fear is real, yes.{w} It should be.{w} You're put out into the wild and you'll have to learn."
    w "没错，你害怕是应该的。{w} 这是理所当然的。{w} 你这是被扔进了野地里，就得自己学着点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10252
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_15bce256:

    # w "I hope you will, but it'll be without me."
    w "我希望你能行，但别指望我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10254
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c391c458:

    # w "For your own sake."
    w "我是为你好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10256
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_dbbc07b2:

    # p "Not everyone's completely cynical or self-interested. There are good, honorable people all over the world. Friends."
    p "并非所有人都那么愤世嫉俗或自私自利。天底下到处都有心怀坦荡、讲究道义的好人。比如朋友。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10258
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_be82046a:

    # "Wolf opens his mouth, but catches himself and closes it immediately after."
    "Wolf 张了张嘴，但立马又闭上了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10260
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8337703c_2:

    # w ". . ."
    w ". . ."

# game/script day12.rpy:10262
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_7b070eb7:

    # "You're not sure what else you could say. Instead, you stay silent."
    "你也不知道还能说些什么，于是选择了沉默。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10268
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c1a69cb8:

    # p "Come on, Wolf.{w} I need you. We understand each other and I want you to come along."
    p "我说，Wolf！{w} 我需要你。咱俩互相理解，我真想你跟我一起走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10270
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_27776b87:

    # "Wolf stays silent."
    "Wolf 还是不说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10272
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_4e374a1a:

    # "He stays silent for a long time."
    "他沉默了很久。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10274
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_263ceffd:

    # "Unusually long, even for him."
    "久得出奇，这可不像他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10276
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_efea3e3c:

    # "It feels like almost a minute passes as the boat sways lazily, raindrops falling one after another, the time between them slowly growing longer."
    "感觉时间都快过去一分钟了，小船慢悠悠地晃荡着，雨点噼里啪啦地落下来，而且越下越稀疏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10278
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_a70d14eb:

    # "Finally, the canine speaks."
    "终于，这头狼开口了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10280
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_daddbb60:

    # w "I told you already."
    w "我早就跟你说过了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10282
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_4309ad3a_1:

    # w "No."
    w "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10286
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_3d8a07a0:

    # w "We're not friends just because you happened to help me out with my clothes, or offered me some of your dinner yesterday."
    w "别以为你帮我拿了身衣服，昨天又分了我点晚饭，咱们就是朋友了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10290
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_ff5a628b:

    # w "We're not friends just because you helped me with the fife, or offered me some of your dinner yesterday."
    w "别以为你帮我弄了弄横笛，昨天又分了我点晚饭，咱们就是朋友了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10292
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_58e31649:

    # w "I think what you really want isn't me..."
    w "我觉得你真正想要的，根本不是我..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10298
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_4ec2aafe:

    # "Wolf leans in. He's uncomfortably close now."
    "Wolf 凑了过来，现在离得太近了，让人觉得不自在。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10300
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_90c74ba4:

    # w "But someone who can take the burden off of your shoulder."
    w "而是想要找个能帮你分担重担的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10304
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_af02cab3:

    # w "Someone to dispel the fear."
    w "一个能帮你驱散心头恐惧的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10306
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e74e9ca9_1:

    # p "I don't..."
    p "我不..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10308
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_ab3529f7:

    # w "You just don't want to be alone."
    w "说白了，你就是不想一个人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10310
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_05e2efd8:

    # w "You already thought sailing was some romantic swashbuckling adventure. Like a story a passenger would read in a book. But you're no passenger here."
    w "你是不是还以为航海是什么浪漫的、充满英雄气概的冒险？就像那些乘客在书里看的故事一样。但你现在不是乘客了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10312
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5e61fbe6:

    # w "And now you feel your dream dissolving between your fingers, and you insist I should drop everything and come with you on {i}your{/i} next great adventure."
    w "现在你觉得你那美梦就要从你指缝间溜走了，所以就非要让我扔下一切，跟你去进行{i}你那{/i}下一次伟大的冒险？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10316
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0c3ceea3:

    # w "Then what? Rescue you from a constant string of bad decisions?{w} Hold you back in every tavern we stop at along the way?{w} Keep you on a leash so you don't keep fucking yourself over forever?"
    w "然后呢？ 让我天天替你收拾烂摊子？{w} 每到一个酒馆都得看着你点？{w} 给你拴上链子，省得你一直作死下去？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10320
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_029dddd2:

    # w "Then what? Keep protecting you like just now?{w} Be the shield between you and the world?{w} Your trusted nanny, ready to save you from whatever comes our way?"
    w "然后呢？ 像刚才那样一直保护你？{w} 成为你和这世界之间的挡箭牌？{w} 成为你那靠谱的保姆，随时准备把你从各种麻烦里捞出来？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10322
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_296c963a:

    # "The verbal assault catches you by surprise."
    "这劈头盖脸的一顿话说得你措手不及。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10326
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_4556fad4:

    # "You perceive anger in his words. An anger seemingly coming from a place of disappointment, rather than grievous intent."
    "你从他的话里听出了愤怒。这怒火似乎是源于失望，而不是真的想伤害你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10328
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2f8bdf06:

    # "You can't tell if that makes it more or less painful."
    "你也不知道这样是更难受，还是能好受点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10337
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_33c51144:

    # "You take a step back, but your retreat is cut short by the gunboat scraping over your wounds and sending a flash of pain up your spine. The only space left behind you is taken up by the gunwale you were resting on just a few minutes ago."
    "你想往后退一步，结果炮艇擦过你的伤口，疼得你脊梁骨都麻了。身后能站人的地方，几分钟前还让你靠在gunwale（舷缘）上了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10341
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_31949807:

    # "You take a step back, but your retreat is cut short by the gunboat hitting you in the kidneys. The only space left behind you is taken up by the gunwale you were resting on just a few minutes ago."
    "你往后退了一步，结果炮艇一下撞在你的腰子上，直接把你顶了回去。身后能站人的地方，几分钟前还靠着的船舷全占了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10343
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c2ecdce5:

    # "Suddenly the water sloshing around the hull below feels frighteningly close."
    "突然，感觉船底下的水声就在耳边，瘆得慌。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10347
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_914a9949:

    # "Something in your expression hits Wolf. He stops, shutting his muzzle fast."
    "你脸上露出的表情触动了 Wolf，他立马闭上了嘴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10352
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8e82698a:

    # "The canine pinches between his eyes, taking a deep breath."
    "他眉间的肌肉紧了紧，深吸了一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10356
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_f7e16732:

    # w "You're naive, but you're not that stupid. I can tell that much by now."
    w "你小子是嫩了点，但还没蠢到家。我早就看出来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10358
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_b6600d32:

    # w "I told you. You, the ship, the crew—I just do it to get paid. And yet here you are, asking me to drop everything and set off with you.{w} {i}Again.{/i}"
    w "我告诉过你。你，这艘船，船员——我做这些只是为了拿报酬。可你却在这里，要我抛下一切跟你走。又一次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10360
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_85c99319:

    # w "I don't even care if it's because you need, or want me to come along."
    w "我才懒得管你是需要我，还是想让我跟你一块儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10362
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_4309ad3a_2:

    # w "No."
    w "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10364
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_f2add639:

    # w "My answer is no."
    w "我的回答是，没门儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10366
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e4bee346:

    # p "I just meant to say..."
    p "我只是想说..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10370
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_b1c664cc:

    # w "You're not listening. You never listen."
    w "你根本就没听进去。你从来就没听过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10374
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_6a6cd7d5:

    # w "You're green. I'm not going to fault you for that."
    w "你还是个雏儿。我不怪你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10376
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e27dabba:

    # w "I'd have said no regardless. I told you more times than I can count. I'm not here for adventure, I'm here because of the work."
    w "就算没这茬，我也是一样拒绝。我跟你说了多少遍了，我不是来冒险的，我是来干活的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10378
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e286f432:

    # "Wolf shakes his head."
    "Wolf 摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10380
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d25ca39d:

    # w "Look, I'm not..."
    w "听着，我不是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10384
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_cb462340:

    # w "Ah, bloody hell..."
    w "哎，真他妈的..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10386
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_07dacec4:

    # w "I'm not heartless. I don't think you're a hopeless idiot. I think you're more desperate than you're willing to admit."
    w "我又不是铁石心肠。我也没觉得你蠢到无可救药。我只是觉得你比你自己承认的还要绝望。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10390
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5836924b:

    # w "A sailor's work is tough. But at this point, consider that you might not be cut out for it. Think about finding a passage home. Could be your best option."
    w "干水手这行是挺苦的。不过你也该考虑考虑，自己是不是这块料。要我说，你不如找条船，打道回府。这说不定才是你最好的选择。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10392
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_b5792eb9:

    # "The wind and the waves provide the period at the end of your conversation."
    "风声和浪声给你们的对话画上了一个句号。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10394
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2e3b0187:

    # "Shared silence, seemingly the defining trait of your... Friendship? Not quite the word you feel you can apply to your relationship with Wolf."
    "又是无言以对，这好像都快成了咱们...友谊的象征了？呸，就咱俩这关系，配用“友谊”这词儿吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10396
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_57c4eff0:

    # "If there's ever been a crack in his facade, it's so small you can't even tell it's there."
    "要说他那张面瘫脸上有过一丝裂缝，那也细微到你根本察觉不到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10398
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_cc3f108f:

    # "But Wolf is still here, though, talking to you."
    "不过 Wolf 还是站在你面前，跟你说着话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10400
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_eb543648:

    # "Still, silence is what stands between the two of you now. Just as it stood so many times before."
    "唉，沉默依旧横在你们两人之间。就像之前无数次那样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10402
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_d48c8b17:

    # "This is it, then, you think. The two days aren't over yet, but this is about as far as Wolf would push himself for a \"goodbye.\""
    "看来到此为止了，你暗想。两天期限虽尚未过完，但这大概已经是Wolf能勉强挤出的最体面的‘道别’了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10404
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_27d37a76:

    # "You chuckle.{w} How appropriate that your last attempt at opening him up ends in the same silence he's shared with you since the beginning."
    "你自嘲地笑了笑。{w} 真讽刺，最后一次想打开他的心扉，结果还是像一开始那样，陷入一片死寂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10406
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e095c067:

    # "This time, he's the one who breaks it first."
    "这次，反倒是他先开了口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10412
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_ea8721ac:

    # p "Well... two more days."
    p "嗯……还有两天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10415
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_383e0388:

    # p "Yes...{w} two days..."
    p "是啊……两天……"

# game/script day12.rpy:10417
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_1a17a1b6:

    # p "When are you going to leave this ship behind?"
    p "你打算啥时候离开这条船？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10421
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_98b11ef8:

    # "Wolf sighs. His answer comes much faster than you expected.{w} Really, you're not sure you expected an answer at all."
    "Wolf 叹了口气。他的回答比你预想的快得多。{w} 说实话，你都没指望他能回答你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10423
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_921e07b6:

    # w "I don't intend to."
    w "我没打算走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10425
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c394861a:

    # p "Well, you're hardly going to stay forever, are you?"
    p "怎么，难不成你还打算一辈子留在这船上？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10431
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_cfdfa326:

    # w "Will you shut up already?"
    w "你能不能安静点？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10436
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_6111a711:

    # w "I don't know."
    w "不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10438
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_408cb333:

    # w "Whenever fate guides me towards the next thing."
    w "命运何时会指引我走向下一步呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10440
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_07786ce7:

    # p "What do you think that will be?"
    p "你觉得会是什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10442
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_1939486d:

    # "He shrugs."
    "他耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10444
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2373e683:

    # w "I'll know it when I'm face to face with it."
    w "等我亲眼见到就知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10446
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_14746183:

    # p "I hope that it'll come on your own terms. It's... it's embarrassing to admit, but it's a little scary for me to see what's ahead."
    p "我希望你能自己掌控未来。承认这个有点难为情，但一想到未来会发生什么，我还是有点害怕。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10448
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_aada2286:

    # p "I think...{w} I thought I had made up my mind."
    p "我想...我原以为自己已经下定决心了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10450
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_8ace0892_1:

    # p "I thought that I'm just going to leave. Head held high, strong, being above anything that piece of shit can throw at me. But..."
    p "我本以为自己能昂首挺胸地离开，坚强地面对一切，不被那个混蛋击垮，但是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10452
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_984ab389:

    # p "What am I going to do once I get off this ship?"
    p "下了这条船之后要做什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10454
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_0699673f_1:

    # p "I don't know what my options are, I don't know the language. I might be able to find a ship to take me on, he said the harbor is busy enough to have a ship take me back within a month, but that feels like a game of chance."
    p "我甚至不知道该怎么办，而且我语言不通。也许能找到一艘船把我带走，他说港口挺繁忙的，说不定一个月内就能有船送我回去，但这简直就像赌博一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10456
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_cd4739b2_1:

    # p "I'll be tossing the dice on my entire future. That's...{w} terrifying, Wolf."
    p "我要把我的整个未来都押上去。这……{w} 太可怕了，Wolf。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10458
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_3861f93f_1:

    # p "I need to do something before it's time."
    p "我必须在一切发生之前做点什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10460
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_be82046a_1:

    # "Wolf opens his mouth, but catches himself and closes it immediately after."
    "Wolf 张了张嘴，但立马又闭上了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10462
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_16da311e:

    # "He dips his head down for a moment, his eyes fixed briefly on the deck, before he finds your eyes again."
    "他先是低下头，目光在甲板上短暂停留，随即又抬眼看向你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10464
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_285c487d:

    # w "Your fear is real, yes.{w} It should be. It's how our ancestors survived, seeking the strength of their packs."
    w "你的恐惧是真实的，没错。 这很正常。 我们的祖先就是靠着恐惧，以及对同伴的依赖才得以生存。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10466
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_784c48f8:

    # w "You're put out into the wild and you'll have to learn quickly."
    w "你会被扔到荒野里，必须尽快学会生存。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10468
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_cbfd7de1:

    # w "I hope you will."
    w "我希望你能做到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10470
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_c391c458_1:

    # w "For your own sake."
    w "我是为你好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10472
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_e9370f62:

    # "Now it's your turn to sigh in defeat."
    "现在，该你认输叹气了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10474
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_97b2b8f4:

    # p "You're not helpful, Wolf."
    p "你一点用都没有，Wolf。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10476
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_fe076b1f:

    # p "I must find a way back to my homeland, not go out and survive in the forest."
    p "我必须想办法回到家乡，而不是跑到森林里求生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10480
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_51fa55d4:

    # w "Then don't ask me, ask the lizard, or anyone else for that matter."
    w "那就别问我，问蜥蜴去，或者随便什么人都行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10485
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_13124aa8:

    # "He turns to leave and for a second you play with the thought of asking where he's going, but then think better of it."
    "他转身要走，你有那么一瞬间想问他去哪，但转念一想还是算了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10487
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_2dc66235:

    # "He doesn't seem to be in the best mood and it's probably good not to prod the hornet's nest."
    "他似乎心情不太好，最好不要捅马蜂窝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10489
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_645b3e86:

    # "Perhaps you should get back to Samuel, before [he] thinks you skipped watch."
    "你最好回去找Samuel，免得他以为你偷懒溜岗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10495
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_00362e40:

    # w "We should go find Samuel. Before anyone thinks we skipped watch."
    w "我们该去找Samuel了，免得被人当成是偷懒溜岗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10497
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_64f8d07c:

    # "You nod. He's right. However things may have gone, you're still on a ship and you're still in a crew."
    "你点点头。 他说得对。 不管之前发生了什么，你现在还是在船上，还是船员。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10499
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_411694b6:

    # "The idea of putting your body through even more work, after today, has significant parts of it loudly complaining at you. But you decide they'll have to deal with it."
    "一想到今天已经这么累了，还要让身体承受更多的工作，身体的各个部位都在大声抗议。 但你还是决定让他们克服一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10501
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_a9fe8df5:

    # "Just like you do..."
    "就像你一直做的那样......"

# game/script day12.rpy:10503
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_cea341bf:

    # "You're part of the crew."
    "你是船上的一员。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10505
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_5b9b7942:

    # "For now."
    "至少现在是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10507
translate Chinese day12_leave_wolf_post_eagle_740facc2:

    # "For just a little longer."
    "再过不久吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10539
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4eacfb19:

    # "The morning in the galley is a sullen one, with every member of the crew wearing the signs of the earlier rush now that things have calmed down and the adrenaline left their bodies."
    "清晨的厨房里一片死气沉沉，船员们个个脸上都写满了疲惫，早上的那股忙乱劲儿已经过去了，肾上腺素也消退了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10541
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b035512a:

    # "For you, though, there isn't a shred of weariness that remains. Almost as if your body realizes that it can't allow you to be tired for the next few days."
    "然而对你而言，身上却连一丝睡意疲态也无。仿佛你的身体本能地意识到，在接下来的这几天里，自己绝没有犯困懈怠的资格。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10543
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_dac9055a:

    # "Not if you want to actually stay on the ship."
    "如果你还想待在这艘船上的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10545
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_6fb7375c:

    # "Or perhaps it's the guilt that is your own greatest enemy to slumber."
    "或许，让你无法入眠的是你心中的愧疚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10547
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_31acc17d:

    # "Knowing that this was all your fault."
    "明知道这一切都怪你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10549
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_c711021f:

    # "Every so often there's a large, ominous boom—from where and what in the ship you lack the knowledge, let alone experience, to tell."
    "时不时会传来一声沉闷不祥的巨响——以你贫乏的操船知识和阅历，根本辨别不出究竟是来自船身何处、又是因何而起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10551
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9d500f7a:

    # "But it's usually followed by the wet splash and trickle of water, which for the first couple of times made you fear the ship was about to go under."
    "但紧接着，通常会传来湿漉漉的水花飞溅声和滴水声，头几次你还真怕船要沉了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10557
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d7bb3795:

    # "You push yourself through the ship from one steadying beam to the next. Passing a few hammocks and almost falling over a wayward box that slides across the ground."
    "你扶着船梁，一步一步艰难地走着。经过几张吊床，差点被地上乱滑的箱子绊倒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10559
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ac4a3823:

    # "The air in the galley feels thick and tense, filled with the sour scent of their resentment.{p}Word must be getting around..."
    "厨房里的气氛压抑得让人喘不过气，空气中弥漫着他们怨恨的味道。{p}看来消息传开了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:10561
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_648a6fbb:

    # "Few make even as much as eye contact with you, preferring to drift around you like flotsam."
    "几乎没人愿意同你对视哪怕一眼，所有人都像避开海上漂浮物一样从你身旁绕道而过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10572
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8b74236e:

    # "Their seemingly effortless avoidance is in fact terribly deliberate: a practice undoubtedly well-honed for such a cramped vessel. A practical defense that stops anything boiling over."
    "他们看似毫不费力的躲避，实际上是刻意为之：在这种拥挤的船上，他们无疑早已练就了纯熟的回避技巧。这是一种实用的防御手段，能避免任何冲突爆发。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10574
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3a817118:

    # "But by the fourth or fifth deep breath, the silence towards you becomes sickening. Can't they just shout at you, beat you even?{w} Just do something to get over it. Anything other than bury their anger and let it smoulder."
    "深呼吸了四五次，周围的沉默让你简直要窒息。他们就不能冲你吼两句，甚至打你一顿吗？{w} 做点什么都行，别这样把怒火憋在心里，让它慢慢燃烧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10578
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_093a6105:

    # "Even Nomax barely talks, though you could only imagine that the reason he isn't doubled over emptying his stomach is that there's nothing left in there to begin with."
    "就连Nomax也一声不吭，估计他没趴在那里吐，是因为肚子里早就空空如也了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10585
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bfdcd7e8:

    # "That feeling is coiling underneath your tongue, goading you to be the first to say something. But, as tempting as the thought is, you hold your tongue. They are right to treat you this way, after all."
    "那种感觉在舌尖翻涌，怂恿你先开口说点什么。但这个念头再诱人，你还是忍住了。毕竟，他们这样对你也是应该的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10587
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b3e12ea5:

    # "Still..."
    "还是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:10594
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4f0b428b:

    # "It's hard. Thoughts of home are tugging at every sluggish heartbeat."
    "真难熬。对家的思念，牵动着每一颗沉重的心跳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10596
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_df7fdf1c:

    # "The cool, sweet spring breeze. The warble of songbirds. The smell of freshly cut hay, and the long summer days scything the wheat..."
    "凉爽香甜的春风。婉转动听的鸟鸣。新割的干草香气，还有挥镰收麦的漫长夏日……"

# game/script day12.rpy:10598
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_e137eb25:

    # "Taking a bath in the clear stream behind the mill while watching the sun set."
    "在磨坊后面的清澈小溪里洗澡，同时看着太阳落山。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10600
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_cf4726d6:

    # "What you've given up for...{p}This."
    "你放弃了那些，换来了……{p}现在这副光景。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10608
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_f9d17e37:

    # "The lump in your throat stubbornly remains as you sit down at the table."
    "坐在桌旁，你还是觉得喉咙里堵得慌。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10610
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a531f7fa:

    # "Perhaps... you had made a mistake long before what happened today."
    "也许……早在今天的事情发生之前，你就已经铸成大错了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10612
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_1a87fa4b:

    # "It's an inescapable feeling, and one that both breakfast, and the unceasingly cheery air of its creator, fails to alleviate."
    "这种感觉挥之不去，无论是早餐，还是Bandile那不知疲倦的乐天劲儿，都没法让你好受一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10616
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_6b03c2fe:

    # b "Come on, cheer up!"
    b "嗨，打起精神来！"

# game/script day12.rpy:10620
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_521686e9:

    # "A bowl thuds down on the table in front of you, followed by the usual cheerful demeanour of Bandile. Even a storm doesn't dampen his spirits, but..."
    "一个碗砰地一声落在你面前，接着是Bandile一如既往的笑脸。就算暴风雨也浇不灭他的热情，但是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:10622
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_77b2ddeb:

    # "perhaps a storm does dampen his creativity."
    "也许暴风雨真的会影响他的创作灵感。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10624
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_36a998ac:

    # p "Dog's body again?"
    p "又是“狗食”？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10626
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3bf96ab7:

    # b "Excuse you. Dog's body,{w} {i}with molasses{/i}."
    b "说什么呢。“狗食”，{w} {i}加了糖蜜{/i}！"

# game/script day12.rpy:10631
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_70965527:

    # b "And I added some ship's biscuits as well, but I doubt you'll go crazy over those, so I won't mention it."
    b "我还加了些船上的硬饼干，不过估计你也不会喜欢，我就不提了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10633
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4805ea1b:

    # b "I know this is not my best, but I promise when we make port in the next couple of days I'll be able to wow you with all the delightful spices the bazaars can offer!"
    b "我知道这顿饭发挥失常，但我保证过两天靠港的时候，集市里琳琅满目的香料绝对能让我大显身手，惊艳你们的舌头！"

# game/script day12.rpy:10637
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3f4efdbc:

    # b "Rajeeyah here already told me that she'll show me the best market in the city."
    b "Rajeeyah已经答应带我去城里最好的集市逛逛了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10639
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_f9f8e4fe:

    # "The hare's velvet nose quivers in excitement."
    "这只兔子的天鹅绒小鼻子，兴奋地抽动着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10643
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_20afce4a:

    # p "You know I'm getting kicked off at the next port, right?"
    p "你知道我会在下一个港口被赶下船吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10645
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ac5d6e90:

    # "The hare huffs and bats you with a paw."
    "兔子哼了一声，抬爪子拍了你一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10647
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_70428263:

    # b "Poppycock. As if."
    b "瞎说。怎么可能。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10649
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9214feff:

    # p "Don't just take my word for it."
    p "别光听我瞎说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10651
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_6f732bc2:

    # "You shrug, trying to do your best to hold back your sour mood. Sure, you'd spoiled the feelings of the rest of crew, but at least Bandile hadn't turned on you."
    "你耸了耸肩，尽量压下低落的情绪。没错，虽然你把全船水手的好感都败光了，但至少班迪尔并没有对你横眉冷对。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10653
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_29cb8514:

    # p "I'm the reason the ship got caught in the storm."
    p "这场风暴都是我害的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10657
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a618850e:

    # b "What, you conjured that all up by yourself?"
    b "怎么着，你一个人就能呼风唤雨了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10659
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_951149c8:

    # "He points to the planks above."
    "他指了指头顶上的甲板。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10661
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b2c3ddfb:

    # "Given Bandile's usual playful demeanour, it's hard to tell whether he's joking with you or not."
    "谁知道 Bandile 是不是在跟你开玩笑，他平时就爱闹腾。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10663
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_91b70bb2:

    # "Perhaps that's the point."
    "也许人家就是想让你摸不着头脑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10665
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_5b5925e9:

    # b "I didn't realize we had a wizard on board."
    b "我还不知道咱船上藏了个魔法师呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10669
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_da63cc2d:

    # b "My man, storms happen."
    b "老兄，风暴这种事，家常便饭。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10671
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_32150dcf:

    # p "I fell asleep on the weather watch."
    p "我值班的时候睡着了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10675
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_f8d4ba09:

    # b "Oh, I did hear about that now you come to mention it."
    b "哦，你不说我都忘了这茬了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10677
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4e2721f9:

    # "The hare nods, stroking his chin."
    "那只兔子点点头，摸了摸他的下巴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10681
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4172f5b0:

    # b "Well, it's just a little seawater. Ships get in storms all the time! You'd think sailors were allergic to getting wet with how often we moan about it!"
    b "嗨，不就是点海水嘛。跑船的谁还没见过风浪！要我说，水手们就是矫情，好像一碰水就要掉层皮似的，天天抱怨个没完！"

# game/script day12.rpy:10683
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_c2b9c50c:

    # b "I wouldn't let it get to you."
    b "别往心里去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10685
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_50ac4e1a:

    # p "It's not about the crew in general, but Arthur."
    p "倒不是针对大家，主要是 Arthur 针对我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10689
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0bf37c6f:

    # "You poke at the dull lump squatting in your bowl, half-hoping that it might taste miraculous, despite appearances."
    "你戳了戳碗里那坨灰不拉几的东西，心里还抱着一丝希望，想着它会不会出人意料地美味。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10691
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_83fdff07:

    # "You could do with some proof that such things were possible, after all."
    "毕竟，你现在特别需要一些奇迹来证明一下自己。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10693
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8cbd3305:

    # b "Is that so?"
    b "真的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10695
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_60c30a4b:

    # p "Yes. He's the one who just wants me out of his sight as fast as possible."
    p "没错。他巴不得我赶紧从他眼前消失。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10699
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_64bf8875:

    # "You speak through a sigh; half from homesickness, and half from forlorn thoughts of home."
    "你叹了口气，这口气里一半是想家，一半是对家乡的惆怅。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10701
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a28b7ece:

    # "How naive you were..."
    "当初真是太天真了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:10703
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_351cf165:

    # b "Well, will you just roll over and accept it?"
    b "难道你就打算这么忍气吞声了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10707
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9a06557b:

    # "Bandile shifts, straightening his back."
    "Bandile 挪动了一下身子，挺直了腰板。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10709
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9aa0e9c0:

    # p "That wasn't my plan, no."
    p "我当然没打算就这么算了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10711
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4f250c39:

    # "You mutter as you chew your mouthful."
    "你嚼着嘴里的东西，咕哝道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10713
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4288d0df:

    # b "Then what's the plan?"
    b "那你有什么打算？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10715
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_08cede8e:

    # p "Well... try {i}something{/i}, I guess."
    p "嗯…… 试试{i}看呗{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10717
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bba247f3:

    # p "I've yet to figure out what exactly, but I guess anything that raises my status in the perception of Arthur will do."
    p "我还没想好具体要怎么做，不过我想，只要能提高我在 Arthur 心里的地位，什么都行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10719
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_e51a5c1c:

    # p "It's more... frustration that's dragging me down, Bandile."
    p "主要是…… Bandile，是挫败感压得我喘不过气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10721
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d26e7e7d:

    # p "Frustration that I even have to deal with this in the first place."
    p "一想到我居然要应付这种事，我就觉得窝火。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10725
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b17f6126:

    # b "Good, I think the starry-eyed stray—all adventures on the ocean in his eyes—that I met that first night is still present."
    b "那就好，看来登船第一天晚上我遇见的那个满眼星光、满脑子大洋冒险的流浪小伙子还没彻底消失。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10727
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_c58c0afa:

    # p "I'm not so sure about that. It feels like that urge for adventure is only hanging on by a thread."
    p "我可不太确定。我感觉他对冒险的渴望已经岌岌可危了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10729
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_feb3fba1:

    # p "You must have had your fair share of them, Bandile."
    p "你肯定经历过不少冒险吧，Bandile。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10731
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_77feacb9:

    # "The disappointment was only second to the bitterness that lingered in your mouth. It made the food taste even worse."
    "失望感比口中的苦涩好不到哪儿去。这让食物更难以下咽了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10733
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_cc01b124:

    # "This would have worked out fine if it wasn't for Arthur."
    "要不是Arthur，事情本来会很顺利的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10739
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_00794918:

    # "Bandile scoots closer, taking advantage of the lull between watches to join you on the opposite bench."
    "Bandile 蹭了过来，趁着换班的空隙，和你一起坐在了对面的长凳上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10741
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_357a2b18:

    # "This close you can spot a few familiar faces begin to trickle in, but judging from food on display, they're in no rush for Bandile to finish with you."
    "离得近了，你能看到几张熟悉的面孔陆陆续续走了进来，不过看看摆出来的食物，他们也不着急让Bandile 结束和你的谈话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10743
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_362a0119:

    # b "Oh, of course. I may not be up on the deck or clambering up the sails with the sea breeze coursing through my fur, but I've met plenty of people in my travels."
    b "哦，那是当然。我可能没在甲板上迎着海风爬桅杆，但在我的旅途中，我也遇到过不少人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10745
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_46f9c097:

    # b "You don't strike me as someone that quits on their dreams."
    b "你看上去不像是会放弃梦想的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10747
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3f841014:

    # b "If you did, you wouldn't have set foot on this ship in the first place for the reasons you did."
    b "如果你真的放弃了，当初就不会因为那些原因而踏上这艘船了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10749
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_08948723:

    # p "You talk like you've seen a lot of the world?"
    p "听你说话的口气，好像见过不少世面？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10751
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_690e6145:

    # "You temper your tone, hoping your questions don't come off as rude or condescending. It's just... hard to imagine, given you've only ever seen the hare busy in the kitchen below deck."
    "你尽量控制着语气，希望你的问题听起来不会显得粗鲁或者居高临下。只是……很难想象，毕竟我只见过你在甲板下的厨房里忙碌。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10755
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ead80e29:

    # b "Food's one of the world's great uniters, [name]. It brings the world to you, and you to the world..."
    b "食物可是连接世界的纽带，[name]。它把世界带给你，也把你带向世界……"

# game/script day12.rpy:10757
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_6eb7776a:

    # "Bandile leans forward and holds his head in his paws, a dreamy expression flickering over his eyes."
    "Bandile 向前倾身，用爪子抱着脑袋，眼神里闪烁着对未来的憧憬。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10759
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8de0e296:

    # b "How else could a cook like me come to be so far from home? Perhaps my dreams aren't particularly grand, but it's fascinating to discover the world as a cook."
    b "要不然像我这么个伙夫，怎么会离家漂泊到这么远的天涯海角？或许我的志向算不上多么远大，但以厨子的身份去丈量探索这个世界，本就其乐无穷。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10761
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ceda9bf9:

    # b "Sometimes, you've just got to push through, despite what the rest of the world tells you."
    b "有时候，就得顶着压力往前冲，别管别人怎么说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10765
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_1a3b8e64:

    # b "You'll make a fine sailor, I'm sure."
    b "我相信，你肯定能成为一名出色的水手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10767
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8ec8c106:

    # p "No offence, but I don't think you're the best to advise when it comes to sailing."
    p "没冒犯的意思，不过要说航海的事儿，我觉得你可能给不了什么有用的建议。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10769
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8848c7e6:

    # "You don't want to sound ungrateful for his company, but there's a fine line between hope and senseless optimism, and you don't really want to discover the cheery hare on the latter."
    "你不想因为他来陪你而显得不知好歹，但希望和盲目乐观只有一线之隔，你可不想看到这只乐天派兔子属于后者。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10774
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b95cab72:

    # b "Of course not. But, it's in the spirit I give such advice."
    b "当然不是。我只是怀着美好的祝愿，才这么建议的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10782
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_f393e11b:

    # "Before you can say anything more, Samuel walks over and sits down by your side, having been served [his] ration by another member of the galley with Rajeeyah in tow."
    "你还没来得及说更多，Samuel 走了过来，坐在你旁边，另一个厨房的伙计把他的那份食物端了上来，Rajeeyah 也跟在他身后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10784
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4bba53d6:

    # "Yet the maned wolf acknowledges your presence with a terse huff, the usual scent of their fur smelling heavily of saltwater."
    "然而，那只鬃狼只是冷哼一声，算是打了招呼，它皮毛上那股熟悉的气味里带着浓重的海腥味。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10786
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_1dedb4a6:

    # s "Look who it is, Raj."
    s "看看这是谁，Raj。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10790
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_38e38c2f:

    # s "You don't look as well rested as you should, what gives?"
    s "你看起来没休息好啊，怎么了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10799
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_e21558f3:

    # p "Very funny. I told you I'll be doing my best from now on."
    p "真好笑。我跟你说了，从今往后我会尽力做到最好的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10801
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bdb3a848:

    # p "Don't have to keep prodding the wound."
    p "别揭人伤疤了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10807
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bf14f465:

    # p "Funny."
    p "有意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10809
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d220a55e:

    # p "I assume you know then?"
    p "我猜你已经听说了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10813
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_f8264504:

    # s "Of course. It's not going to stay a secret for long on a ship."
    s "那是当然。这种事在船上可瞒不了多久。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10815
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_c4fc2b69:

    # s "Someone always sees or hears it from somewhere."
    s "谁都能从哪儿听到点风声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10827
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8c6d7ad1:

    # "Rajeeyah shuffles onto the same table, followed by Nomax not long after. They all seem more or less devoting their energy to attacking their food, but eventually Samuel picks up on your half-hearted chewing."
    "Rajeeyah慢吞吞地走到桌边，Nomax也紧随其后。他们几乎都在狼吞虎咽地对付着食物，Samuel最终注意到了你那心不在焉的咀嚼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10837
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_cbb25b34:

    # "Rajeeyah shuffles onto the same table. They seem more or less devoting their energy to attacking their food, but eventually Samuel picks up on your half-hearted chewing."
    "Rajeeyah挪步坐到了同一张长桌边。大伙基本都在埋头应付盘子里的饭食，但Samuel终究察觉到了你那心不在焉的咀嚼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10839
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3d4bfcd2:

    # s "If you're not going to finish that, I'll have it."
    s "“你不吃完我可就吃了啊。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10841
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_73cab25f:

    # b "Tough morning topside?"
    b "“今天早上在甲板上不好受吧？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10845
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_33523583:

    # "Sam just looks at him for a moment or two."
    "Sam只是看了他一会儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10847
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9093a921:

    # s "How do I look?"
    s "“我看起来怎么样？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10849
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_7cb4d29c:

    # b "Like someone who had a tough morning."
    b "“像早上倒了霉一样。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10853
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ce857223:

    # "Samuel shrugs and rolls [his] eyes."
    "Samuel耸耸肩，翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10855
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_7eea491a:

    # s "Didn't see the end of it. It must have been at least several leagues wide and kept shifting on us, so there was no avoiding it really."
    s "“我没看到头。那玩意儿起码有好几里格宽，而且一直冲着我们漂移，根本躲不开。”（leagues，航海里程单位，约等于5.5公里）"

# game/script day12.rpy:10859
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_5125edc1:

    # "When that fails to bring a flash of relief across your face, Samuel nudges you with [his] elbow."
    "见你脸上毫无放松之色，Samuel用胳膊肘顶了你一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10863
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9fca8bd5:

    # s "You're supposed to smile at that."
    s "“你这时候该笑一个。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10865
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_10745251:

    # p "I'm not feeling it."
    p "“我笑不出来。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10869
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_893f3420:

    # s "Don't tell me you're feeling seasick like the dog over there."
    s "“别告诉我你像那边的旱鸭子一样晕船了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10871
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_329e0c56:

    # p "No..."
    p "不是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:10882
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b252896a:

    # "Nomax perks up as he hears himself mentioned."
    "Nomax听到提到了自己，立刻来了精神。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10884
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bf07ad14:

    # n "I'm fine!{w} -ish."
    n "“我没事！{w} - 差不多吧。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10886
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b699f862:

    # n "Only a little bit queasy."
    n "“就是稍微有点想吐。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10890
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_86b968b2:

    # r "He's staying close to the center of the ship on doctor's orders."
    r "“医生让他待在船中央，他可听话了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10894
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d23ed2d0:

    # s "Don't tell me you're feeling seasick?"
    s "“别告诉我你晕船了？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10896
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_329e0c56_1:

    # p "No..."
    p "不是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:10905
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_681e3962:

    # "You sigh."
    "你叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10907
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_10a385f7:

    # p "I'm just not really feeling it."
    p "“我就是提不起劲儿。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10911
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_5de7c46d:

    # b "An army marches on its stomach... Same principle for a ship at sea."
    b "“人是铁饭是钢……船在海上也一样。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10913
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_acf5b7f3:

    # "The hare grins, giving your bowl an encouraging nudge."
    "那野兔咧嘴一笑，鼓励地推了推你的碗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10915
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_15e01561:

    # b "It's not pretty food, but I tell you, it gives you the energy you need to keep going, even during rough seas."
    b "“这玩意儿卖相差点，但我跟你说，就算是在风浪最大的时候，也能让你有干劲儿。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10919
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_48a199e0:

    # s "Maybe a little sugar, or cinnamon even, would help make it slide down easier."
    s "或许加点糖，或者哪怕一点肉桂，能让这玩意儿咽起来顺溜一些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10921
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_73e74138:

    # "Samuel chews away, working through the mush of peas with evident practice."
    "Samuel大口嚼着，看来是吃惯了这种豌豆糊糊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10923
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_5ee62a9d:

    # b "Yeah, well, you better become one of the gentlemen if you want either of those over molasses..."
    b "“是啊，想在糖蜜里加这些，你最好先混成个老爷再说……”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10925
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_921a5846:

    # b "I can do my best, but I can't work miracles... Maybe I'll find some in port."
    b "“我尽力，但我又不是神仙…… 没准能在港口找到点。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10927
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_cc27ce48:

    # "The mood goes quiet as they skirt around the obvious, tempering any signs of excitement the two of them might have had about port. It still comes across, however."
    "他们没再提靠港的事儿，气氛一下子安静了下来，两人原本对靠港的那么点兴奋劲头也消散了，但还是能感觉出来他们有点期待。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10929
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_96e60ef9:

    # b "Hopefully we'll get a decent budget to purchase supplies with this time."
    b "“希望这次能多给点预算，好让我们多买点补给。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:10931
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_e2aa2bca:

    # "The hare shrugs."
    "那野兔耸了耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10935
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_5edc1745:

    # b "I doubt our smartly dressed friend over there is overly thrilled."
    b "我很怀疑那头穿戴考究的贵气朋友会不会给什么好脸色。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10937
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_5bce3c34:

    # s "You probably should go see to him."
    s "你最好还是去看看他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10941
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_93b3c0ae:

    # b "Is he eating with you today? Not with the gentlemen?"
    b "他今天跟你一块儿吃？没跟那些长官们一起？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10943
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0e60ec1d:

    # n "Yes, I prefer to stay here, rather than go to their cabin in the back."
    n "是啊，我宁愿在这儿待着，也不想去他们后头的船舱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10949
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4c56a5e3:

    # "The hare nods, shooting off to tend to him and prepare Nomax a ration of the crew's breakfast."
    "兔子点点头，一溜烟跑去照顾他，还给Nomax准备了一份早餐的伙食。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10953
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ae91b35e:

    # b "I hope you don't mind the simpler fare. It'll fill you up either way though."
    b "希望你别嫌弃这吃的简单。不过管饱倒是真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10958
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_639dbc7c:

    # n "I will happily take it over expelling what I eat into a bucket."
    n "我可太乐意吃这个了，总比吃进去又吐出来好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10965
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_fa10e83a:

    # "Samuel even slides up against you, patting you on the back gently."
    "Samuel还往你这边蹭了蹭，轻轻拍了拍你的后背。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10977
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b64a615b:

    # s "How're you holding up?"
    s "你还撑得住吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10979
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_7b72496e:

    # p "What do you think?"
    p "你觉得呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10983
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_e5011945:

    # "Samuel looks over to Rajeeyah, catching her eye."
    "Samuel朝Rajeeyah那边看了一眼，眼神交汇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10985
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_aa38b946:

    # s "I get it. But seriously..."
    s "我懂。但说真的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:10987
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_42bc50ed:

    # s "You think this is the first time a landsman has ever fallen asleep on weather watch?"
    s "你以为这是头一回有旱鸭子在值班的时候睡着吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10989
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_55bca26a:

    # s "Or that a ship has been caught in a storm?"
    s "还是说，船遇上风暴是什么新鲜事儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:10991
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8762ca50:

    # p "They're shunning me."
    p "他们都在躲着我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10993
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9fd4201e:

    # p "Now it's not just Arthur but the others as well."
    p "现在不光是Arthur，其他人也一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10995
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3cf436e9:

    # p "Doesn't feel like it'll become any easier to convince him now."
    p "感觉现在更难说服他了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:10999
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_600b242c:

    # "You complain, pointing out the sullen nature of the rest of the crew."
    "你抱怨道，嘟囔着其他船员都拉着个脸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11001
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_29ddf7f2:

    # s "No—they're shattered from having to jump to it and fight the storm all morning just to stay on a safe course."
    s "不是——大家伙一整个大清早都在拼了老命跟狂风暴雨搏斗，只为了保住船身航向，早就累散架了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11003
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_581801d5:

    # s "You hopped back in early, while they had to finish the remaining sails."
    s "你早早就回来了，剩下的帆是他们收的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11005
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ffae3ed3:

    # s "Not saying that you stopping early was wrong, of course, but it means you missed the rough stuff."
    s "我不是说你早点收工不对，但你也错过了最难熬的时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11007
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_35096026:

    # s "Take it from me."
    s "听我的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11009
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3dab151c:

    # s "But also, you can't just keep fucking moaning about Arthur, man."
    s "再说了，兄弟，你总不能一天到晚光他妈抱怨Arthur吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11013
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b6729ce7:

    # "[He] takes your half-empty bowl and begins hoovering up your leftovers."
    "他端起你那半空的碗，开始呼噜呼噜地吃你剩下的饭。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11015
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_1320fb8c:

    # s "As a friend, I'm with you."
    s "朋友立场上，我挺你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11019
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_03006b6c:

    # "[He] sighs."
    "他叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11021
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b68289c3:

    # s "But as a sailor, you stop the bitching and moaning and just get on with it."
    s "但作为水手，你就该闭上抱怨的臭嘴，赶紧干活。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11025
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d0291ae4:

    # s "I told you I'll help by talking with him. So you will have to actually do your part and behave like the sailor you want to be."
    s "我说了我会帮你说和说和。你也得拿出点实际行动，拿出个水手的样子来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11029
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d54af87a:

    # s "So if you want to do that, you actually have to behave the part."
    s "想当水手，就得有个水手的样儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11031
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_7bb7ea87:

    # p "I'm sorry."
    p "我错了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11035
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_c91d9c3b:

    # s "I know."
    s "知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11037
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_971d82e4:

    # "[He] pauses, ears twitching. Reluctantly, [he] pulls [his] bowl back in front of [him] and starts chewing away once again."
    "他顿了顿，耳朵动了动。不情愿地把碗拉回自己面前，又开始嚼了起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11039
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_49e94d3a:

    # "You consider quietly finishing the remaining spoonfuls of breakfast before another shuddering taste of the gruel leaves you wishing for any distraction."
    "你默默地吃着剩下的几勺早饭，但那糟糕的糊糊味儿又让你难受起来，恨不得找点什么乐子分散一下注意力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11051
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b7042c98:

    # b "You know [name], you're not the only one who's ever had some bad days."
    b "我说[name]，谁还没倒霉过几天啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11053
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_930fb494:

    # p "Well, I know that-"
    p "是，我知道……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11057
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_fe5b3575:

    # b "No, stick with me here for a moment."
    b "你听我说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11059
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ba29036a:

    # "The hare taps his foot, frowning while he tries to think back."
    "兔子先生敲着脚，皱着眉头回忆着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11063
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_c1d10d95:

    # b "You know, food's rarely a dangerous thing, but still, I've had some rough days myself."
    b "你知道，食物这玩意儿一般没啥危险，不过话说回来，我也倒霉过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11065
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_1780b17b:

    # b "You don't get as good a cook as I without some."
    b "没点儿经历，哪能成为我这样的好厨子？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11067
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_1bb521ce:

    # s "Please, don't be too humble."
    s "别谦虚啦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11069
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_c4dc42f9:

    # b "But there was that time way back at the cape colony when I was still young and learning."
    b "但那是很久以前在海角殖民地的事了，当时我还年轻，正在学艺。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11073
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d451c3ea:

    # "He looks about and takes a seat on the bench, huddling closer."
    "他环顾了一圈四周，在长凳上坐下，往近处凑了凑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11075
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_efbfb8e4:

    # b "I don't really want the rest of the crew to doubt my skills, but I think this might cheer you up."
    b "我也不想让你们觉得我手艺不行，就想说点啥让你开心开心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11077
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_e1e0b125:

    # "Bandile takes another look at the half-eaten bowls in front of him, but to his relief everyone resists the urge to comment."
    "Bandile 又看了看面前那些吃了一半的碗，还好，大家总算没说啥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11079
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9408e7bf:

    # b "Anyway... there's a lot to learn when it comes to food, and even if you can read, not everything that's written down is entirely helpful."
    b "总之……关于吃的东西要学的东西可多了，就算你识字，书上写的东西也不一定靠谱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11081
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_da9803e0:

    # "Bandile sighs and shakes his head, shoulders shrugging too."
    "Bandile 叹了口气，摇摇头，耸了耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11083
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_879eb61a:

    # b "I was still a novice and had barely mastered a handful of recipes."
    b "我那会儿还是个菜鸟，就会做那么几个菜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11085
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d7eec772:

    # b "If I had mastered any at all..."
    b "就算真会做吧……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11087
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3fcee638:

    # b "The chef at the local station came down with some illness that had him lay flat for a while, so I figured, now was my time to shine!"
    b "当时车站的厨子病了，一下起不来床，我就寻思，这下可轮到我大显身手了！"

# game/script day12.rpy:11089
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_527fd0d4:

    # b "If I could just keep things running, surely I'd get recognized as the budding chef that I knew I was."
    b "要是能把厨房撑起来，肯定能让人觉得我是个前途无量的厨子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11091
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_454ac9a4:

    # b "And hey, I mostly did. Except there was this one dish..."
    b "嘿，大部分时候我都做到了。就是有一道菜……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11093
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3bbca557:

    # "The hare shakes his head again and bites his lip, as if the memory still irks him."
    "兔子先生又摇了摇头，咬着嘴唇，好像现在还觉得丢人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11095
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_78495885:

    # b "They told me they wanted to try something local.{w} You know, they were all caught up in the adventure and instead of wanting something from home in the usual style, they asked me for something hot."
    b "他们说想尝尝当地的玩意儿。{w} 你知道，他们都玩high了，也不想吃家乡菜，非要我做点辣的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11097
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_fdeecca9:

    # b "You see, they were pretty adamant after they saw the rack of spices hanging on the wall, and sometimes, people can't be dissuaded."
    b "你看，他们一看到墙上挂着的一排香料架子就铁了心，而有些时候，钻了牛角尖的人是劝不动的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11105
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ff8bb5a8:

    # s "Oh no..."
    s "完了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11109
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a8b74b90:

    # "Samuel smirks, nudging you with an elbow. Even Rajeeyah lets the ghost of a smile creep across her muzzle."
    "Samuel咧嘴偷笑，用胳膊肘捅了捅你。就连Rajeeyah的嘴角边也泛起了一丝若有若无的笑意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11113
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8b710a38:

    # b "Oh yes. They wanted it! I told them... they said they would settle for nothing less..."
    b "可不是嘛！他们就要吃！我跟他们说……他们说啥都要吃……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11115
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b37e0807:

    # b "It continued like that for at least ten minutes, until I was tired of arguing and figured—fine, if you want to try I've warned you..."
    b "这样至少持续了十分钟，直到我懒得再争，心想——好吧，既然你们想试，我可警告过你们了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11117
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_1ec8979b:

    # "Bandile gives a muted laugh."
    "Bandile 闷笑了几声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11122
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9b322080:

    # b "I used a fraction of the spice, and it still practically blew their heads off. I can still see them, panting frantically, tongues hanging out of their muzzles like they were on fire."
    b "我就放了一点点香料，结果差点没把他们辣死。我现在还记得他们，一个个拼命喘气，舌头都吐出来了，跟着了火似的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11124
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9676c5c7:

    # "Bandile shrugs, ignoring the others as they chortled away."
    "Bandile 耸耸肩，没理会那帮在那偷笑的家伙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11126
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_13268131:

    # b "And that is how I learned that I should never let you lot dictate what I'll be making."
    b "所以我算是明白了，以后做啥，可不能听你们瞎指挥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11128
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d51ddd12:

    # b "It never ends well because, and I say that in the most endearing way possible, you sailors are dumb as rocks sometimes."
    b "事情总没好，我是说真的，你们水手有时候蠢得像块木头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11130
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3427d524:

    # b "The stupid idea of one person just gets amplified by everyone on this thing egging them on."
    b "一个人的蠢主意，在这种破船上，被你们这么一伙人一怂恿，就更来劲了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11142
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8027d243:

    # s "See, rabbit, the reason for that is that it always ends in a laugh."
    s "知道不，兔子，就因为这样最后大家才能乐呵乐呵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11149
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_1d6a83c4:

    # s "Someone will do something stupid and we all get to laugh about it."
    s "总有人会犯傻，然后咱们就能乐呵他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11151
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3639007b:

    # s "That's the reason why you {i}always{/i} egg on stupid decisions like that."
    s "所以说，你们{i}总是{/i}喜欢起哄，怂恿别人做蠢事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11153
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9b9eca0d:

    # s "We don't exactly have much else to do for entertainment, do we?"
    s "不然还能干嘛，也没啥别的乐子，你说是不是？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11165
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ea4c187a:

    # b "What's odd is that's not what irritates me most about the memory."
    b "说起来，那件事儿最让我恼火的倒还不是这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11167
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_19ab7850:

    # p "What is it then?"
    p "那是什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11169
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3145a106:

    # b "I overcooked the meat.{p}I was so focused on sorting out the heat that I forgot about the rest of the meal."
    b "我肉烧过头了。{p}光顾着控制火候了，结果把其他的给忘了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11178
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4f7e4e81:

    # r "A tragedy, but I don't think they'll have noticed."
    r "惨是惨了点，不过我觉得他们应该没察觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11180
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_024641f9:

    # s "Maybe you should try it again sometime here, with a more adventurous crew."
    s "没准你啥时候能再试试，找个胆子大点的船员。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11182
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9f9344e3:

    # b "Maybe! That is, once I can get some more spices..."
    b "没准吧！等我再弄到点香料再说..."

# game/script day12.rpy:11184
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_72fc167b:

    # "You join their chuckles for a moment before turning back to your bowl."
    "你也跟着他们笑了笑，然后又转回头扒拉碗里的饭。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11193
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_7c024d5d:

    # p "I mean... I'm sure the meat not being satisfactory was a great loss for you.{w} But that hardly sounds like it compares to being dismissed from the ship."
    p "我是说... 肉烧得不好，对你来说肯定损失很大吧。{w} 但跟被船上开除比起来，那都不算啥吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11195
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_72832668:

    # p "Do any of you perhaps have more fitting stories about your bad days?"
    p "你们谁还有更惨的故事，拿出来让大伙儿乐呵乐呵？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11197
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d77ed3de:

    # p "I guess, just to not feel quite so alone in it."
    p "哎，就是想找点安慰，别显得我这么孤单。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11206
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8182f56b:

    # "Your eyes settle on the cheetah. She's eating quietly, nibbling at the spoonful before her while looking far off, eyes unfocused on her surroundings."
    "你看着那只猎豹。她安安静静地吃着东西，一小口一小口地抿着勺子里的食物，眼睛却不知道在看哪儿，感觉都没往咱们这边看。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11208
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0cb66f45:

    # "From what you can tell, she's only been half-paying attention to your conversation."
    "听她说话，感觉她就没怎么认真听咱们聊天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11210
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_f615552f:

    # "But you figure that, out of the others, you're most curious to hear what she has to say."
    "不过你寻思着，这几个人里头，你最想听听她能说出点啥来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11212
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_7544ce73:

    # p "Rajeeyah, would you be okay telling me?"
    p "Rajeeyah，你能跟我讲讲吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11216
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_da836700:

    # "Rajeeyah blinks, tail twitching behind her. She runs her eyes up and down you for several moments, considering whether to engage."
    "Rajeeyah眨了眨眼，尾巴在她身后动了动。她上上下下地打量了你一番，琢磨着要不要搭理你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11218
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_fd6eace3:

    # r "I'm a surgeon. Not a sailor."
    r "我是外科医生，不是水手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11222
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3ff6875e:

    # r "Unfortunately, the bad days I'd bring to the table are a lot less..."
    r "遗憾的是，我所经历过的那些艰难日子，可就远没有那么……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11224
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_19d333ea:

    # "You realize your mistake."
    "你意识到自己说错话了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11226
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_09cd9746:

    # p "I'm sorry—you don't have to bring this up."
    p "对不起——你不必提起这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11228
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_565e2427:

    # "Rajeeyah shakes her head, shrugging."
    "Rajeeyah摇摇头，耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11230
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d849cc43:

    # r "I won't, in that case. Besides, I prefer to keep a healthy distance myself."
    r "那我就不说了。再说，我这人喜欢跟人保持距离。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11232
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_c3f9e608:

    # r "Which isn't always easy on a ship like this."
    r "在这种船上，想保持距离可不容易。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11234
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_dba2dedd:

    # "She pauses thoughtfully, taking a moment to watch Samuel finish off the last of her scraps."
    "她若有所思地停顿了一下，看着Samuel把她剩下的饭渣都吃光了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11238
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_1b06e362:

    # r "I'm just glad that no one was hurt this morning."
    r "今儿早上没人受伤，我就谢天谢地了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11242
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_40f8fc89:

    # r "But like Samuel said, you've got to see why he's annoyed at you."
    r "不过就像Samuel说的那样，你得明白他为什么冲你发火。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11244
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0f7a0449:

    # "She nods with a finality that indicates she's finished talking."
    "她点点头，那架势像是在说：“我讲完了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:11246
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_fb03b2d6:

    # "Even though she hadn't gone into details, the subtle sad shift to the scent in the air about her said enough. You take her silence as a small mercy."
    "虽然她没细说，但空气里那一丝淡淡的悲伤已经说明了一切。你觉得她没继续往下说，算是发了点慈悲。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11248
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_cdfdf3d8:

    # "Still, it didn't do much to make you feel any better. You couldn't change what happened, but also."
    "可就算这样，你也没觉得好受点。事情已经发生了，你也改变不了，但是......"

# game/script day12.rpy:11264
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a91a83e3:

    # p "What about you, Samuel?"
    p "你呢，Samuel？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11268
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_f059d4ec:

    # "The maned wolf takes a minute to finish chewing the last bits of their meal, [he] licks [his] lips and takes a long drink from the wooden cup."
    "这匹鬃狼慢悠悠地嚼完剩下的食物，他舔了舔嘴唇，咕咚咕咚地灌了一大口木头杯里的水。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11270
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_7d3111c9:

    # s "Errr, well..."
    s "呃，这个嘛......"

# game/script day12.rpy:11272
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_09cd66a6:

    # "Samuel pauses, scratching [his] head as [he] racks [his] brain for an example."
    "Samuel停顿了一下，挠了挠他的脑袋，拼命地想着例子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11274
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_617d12a6:

    # s "I've been about long enough that there are a few that come to mind."
    s "我出海年头够久了，脑子里随时能蹦出好几桩倒霉事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11276
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_010da5f9:

    # s "But there was this one time I was told a ship came to port to take on some new recruits."
    s "就说有一次，我听说有艘船靠岸，要招募新水手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11280
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8ca694fb:

    # p "Sounds familiar."
    p "听着耳熟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11282
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_266a3547:

    # s "This wasn't the nice volunteering you did. Sometimes, the navy would go and press gang guys into joining."
    s "这可不是你那种自愿报名。有时候啊，海军会直接{a=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Impressment}press gang{/a}（强行拉人入伍）抓人当兵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11284
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0569516c:

    # s "Literally, drag you, howling, kicking, and screaming, onto a ship to work and fight."
    s "真的是，直接把你拖走，让你哭爹喊娘、又踢又闹，硬把你弄到船上去干活卖命。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11286
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bb8ba512:

    # s "So imagine being pulled from your home, made to serve for years on end, and paid less than you are now. Lot more that can go wrong when part of your job is to work the guns or fight."
    s "你想想，被人从家里抓走，一干就是好几年，工钱还不如现在。而且干的活儿不是扛枪就是打仗，出事的概率也高多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11290
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_e5c53a09:

    # "Samuel shudders, the fur on the back of [his] neck bristling."
    "Samuel打了个哆嗦，他脖子后面的毛都竖起来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11292
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_34d5fb7a:

    # b "I've heard even worse things about the food."
    b "我还听说那伙食，更不是人吃的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11296
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_5d5e2390:

    # s "Point is, you've not got it so bad, even if you think you're at your lowest now."
    s "所以说啊，你现在就算觉得倒霉透顶，也没那么糟糕。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11298
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_173c8b73:

    # "Samuel shrugs and folds [his] ears back."
    "Samuel耸了耸肩，把他的耳朵向后拢了拢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11300
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_41dfb130:

    # s "As for myself directly?"
    s "要说我自己的亲身经历？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11304
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d2a735ee:

    # s "Hmmm... which one was pretty bad..."
    s "嗯......哪个比较惨来着......"

# game/script day12.rpy:11308
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ee578fd2:

    # s "I once fell from the rigging. I was being silly and didn't want to be the new sailor that took the lubber's hole."
    s "我记得有一次，我从索具上掉了下来。那时候我傻了吧唧的，不想当第一个走水手洞（在桅杆底部供资历浅的水手使用的通道）的新水手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11310
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_2a5e8a37:

    # s "Did the whole spiel.{w} Being cocky, taking needless risks, all the stuff an {i}actual{/i} old salt wouldn't do."
    s "那些年轻气盛的蠢事我一件不落都干过。{w}狂妄自大、瞎冒不必要的险，全都是{i}真正{/i}的老水手绝不会碰的臭毛病。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11312
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b95af4ae:

    # s "Or at least know enough to realize when they take those risks, and if it is actually a situation where they have to take them."
    s "就算要冒险，也知道什么时候该冒，是不是真的到了非冒不可的时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11314
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ed7a4296:

    # s "Instead of being seen as brave, one of the hands caught me as I fell and told me I was a fucking idiot."
    s "结果呢，没人觉得我勇敢，一个水手一把把我拽住，骂了我一句：“你他娘的就是个白痴！”"

# game/script day12.rpy:11318
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_2d34c5c0:

    # s "Which, yeah.{w} Point taken, Jack."
    s "是，是。{w} 您说得对，Jack。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11320
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_23ea5676:

    # s "Still am, but a brush with death wakes you up to it like nothing else."
    s "现在也是。不过跟死神打了个照面，比啥都管用，一下子就清醒了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11322
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b0493cf8:

    # "[He] laughs."
    "他笑了笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11328
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8b24220d:

    # p "Why didn't you forbid me to go up in that case?"
    p "那你当时怎么不拦着我？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11330
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d07a9c75:

    # s "I thought about it."
    s "我倒是想过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11332
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_afbd097b:

    # s "I guess I just felt like I had to allow you to do your thing if you really wanted to, you know?"
    s "我寻思着，你要是真想干，那就让你去试试呗，是不是？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11334
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_e7419ead:

    # s "Maybe I'll make a better decision next time."
    s "也许我下次能做个更好的决定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11336
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_7a7f8ce7:

    # p "...I'd prefer if today wouldn't be repeated anytime soon."
    p "我真希望今天别再有下次了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11338
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_223419ab:

    # "You nod, accepting it with a bit of humility."
    "你点点头，带着几分谦逊接受了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11344
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_139923f5:

    # p "What about you?"
    p "你呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11348
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_e9c10e08:

    # "You look over to the wild dog, in his smart black and gold clothing, trying to steady himself against one of the beams."
    "你看向那只野狗，他穿着一身考究的黑金制服，正扶着船舱的梁柱，努力稳住身形。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11350
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a749f198:

    # n "What do you mean?"
    n "你这话什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11354
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_718de90b:

    # "He sighs heavily, poking at his food, clearly put off by the unceasing swaying, pitching, and rolling of the ship."
    "他重重地叹了口气，拨弄着盘中的食物，显然被这没完没了的摇晃、颠簸给弄得没了胃口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11356
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4f443a2f:

    # n "Is that not quite obvious?"
    n "这还不够明显吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11358
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_de7b8540:

    # "His tone is unfriendly, more so than usual—perhaps he too had heard from the crew about what had happened, and for a moment you regret asking him at all, but before you can make apologies and forget the whole thing, he continues."
    "他的语气比往常更加冷淡生硬——大概他也从其他水手那里听说了风声。有那么一瞬间你甚至后悔开口问他，但还没等你赔罪打圆场，他已经接着说了下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11362
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b05387dd:

    # n "Well, I hate to say it, but the answer to your question is most certainly the whole trip."
    n "哎，虽然我不想这么说，但要我说，整个航程都是罪魁祸首。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11364
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_1fc0964b:

    # n "No offence to present company intended."
    n "各位别介意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11366
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_e2ce9e30:

    # n "The storm isn't exactly making it any better..."
    n "这鬼天气，更是雪上加霜……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11368
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_67da05b7:

    # "The wild dog sighs, the sound ending with a characteristic squeak from his species."
    "野狗叹了口气，声音末尾带上了他们这个种族特有的吱吱声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11372
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0e89e22e:

    # s "None taken."
    s "不会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11374
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_60d043d6:

    # "Samuel smirks, taking a moment to flash a grin between yourself and Rajeeyah."
    "Samuel 假笑着，飞快地在你和Rajeeyah之间扫了一眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11378
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_c3bc3133:

    # n "To be quite honest, ending up aboard this ship really is the culmination of some unfortunate circumstances. Botany is, well, at least for many of us not the most stable endeavor, and most of my work comes from the apothecary business."
    n "说句老实话，沦落到这艘船上，纯粹是一连串不幸变故促成的结果。植物学研究，呃，至少对我们多数人而言并非什么安稳的营生，我的大部分收入其实来自给药剂铺供货。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11380
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0690dd3d:

    # "He folds his ears back, embarrassed that his situation would be by far better off than most."
    "他不好意思地耷拉下耳朵——毕竟他的情况可比大多数人要好多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11384
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b270a2d7:

    # n "My patron was, well, still is I suppose, a wealthy provider of botanical ingredients for a variety of medicinal salves. I'm sure you might be familiar with some of them, err... Rajeeyah, was it?"
    n "我的赞助人，嗯，我想现在还是吧，是个有钱的主儿，专门为各种药膏提供草药成分。我相信你肯定听说过几种，呃……Rajeeyah，是吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11386
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3e3a022f:

    # "He takes a moment to look over to the cheetah, who nods slowly."
    "他转头看了看那只猎豹，猎豹缓缓地点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11388
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0292b420:

    # r "I have some idea, yes, but I don't think this is quite the company for that topic."
    r "我倒是知道一些，不过这里不太适合聊这个话题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11390
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9f041168:

    # n "That's fair. Anyway, before all this I used to be quite comfortable."
    n "有道理。总之，在那之前，我过得还算舒坦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11394
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_9bb5b491:

    # n "I was paid to cultivate and tend to the more exotic and fickle specimens—working in this beautiful house in the countryside. Peace and quiet, and so many interesting plants."
    n "我受雇培育和照料那些更奇异娇贵的品种——在乡下一栋漂亮的房子里工作。宁静安逸，还有那么多有趣的植物。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11396
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a8907d96:

    # "The wild dog adjusts the neatly balanced glasses on his muzzle, leaning his head in his paws and looking off to somewhere far away. The memory must be pleasant enough that his body relaxed, losing the tension that had kept him like a tense wire."
    "野狗扶了扶鼻子上那副纹丝不动的眼镜，把头枕在爪子上，目光飘向了远方。这段回忆一定很美好，他放松下来，浑身紧绷的神经也松弛了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11398
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_f8d39fb7:

    # n "I was quite happy there, doing my work, learning more, making notes and observations. Then my patron fell on hard times. She sold the house—the one I was residing in—and sent me on this journey."
    n "我原本在那儿过得很知足，做着研究、钻研新知、记录观察手记。后来我的资助人陷入了经济危机。她卖掉了房产——也就是我寄居的那栋宅子——随后打发我踏上了这趟旅程。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11404
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0caadd62:

    # n "I'm here trying to find something remarkable halfway around the world for her, all in the hopes that it'll prove more effective than the new chemicals starting to take hold."
    n "我现在正替她在世界各地寻找奇珍异草，希望能找到比那些开始流行的化学制品更有效的替代品。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11406
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_721160df:

    # r "That's largely because, I'm afraid, they tend to be more effective, and cheaper too."
    r "恐怕很难，毕竟那些玩意儿效果更好，价格也更便宜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11412
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_7678cb31:

    # n "That may very well be... I just wish that it wouldn't lead me on whatever this fool's errand is..."
    n "也许吧……我只是希望这别是一场白跑一趟的蠢差事……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11414
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_28ec491c:

    # n "She is a bit of an odd lady, but I guess she views this as an opportunity for the business."
    n "她是个有点古怪的女士，但我想她把这看作是一个商业机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11416
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8bc7f43a:

    # n "A chance for me to find something... {i}anything{/i} that is not widely known in Europe.{w} Some sort of mystical, exotic plant, I suppose."
    n "一个让我有机会去寻找一些... {i}任何{/i} 在欧洲还不为人所知的东西的机会。{w} 比如说，某种神秘的异域植物吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11418
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bf48138a:

    # n "She always talks about how people there practice and draw from their oneness with nature. I guess it is just an enticing thought for someone in the business of making and selling medicine."
    n "她总是说那里的人如何与自然融为一体，并从中获得力量。我猜对于一个做药材生意的人来说，这说法真是太诱人了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11420
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8d40e5ae:

    # n "Something that cures every ailment known to the world, which, naturally, could only be found on the other side of the globe."
    n "找到一种能治百病的灵药——当然，这种东西只能在世界的另一头才能找到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11422
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a75eb817:

    # n "And, well, I have been given the simple task of finding it."
    n "而我呢，倒霉地接下了寻找它的任务。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11426
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_2085718e:

    # p "Simple..."
    p "简单个鬼..."

# game/script day12.rpy:11430
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_91a1b984:

    # r "So... she's shipping you across the globe to another residence in Cape Town to... save money?"
    r "所以……她把你大老远送到大半个地球外的开普敦庄园去……就是为了省钱？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11432
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_cd7e7410:

    # r "I might have to adjust my own views on her products even further if that is her solution to the problem."
    r "要是她真打算靠这个来解决问题，那我可能还得重新审视一下她的产品了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11436
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_7f5ec988:

    # r "And you just went along with it?"
    r "你就这么答应了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11440
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a561ce9e:

    # n "Well... I owe her for what she provided me with, I guess."
    n "嗯... 我想我总归是欠她一份人情，感谢她为我提供的一切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11442
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_29f993fd:

    # n "So I agreed and said that I would try."
    n "所以我就答应了，说我会尽力试试。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11446
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b133e488:

    # "Nomax dips his head, busying himself from contemplating the personal implications of that future out loud."
    "Nomax 赶紧低下头，不去想这件事会给自己带来什么影响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11448
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8f55a9cd:

    # "You sigh, letting your head rest in your palm."
    "你叹了口气，手一撑，脑袋就靠在了掌心上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11460
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_931401b3:

    # p "Just all that's missing is knowing how I want to do it."
    p "唉，现在就差知道该怎么下手了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11462
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_f05f966e:

    # p "Winning Arthur over, that is."
    p "也就是把Arthur给摆平拿下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11464
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d1962977:

    # r "I think you're thinking about it too much."
    r "我觉得你有点想太多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11466
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ecb16751:

    # r "There's not going to be any one plan that you can execute to fix it all. It's not how you get into people's good graces."
    r "哪有什么一劳永逸的计划，能让你一下子就搞定一切。 想要别人对你好，可不是这么来的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11468
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a3ddfe5a:

    # p "Well, but I have to do {i}something{/i}, time isn't exactly on my side."
    p "哎，可我总得做{i}点什么{/i}吧，时间不等人啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11482
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_aee6bf40:

    # p "Come to think of it, Sam. Perce mentioned something to me."
    p "说起来，Sam。Perce跟我嘀咕过一些事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11484
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8d47fe3b:

    # "Samuel doesn't finish chewing before [he] speaks up, rubbing out some stiff spot on [his] neck."
    "Samuel嘴里的东西还没嚼完就嘟囔起来，一边说，一边揉着他僵硬的脖子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11486
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_036f6dc5:

    # s "Blackborow?"
    s "Blackborow？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11488
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11490
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_516dc565:

    # s "What did he tell you?"
    s "他跟你说什么了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11492
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_94a22528:

    # p "Well, essentially that it might be worth a shot to try and pay him off.{w} Arthur that is."
    p "呃，大致就是说，或许可以试试给他点好处。{w} 就Arthur那家伙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11496
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3b9189cc:

    # s "I guess you could try that.{w} You wouldn't be the first one."
    s "我觉得你可以试试。{w} 反正你也不是第一个这么想的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11498
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_82cccead:

    # s "Can't say that I'm necessarily in favor of it, it feels... I don't know, icky, I guess. When the reason you are tolerated is for whatever presents you bring, you know?"
    s "不过我个人不太赞成，总觉得……有点膈应，你知道吗？ 如果别人容忍你，只是因为你能带来好处，那算什么事儿啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11500
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_73a44b92:

    # s "But that's just me. Some grease helps make the wheels spin, even on a ship.{w} Especially on a ship."
    s "当然，这只是我的看法。 有时候，加点油能让轮子转得更顺畅，就算是在船上也是一样。{w} 尤其是在船上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11502
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_2f3a2047:

    # s "And many a conflict has been solved over a bottle, something to smoke, good food or whatever it may be."
    s "很多冲突都是在酒桌上、烟雾缭绕中、或者吃吃喝喝的时候解决的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11506
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ee8c8eb1:

    # s "Though, you're a farmer's boy, are you not? What are you going to bring him?"
    s "不过，你是个庄稼地里出来的农家小子，不是么？你打算拿什么东西去打动他？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11508
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_96743b23:

    # p "Perce mentioned alcohol."
    p "Perce提到了酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11512
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_5211d38a:

    # s "Of course... Did he also offer you a deal on some?"
    s "呵……他是不是还想顺便卖你点啥？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11514
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d14de3d7:

    # p "Kind of, yeah."
    p "差不多吧，算是吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11516
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_66cae9eb:

    # s "Convenient..."
    s "真是方便啊……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11518
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_5911e8e3:

    # p "You don't sound like the closest of friends?"
    p "听你这口气，你们关系不怎么样嘛？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11520
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_a7a01376:

    # s "He's a bit of an ass."
    s "他那人有点混球。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11522
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_907decda:

    # s "I won't tell you no, I'm not your mother after all, I'm just saying that he's a bit of an ass."
    s "我不会拦着你，我又不是你老妈。 我只是说，他那人确实有点混球。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11526
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_67e95cee:

    # "For a moment you just sit there. Allowing your thoughts to stew."
    "你就那么坐着，让脑子里的想法乱成一锅粥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11528
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bd7f2a06:

    # "You console yourself by running your claws through your fur, stretching the back of your neck as you try to figure out what you want to do."
    "你烦躁地挠着毛，算是安慰自己，伸着脖子，琢磨着到底该怎么办才好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11530
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_d764858a:

    # n "Friends or not. If it will help you solve this issue, then why not?"
    n "管他是不是朋友呢。 要是能解决问题，试试又何妨？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11534
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_594cb50d:

    # n "It is just a present after all to smooth out a misunderstanding. Unfortunately I did not bring anything present worthy of my own, otherwise I would have let you borrow it if that is all it takes."
    n "归根结底，这只是为了化解误会送的礼物罢了。 可惜我没带什么能拿得出手的礼物，不然就借给你了，如果送礼就能搞定的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11538
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_602dcdca:

    # "Would hard work really be enough?"
    "光靠卖力干活，真的行得通吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11540
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_baab0cd1:

    # "So far, all evidence appears to be to the contrary."
    "迄今为止，所有的迹象似乎都在指向截然相反的方向。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11542
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bf01e426:

    # "You claw through your mind, trying to find that right answer as if it would manifest itself if you just think about it that little bit harder."
    "你在脑子里拼命搜索，想找到那个正确的答案，好像只要再努力想想，它就会自己冒出来一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11544
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_54f588cc:

    # "Maybe it's not the worst idea to stack things in your favor."
    "也许让形势对你有利并不是最坏的主意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11546
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_2d87d9fc:

    # "Perhaps even turning the tables, turning the screws on Arthur, somehow? Even if it felt underhanded..."
    "说不定还能给Arthur点颜色看看，给他来个下马威？就算这么做有点不光彩……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11548
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0db29cb4:

    # "But the more you think about it, the more it begins to look like the only chance you have."
    "但你越是反复琢磨，这越显得像是你眼前唯一仅剩的生路。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11550
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8dbf84fa:

    # "Yes, why not make use of it?"
    "是啊，为什么不呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11552
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bae67eb3:

    # "Screw his rules."
    "管他的规则。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11554
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_51bce8c8:

    # "If he isn't playing by them, then why should you try to be honest?"
    "他都不守规矩，我干嘛要老老实实的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11556
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_256858f7:

    # "You'll have to talk to Perce again."
    "你还得再找珀西聊聊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11564
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_602dcdca_1:

    # "Would hard work really be enough?"
    "光靠卖力干活，真的行得通吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11566
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_6c76dc4a:

    # "Would... it be sensible to leave it just to chance?"
    "把一切都交给命运……这靠谱吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11568
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_3ea711d1:

    # "To just hope a chance for redemption presents itself?"
    "难不成光坐着干等老天爷施舍一次戴罪立功的良机？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11570
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_bf01e426_1:

    # "You claw through your mind, trying to find that right answer as if it would manifest itself if you just think about it that little bit harder."
    "你在脑子里拼命搜索，想找到那个正确的答案，好像只要再努力想想，它就会自己冒出来一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11572
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_54f588cc_1:

    # "Maybe it's not the worst idea to stack things in your favor."
    "多给自己增加些筹码，或许并不算个坏主意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11574
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_2d87d9fc_1:

    # "Perhaps even turning the tables, turning the screws on Arthur, somehow? Even if it felt underhanded..."
    "说不定还能给Arthur点颜色看看，给他来个下马威？就算这么做有点不光彩……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11576
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_867ffa8e:

    # "Either way, you assume that the sooner you do it, the better."
    "总之，你觉得越快动手越好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11591
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_8d47fe3b_1:

    # "Samuel doesn't finish chewing before [he] speaks up, rubbing out some stiff spot on [his] neck."
    "Samuel嘴里的东西还没嚼完就嘟囔起来，一边说，一边揉着他僵硬的脖子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11595
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_ded722ad:

    # s "[name], you're on a ship. One in a storm no less."
    s "[name]，你现在可是在一条船上，还是在暴风雨里！"

# game/script day12.rpy:11597
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_0b224add:

    # s "You {i}will{/i} have an opportunity to convince him."
    s "你{i}一定{/i}有机会说服他的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11599
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_318ee795:

    # s "Pay attention to what he needs done perhaps, or go the extra mile to help others."
    s "留心他需要做什么，或者主动帮别人一把。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11601
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_43756ecb:

    # s "Whatever it may be, I don't think it's a case where you need to show him through some planned theater act. Simply keeping your eyes and ears open will provide what you need."
    s "我看你也不用刻意演戏，只要多留心观察，就能找到机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11612
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b32d7bbb:

    # "There's a muted nod of agreement among the rest of the group as they finish up their food and before long they excuse themselves."
    "其他人默默点头表示赞同，他们吃完了盘中物，没过多久便各自告辞离席。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11615
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_834cddba:

    # "There's a muted nod of agreement among the rest of the group as they finish up their food and before long both Bandile and Rajeeyah excuse themselves."
    "同桌的人默默点头赞同，吃完手头的饭食后，班迪尔和Rajeeyah很快便先行告辞离开了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11617
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_74ef94b7:

    # "You take it as less of a personal slight than before, knowing that there was still plenty of extra of work to do thanks to you."
    "你倒没觉得像之前那么难受了，毕竟是因为你，他们才不得不加班。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11619
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_089fb92e:

    # "You're left alone with Samuel, who, in the absence of everyone else, seems more visibly tired than [he] was letting on earlier. It's kind of impressive, what the maned wolf seems to be able to sweep underneath their fur."
    "你独自同Samuel留了下来。在旁人散去后，[he]眉宇间的疲惫比方才表现出来的要浓重得多。鬃狼能将多少心事严严实实掩藏在毛发之下，真叫人不得不叹服。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11621
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_c01280b2:

    # p "Sam?"
    p "Sam？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11623
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_dc1cd401:

    # s "Hm?"
    s "嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11625
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_92dc9593:

    # p "Thanks."
    p "谢谢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11627
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_b26613e7:

    # "You pause, trying to find the words. In the end you opt to leave it at that."
    "你顿了顿，斟酌着恰当的字句。但最终你还是决定适可而止，不再深究。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11629
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_4027310c:

    # p "And I am sorry."
    p "我很抱歉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11631
translate Chinese day12_decidestay_eb3bf8de:

    # s "Yeah. I know."
    s "嗯，我知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11662
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6f37d10c:

    # "Starting your efforts small, you follow Samuel at the end of the forenoon watch to inspect the deck for any damage or repairs that might need attention."
    "你决定先从简单的做起，上午值班结束后，你跟着Samuel去检查甲板，看看有没有什么地方需要维修。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11664
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_09bc6e82:

    # "The deck appears deserted, with only those who need to be outside for work braving the rain, along with a few people taking the opportunity to wash their clothes, while others seek refuge in the relative dryness below deck."
    "甲板上空荡荡的，只有一些必须在外面工作的人冒着雨，还有些人抓紧时间洗衣服，其他人则躲在甲板下面避雨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11676
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2950dc3c:

    # p "Can't we wait until the weather calms down a bit?"
    p "咱们就不能等雨小点再说？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11678
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_25f6623a:

    # "You ask, raising your paw to shield your eyes from the relentless downpour."
    "你抬起爪子挡雨，抱怨道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11682
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f174d7ab:

    # "Samuel smirks at you, raindrops clinging to [his] dark hair, which at this point runs in wet streaks across [his] head."
    "Samuel坏笑着看着你，雨水顺着他湿漉漉的黑发往下流。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11684
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_56b5840d:

    # s "We could. But you're the one who asked me for a suggestion on how to make a good impression."
    s "咱们当然可以等。可你不是问我怎么才能给人留下好印象吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11686
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_00646206:

    # p "I was hoping for something less...{w} wet."
    p "我是想找点不那么……{w}湿的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11690
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_681e06a2:

    # s "Stop being such a cat."
    s "你少来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11692
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1716f355:

    # s "Or do you see him complaining?"
    s "你看他抱怨了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11696
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b6177e9d:

    # "[He] nods to Wolf, who is standing nearby, seemingly unaffected by the rain pouring down on him."
    "Samuel朝着站在附近的Wolf点点头，Wolf好像一点也没被这瓢泼大雨影响到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11700
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f18d1dfd:

    # s "Besides, the storm is already getting weaker."
    s "而且，暴风雨已经在减弱了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11702
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_933a8071:

    # "You look up into the clouds, but it appears the same to you. It's still a downpour with a distant rumble of thunder somewhere up there in the thick of it."
    "你抬头望向天空，但在你看来没什么变化。依旧是倾盆大雨，远处雷声滚滚，就在那厚厚的云层深处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11704
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2262bfbc:

    # p "That doesn't count. He just never talks."
    p "那不算数。他只是从不说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11706
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ea1f6875:

    # w "I've been through worse."
    w "我经历过更糟的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11708
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8cca348f:

    # p "That doesn't count either. We simply just witnessed a miracle."
    p "这也算不上什么。我们这不刚见证了个奇迹嘛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11714
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_27384cb6:

    # "Wolf narrows his eyes and returns nothing but a snarl."
    "Wolf眯起眼睛，龇牙咧嘴地低吼了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11718
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a8a5339d:

    # "Wolf just rolls his eyes at you and brushes a wet strand of fur from his eyes."
    "Wolf只是对你翻了个白眼，然后拂去眼角一绺湿漉漉的毛发。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11720
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_64cda354:

    # s "It's just water, or are you afraid of dissolving?"
    s "只是水而已，还是说你怕被水溶解了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11722
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a0251424:

    # p "No, only of being thrown overboard."
    p "不，只是怕被扔到船外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11731
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bd256f6f:

    # "You run your paw down the length of the line, looking and feeling for any wear it might have sustained."
    "你用爪子沿着绳索的长度滑动，寻找并感受可能存在的磨损。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11733
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_18709a7c:

    # p "This line seems tight, can't see any fraying."
    p "这条绳子看起来很紧，看不出有任何磨损。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11735
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d514d3e4:

    # s "Being thrown overboard by the ship or by him?"
    s "被船扔下去还是被他扔下去？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11737
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ea19008d:

    # p "Both?"
    p "都有可能？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11739
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f70b0c53:

    # w "This one looks good, too."
    w "这条看起来也不错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11741
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8da1aed8:

    # s "I'll catch you by the tail if that happens."
    s "如果真发生那种事，我会抓住你的尾巴的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11743
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a7495626:

    # s "[name], can you crawl under and see if the boat has slipped from its anchor points?"
    s "[name]，你能爬到下面看看船是不是从锚点上松脱了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11747
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_19ed76ee:

    # "You comply and slide beneath the jolly boat. Immediately you're surrounded by the echoing drum of raindrops beating on the wooden hull above you."
    "你照做了，滑到小艇下面。立刻，豆大的雨点敲打着上方的木制船体，回声阵阵，将你包围。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11749
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_864c26f3:

    # "Everything appears secure; you give it a quick tug to be sure, before emerging back into the open. Their voices, momentarily hollow-sounding, regain their clarity."
    "一切似乎都很牢固；为了确保安全，你快速拉了一下，这才回到外面。他们的声音，刚才听起来有些空洞，现在又恢复了清晰。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11751
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_305d57d2:

    # s "And?"
    s "然后呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11753
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_82c91e50:

    # "Samuel's voice cuts through the steady patter of rain, [his] eyes following you as you emerge from under the boat."
    "Samuel的声音穿透了持续不断的雨声，他的目光随着你从船下出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11755
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b3af8dfb:

    # p "Looks perfect. Didn't budge an inch."
    p "看起来完美。一寸都没动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11757
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c5e9ad2e:

    # s "Sweet, so the jolly boat didn't get knocked loose. Let's check the other one."
    s "很好，看来这艘小艇没被撞松。我们去检查另一艘吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11764
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4fa54756:

    # "The three of you loop around to the other side of the ship to inspect the other boat."
    "你们三个人绕到船的另一侧去检查另一艘船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11776
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9acb9f32:

    # "The lines are all in place, no signs of wear visible to you as you run your paw along them."
    "绳索都完好无损，你用爪子沿着绳索滑动，没发现任何磨损。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11780
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ccd417cc:

    # "Just as on the other side, you slip underneath the boat to see if it is firmly sitting in its anchor points."
    "就像刚才一样，你滑到船下，看看它是否牢固地固定在锚点上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11782
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_da5574bc:

    # "But before you can inspect it further, Samuel's hand lands on your shoulder to interrupt you."
    "但你还没来得及进一步检查，Samuel的手就搭在了你的肩膀上，打断了你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11784
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_709b2be5:

    # "[He] has joined you underneath the boat and gently pushes you aside."
    "他跟着你钻到了船底下，轻轻地把你推到一边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11786
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2806f5fe:

    # s "Actually, let me check. This one broke a while ago, so we tied it to this pin back here."
    s "实际上，还是让我来检查一下吧。这条绳子前段时间断了，所以我们把它绑在了后面的这个销子上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11788
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1c004c61:

    # s "Wolf, can you come down here? Then I won't have to explain it twice."
    s "Wolf，你下来一下行吗？这样我就不用解释两遍了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11792
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e69a1e59:

    # "Wolf readily ducks under the boat to be able to watch Samuel's instructions."
    "Wolf很配合地钻到船下，等着听Samuel的指示。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11794
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6fbc7162:

    # "Samuel reaches to the back of the boat, [his] fingers probing blindly. [He] guides your hand there when [he]'s found it—a thick bundle of rope securing the boat to one of the pins."
    "Samuel伸手到小艇后部，手指摸索着。当他找到后——那是一捆将小艇固定在一个系索栓上的粗绳——他引导你的手过去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11796
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_61485e52:

    # w "What's broken about it?"
    w "哪里坏了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11798
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e74fa408:

    # s "The pin here that they're tied to is broken."
    s "固定绳子的这个船栓断了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11802
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_dd445529:

    # s "It snapped a few months ago.{w} Low priority, I suppose. Konrad hasn't gotten to it yet. Mentioned he'd have to replace the whole thing."
    s "几个月前就断了，{w} 看来优先级不高。Konrad还没来得及修。他说过得整个换掉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11804
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_10082d26:

    # s "Anyway, you always want to check the ropes back here and feel if they're still tight."
    s "总之，要记得经常检查船尾的绳子，摸摸它们是否还紧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11806
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3f398d32:

    # "After [he] shows you, [he] also guides Wolf's paw to the back of the boat to ensure you both are aware of it for future inspections."
    "他向你示范后，还引导Wolf的爪子到船尾，确保你俩都知道以后该怎么检查。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11808
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c237907a:

    # s "Looks like it's all in order, though. Nothing wrong with the lines you checked either?"
    s "不过，看起来一切都正常。你检查的绳子也没问题吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11810
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5a100d7c:

    # p "Everything looks fine."
    p "一切都很好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11812
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ae2c6513:

    # w "This one looks like it's starting to fray a little, but I assume it's not a problem yet. You'd better check it yourself, just in case, Sam."
    w "这根绳子看起来有点磨损了，不过我估计现在还没事。你最好自己也检查一下，以防万一，Sam。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11816
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1728c33b:

    # "You emerge from the boat, dropping to your knees to crawl out from underneath it, only to have a stray wave throw you off balance for a moment."
    "你从船底下爬出来，刚想站起身，一个不留神，被涌来的浪花打了个趔趄。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11818
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9dd4ec62:

    # "Slowly rising back to your paws, you find Samuel and Wolf busy checking the other line."
    "慢慢地用四肢撑起来，你发现Samuel和Wolf正在忙着检查另一根绳子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11820
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7ef005ba:

    # p "If only we could do the whole inspection under one of these."
    p "要是每次检查都能在这种地方进行就好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11822
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d5187a0e:

    # "You mutter, glancing back at the upturned boat."
    "你嘟囔着，回头看了一眼翻过来的船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11832
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b331262e:

    # w "They're not the worst spot out here, eh?"
    w "这儿可不算是个糟糕的地方，是吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11834
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5ebfe729:

    # w "Think I might sit out here in weather like this once in a while."
    w "我想我以后没事也该在这种天气里在这儿待一会儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11836
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a8c7b6fb:

    # w "When the deck below is as cramped as it is now."
    w "特别是当下面的甲板像现在这么拥挤的时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11844
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_30d50b94:

    # s "It's certainly drier than out here."
    s "肯定比外面干燥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11846
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_106047c9:

    # s "But only until the next wave sends a load of spray across the deck."
    s "但也只是在下一道浪把水花打到甲板上之前。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11848
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3e4de560:

    # w "Still better than getting drenched from the rain {i}and{/i} the spray."
    w "总比淋雨{i}又{/i}被浪花打湿要好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11850
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_17dc93e7:

    # s "Very true. Not uncommon to have people sitting under them when it's raining. Makes for a nice spot when you're out on watch."
    s "确实。下雨的时候，经常有人坐在下面。值班的时候，这可是个好地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11856
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_30d50b94_1:

    # s "It's certainly drier than out here."
    s "肯定比外面干燥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11858
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_106047c9_1:

    # s "But only until the next wave sends a load of spray across the deck."
    s "但也只是在下一道浪把水花打到甲板上之前。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11862
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_65345026:

    # p "Still better than getting drenched from the rain {i}and{/i} the spray."
    p "总比淋雨{i}又{/i}被浪花打湿要好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11864
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_27e6649b:

    # w "A bit too huddled up for my taste."
    w "对我来说，有点太挤了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11866
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_35195fe7:

    # "He squints at the upturned boat, water dripping from his snout."
    "他眯起眼睛看着翻过来的船，水从他的鼻子上滴下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11868
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_34fa2171:

    # p "What? I would have thought it would be perfect for you."
    p "怎么？我还以为这里对你来说是完美之选呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11870
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1fd1e742:

    # w "It might, but with you two underneath? Then it becomes a harder sell."
    w "也许吧，但如果你们俩也在下面？那我就不太想待了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11874
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_78c90276:

    # s "Maybe in the future they'll build ships with their whole deck covered.{w} Wouldn't that be a luxury?"
    s "也许未来他们会建造整个甲板都覆盖起来的船，{w} 那该有多奢侈啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11878
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fa4d7e40:

    # s "Never again the smell of wet fur, blergh."
    s "再也不用闻湿毛的味道了，呸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11880
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5a2e88a7:

    # "Crossing [his] arms on the jolly boat, Samuel grimaces at the countless memories that come flooding back of the lower deck crammed with soggy crew members."
    "Samuel在小艇上抱起双臂，皱着眉头，无数关于下层甲板挤满湿漉漉的船员的记忆涌上心头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11882
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a705e9ee:

    # w "I've had worse."
    w "我经历过更糟糕的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11886
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e9c2fd03:

    # s "What? No, you haven't."
    s "什么？不可能吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11888
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5756fa72:

    # s "Not worse than what this place is going to smell like in about another hour or two, once it permeates everything."
    s "不会比一两个小时后这里散发出的味道更糟，一旦那种味道渗透到所有东西里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11896
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c8586d04:

    # w "I stand by what I said."
    w "我还是那句话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11898
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_98c0e84b:

    # s "And you will tell us about it?"
    s "你打算跟我们说说吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11900
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_096e61d9:

    # w "Absolutely not."
    w "绝对不要。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11904
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_48ba6318:

    # p "You can't just bring it up and not expect us to be curious."
    p "你不能光提起这事儿，不让我们好奇啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11906
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_41c255a2:

    # w "You can be curious all you want, but these lips will remain sealed."
    w "你们随便好奇，但我可什么都不会说的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11910
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6d8924c9:

    # "Samuel lets [his] arms slide off the boat, fingers deftly untying and retying a knot around a belaying pin that must have looked too hastily made."
    "Samuel把胳膊从船舷上放了下去，手指飞快地解开又系紧了系缆柱上的一个结，那结看起来肯定系得很随便。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11914
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d58c5a20:

    # s "You do know we'll just make up our own story if you don't tell us yours?"
    s "你要是不说，我们可就自己编故事了啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11916
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f3d113f2:

    # "The maned wolf earns a long exhale in response."
    "只见Wolf长长地叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11918
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b4d4b3ee:

    # w "It was nothing. Just some work in the stables."
    w "没什么，就是在马厩里干了点活。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11920
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_60dbeefc:

    # w "The animals can reek in there."
    w "那地方的牲口味儿可大了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11928
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_19354755:

    # s "That doesn't sound very convincing..."
    s "这话听着不太可信啊……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11930
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ce887544:

    # s "Who would call working the stables a story, let alone try to keep it quiet?"
    s "谁会把在马厩干活儿当故事讲，还藏着掖着的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11932
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_93b63974:

    # p "He would."
    p "他会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11934
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d38fd262:

    # s "It probably was something like..."
    s "估计是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:11937
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_20295d11:

    # s "{cps=5000}It probably was something like...{/cps}" nointeract
    s "{cps=5000}估计是……{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:11944
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0f1e1583:

    # p "I think he's telling the truth and there's nothing more to it, Sam."
    p "我觉得他说的就是实话，没什么别的，Sam。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11946
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_aa6b683c:

    # "You brush off Samuel's prodding."
    "你没搭理Samuel的追问。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11952
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7cf17e2d:

    # p "If he said it was just some stable work, then it was just that—mucking out stalls and tending to the horses."
    p "如果他说只是些马厩工作，那就只是那样——清理马厩和照料马匹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11954
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0e0dcd75:

    # p "No need to question it."
    p "没必要刨根问底。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11956
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_dd2e906d:

    # w "I appreciate it."
    w "多谢了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11958
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_43697cfb:

    # s "Stable work it was then."
    s "那就当是马厩的活儿吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11962
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_01772c6d:

    # s "Might come in handy, Wolf. I assume we'll be picking up some animals in Morocco."
    s "没准有用呢，Wolf。我猜咱们会在摩洛哥弄到一些牲口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11964
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6272a12e:

    # s "It's unusual that we don't have any around. The gentlemen enjoy their fresh eggs, milk and meat after all."
    s "咱们船上没带牲口，这可不常见。毕竟，先生们也喜欢新鲜鸡蛋、牛奶和肉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11966
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e1ab40ea:

    # s "So some of us might be shoveling shit soon enough."
    s "这么说，咱们迟早也得去铲屎了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11968
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b8ff1806:

    # p "Doesn't sound like we'll be getting much of it?"
    p "听起来咱们也捞不着多少活儿干？"

# game/script day12.rpy:11972
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e4dfa82d:

    # s "Not regularly, no.{w} Certainly not as a landsman."
    s "肯定不会经常干，啊。{w}当然，肯定轮不着旱鸭子去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11981
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d9b97c75:

    # p "Stumbling face first into a pile of shit."
    p "一头扎进屎堆里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11987
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e76cd27d:

    # "Instead of a laugh, you get a look of sheer disgust from Samuel, and a snarl coming from Wolf."
    "Samuel听了，一脸嫌弃，Wolf也低声咆哮了起来，你可没逗乐他们。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11989
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_95f7bbd1:

    # "You flinch, thinking that you may have overstepped things a bit instead of earning the desired amused reaction."
    "你缩了缩脖子，觉得自己可能玩笑开大了，没得到想看到的反应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11991
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_696cf517:

    # s "Ugh, gross. I don't even want to imagine it."
    s "呃，真恶心。我都不敢想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11995
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_93b7cddc:

    # s "Just thinking about it, I'm already feeling sorry for Wolf—if that's {i}actually{/i} what happened."
    s "光是想想，我就已经开始为Wolf感到难过了——如果那{i}真的{/i}发生了的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:11999
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6f3ade6c:

    # w "It did not happen."
    w "没发生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12001
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_76dea152:

    # w "And you're one to talk. Aren't you the one who fell over with his pants around his ankles to fetch some dice."
    w "你也好意思说别人？你不就是那个为了捡个骰子，裤子都掉到脚脖子了，还摔了个狗啃泥的家伙吗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12005
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_722ed750:

    # s "What?"
    s "啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12007
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_230c369a:

    # "Samuel asks with a laugh."
    "Samuel笑着问道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12009
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9093f0e8:

    # p "It was nothing."
    p "小事一桩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12011
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_700d7793:

    # p "Lost a bet."
    p "输了个彩头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12013
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_24f2548f:

    # s "With who?"
    s "跟谁啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12015
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2ca7234a:

    # p "Three guesses."
    p "给你三次机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12017
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ed818d85:

    # s "Julian, wasn't it?"
    s "Julian，是吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12019
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fd109c8e:

    # p "You didn't even stop to think about it."
    p "你小子想都不想就说了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12023
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_090d80aa:

    # "[He] erupts into another fit of laughter."
    "Samuel又开始捧腹大笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12027
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_87f8cb80:

    # s "So you had the pleasure of seeing his ass, Wolf?"
    s "这么说，你小子有眼福，看见他屁股了？Wolf。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12029
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_84de92a1:

    # s "Man, the things I missed because of that stupid injury."
    s "哎，我跟你说，就因为那破伤，我错过了多少好戏啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12035
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_32edea15:

    # "He doesn't respond and just narrows his eyes."
    "他没搭腔，只是眯缝着眼睛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12037
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2bcc9db5:

    # s "How does he look?"
    s "他看起来怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12039
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_61ceeeda:

    # w "Alright."
    w "还行吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12041
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_822a11eb:

    # s "Alright?! Did you hear that, [name]?"
    s "还行？！你俩听见没，[name]？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12043
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_944ca197:

    # s "Coming from him that's like, the highest praise imaginable."
    s "这话从他嘴里说出来，那可真是天大的夸奖了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12047
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cd9cd75b:

    # w "Unfortunately."
    w "可不是么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12049
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7256cf36:

    # p "Sam, is this your attempt at flirting?"
    p "Sam，你这是想泡他是吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12053
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3c9f3228:

    # s "What? No! I'm just trying to get a picture of the scene."
    s "哪有！我就是想还原一下当时的场景。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12055
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0ff836b6:

    # p "You seem to be focusing very much on one particular aspect though rather than the whole scene."
    p "你小子好像特别关注某个细节啊，都没看全景。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12057
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5c95d45c:

    # s "Because it's a very important part of the scene."
    s "因为那个细节很重要啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12059
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_53b13a51:

    # "[He] returns with [his] tongue sticking out from between [his] lips."
    "[He]回来时，舌尖俏皮地抵在嘴唇之间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12064
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_de85eed3:

    # s "It's not the hardest riddle. It sounds exactly like the payment for a lost bet that he'd come up with."
    s "这可不难猜。一听就是他能想出来的，输了打赌的代价。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12068
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_34a1677a:

    # s "Anyways, that's not what I was thinking."
    s "算了，我说的不是这个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12072
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a3bd8f1a:

    # s "No, I was thinking of something with a bit more flair, you know.{w} Something that suits him."
    s "我说的是那种更有范儿的，你知道吧。得配得上他的气质。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12074
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_42c3de85:

    # s "Maybe..."
    s "也许吧……"

# game/script day12.rpy:12078
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_17d437a1:

    # "Samuel leans toward you with conspiratorial glee."
    "Samuel一脸坏笑，凑到你跟前。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12080
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_dd51ffac:

    # s "Maybe he's a royal assassin."
    s "说不定他是位皇家刺客呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12082
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a89f88e4:

    # s "Picture this: Him wading through thick, murky swamps, the water up to his shoulders."
    s "你想想那个画面：他趟过又脏又臭的沼泽，水都淹到肩膀了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12086
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a7872976:

    # s "He has to dive below the surface to avoid the light coming from the torches of the patrols. And then, just as he's nearing the castle wall, he emerges, dripping and determined."
    s "为了躲开巡逻队火把的光，他还得潜到水底下。然后，就在快摸到城堡墙根的时候，他猛地冒出头来，浑身滴着水，眼神里透着坚定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12088
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a847d0c1:

    # s "Now that's more like it! Don't you think?"
    s "这才够味儿！你不觉得吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12090
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4ab59082:

    # s "Just imagine him, cloak billowing dramatically, moonlight glinting off his blade. The castle guards none the wiser."
    s "想象一下他，斗篷招摇地飞舞，月光在他刀刃上闪烁，城堡守卫们还一无所知。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12092
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_86e5bb18:

    # s "Disappearing into the night like a shadow."
    s "如同影子般消失在夜色中。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12096
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fe990cf3:

    # p "Of course, that would have been my next suggestion."
    p "当然，这正是我接下来要说的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12098
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_85a058f2:

    # w "Of course..."
    w "当然……"

# game/script day12.rpy:12102
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b50939a5:

    # p "Is that what the book Arthur gave you when you were injured was about? Or how did that story come to mind?"
    p "Arthur在你受伤时给你的书里就是写的这些？或者，你这故事是哪儿来的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12104
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1ff9a204:

    # s "I can be rather creative at times, [name]."
    s "我有时候也挺有创造力的，[name]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12108
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_209e7a11:

    # s "Stories of intrigue, thrilling adventures, you name it."
    s "阴谋诡计，惊险冒险，要什么有什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12110
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0394480d:

    # s "Who knows, maybe I'll be the one to write the next Robinson Crusoe."
    s "没准儿下一个《鲁滨逊漂流记》就出自我的笔下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12118
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_afe22c2c:

    # "Wolf gives his line a testing tug, to see if it'll slacken."
    "Wolf试探性地拽了拽钓线，看看会不会松。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12120
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2f7ca387:

    # w "Fortunately, it is neither."
    w "幸运的是，两者都不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12126
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f666de0c:

    # w "The truth is much less exciting. But if you two want to continue fantasizing, be my guests and don't let me or our work get in the way."
    w "真相可没这么刺激。不过，如果你们想继续幻想，请便，别耽误我和你们干活就行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12128
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_54751781:

    # w "I didn't want to take a break anyway..."
    w "反正我本来也没打算歇着……"

# game/script day12.rpy:12130
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c76c668c:

    # p "Come on, we all need a little humor to lighten the mood."
    p "拜托，咱们都得找点乐子，缓和缓和气氛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12132
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_90d06cbc:

    # w "Can't say I'm a fan of your jokes."
    w "你的笑话，我可欣赏不来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12134
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_12dc0e5d:

    # "He replies, completely deadpan."
    "他面无表情地回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12136
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ef0447e0:

    # "You sigh and turn back to your own line to continue your inspection."
    "你叹了口气，转过身去，继续检查自己的钓线。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12143
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9a315a33:

    # p "Maybe he is a royal spy and had to crawl through the castle's fetid sewers to reach his target."
    p "没准儿他是个皇家间谍，为了接近目标，不得不爬过城堡里那臭气熏天的下水道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12147
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_004e34b8:

    # p "Scaling the castle walls under the moon's watchful eye. Not above getting his paws dirty to make his king proud."
    p "在月亮 watchful 的注视下，攀爬城堡高墙。为了让国王骄傲，不惜弄脏他的爪子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12149
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0dc34b50:

    # p "He emerges, sword drawn from its scabbard. Whispering \"For King and Country,\" in his target's ear as he sinks the weapon into their chest, before disappearing without a trace into the blackness of the night."
    p "他拔剑出鞘悄然现身，在把利刃刺入目标胸膛时，贴在对方耳边低语一句‘为了国王与祖国’，随即消失在漆黑的夜色中无影无踪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12151
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3c991b3e:

    # "You really get caught up in the fantasy and imitate a few swings with a sword, a stab, a slice, and a skillful dodge."
    "你完全沉浸在幻想里，还模仿了几下挥剑、刺、砍和巧妙躲闪的动作。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12153
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3c694209:

    # "Or rather, what you assume skillful swordplay to look like."
    "或者说，是你自以为是的熟练剑术。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12155
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_af4ea5fc:

    # s "Oh, that's a good one. What do you say, Wolf?{p}Hot or cold?"
    s "呦，这故事不错啊。你说呢，Wolf？{p}热的还是冷的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12163
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bb42d964:

    # "His answer is predictably deadpan."
    "他的回答还是一如既往地一本正经。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12165
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_76c5f699:

    # w "Cold."
    w "冷的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12169
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fbdd4d33:

    # w "Can't deny that it sounds exciting, but reality tends to be more mundane than your imagination."
    w "虽说听起来挺刺激，但现实往往比你想象的要无聊得多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12173
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_00dcbff6:

    # w "And that phrase? You'll never hear me utter those words."
    w "至于那句话？你这辈子都别想从我嘴里听到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12175
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_845a2027:

    # "He ends the sentence by spitting his words on the deck."
    "他说完，朝甲板上啐了一口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12177
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bd350831:

    # p "Not a fan of royalty, I take it?"
    p "看来你很不喜欢皇室啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12179
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cabb7ce0:

    # w "Best if I don't answer that."
    w "还是不回答为妙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12183
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1d0cc113:

    # w "But let me be clear: the right answer remains mundane, stable work."
    w "但我得说清楚：踏实肯干才是正道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12185
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7c31b8e5:

    # w "I'm not proud of it, so I don't usually bring it up."
    w "我自己也不觉得光彩，所以平时很少提起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12189
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_39d1925d:

    # w "The truth is often boring."
    w "真相往往就是这么枯燥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12191
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c06d011b:

    # w "And working in the stables is about as boring as it gets."
    w "而在马厩里干活，那简直是枯燥到了极点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12199
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cbcc746b:

    # s "No better or worse than what we're doing, in fact I'd be surprised if we didn't pick up a few of them in Morocco."
    s "说真的，跟咱们现在干的也没啥两样，要我说，没在摩洛哥染上点什么都算咱们走运。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12201
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4d09867f:

    # s "So we might find ourselves shoveling shit soon enough."
    s "所以啊，咱们八成很快就得去铲屎了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12205
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8cd17f64:

    # p "Looking forward to it..."
    p "真是期待呢……"

# game/script day12.rpy:12207
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_34762a49:

    # p "Does that at least mean we'll get a share? I wouldn't mind maybe a little milk or an omelette now and then."
    p "那好歹也得分咱们一份吧？时不时来口牛奶，摊个鸡蛋饼啥的，我也乐意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12212
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5a57b2ff:

    # "[He] laughs and reaches over to playfully tap your shoulder."
    "他笑着，抬手拍了拍你的肩膀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12214
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f6f5f2f8:

    # s "My man, that's the life of a landsman."
    s "哥们儿，陆地上的日子就是这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12216
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_344c1b61:

    # s "All of the work, none of the benefit.{w} Most of it goes to the officers."
    s "干的全是苦活累活，好处一点捞不着。{w} 大头全让那些当官的拿走了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12220
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1dcaa3e6:

    # "You slump your shoulders."
    "你耷拉下肩膀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12226
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9d5eb7ee:

    # "You remain silent, your fingers tracing the coarse fibers of the rope that hold the boat in place."
    "你沉默不语，手指摩挲着粗糙的缆绳，它们可是固定船身的命脉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12230
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_73d70f34:

    # s "... I'm blanking..."
    s "……我脑子里一片空白……"

# game/script day12.rpy:12234
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_09d07ec1:

    # s "But something valiant. I mean, look at him and tell me you don't expect him to emerge silently from the shadows."
    s "但肯定得是个英雄事迹。我是说，你瞅瞅他，难道不觉得他会悄无声息地从阴影里冒出来吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12242
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d7f02841:

    # p "He's already done it to me."
    p "他就这么对我干过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12244
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_279b8480:

    # p "Twice."
    p "两次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12248
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2f105f49:

    # p "And scared the crap out of me."
    p "差点没把我吓死。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12252
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2436e6b7:

    # w "I can't account for you not paying attention to your surroundings."
    w "我可没法替你解释，为啥你走路不长眼睛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12256
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_79dd8816:

    # w "I make enough noise when I walk."
    w "我走路动静够大了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12258
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0a2e1bfb:

    # p "You most certainly don't."
    p "你可不一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12260
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5c96a6c8:

    # p "At least not if you want people to actually notice you when you walk up to them."
    p "至少你要是想让人注意到你走过来了，就得弄出点动静。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12262
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bbb7dca2:

    # p "And besides, I don't exactly want to be alert during every waking moment, you know."
    p "再说了，我又不是时时刻刻都想保持警惕，你懂吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12266
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2922bf9a:

    # p "Sometimes a simple call when you're not already breathing down my neck would be nice."
    p "有时候，你要是没在我耳边嗡嗡，好好出声打个招呼，我会更高兴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12270
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ad9b3892:

    # "Wolf huffs and pulls on his line to see if it'll slacken."
    "Wolf哼了一声，拽了拽绳子，想看看能不能松一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12272
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_64766ef2:

    # w "Pay more attention."
    w "用点心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12274
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_419b51a1:

    # p "Sorry that I don't want to be alert every waking moment, Wolf."
    p "抱歉啊，Wolf，我就是不想每时每刻都提心吊胆的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12276
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_06d43d83:

    # p "The first mate has got that covered already. It would be kind of you not to be the second person I have to watch out for."
    p "大副已经够操心了。要是你也能让我省点心，那就再好不过了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12284
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_42ecf448:

    # p "Whatever the case, these lines look to be in good order to me, Sam."
    p "话虽如此，不过在我看来，这些缆绳都没什么问题，Sam。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12286
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3d2fcf35:

    # "You meticulously inspect each knot for any damage it might have sustained during the storm."
    "你一丝不苟地检查着每个绳结，看看它们在暴风雨中是否受损。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12290
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5e5f02c9:

    # "You steady yourself against the gunwale with one hand as your group makes its way to the bow of the ship."
    "你一手扶着舷墙，稳住身形，和大家伙一起走向船头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12299
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7ee96d7b:

    # "Bit by bit, you move along the length of the vessel, inspecting one line after another. Fortunately, nothing requires immediate attention."
    "你一点一点地沿着船身移动，逐一检查缆绳。 幸运的是，没有发现什么需要立刻处理的问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12301
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_70004aeb:

    # s "If you'd like more to do after this, I might have something simple."
    s "如果你之后还有空，我这儿可能还有些简单活儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12303
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_83fcaa3c:

    # p "Oh? How wet will I get during it?"
    p "哦？会遇到什么麻烦事儿吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12307
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_890d3d7b:

    # "The maned wolf lets [his] eyes wander down your body."
    "鬃狼的目光在你身上扫视。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12309
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f9f1d1c6:

    # s "Would it really matter at this point?"
    s "到了这个地步，还在乎这些吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12313
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_92498eae:

    # s "But no, that'll be the best part—{w}you'll get to stay dry."
    s "不过不会的，那反而是最好的部分——{w}你会保持干爽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12315
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ebebb02d:

    # s "Or at least as dry as you can be when you get back in."
    s "或者说，顶多就是在回去的路上稍微淋湿一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12317
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d6a05889:

    # p "Well, if that's the case then spit it out already."
    p "得了吧，有话快说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12323
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f7e50de7:

    # s "Rajeeyah needs some help. I asked her if you could take over for me."
    s "Rajeeyah需要搭把手。我问她能不能让你替我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12327
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c4dda695:

    # s "Rajeeyah, the ship's surgeon, needs some help. I asked her if you could take over for me."
    s "Rajeeyah，就是咱们船上的外科医生，她需要人帮忙。我跟她说你能替我过去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12329
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_32f09164:

    # s "Usually I'll help her out before a port of call."
    s "每次靠岸前，我都会帮她一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12333
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8d391a5f:

    # p "Sam, I don't know if you've noticed, but I'm not a trained surgeon."
    p "Sam，我不知道你有没有注意到，我可不是什么训练有素的外科医生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12337
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_edf00f5b:

    # s "Am I?"
    s "我是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12339
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cde92cc7:

    # p "No."
    p "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12341
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a855559d:

    # s "Well, there you go."
    s "这不就得了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12345
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f5d03541:

    # s "All you need to do is help her maintain her instruments. No expertise required—just two working hands, and last I checked, you do have those."
    s "你只需要帮她保养器械。不需要专业知识——只要两只能干活的手就行，而我上次检查时，你确实有这两样东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12347
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5e148bf3:

    # s "Usually I use it as an opportunity to catch up with her, maybe make some plans for when we get back on solid ground. But this time I think you could make better use of it."
    s "之前我都是借着这个机会和她聊聊天，再计划一下上岸之后去哪儿玩。不过这次我觉得你过去能帮上更大的忙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12351
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_73ea5c4b:

    # s "Just don't do it {i}too well{/i}, or she won't want me back!"
    s "不过可别干得{i}过于完美{/i}了，不然她以后都不想让我回来了！"

# game/script day12.rpy:12355
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e6eba105:

    # "[He] says with a bright laugh, and a playful slap lands on your shoulder."
    "他脸上带着灿烂的笑容，在你肩膀上轻轻拍了一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12359
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3b66eea6:

    # "You smile back, forced at first, but after a moment you manage a genuine one."
    "你也回以微笑，但一开始有点僵硬，过了一会儿才自然了些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12361
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7c3f1cde:

    # p "Thank you, Sam. When do I go meet her?"
    p "谢谢你，Sam。我什么时候过去找她？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12363
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e6cca0d2:

    # s "What do you mean, when?{w} Right now, off you go. I told her you'd stop by after we're done here."
    s "你说什么呢？什么时候？{w}现在就去啊。我跟她说你忙完这边就过去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12391
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6b21fc11:

    # "A few knocks on her door and it swings open. The cheetah greets you with a hint of surprise across her features before her memory of the previous arrangement must have returned."
    "敲了几下门，门就开了。猎豹脸上闪过一丝诧异，不过很快就想起了之前说好的事情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12395
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_be4cf4ec:

    # p "Hey Rajeeyah. Samuel sent me, mentioned you needed an extra pair of hands?"
    p "嘿，Rajeeyah。Samuel让我来的，他说你这儿缺人手？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12399
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ccb5c45d:

    # r "Oh, of course, [name]. Sorry, I'm just so used to Sam coming over for this that even though he told me earlier, it still took me by surprise."
    r "哦，[name]，是你啊。不好意思，我都习惯Sam来帮忙了，所以就算他之前跟我说了，还是有点惊讶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12401
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_12087260:

    # r "Yes, please come in."
    r "快请进。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12407
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7b737bfc:

    # p "Samuel sent me, Doctor. I was asked to help?"
    p "医生您好，Samuel让我来帮您。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12409
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e471017e:

    # r "Oh, right. Please, come in."
    r "哦，对对。请进。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12417
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6c84ff9e:

    # "As you step into the doctor's cabin, she moves back to make room for you. The door closes behind you, muffling the sounds of the ship's deck."
    "你走进医生的船舱，她往后让了让，给你让出地方。身后的门关上，封闭的空间里弥漫着药水的味道，甲板上的声音也听不见了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12425
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_aee500a7:

    # "Brushing past you and kneeling down, Rajeeyah opens the lock on one of the cabinets. An array of vials, pouches, boxes, and medical supplies greets your eyes, and among them, a few items that would look more at home in a carpenter's toolbox."
    "Rajeeyah从你身边走过，跪下来打开了一个柜子。你看到里面放着一排排药瓶、小袋子、盒子和医疗用品，还有一些看起来更像是木匠工具的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12427
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eb282a3f:

    # r "I assume Samuel has told you what we'll be doing?"
    r "Samuel应该跟你说了我们要干什么了吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12429
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8e76fb77:

    # r "Whenever we're approaching a port of call, I usually take an inventory of what might need to be restocked. Along with the general maintenance and cleaning of everything."
    r "每次快到码头的时候，我都会清点一下需要补给的东西，还有对所有东西进行维护和清洁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12435
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c6dbe328:

    # r "A little spring cleaning, you might call it."
    r "“废物利用”吧，你可以这么说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12437
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cad4b083:

    # "She adds with a smile."
    "她笑着说道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12441
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cc205228:

    # p "Are you sure you don't need someone who knows what they're doing?"
    p "你确定不需要找个更专业的人来？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12443
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_26a8979e:

    # r "Oh, don't worry. All I need you to do is clean some equipment."
    r "哦，放心吧。我只是要你清洁一些工具。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12445
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9d0f6a1c:

    # r "As long as you can follow instructions, you'll be just fine."
    r "只要你听指挥就行，没问题的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12447
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bad940ca:

    # r "Besides, it's a ship. Outside of my mate, I don't exactly have a swath of people with medical knowledge around me."
    r "毕竟是在船上，除了我的大副，也没多少懂医的人手能使唤。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12449
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4dc000bd:

    # r "Even fewer people of low enough rank who could be persuaded to do something like cleaning my tools."
    r "至于军阶够低、能被劝来说服帮我清洗医疗器械的人，那就更屈指可数了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12451
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_277fdc14:

    # r "You learn to make do with what's available.{w} And in this case, that's you."
    r "只能有什么用什么了。{w} 现在嘛，就只能是你了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12455
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e7554c67:

    # p "\"What's available\"... I didn't realize I was so highly valued."
    p "“有什么用什么”……我没想到我这么抢手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12459
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f90468a5:

    # "She laughs and rubs the side of her neck."
    "她笑着挠了挠脖子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12461
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_df176cc2:

    # r "My apologies, I didn't mean to make it sound like I view you as mere stale leftovers."
    r "抱歉，我不是想说你只是些没人要的边角料。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12465
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9f8f8c3e:

    # r "I do appreciate your company, and I have no doubt you'll do a fine job of it."
    r "我很感谢你能来帮忙，而且我相信你肯定能干好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12467
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_17131227:

    # p "And the mate isn't around?"
    p "大副不在吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12471
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2cc88bb6:

    # r "Why all the questions? It sounds almost like you don't even want to be here."
    r "你哪来那么多问题？听着你好像不太乐意干啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12473
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b134aeac:

    # p "Oh, it's not that. I'm just curious why it's usually Samuel who helps you."
    p "哦，倒也不是。我就是好奇平时不都是Samuel帮你吗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12475
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_929aa5d4:

    # r "Is it not reason enough for us to spend some time together? It has become a bit of a ritual."
    r "难道这还不足以成为我们共度片刻时光的理由吗？这几乎已经成了一种惯例了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12484
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2ba02542:

    # "As she speaks, Rajeeyah prepares a bowl on the table. She opens a bottle and empties the contents into it and with it you pick up the scent of vinegar filling the air."
    "说话间，Rajeeyah在桌上摆弄出一个碗。她打开瓶子，把里面的东西倒进去，一股醋味扑鼻而来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12486
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2c6ccc18:

    # r "But no, the mate is busy reporting to the captain and making the rounds to address any sanitary concerns anywhere on the ship."
    r "大副正忙着向船长汇报，还得四处巡查，看看船上还有什么卫生隐患。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12488
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6c1c3501:

    # p "The bilge reeks."
    p "船舱里都臭死了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12494
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_71e6996d:

    # "Another laugh escapes her."
    "她忍不住又笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12496
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fb838a02:

    # r "Wait, you're saying it's possible that it doesn't?"
    r "等等，你是说...可能不管用？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12500
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_71e128e6:

    # r "Sorry, Mr. [family_name], but I'm just a surgeon—I don't deal in miracles. {p}Don't sleep down there, and you'll be alright."
    r "抱歉，[family_name]先生，但我只是个外科医生——我可不创造奇迹。 {p}别睡在下面，你就没事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12504
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5e63f063:

    # r "I can't work miracles, my sincere apologies. Just avoid sleeping in there, and you'll be fine."
    r "我可没法创造奇迹，抱歉了您嘞。反正别在里面睡觉，就成。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12506
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b2083141:

    # r "But why don't we get started?"
    r "咱们还是开始干活吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12514
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7a43e31b:

    # "Once you are set up and the bottle of vinegar is stowed away, she gestures toward the cabinet."
    "等你准备好了，醋也放好了，就看看那边那个柜子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12516
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a1779ae7:

    # r "Your task is very simple. I'm going to hand you a tool and you're going to scrub it well with the vinegar in the bowl here. Then leave it to soak."
    r "活儿很简单。我给你一样工具，你用碗里的醋好好刷刷，然后泡着就行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12518
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_dca84bc8:

    # r "Make sure you scrub it well, without breaking it, of course."
    r "记得刷干净点，可别给我弄坏了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12520
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0cac8141:

    # p "I think I could have just about figured out the part about not breaking them on my own."
    p "我觉得不弄坏东西这么简单的道理，我还是懂的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12527
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_69b737cf:

    # "She continues unabated and rests her palm on a set of two leather bags sitting on the cabinet."
    "她自顾自地说了下去，手放在柜子上那两个皮包上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12529
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_be5a1961:

    # r "These two contain more tools. Basically anything that is small enough to not be stored in the cabinets, and everything in there needs the same treatment."
    r "都在这两个包里了。反正就是些没地儿放的小玩意儿，都得这么刷一遍。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12531
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7f9e948c:

    # p "Scrub and soak everything in vinegar.{w} Sounds easy enough."
    p "用醋把所有东西都刷洗、浸泡一遍。{w} 听起来挺简单的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12533
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3db902df:

    # "Rajeeyah hands you a pair of metal bowls, and you go to the table and start cleaning them with a small sponge that's in the bowl."
    "Rajeeyah 递给你一对金属碗，你走到桌子旁，开始用碗里的小海绵清洗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12537
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0e809509:

    # "When you reach in with your hands, you immediately feel the burn of the vinegar on your wounded hand. Hissing, you quickly pull it back and try to dry it against your clothes."
    "当你伸手进去时，你立刻感觉到醋烧灼着你受伤的手。你嘶的一声倒吸一口凉气，迅速把手缩回来，在衣服上擦了擦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12541
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2a337bb0:

    # p "Ah, fuck!" with hpunch
    p "啊，真他妈的！" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:12543
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a6f926ba:

    # "Rajeeyah looks at you with wide-eyed surprise."
    "Rajeeyah 睁大眼睛，一脸惊讶地看着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12545
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bb2a78d0:

    # r "What's wrong?"
    r "怎么了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12547
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6d076c19:

    # p "Nothing, nothing.{w} I injured my hand earlier and I guess this stuff stings..."
    p "没事，没事。{w} 我之前伤了手，这玩意儿好像有点刺激..."

# game/script day12.rpy:12551
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_04764623:

    # "Her surprise turns to laughter, but she composes herself quickly."
    "她先是惊讶地笑了出来，但很快就忍住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12555
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a1585f4a:

    # r "It's vinegar, yes—it stings."
    r "是醋，没错——会刺痛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12557
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eda2b2d0:

    # r "Do you want me to have a look at your hand?"
    r "要不要我看看你的手？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12559
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_854a283f:

    # p "No, no. It's just a scratch."
    p "不用，不用。就是一道小口子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12561
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4a9536e0:

    # p "I'll be fine. I guess I just have to be careful not to let the vinegar touch it."
    p "我没事。我注意点，不让醋碰到就行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12563
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9959382f:

    # p "Do you need me to help with taking inventory as well?"
    p "需要我帮忙清点一下货物吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12567
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a4542d07:

    # r "No, just focus on cleaning."
    r "不用，你专心洗碗就行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12569
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6e7976c9:

    # p "And you do this before every port we enter?"
    p "每次靠港前都要这样吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12573
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2984ef86:

    # "She nods and grabs the first bottle from the cupboard, checking its contents and makes some notes in a cloth bound notebook."
    "她点点头，从柜子里拿出一个瓶子，检查了一下里面的东西，然后在布面封皮的笔记本上记了几笔。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12575
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_06214c6c:

    # r "It's best to keep abreast of it whenever I have the opportunity."
    r "最好是能抓住机会就多了解一下情况。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12579
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f0dd575a:

    # r "You helped me with Perce before, so you know firsthand how bad it can get when we run out of something."
    r "你之前帮我照料过Perce，所以你亲眼见过药品一旦耗尽情况会有多棘手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12581
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_03803d52:

    # r "He was in pretty bad shape and at times it wasn't clear if I would have to amputate his hand..."
    r "他那次的情况可糟透了，有好几次我都觉得要给他截肢了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:12583
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_15e34f7e:

    # r "Luckily we didn't have to."
    r "还好最后没到那一步。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12585
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a2553cf7:

    # r "I can't ensure that situations like that never happen, but I can at least make sure that we are stocked with what {i}should{/i} be enough."
    r "我没法保证以后都不会遇到这种事，但我至少能保证{i}应该{/i}有足够的储备。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12587
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0abff762:

    # r "So I try to stock up whenever possible. And Mogador is the principal port in the region; they'll have most of what I need."
    r "所以我只要有机会就尽量补给。莫加多尔是这片海域最重要的主港，我需要的大部分药材那里都有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12596
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bef83c54:

    # "You continue to scrub the bowls carefully. But no matter how hard you try, the occasional renewed burn of your knuckles is impossible to avoid."
    "你继续小心地擦洗着碗。但不管你再怎么小心，指关节还是免不了时不时被醋灼烧一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12598
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f0c53aa9:

    # "And there's the added difficulty of trying to keep the papers scattered all over the desk away from the vinegar."
    "还有，得小心别让醋溅到桌上那些乱七八糟的纸上，这也够让人头疼的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12602
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_745a5480:

    # "You keep scrubbing the bowls, trying to keep the vinegar off the papers strewn all over the desk."
    "你不停地擦洗着碗，尽量不让醋沾到桌子上的纸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12604
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_557df467:

    # "A task easier said than done, and you occasionally lift the bowl to keep the rocking of the ship over the stormy waves from spilling it."
    "说起来容易做起来难，而且你还得时不时地抬一下碗，免得船在风浪中摇晃把醋洒出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12613
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5eb0bcb5:

    # p "You must be starting to feel the excitement now that you're just a few days away from home?"
    p "再过几天就到家了，你现在是不是已经开始兴奋起来了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12615
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ede769c6:

    # "She doesn't look up from the piece of paper she's filling out before reaching for the next bottle."
    "她头也不抬，眼睛盯着手里的文件，然后伸手去拿下一个瓶子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12619
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_47abf337:

    # p "I'm curious, since we're not too far from the nearest port. Do you prefer your time on the ship, or do you still get excited when we stop somewhere and get some solid ground under your paws again?"
    p "我挺好奇的，反正离港口也不远了。你更喜欢待在船上，还是更喜欢靠岸之后脚踏实地的感觉？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12621
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_58936b85:

    # r "Usually? No."
    r "一般？不喜欢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12623
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_873cdc84:

    # p "Usually?"
    p "一直都这样吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12625
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ae7a6fc7:

    # p "Does that mean this one is different?"
    p "这么说，这次有什么不一样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12629
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_08d17068:

    # r "I'd be lying if I said I wasn't looking forward to some of it."
    r "要说我一点都不期待，那肯定是假话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12631
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_57cc5ead:

    # p "The famed run down the beach."
    p "还有那令人向往的海滩跑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12635
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a67a023a:

    # r "I'll take any route, beach or no beach, but it would be nice to do it by the water."
    r "什么路线我都行，有没有海滩都无所谓，不过要能在水边跑就更好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12637
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4890b767:

    # r "Ideally with a nice summer breeze to cool me down."
    r "最好是吹着凉爽的夏日微风，那就太舒服了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12639
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3de456cd:

    # r "Or just not be a scorching day. I'll take either."
    r "或者别赶上大热天也行，这俩条件我哪个都能接受。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12643
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ec1a6ae7:

    # r "If I get my wish? That is a different matter entirely at this time of year."
    r "如果真能如我所愿？那在这个季节可就难说了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12647
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_78e25cb2:

    # r "It is."
    r "的确晚了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12649
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2857014d:

    # r "I don't think I've told you yet, but it'll be my home port.{w} \"Was\", I suppose, given that this ship has been my home for the past few years."
    r "我好像还没跟你说过，这儿是我的母港。{w} 应该说是“曾经是”吧，毕竟这艘船在过去几年里就是我的家。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12651
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d2112306:

    # p "Oh, you're from Mogador?"
    p "噢，你是 莫加多尔 人？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12653
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6cc57708:

    # r "Not quite Mogador directly, but close to it. I grew up in Safi."
    r "也不完全是 莫加多尔，就在它附近。 我是在 萨菲 长大的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12655
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_92022b8c:

    # p "Then I've no doubt that it must be exciting to visit it again."
    p "那我毫不怀疑，故地重游一定让人心潮澎湃。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12657
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2e2ba8eb:

    # p "How long has it been?"
    p "离开多久了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12659
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7f7f8dc3:

    # r "Two years."
    r "两年了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12661
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_23d277be:

    # r "We don't land there often, though this time we have a lucrative freight contract for a load of grain, so I am lucky to spend a few days in my homeland again."
    r "我们不常在那边靠岸，不过这次我们接了个大单，要运一批谷物，所以我很幸运能在家乡待上几天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12663
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4ba1d338:

    # r "Though originally I left even before that."
    r "其实我最开始离开那儿的时间更早。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12665
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d1060b5e:

    # r "Two years is how long it's been since I last set foot on Moroccan soil."
    r "准确地说，自从我上次踏上摩洛哥的土地，已经过去两年了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12667
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6afe463c:

    # r "I left of my own accord back then, but I would be lying if I said that I am not missing it."
    r "当年我是自愿离开的，但若是说我心里一点都不怀念它，那也是自欺欺人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12669
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d3fd3e70:

    # r "Smell the familiar smells.{w} See the familiar colors of the towns. {w}Finally sit down for a good tea again... Mmm"
    r "闻一闻那熟悉的味道。{w} 看一看小镇那熟悉的色彩。{w} 最后再舒舒服服地喝上一杯好茶……嗯……"

# game/script day12.rpy:12671
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6e1cc813:

    # "You notice her lips bend into a subtle smile."
    "你注意到她嘴角微微上扬，露出了一个浅浅的笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12673
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f581cadb:

    # r "It'll be nice."
    r "那感觉肯定很棒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12675
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b10b9284:

    # p "Someone rather enjoys their tea?"
    p "看来你很喜欢喝茶啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12677
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5bfafb7c:

    # r "Find me a Moroccan who doesn't."
    r "你能找出一个不喜欢喝茶的摩洛哥人吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12679
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_aa1ed634:

    # r "It's an event for us. You sit down, take your time to get lost in the moment with family, friends, some person walking down the street. Whoever it may be."
    r "对我们来说，喝茶可是件大事。 坐下来，和家人、朋友，甚至是街上的陌生人，一起沉浸在那份悠闲惬意之中。 不管和谁都行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12681
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c150176b:

    # r "I've been missing it. Not many of the men here are drawn in by that prospect, nor do they usually have the time."
    r "我一直都很想念那种感觉。 船上的弟兄们对这些都不太感兴趣，而且他们也难得有那个闲工夫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12685
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5aff3cf4:

    # r "Where's the gambling?"
    r "哪儿有得赌钱？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12687
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6d5bbe0a:

    # r "Where's the drunken pleasure?"
    r "那借酒买醉的快意又从何谈起呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12691
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c5c0f514:

    # r "Only exception is when we're crossing into colder regions. Now, when they have to reef the sails in a sleet storm, let me tell you then a cup of tea gets traded like a bar of pure gold."
    r "除非是到了天寒地冻的地方。 我跟你说，要是在冰天雪地里顶着风暴收帆，那会儿能喝上一杯热茶，简直比金子还珍贵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12693
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_94bc1f80:

    # p "I can believe it."
    p "我信。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12695
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cc0b6a6e:

    # p "Do you have anything planned coming back after all that time?"
    p "离开这么久，这次回去有什么打算吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12697
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_05b95c05:

    # p "For most of us it's probably just going to be more work."
    p "对我们大多数人来说，恐怕就得更卖力干活了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12699
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f22277ba:

    # p "Or whatever it is you do as a sailor during the stay in a harbor."
    p "或者说，水手在靠港期间还能有啥事儿干呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12701
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_69d709bd:

    # r "Running."
    r "跑步。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12703
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a374088c:

    # "Her answer takes you aback and you stare at her with wide-open eyes."
    "她这话可真让你吃了一惊，你瞪大了眼睛看着她。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12705
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_670be001:

    # p "Running?"
    p "跑步？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12707
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4f7b6c8c:

    # p "Deserting from...{w} the ship?"
    p "从……{w}从船上开溜？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12711
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cf7be1af:

    # "Now it was her turn to stare back in disbelief, her teeth peeking past her ajar lips."
    "现在轮到她一脸难以置信地瞪着你，微微张开的嘴唇里露出牙齿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12713
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e4af39d0:

    # "She catches herself with a quick shake of her head."
    "她赶紧摇了摇头，让自己清醒一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12717
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_19fcb7b1:

    # r "What?"
    r "啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12719
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_73ae705d:

    # r "No."
    r "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12721
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_96731d0e:

    # r "{i}Running{/i}."
    r "{i}跑步{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12723
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_61e67a26:

    # r "To nowhere."
    r "哪儿也不去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12725
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8ce0e50b:

    # r "Just for the sake of it."
    r "就是想跑着玩儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12727
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_772aee62:

    # p "Oh...{w} You {i}really{/i} are a cheetah, aren't you?"
    p "哦……{w}你{i}还真{/i}是只猎豹啊，我说得对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12731
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0bc7db9d:

    # "She laughs."
    "她笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12735
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ce8c965d:

    # r "Not just {i}any{/i} cheetah.{w} A king cheetah."
    r "可不是{i}普通的{/i}猎豹。{w}是猎豹之王！"

# game/script day12.rpy:12737
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9b83d6c3:

    # r "If not me, then who else would keep the nature of our species alive?"
    r "如果我不跑，谁来保持我们猎豹的天性呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12739
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ec099e3b:

    # r "Though perhaps queen cheetah would be a more fitting title, don't you think?"
    r "不过，也许叫猎豹女王更合适，你说呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12741
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d571bc5a:

    # p "A worthy one."
    p "当之无愧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12745
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0f465cbe:

    # "You play along, imitating the tone of a servant."
    "你配合她演戏，模仿着下人的腔调。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12747
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1e82c1e8:

    # r "But, no, I just like it, and unfortunately this ship is not convenient for a run."
    r "哎，没办法，我就是喜欢跑步，可这破船根本没法跑啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12749
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f40d30e3:

    # r "Fighting against the waves, fighting against the slippery wet planks, the wind, having to weave through you lot and avoid the tar dripping from above..."
    r "跟海浪较劲，跟湿滑的甲板较劲，顶着大风，还得在你们这群人里钻来钻去，还得小心上面滴下来的焦油……"

# game/script day12.rpy:12751
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_31faca5b:

    # r "It's not the same, and whenever I'm out here I just crave that euphoric feeling I get from it."
    r "感觉完全不一样，我只要待在这儿，就浑身难受，只想跑起来，享受那种快感。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12753
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5c36568a:

    # p "At least I won't have any trouble spotting you among the crowd."
    p "起码这样，我在人群里一眼就能认出你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12757
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_31f6ba1c:

    # "Briefly, Rajeeyah pulls the cork from the bottle she's inspecting before plugging it again and returning it to the cabinet."
    "简短地，Rajeeyah 拔掉她正在检查的瓶子的瓶塞，然后又塞回去，放回柜子里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12759
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_241a7620:

    # "You glance at the bottle, though unable to read the label from where you are."
    "你瞥了一眼瓶子，但从你所在的位置无法辨认标签。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12761
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_42e92851:

    # p "Is that vanilla?"
    p "那是香草吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12765
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fa67f790:

    # r "Good nose."
    r "鼻子挺灵啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12767
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c6d56744:

    # r "It doesn't actually have any medicinal value itself, but sometimes dealing with your sailors is like dealing with stubborn children..."
    r "这东西本身倒是没什么药效，但有时候跟你们这些水手打交道，就跟哄小孩儿似的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:12771
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b864e817:

    # r "Correction, it's almost always like dealing with stubborn children."
    r "说白了，就是哄一群熊孩子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12773
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_acbc3f21:

    # r "And suddenly it's almost impossible to take the medicine if it isn't palatable..."
    r "所以啊，药要是不好喝，他们才不吃呢……"

# game/script day12.rpy:12777
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c600c5c3:

    # p "You wouldn't happen to be able to spare some for Bandile?"
    p "你能不能匀点儿给 Bandile 使使？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12779
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_46af7220:

    # r "I'm afraid not. It wouldn't last a day if you lot got your paws on it."
    r "不行。让你们这群人碰了，一天都保不住。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12781
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cbc105b3:

    # r "Why did you want to help anyway?"
    r "你干嘛要帮忙？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12783
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bea334d0:

    # p "The desire to be helpful isn't a sufficient answer, I assume?"
    p "就想帮个忙，这理由说不过去吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12787
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a4cfba9e:

    # r "No. I've been around sailors long enough. Are you ducking out from something worse?"
    r "不。我和水手们打交道很久了。你想躲什么事儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12791
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ff98ab54:

    # p "No, on the contrary. I'd have my break right now."
    p "不，我正好得空。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12793
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_93409127:

    # p "But the whole thing with the first mate who seems to have it in for me..."
    p "但是那个一直找我茬的大副..."

# game/script day12.rpy:12795
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b5fb8ff9:

    # p "I'm just trying to find some way to turn his opinion of me around.{w} Somehow..."
    p "我只是想找个办法扭转他对我的看法。{w} 想办法..."

# game/script day12.rpy:12799
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_96a4964b:

    # "Rajeeyah reaches for another bottle as she finishes jotting down what she needed to note."
    "Rajeeyah搁下笔，又顺手抄起个药瓶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12801
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ce0475f0:

    # p "I asked Samuel what kind of work I could do. You know, show the officer that I can pull my weight."
    p "我问了Samuel我能做些什么。你知道，想让长官知道我不是吃白饭的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12803
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_68c2a78b:

    # p "Really feels like it's an impossible task, though."
    p "不过，感觉难如登天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12805
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2dd6aedd:

    # "A few seconds pass before she answers."
    "过了几秒钟她才回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12807
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9141e714:

    # r "It's not easy to carry the weight of the responsibility of first mate on your shoulders."
    r "当大副可不容易。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12811
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b72e2e5c:

    # p "And you think being thrown off of this goddamn ship because of his stubbornness is?!" with hpunch
    p "难道被他一意孤行地赶下船就容易了？！" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:12813
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a2e30639:

    # "For a moment, your emotions overtake you. Her words about it being a tough situation for Arthur just rub you the wrong way."
    "有一瞬间，你的情绪压过了理智。她说Arthur处境艰难的那些话，听在你耳朵里格外刺耳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12815
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_904acbfe:

    # p "All this shit, because he can't listen to reason. I guess the grunts aren't worth the effort to actually listen to or consider their point of view when I'm so easily discarded."
    p "还不是因为他不讲理。像我这种小喽啰，哪值得他费心听我说什么，反正随时都能丢掉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12817
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_76fd581c:

    # p "...Sorry."
    p "...对不起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12821
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_81129f95:

    # r "I understand your frustration."
    r "我理解你的沮丧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12823
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_dc5258ea:

    # "With the bowls done, you move on to the next item to clean—a saw that, you assume, must have seen too many grim sights."
    "碗洗完了，你开始清洗下一件物品——一把锯子，你猜想，它一定见证过太多可怕的景象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12825
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_87c07084:

    # "Although, come to think of it, you haven't come across any poor chap on the ship who seems to have undergone an amputation. Perhaps it's less common than you've heard?"
    "不过话说回来，船上好像没见过哪个倒霉蛋截肢啊。难道没我想的那么常见？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12827
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_56bf4c5d:

    # "Or they're just let go at the earliest convenience..."
    "或者早就找个由头给打发了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:12829
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c13eef98:

    # "Like you..."
    "就像你一样..."

# game/script day12.rpy:12831
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2dad7286:

    # "Your little mental excursion is enough for the sway of a stronger wave to catch you off guard."
    "你正走神，一个大浪猛地打来，你一个趔趄。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12835
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_10b2a3c6:

    # r "Careful!"
    r "小心！"

# game/script day12.rpy:12839
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_251a6901:

    # "You lose your balance and scramble, leaving a trail of claw marks along the wall before you manage to catch your weight." with hpunch
    "你失去平衡，在墙上猛抓几下才稳住身形。" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:12841
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4bc4eb42:

    # "The saw clatters across the floor, and when you regain your footing, you meet Rajeeyah's startled eyes."
    "锯子哐当一声掉在地上，你抬头一看，Rajeeyah正一脸惊讶地看着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12843
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_dd9c7c6e:

    # r "Are you alright?!"
    r "你没事吧？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:12847
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a9807c30:

    # p "I-uh... I'm sorry."
    p "我...呃...对不起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12851
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b94e33cb:

    # "Straightening up, you adjust your trousers."
    "你挺直身子，整理了一下裤子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12853
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_447e5c21:

    # r "Didn't I mention that you should try not to break them?"
    r "我是不是说过让你尽量别弄坏它们？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12855
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8c84adfa:

    # p "I'm sorry, Doctor. I was distracted for a moment."
    p "对不起，医生。我刚才走神了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12857
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_dca4803e:

    # "You bend down to pick up the instrument from the floor."
    "你俯身从地上捡起那个东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12859
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4c92672e:

    # r "Are you not feeling well?"
    r "你没事吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12861
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a2fbfe12:

    # p "It's fine, Doctor. There's nothing wrong with me."
    p "我没事，医生，就是有点走神。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12863
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_31dcbfab:

    # p "Just distracted."
    p "只是走神"

# game/script day12.rpy:12865
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1ecb954e:

    # r "If you say so..."
    r "你这么说，我也就听听..."

# game/script day12.rpy:12871
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_08b9db1b:

    # "Rajeeyah turns around hesitantly to pull the next bottle out of the cabinet."
    "Rajeeyah犹豫了一下，转过身从柜子里拿出另一个瓶子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12873
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1e4c2606:

    # p "What is in that one?"
    p "这瓶里装的是什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12875
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_27b1ccd6:

    # p "If you don't mind me asking. Just tell me if I'm slowing you down too much."
    p "如果不方便说就算了，要是我耽误你做事了，你告诉我一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12877
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d7fc5003:

    # p "I'm just curious, that's all."
    p "我就是好奇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12879
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_98b9eec6:

    # r "As long as it doesn't distract you further."
    r "别因为我更分心了就好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12885
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_dde92857:

    # "You can see her muzzle curl into a smile as she pulls out several bottles that seem to be the same make."
    "你瞧见她嘴角一弯，笑了笑，然后拿出几个看起来一样的瓶子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12887
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_20dbce0e:

    # r "Although I would rather have someone who is inquisitive than someone who would rather be anywhere else."
    r "我宁愿要一个好奇的，也不想要那种身在曹营心在汉的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12889
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cfa50d20:

    # r "It's wormwood wine.{w} Four bottles in total, but one of them is empty. That means I have to make a note to pick up a replacement bottle when I'm restocking."
    r "这是苦艾药酒。总共四瓶，一瓶空了，得记着补货。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12893
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_40c12622:

    # p "What's it good for?{w} Or do we just get to choose what kind of alcohol we get when we're injured?"
    p "这有什么用？{w}还是说等我们受伤时，能由着自己挑喝哪种酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12895
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_df378baf:

    # p "Because this sickbed is beginning to sound more and more like the most luxurious place on this ship."
    p "这么一说，这病床听着倒像是船上最舒坦的地儿了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12899
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_345c33fe:

    # p "Since you handed Samuel some rum."
    p "之前你不是还给Samuel喝了朗姆酒吗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12903
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c06d620a:

    # p "Perce too, if my memory serves me right?"
    p "Perce好像也有份吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12907
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ce9d4b5b:

    # p "Or do I get to make a request for what I'll get in my dire time of need?"
    p "那我能不能点单，等我快不行的时候喝点啥？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12911
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0164cdd2:

    # p "If so, then maybe I'd go with wine."
    p "要能点的话，我就要葡萄酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12913
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_851d1c89:

    # "She's looking at you with a raised eyebrow."
    "她挑着眉毛看你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12915
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_076df18c:

    # r "Are we getting fancy?"
    r "咱们要讲究起来了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12917
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6d90a64a:

    # r "This isn't meant to numb the pain, although it does a good job of that just the same in large enough quantities."
    r "这玩意儿不是止疼的，当然，喝多了也能麻痹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12921
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5a4d5c6a:

    # p "Since you gave Perce rum, as I recall."
    p "记得你还给Perce喝了朗姆酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12925
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ce9d4b5b_1:

    # p "Or do I get to make a request for what I'll get in my dire time of need?"
    p "那我能不能点单，等我快不行的时候喝点啥？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12929
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0164cdd2_1:

    # p "If so, then maybe I'd go with wine."
    p "要能点的话，我就要葡萄酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12931
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_851d1c89_1:

    # "She's looking at you with a raised eyebrow."
    "她挑着眉毛看你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12933
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_076df18c_1:

    # r "Are we getting fancy?"
    r "咱们要讲究起来了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12935
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6d90a64a_1:

    # r "This isn't meant to numb the pain, although it does a good job of that just the same in large enough quantities."
    r "这玩意儿不是止疼的，当然，喝多了也能麻痹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12939
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5bbee733:

    # r "We do not offer you the choice. Everyone will get what is needed for them to recover."
    r "没得挑。我们会给每个人最合适的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12943
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_07b42066:

    # r "In the instance of wormwood wine, it serves to remedy intestinal worms."
    r "苦艾药酒是用来治肚子里虫子的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12945
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b4697b0d:

    # "You grimace at the very thought of it."
    "你一听这个就觉得恶心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12947
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_460ab4d0:

    # p "Worms? In my gut?"
    p "虫子？在我肚子里？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12949
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e703d831:

    # p "The long, squiggly kind?"
    p "长长的那种，还会扭的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:12953
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fb6aa74a:

    # r "The very same."
    r "就是那种。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12955
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e003a51a:

    # p "Maybe that's something I'd rather avoid. No matter how good this wine may be."
    p "那还是算了吧，酒再好我也不想喝了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12957
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_33e1fef7:

    # r "I would recommend it."
    r "我倒是挺推荐的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12959
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_18bfc561:

    # r "They do have to come out someho-"
    r "“它们总得用完，然后…”"

# game/script day12.rpy:12963
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_04750d18:

    # p "No! Stop! Please. Do not continue that sentence. I'm quite happy not thinking about it." with hpunch
    p "“别！住嘴！求你别说了。我宁愿什么都不知道。”" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:12965
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9e761322:

    # p "Though..."
    p "“不过话说回来…”"

# game/script day12.rpy:12969
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9f68fb1f:

    # "If a bottle is empty... then someone must have needed it."
    "“如果瓶子空了…那肯定是有人需要它。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:12971
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_03a55875:

    # "You can't help but wonder who it could be..."
    "“你肯定会忍不住想，究竟是谁用了…”"

# game/script day12.rpy:12979
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_72b93aa5:

    # p "If this last bottle is empty, then someone must have needed it?"
    p "“如果这最后一瓶也空了，那一定是有人急需它？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:12981
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a312927f:

    # p "Who was it?"
    p "“究竟是谁？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:12985
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_29b9368a:

    # r "Didn't you just say you didn't want me to talk about it?"
    r "“你刚才不是说不想让我提这事儿吗？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:12987
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c4b9e2df:

    # p "Curiosity killed the cat—no, I meant the exact effects, which we don't need to illustrate in great detail-"
    p "好奇害死猫——不，我是说具体药效，咱们用不着掰开揉碎了细讲——"

# game/script day12.rpy:12989
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cc06affb:

    # r "Anyway, you're in no position to ask for that information, nor would I want to violate the privacy of the crew members. So if you could, please continue cleaning."
    r "“总之，你没资格问这些，我也不想泄露船员们的隐私。所以，没事儿的话就继续干活吧。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:12996
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1fe5797d:

    # "Your ears fold down as you return to your task, carefully running the sponge along the serrated edge of the saw."
    "你听了这话，耳朵耷拉下来，又开始小心翼翼地用海绵擦拭着锯子的锯齿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:12998
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5cc0d469:

    # p "Sorry, I understand."
    p "“对不起，我明白了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:13004
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fc0e6a14:

    # "Instead of prying into other people's problems, you direct your question to the medicine itself."
    "你不再追问别人的私事，转而向药物本身发问。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13006
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e99283d4:

    # p "Do you know much about all this medicine you have here?"
    p "“你对这些药了解多少？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:13008
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4b5e3693:

    # p "Well, I mean, of course you do. That came out awkwardly.{p} What I mean is, do you know about them in detail—the history, why they work and so on?"
    p "嗯，我的意思是，你当然了解。这话问得有点尴尬。{p} 我的意思是，你了解它们的细节吗——历史、为什么有效等等？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13010
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6fee8892:

    # p "Or is it just a situation where you know it's supposed to help and that's good enough?"
    p "“还是说，你只知道它们管用就行了？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:13014
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1044c95b:

    # r "An inquisitive mind in that head of yours, I see."
    r "“看来你脑子里装满了好奇心啊。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:13019
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7a592ed1:

    # "She turns to you and holds out her paw to give you one of the bottles."
    "她转过身，朝你伸出手，递给你一个药瓶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13021
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c181c0aa:

    # "You take the bottle and run your thumb over the label as you read it."
    "你接过瓶子，用拇指摩挲着标签，仔细阅读着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13025
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2b84000f:

    # r "I do, to a certain extent. With wormwood, for example, I know it's been used for countless years. Hundreds, if not thousands."
    r "“我了解一些。就拿苦艾来说，我知道它已经用了好几百年了，甚至可能上千年。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:13029
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1511c26f:

    # r "Although your passenger friend is likely to know more about the plant than me."
    r "“不过，你那位乘客朋友可能比我更懂这种植物。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:13031
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7c7d3b90:

    # r "That is definitely not my specialty."
    r "“那可不是我的强项。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:13035
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3a489cb4:

    # r "I have heard that it has been used in the past to help with childbirth. But I guess the use against intestinal worms is the one that crystallized over time, while the former fell by the wayside."
    r "“我听说以前人们用它来辅助分娩。不过我猜，随着时间推移，它驱除肠道寄生虫的功效逐渐被人们熟知，而前一种用法则被渐渐遗忘了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:13037
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_86fb04c5:

    # r "Or who knows, maybe it really does have a valuable use in childbirth?{p}I wouldn't have too many opportunities on this ship to know either way."
    r "“或者，谁知道呢，说不定它在分娩方面真的有奇效？可惜我在这艘船上也没什么机会验证。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:13042
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a734954a:

    # "She chuckles, and when she takes the bottle back, you hold on for a split second too long, afraid it might fall."
    "她轻声一笑，当她拿回瓶子的时候，你依依不舍地多抓了一秒，生怕它掉下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13044
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_421ce336:

    # "Things grow quiet for a while as you both focus on your tasks."
    "两人都埋头干活，四周安静了下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13049
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_05522668:

    # "After you finish with the larger items, you bring the leather bag over and open it on the table, moving some of the scattered paper to make room for it."
    "你擦拭完大件物品，把皮包拿过来，在桌上打开，挪开一些散落的纸张，给它腾出地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13051
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_16cdaf20:

    # "While the items themselves are usually quicker to clean, you have to be more careful not to accidentally cut yourself on a stray scalpel or some other sharp edge you weren't expecting."
    "清理这些小东西虽然快，但你得格外小心，别被藏在里面的手术刀或其他锋利的边角划伤。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13053
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5dbc0559:

    # a "Rajeeyah?"
    a "“Rajeeyah？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:13055
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bb2aabe5:

    # "Arthur's voice breaks the silence from the other side of the door, slightly muffled but still easily audible."
    "Arthur的声音从门外传来，打破了寂静，声音虽有些沉闷，但还是能清楚地听到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13062
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0153d21b:

    # "You look up from what you're doing and catch Rajeeyah's eyes before turning to the door."
    "你从手头的事情中抬起头，目光与Rajeeyah交汇，然后转向门口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13064
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_220706cc:

    # r "Let him in if you would."
    r "如果可以，就让他进来吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13071
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0edf2122:

    # "You hesitate before opening the door, finding Arthur's surprised expression greeting you."
    "你犹豫着打开门，Arthur惊讶的表情映入眼帘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13073
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a3395eae:

    # r "Please come in, Mr. Hudson."
    r "请进，Hudson先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13082
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d28e1f79:

    # "He takes a moment to collect himself, but walks past you into the now cramped room. He looks down at you over his shoulder before turning to face Rajeeyah."
    "他愣了一下，定了定神，然后走进这间现在显得有些拥挤的房间。他越过肩膀看了你一眼，然后转向面对Rajeeyah。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13084
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ca2c8bc8:

    # r "What can I help you with?"
    r "我能帮上什么忙吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13086
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b1e19c32:

    # a "What is he doing here?"
    a "他来这里做什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13088
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7f499659:

    # "The cheetah glances at you before answering."
    "那只猎豹看了你一眼，回答道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13090
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_49a9be4c:

    # r "Assisting me."
    r "协助我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13094
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f716b90b:

    # a "Why was I not notified?"
    a "为什么没有通知我？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13096
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e12e4a27:

    # r "He came here of his own volition during his spare time."
    r "他是在自己的轮空休息时间自愿过来的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13098
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8cbb4c61:

    # r "As you are no doubt aware, your watch is off duty at the moment, and as far as I am aware, he would not be required to report what he does in his free time."
    r "想必您也清楚，现在并非您的值班时间，而且据我所知，他也没有义务汇报自己空闲时做了什么吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13102
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2be55a8a:

    # a "You know that I am well aware of that. However, given the recruit's current status, it should come as no surprise that the crew needs to be aware of what he is doing to avoid any further incidents."
    a "您当然很清楚这一点。只不过，考虑到这新兵目前的状况，为了避免再出什么岔子，船员们有必要了解他在做什么，这应该不奇怪吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13104
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9349c02a:

    # r "I have been given no such directive. Rest assured, however, all Mr. [family_name] has been assigned with are cleaning duties."
    r "我没有收到过这样的指示。不过您放心，[family_name]先生领到的都是清洁的活儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13106
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5b5f1af4:

    # r "Though I apologize for the mistake and hope you will consider this my official report of the recruit's assignment."
    r "不过我为刚才的疏忽致歉，并希望您能将此视为我对这名新兵派差的正式汇报。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13108
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6b9513d3:

    # r "Now, what can I help you with?"
    r "现在，我能帮您什么忙吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13110
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a7d8ebfe:

    # a "After all this time I would have expected you to have a better understanding of how this ship is run."
    a "这么长时间了，我还以为您早就摸清这艘船的规矩了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13112
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6c9d63cf:

    # r "Sir, with all due respect, Mr. [family_name] has been assigned to {i}clean up{/i}. I do not see how that would in any way be cause for concern or require an immediate report."
    r "先生，恕我冒昧，[family_name]先生只是负责{i}清洁{/i}。我实在看不出这有什么好担心的，或者说需要立刻汇报的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13116
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_24d46fe9:

    # "You can see the officer's jaw tighten before his response."
    "你可以看到那位军官的下巴绷紧了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13118
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fb4686b1:

    # a "Do you really see no problem in allowing him access to the surgeon's cabin and the ship's medical supplies, Ms. al-Maghribi?"
    a "al-Maghribi女士，您真觉得让他随便进出外科医生的舱室，接触船上的医疗物资，没问题吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13120
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_daf6547b:

    # r "In fact, I do not see the problem, Officer."
    r "事实上，我不觉得有问题，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13122
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_33ec6ea3:

    # r "{i}Cleaning,{/i} Arthur.{w} He is busy cleaning."
    r "{i}清洁{/i}，Arthur。{w} 他只是在打扫卫生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13127
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c9a921b6:

    # "Arthur closes his eyes and takes a deep breath. He reaches for his cuff and straightens it."
    "Arthur闭上眼睛，深吸一口气。他伸手拉了拉袖口，把它弄平整。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13129
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_864cee83:

    # a "Ms. al-Maghribi, I would suggest that you hold your tongue and not try to undermine my authority, but...{w} be that as it may, his presence makes things easier."
    a "al-Maghribi女士，我劝您谨言慎行，不要试图挑战我的权威，但是…{w} 就算这样，他在这里也方便一些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13131
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_79e23cae:

    # r "How so?"
    r "怎么说？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13133
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_582458f9:

    # a "I was looking for you to oversee the punishment of Mr. [family_name]."
    a "我来找您是为了监督对[family_name]先生的惩罚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13142
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1f6516c4:

    # "Your breath catches in your throat, and you shoot Rajeeyah an anxious glance."
    "你倒吸一口凉气，焦虑地看了Rajeeyah一眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13151
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_66da403f:

    # p "Punishment?! For what?!"
    p "惩罚？！为了什么？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13153
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2f407615:

    # "You blurt out, unable to keep quiet anymore. You know well enough how punishments are said to be carried out on sailing ships."
    "你忍不住脱口而出，再也憋不住了。你太清楚在这航船上，所谓的“惩罚”都是怎么执行的了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13155
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c15bd510:

    # a "You should be well aware of the reasons, recru-"
    a "你该明白是为了什么，新兵——"

# game/script day12.rpy:13163
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5a01d65b:

    # r "Punishment for what, Mr. Hudson?{p}If I may be permitted the question, as the surgeon who is to oversee the procedure."
    r "Hudson先生，请问是为了什么惩罚？{p}如果可以的话，请允许我，作为负责监督行刑的外科医生，问一句。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13167
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2ca82e63:

    # "Another deep sigh escapes the horse's nostrils, this time with a clearer hint of annoyance in it."
    "又一声叹息从他鼻孔里重重地喷出来，这次带着更明显的恼火。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13169
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b22ea737:

    # a "Punishment for failing to perform his duties."
    a "这是对他玩忽职守的惩罚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13171
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4c6b8301:

    # "Rajeeyah was about to speak, but Arthur cut her off."
    "Rajeeyah刚想开口，就被Arthur打断了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13173
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3bf8062b:

    # a "Ms. al-Maghribi.{w} Rajeeyah.{w} Failure to perform his duties, {i}and{/i} endangering the crew."
    a "al-Maghribi女士，{w}Rajeeyah，{w}玩忽职守，{i}还{/i}危害船员安全。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13175
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4bdf022e:

    # a "Leave the room, recruit. I'll pick you up outside as soon as I'm done talking to the Doctor."
    a "新兵，你先出去。我跟医生谈完就去找你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13177
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_85ac9a12:

    # "He gives the order in a stern enough tone that you only barely dared to ask for clarification."
    "他语气严厉地下达命令，你连问都不敢多问一句。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13179
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_99ab8cd0:

    # p "In front of the door?"
    p "在门外等着？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13183
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e89c3d26:

    # a "Where else!" with hpunch
    a "不然咧！" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:13190
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1d0b300f:

    # "As if you weren't present for the past few seconds, the next thing you remember is finding yourself outside of the room, closing the door behind you."
    "仿佛过去几秒钟你整个人灵魂出窍了一般，等你回过神来，自己已经站在门外，顺手带上了舱门。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13194
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_95b8ba42:

    # "Your knees feel weak as the door closes behind you and you sink against the wall. Slowly, you slide down to sit on the floor and let your head sink into your palms."
    "舱门在身后关上的刹那，你双膝一软，背靠着舱壁滑坐下来。你缓缓瘫坐在地板上，把头深埋进双掌之间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13201
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8ddbe776:

    # "From bad to terrible to somehow even worse."
    "真是坏事变糟糕，糟糕透顶，简直没法更糟了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13203
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_698e6edf:

    # "What would it be? Flogging?{w} Being locked up somewhere?{w} He might as well throw you overboard at this point..."
    "接下来会是什么？抽鞭子？{w} 还是关禁闭？{w} 说不定他现在就把我扔海里喂鱼了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13205
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d2b2992f:

    # "If only you had someone here to help you."
    "要是这时候有个人能帮帮我就好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13207
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_55ccd17e:

    # "Family... Friends..."
    "家人... 朋友..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13209
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9641917b:

    # "But it's just you."
    "可只有我一个人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13211
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c5f57335:

    # a "I expected more respect from you, Rajeeyah."
    a "我本以为你会更尊重我，Rajeeyah。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13213
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_045bbf7a:

    # "The officer's voice echoes from inside, making it through the wooden wall you are leaning against."
    "长官的声音从房间里传出来，穿透了你靠着的木墙，听得一清二楚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13215
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_38125bfb:

    # r "Mr. Hudson, wh-"
    r "Hudson先生，我..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13217
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_12a3ca37:

    # a "You may drop the formalities when we're speaking in private."
    a "私下里就不用讲那些虚礼了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13219
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_122723b7:

    # r "You just asked for more respect."
    r "你刚才还说要更尊重你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13221
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_d08d1cd9:

    # r "Why are you asking to punish him, Mr. Hudson?"
    r "Hudson先生，你为什么要惩罚他？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13223
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c8c865e2:

    # a "Did I not make myself clear?"
    a "我说得还不够明白吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13228
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8d4c460e:

    # "You let your head dip back against the wood, straining to hear their conversation better."
    "你把头靠在木墙上，竖起耳朵，想听清楚他们到底在说什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13230
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5b7d2cf7:

    # r "You ordered his dismissal from the ship at the next port, is that not punishment enough?"
    r "你不是已经下令在下一个港口解雇他了吗？这还不够吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13232
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0443a8af:

    # a "He jeopardized the ship's and the crew's safety!"
    a "他置船只和船员的安全于不顾！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13234
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_471fb3fb:

    # r "He is exhausted."
    r "他已经筋疲力尽了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13236
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_71bac47f:

    # a "So are the others. Because of {i}his{/i} mistake."
    a "其他人也是，都是因为{i}他的{/i}失误。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13238
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6f5d65ec:

    # r "I am not talking about his physical condition, Mr. Hudson."
    r "我说的不是他的身体状况，Hudson先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13240
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1200caa6:

    # a "Then he needs to toughen up if he wants to make it as a sailor."
    a "如果他想当水手，就得变得更强硬。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13242
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e42b7541:

    # r "He is exhausted because of you."
    r "他是因为你才累成这样的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13244
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_303c542e:

    # a "Rajeeyah, I did not come to you today to criticize my command."
    a "拉杰雅，我今天来不是为了质疑你的管辖。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13246
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_66f9e02e:

    # r "My criticism is not directed at the Officer, Mr. Hudson, but at you, as my friend, Arthur."
    r "我的指责并非针对身为长官的哈德逊先生，而是针对作为我朋友的你，Arthur。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13248
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a01f06aa:

    # r "I had heard what the man said about you, but now that I see it firsthand, I really must question your thinking behind it."
    r "我早就听说了那人对你的评价，现在亲眼所见，我不得不质疑你这么做的理由。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13250
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_60a17193:

    # r "You dismiss him from the ship, and now you come to me to order an even more severe punishment for him?"
    r "你把他赶下船，现在又来找我，要对他施加更重的惩罚？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13252
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_69a048ca:

    # a "He fell asleep on his watch, and led the ship right into a storm with barely any warning! Do I really need to repeat myself?"
    a "他值班的时候睡着了，几乎没发出警告就把船开进了暴风雨！还要我再说一遍吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13254
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_958796ad:

    # a "He's been aboard for barely two weeks and already has a longer record than most of the veterans in the crew."
    a "他上船才两个星期，黑历史都比船上的老兵多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13256
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a7e28d02:

    # a "Do you not understand it, Rajeeyah? There are few things that keep this ship from falling apart, and I'm not talking about the nails in the planks."
    a "你不明白吗，拉杰雅？能让这艘船不分崩离析的原因不多，我说的可不是木板上的钉子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13258
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c0d78065:

    # a "It is the dedication and discipline of the men."
    a "是弟兄们的忠诚和纪律。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13260
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_81e72e00:

    # a "Their sweat and blood that keeps these men alive."
    a "是他们的汗水和鲜血，才让大家活了下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13262
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a21133cd:

    # a "Nothing else."
    a "没有别的了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13264
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fbe20114:

    # a "And I will not accept anyone who puts my men in danger."
    a "我绝不容忍任何人让我的弟兄们身处险境。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13266
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bab9c2f8:

    # "There is a moment of silence between the two, but it's not difficult to imagine Arthur's glare."
    "两人沉默片刻，我仿佛能看到Arthur的怒视。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13268
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3ed61a5d:

    # "Rajeeyah finally breaks the silence, soft but firm."
    "拉杰雅终于打破了沉默，声音不大，却很坚定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13270
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_475ca541:

    # r "Arthur."
    r "Arthur。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13272
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_23953203:

    # r "And now you want to whip him, too?"
    r "现在你还想鞭打他？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13274
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c61b202f:

    # a "This is a lesson he must learn!"
    a "这是他必须吸取的教训！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13276
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1e09d304:

    # "He retorts sharply."
    "他厉声反驳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13278
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6b10d2f5:

    # a "A harsh lesson, I will grant you, but one he must learn nonetheless."
    a "我承认这教训是严酷了点，但他必须得记住。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13280
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_337234d6:

    # r "Arthur, learn what?"
    r "Arthur，要学什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13282
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a83c8483:

    # r "That an esteemed officer can be so blinded by his own past that he repeats the same mistakes, only because he is still unable to accept the past?"
    r "好一位受人尊敬的长官，竟能被自己的过往彻底蒙蔽双眼，仅仅因为无法释怀过去，就重蹈覆辙吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13284
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ee66d14b:

    # a "Raj-!"
    a "拉杰——！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13286
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_77138317:

    # r "He is being driven to exhaustion."
    r "他快要被你逼垮了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13288
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f08685bc:

    # r "By you."
    r "被你逼的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13290
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f8a79555:

    # r "He was never going to be a danger to anyone on this ship, but you've made him one by pushing him to the point where he's becoming a liability."
    r "他原本不会对船上任何人构成威胁，但你把他逼到极限，让他成了一个累赘。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13292
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_10dbba56:

    # r "This is not the way for him to learn anything, least of all how to perform his duties safely."
    r "这样他什么都学不到，更别提如何安全地履行职责了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13294
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7ae66b4f:

    # a "Raj-"
    a "拉杰——"

# game/script day12.rpy:13296
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_bec8201e:

    # r "Arthur, do you want him to kill someone?"
    r "Arthur，你想让他杀人吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13298
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_5a4cb701:

    # r "Because, by your own admission, you almost did."
    r "因为你自己也承认，你差点就这么做了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13300
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2d8ce257:

    # a "Rajeeyah, I respect your right to disagree with me any day, but don't you dare put my lucidity into question!"
    a "拉杰雅，我尊重你随时反对我的权利，但你别想质疑我的判断力！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13302
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_c6d07bf4:

    # a "Suggestions like that are dangerously close to being mutinous, and you know that we cannot tolerate even a trace of it."
    a "你这种话都快要构成叛变了，你知道我们绝不能容忍任何一丝叛变的苗头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13304
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0433408e:

    # a "So I would strongly advise you to think twice about what you are implying."
    a "所以我劝你最好好好想想你刚才说的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13306
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_7a5ebe00:

    # r "And then what? Are you going to flog me, too?"
    r "然后呢？你也要抽我？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13308
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_ac95a329:

    # r "Is that how you want to solve it?"
    r "你想动粗是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13310
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fb36beb1:

    # "Another pause in their conversation, and you turn your head to press your ear against the wooden surface."
    "他们的谈话又一次停了下来，你转过头，把耳朵紧紧贴在木板上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13312
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_a6d7f133:

    # "But try as you might, you cannot hear anything else."
    "但你再怎么努力，也听不到其他动静。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13314
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_18efa1f6:

    # "Complete silence."
    "一片死寂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13322
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6a6bff27:

    # "Only broken when the door suddenly opens and you immediately pull your head away from the wall."
    "突然，门被猛地打开，这份寂静瞬间被打破，你赶紧把头从墙上挪开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13328
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2bf773f4:

    # "Arthur emerges without sparing you a single glance. In an instant, he turns the corner and briskly disappears up the stairs."
    "Arthur走了出来，甚至懒得看你一眼。他立刻转过身，匆匆走上了楼梯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13332
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_98720c2f:

    # p "Sir?"
    p "先生？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13336
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_41962db1:

    # "You want to slap yourself for speaking up, but to your relief, he doesn't appear to be paying you any attention."
    "你真想给自己一巴掌，怪自己多嘴，还好他压根没注意到你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13341
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3ac4746e:

    # "Once he's out of sight on the deck above, you push yourself to your feet and approach the door with cautious steps."
    "等他从上面的甲板消失后，你这才站起身，小心地挪到门边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13349
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_410e0415:

    # "Afraid to peek past the barrier of the wall, you will yourself to do it and come face-to-face with Rajeeyah."
    "你很害怕，但还是强迫自己鼓起勇气，从墙后探出头，结果和Rajeeyah撞了个正着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13354
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4408ebc2:

    # "Her expression relaxes as she notices you, and she slowly sits down on the bed behind her."
    "看到是你，她的表情放松下来，然后慢慢地在身后的床上坐下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13356
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_76b79caa:

    # p "Where is he going?"
    p "他要去哪里？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13358
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_2f6593e9:

    # r "I assume up to his cabin to reflect, hopefully."
    r "我猜是回他自己的船舱反思去了，希望如此吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13360
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_4363df2f:

    # p "I don't have to follow him, do I?"
    p "我不用跟着他吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13362
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_0e493581:

    # "She shakes her head."
    "她摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13370
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_525139d5:

    # "You go back into the cabin, and softly let the door slide into its lock."
    "你回到船舱，轻轻地把门带上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13372
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_81ad7e77:

    # p "I suppose I owe you my thanks."
    p "我应该谢谢你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13374
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6c014f98:

    # p "For saving me from a few scars across my back."
    p "谢谢你让我免了挨几鞭子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13376
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_aa700603:

    # "Despite your exchange, Rajeeyah appears distant, not focusing on your words."
    "尽管你们在交谈，Rajeeyah却显得若有所思，并没有专心听你说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13378
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8b44b568:

    # r "Though I probably should..."
    r "虽然我可能应该..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13380
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_992bb2c6:

    # p "I'm sorry?"
    p "嗯？你说啥？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13382
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_e79cc1b6:

    # r "I should follow him."
    r "我应该去跟着他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13390
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_9a146890:

    # "She jumps up from the bed and rushes out the door."
    "她猛地从床上跳起来，冲出了门外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13394
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_1d927f5b:

    # "And just like that you are alone again."
    "你又只剩一个人了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13396
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_681c63e2:

    # "What a close call..."
    "真是好险..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13398
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_fb4841a2:

    # "Whatever she did looks to have saved your ass."
    "不管她做了什么，看来是救了你狗命。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13400
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_33d55692:

    # "You listen to her footsteps rattle the wood as she hurries to the deck above."
    "你听着她的脚步声，木板被踩得砰砰作响，她正匆匆赶往上层甲板。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13402
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_22beda2b:

    # "Once she's out of earshot, you realize that you probably have no business being in this room without her."
    "等她走远听不见动静后，你才意识到没有她在场，你恐怕根本没资格呆在这间医务舱里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13407
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_b4809b67:

    # "A slow step takes you to the door and allows you to peek through it."
    "你慢慢蹭到门边，小心翼翼地往外看。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13409
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eec70e84:

    # "A mostly empty corridor. Barely a soul in sight, and suddenly the surroundings feel so quiet."
    "走廊空荡荡的。几乎看不到人影，四周静得出奇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13411
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8d9b19ad:

    # "No stern voice directed at you."
    "没人冲你嚷嚷。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13413
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f507d1c4:

    # "You probably should leave..."
    "你最好还是离开..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13415
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_6dd6e017:

    # "But...{w}do you?"
    "但...你真走了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13424
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_3c4552b9:

    # "Another step takes you out of the door. Without the key to lock it, you pull it shut until it clicks into place."
    "你又往前走了一步，离开了房间。没有钥匙，你只能把门拉上，直到咔哒一声关紧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13426
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_387ebd00:

    # "You glance down both sides of the corridor, but few people are down here, and those who are don't seem to be paying you any attention."
    "你朝走廊两头扫了一眼，没几个人，就算有，也没人注意你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13428
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_24a20226:

    # "That's good enough for you; you hope everyone assumes the door is locked, as usual."
    "这样就够了，你希望大家都以为门已经像往常一样锁好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13435
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_52cbe9c9:

    # "Perhaps you could share it with someone."
    "也许你可以找个人一起分享。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13437
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f4eb4cdd:

    # "Might be nice after everything that happened today."
    "经历了今天这些事，或许这样也不错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13442
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_8e054b2f:

    # "You quickly check to make sure Rajeeyah isn't coming back, then slip over to the cupboard where the wine bottles are kept."
    "你赶紧回头看看Rajeeyah有没有回来，然后溜到放酒的柜子旁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13446
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_178d0d97:

    # "Who will notice one missing bottle?"
    "谁会发现少了一瓶酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13448
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_cd064007:

    # "And even if they did, who would assume you nicked it rather than attributing it to a simple clerical error?"
    "就算他们真发现了，又有谁会怀疑是你顺手牵羊，而不是把它归咎于一次简单的记账疏忽呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13452
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_f090ed33:

    # "The bottle disappears into your shirt, and satisfied with your little gift, you step out the door. Without the key to lock it, you pull it shut until it clicks into place."
    "你把酒瓶塞进衬衫里，心满意足地带着这份小礼物走出了房门。没有钥匙，你只能把门拉上，直到咔哒一声关紧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13454
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_387ebd00_1:

    # "You glance down both sides of the corridor, but few people are down here, and those who are don't seem to be paying you any attention."
    "你朝走廊两头扫了一眼，没几个人，就算有，也没人注意你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13456
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_24a20226_1:

    # "That's good enough for you; you hope everyone assumes the door is locked, as usual."
    "这样就够了，你希望大家都以为门已经像往常一样锁好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13487
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_892f1f60:

    # p "I can't, Torres."
    p "我不行，Torres。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13489
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2c78c2c5:

    # "You say, in an almost whispered voice, barely audible over the howling wind."
    "你几乎是耳语着，声音小到几乎被呼啸的风声盖过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13499
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c0efba0c:

    # p "I'm trying to be on my best behavior, and the first mate will chew me out again if he comes by."
    p "我正努力好好表现呢，要是被大副看见，又要挨训了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13501
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ca88f190:

    # t "Come on, just give it a little pat on the head."
    t "拜托，摸摸它脑袋总行了吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13503
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_18404847:

    # p "What? There's no way I'm going near that thing!"
    p "什么？我才不会靠近那玩意儿！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13505
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4bbe12d7:

    # p "Don't you see how massive it is?"
    p "你没看到它有多大吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13509
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c35ee039:

    # t "So? Big birds give you the flutters?"
    t "怎么，你怕大鸟啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13511
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6ed6e8a2:

    # p "Big birds that are prone to attack me, yes."
    p "我怕动不动就攻击我的大鸟，这有什么问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13513
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ff0d1b90:

    # "You eye the beast warily. It's hunched over, with its wings tucked tightly to its body and its beak open menacingly, sending a hiss in your direction."
    "你提心吊胆地盯着那只野兽。它弓着身子，翅膀紧紧收拢，张开的鸟喙看起来很吓人，还朝你发出了嘶嘶的叫声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13515
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_a938267a:

    # "You step back to put some distance between you and the bird, only to have the bird follow you aggressively."
    "你退后几步，想和它拉开距离，结果那鸟却穷追不舍。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13519
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_35eff226:

    # "With feline quickness, you spring back as it moves and leap to safety." with vpunch
    "你像猫一样敏捷地跳开，躲到安全的地方。" with vpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:13521
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1bc02ddc:

    # p "Ah, shit!"
    p "靠！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13523
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_a6aa3713:

    # p "What even is this thing anyway?"
    p "这玩意儿到底是个什么东西？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13527
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_92ef1f1e:

    # t "Why are you asking me?"
    t "你问我干嘛？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13529
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d19e88ea:

    # t "Do I look like an expert?"
    t "我看起来像个专家吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13531
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_10c26c4c:

    # p "An expert on birds?"
    p "鸟类专家？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13533
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8f111a96:

    # p "Yeah.{w} You do."
    p "没错，你就是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13537
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_242b7b31:

    # t "It's an osprey."
    t "这是只鱼鹰。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13539
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_cc1bf213:

    # t "Must have gotten caught in the storm, perhaps.{w} Certainly looks tired."
    t "大概是被困在暴风雨里了吧。{w} 瞧着真够呛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13544
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0a435683:

    # "Torres kneels down carefully, raindrops dripping from the brim of his hat. He tips his head to the side to inspect the osprey further."
    "Torres小心地跪下来，雨水顺着帽檐往下滴。他歪着头，仔细地打量着那只鹗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13546
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_19eca242:

    # t "He's probably been fighting it for a while. Poor lad."
    t "他八成已经硬撑好一阵子了。可怜的孩子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13548
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_62a6d248:

    # p "Lad? Can you tell?"
    p "家伙？这你都能看出来？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13550
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5374ace0:

    # t "No. I'm just guessing."
    t "瞎猜的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13552
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_37a48c5d:

    # t "Could be a lass, for all I know."
    t "说不定还是个小丫头呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13554
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0e5f57a5:

    # p "Somehow that's even stranger now that I think about it."
    p "我这么一想，感觉更不对劲了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13556
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8e205c16:

    # p "You really can't tell?"
    p "你真看不出来？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13558
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e0d5f4ab:

    # "You watch Torres' wet feathers shift as you earn a puzzled look from him."
    "你盯着Torres湿漉漉的羽毛，他则一脸疑惑地看着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13560
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_cda30fa8:

    # p "I shouldn't have asked, should I?"
    p "我是不是不该问啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13565
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_58b20818:

    # t "I would have preferred if you hadn't."
    t "我倒希望你没问。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13569
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2e1323c0:

    # t "Unless you want an in-depth anatomy lesson right now."
    t "除非你现在想来一堂深入的解剖教学。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13573
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7d0cf11f:

    # p "You know, the last anatomy lesson I had wasn't really that bad, but I think I can do without this time."
    p "倒也不是不行，不过这次就算了吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13575
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f1f5234e:

    # p "Not that you're, you know, a bad teacher or anything."
    p "也不是说你教得不好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13577
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_86a591d6:

    # p "I assume... Of course I wouldn't know fo-"
    p "我是说...我当然不知-"

# game/script day12.rpy:13579
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_624cf16f:

    # p "Just...{w} Sorry, forget what I said."
    p "算了...{w}当我没说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13583
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e81087e7:

    # "He looks at you like were speaking Spanish."
    "他看着你，仿佛你在跟他说西班牙语一样听不懂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13585
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6046302b:

    # "Or Polish, perhaps.{w} Whatever language Torres wouldn't actually understand."
    "或波兰语也说不定？{w} 反正就是Torres听不懂的语言。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13588
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3f4a41bb:

    # p "I can do without."
    p "还是免了吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13592
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3c6186e7:

    # p "So, uh..."
    p "所以，呃..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13594
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_68d7310c:

    # p "You know, never mind, I think I should get back to work anyway."
    p "没事了，我还是回去干活吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13599
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5e3ba6ff:

    # s "Yo, catch." with hpunch
    s "嘿，接着。" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:13610
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_914843d4:

    # "You turn your attention to Samuel's voice just in time to reflexively catch the blurry object [he] had hurled your way."
    "你听到Samuel的声音，赶紧转过头，下意识地接住了他扔过来的那玩意儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13615
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_afad7d4d:

    # "Whatever it is, it lands wetly in your paw and begins to drip oil down your wrist."
    "不管是啥，湿乎乎地糊在你爪子上，油直往你手腕上滴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13624
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_44ad40e9:

    # s "Nicely done."
    s "好样的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13626
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_98bb84e3:

    # p "An old fish?"
    p "一条臭鱼？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13630
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d33f5af3:

    # p "What am I supposed to do with an old fish?"
    p "给我一条臭鱼干嘛？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13632
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_855ae644:

    # p "Or is this your way of telling me that you harbor some stereotypes about cats?"
    p "还是说，你其实对猫有什么刻板印象？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13636
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6dcd0f39:

    # s "Not for you, you muzzy."
    s "不是给你的，你这糊涂蛋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13638
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_88c46aa8:

    # "Samuel gestures animatedly in the direction of the osprey."
    "Samuel朝鹗的方向一个劲儿地打手势。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13642
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f2dc689b:

    # s "For that lad."
    s "就为了那小子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13644
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3621b10d:

    # "You're looking at the osprey, who watches the fish with curiosity, but remains aggressive toward anything that comes near."
    "你瞧那只鱼鹰，盯着鱼看的时候倒是挺好奇，但只要有东西靠近，它就凶得很。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13646
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_81b28e5d:

    # p "For him?"
    p "为了他？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13648
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_800f02a6:

    # p "You have to be kidding!"
    p "你开什么玩笑呢！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13650
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c387bec7:

    # p "Sure, I'll hand it the fish and my whole paw right with it."
    p "我是疯了吗，把鱼带爪子一起喂它？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13652
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b4ff1666:

    # p "I'm sure he'll appreciate the extra serving of delicious cat."
    p "我看它倒是挺乐意再加一份美味猫肉的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13656
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1a74a9a9:

    # s "He sure will if you keep screaming at him."
    s "你要是再冲它嚷嚷，它肯定更乐意了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13658
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_74a0f00b:

    # s "You have to be calm."
    s "你得冷静点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13660
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_fe83d729:

    # s "Look how scared it is."
    s "瞧它吓成什么样了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13662
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f908d3ad:

    # "The osprey huddles down, feathers puffing as it lets out another angry scream."
    "鱼鹰缩着脖子，炸着毛，又是一声怒吼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13666
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_333bbb4f:

    # s "I'll tell you what..."
    s "这样吧..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13668
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_793f0166:

    # s "Two days' pay if you can feed it."
    s "你要是能喂了它，我给你两天的工钱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13670
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9cacdc9a:

    # s "Just throwing the fish doesn't count. You have to feed it, calmly, from your hand or something."
    s "光扔鱼可不算。你得用手，或者别的什么东西，心平气和地喂它才行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13675
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_084ffefb:

    # "Samuel holds out [his] hand and waits for you to shake on the bet."
    "Samuel 伸出手，等着跟你握手定下这赌约。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13677
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f8c2f366:

    # p "Days of your pay, or mine?"
    p "赌你几天的工钱，还是我的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13679
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_85e60e37:

    # s "Yours, of course."
    s "当然是你的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13681
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c6049675:

    # p "Not worth it."
    p "不划算。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13683
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_04c7e763:

    # p "For two days of an officer's pay, I {i}might{/i} consider it."
    p "要是拿军官两天的薪俸来换，我{i}或许{/i}还会考虑考虑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13685
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c8be9011:

    # p "Might."
    p "考虑考虑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13690
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4caf117e:

    # s "Absolutely not."
    s "绝对不要。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13692
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4b74b505:

    # s "That's probably more than you make in a month!"
    s "那估计比你一个月挣得都多！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13694
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_73a5cfa8:

    # s "I'm not betting that much on something so easy."
    s "我才不会拿这么大的赌注去赌这么显而易见的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13698
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b9ffa998:

    # p "Easy?"
    p "小事儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13700
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_aa7d9b4d:

    # t "I'd do it."
    t "我来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13704
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_17df2295:

    # p "Because you're you. You would probably be able to start a flock with it if you tried."
    p "谁让你是“你”呢。你要是想，说不定都能跟它搭伙过日子了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13706
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7c715033:

    # p "No, I'm not doing it for that little."
    p "不，这么点钱，我不干。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13710
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1280b184:

    # p "If you think it's {i}so easy{/i}, then you do it, Sam."
    p "你要是觉得{i}这么简单{/i}，那你自己来，Sam。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13712
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0d34b6a5:

    # "You throw the fish back to Samuel with a casual flick of your wrist."
    "你手腕一甩，就把鱼扔回给了 Samuel。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13716
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_45ca87b8:

    # "[He] catches it effortlessly and tosses it in the air to do it once more."
    "他轻轻松松地接住，又抛到空中，玩了起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13720
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7a95663c:

    # s "I'll do it.{w} Easy."
    s "我来！{w} 小菜一碟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13722
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d6944f5d:

    # s "It's just a bird."
    s "不就是只鸟嘛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13724
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4b7f7b11:

    # s "Oversized, maybe, but still a bird."
    s "体型是大了点，但说到底还不是只鸟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13726
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_cfff95c0:

    # s "How about it, Torres?"
    s "怎么样，Torres？你敢不敢上？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13728
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7408f3e6:

    # s "If he doesn't want do it, do you want to bet against me and lose your pay?"
    s "如果他怂了不敢上，你敢跟我赌一把吗？输了可要扣工资。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13732
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4a2be883:

    # t "Self-assured as ever."
    t "还是一如既往的自信啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13734
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5b0ff278:

    # t "Two days?"
    t "两天？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13736
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c079cc2c:

    # s "Two days."
    s "两天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13738
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4242474e:

    # t "Deal."
    t "成交。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13740
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0b642cc4:

    # "He agrees with a clack of his beak."
    "它咔哒一声，用鸟喙表示同意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13744
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_058cfcbf:

    # s "Sweet! Fortune favors the bold, as they say."
    s "好！正如他们所说，幸运女神眷顾勇者。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13746
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_826e65e1:

    # t "How about not using your hands, Sam?"
    t "要不这样，Sam，别用手？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13750
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_06ec3a6e:

    # s "Not {i}that{/i} bold, Torres."
    s "Torres，我可没{i}那么{/i}大胆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13752
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_37debb26:

    # s "How am I supposed to hold the fish if not with my hands?"
    s "不用手我怎么拿鱼啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13756
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e6c7105b:

    # t "You have teeth, don't you?"
    t "你不是有牙吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13758
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_af73841d:

    # s "I do."
    s "认识。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13760
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2ad60214:

    # s "Teeth, along with eyes—which I value."
    s "牙齿，还有眼睛——这两样我可都很珍惜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13764
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f4f73e74:

    # s "I don't know if you've ever looked in a mirror—never mind, we all know how hard it is to pull yourself away from one."
    s "我不知道你有没有照过镜子——算了，我们都知道你有多离不开镜子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13766
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2fb976a2:

    # "Torres brings his hands up to adjust his soaked cravat."
    "Torres抬手，整理着他湿透的领巾。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13768
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f567bfa2:

    # t "No need to be rude, Sam. {i}Someone{/i} on this ship has to look presentable."
    t "Sam，没必要人身攻击吧。这船上总得有{i}个{/i}能见人的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13772
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8e206509:

    # s "I look plenty fine, Torres, thank you very much."
    s "我好得很呢，Torres，多谢关照。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13774
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_dcc0c254:

    # "Samuel replies with a short and sweet shake of the head."
    "Samuel干脆地摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13778
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f3da230a:

    # s "But anyway, teeth and eyes which are dangerously close together."
    s "总之，牙齿和眼睛离那么近，太冒险了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13780
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_613a6d71:

    # p "See? Not so easy all of a sudden, is it, Mr. 'Oh, it's just a bird'?"
    p "怎么样，现在知道不好办了吧？“区区一只鸟”先生？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13782
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_753f5949:

    # t "I have to agree with the greenie. Sounds to me like you're chickening out, Sam?"
    t "我同意新来的说法。Sam，你这是要当逃兵吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13786
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1bfae857:

    # s "No."
    s "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13788
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1ff9db1d:

    # s "I just value my eyesight."
    s "我只是爱惜我的眼睛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13792
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2cffaa31:

    # t "It might go for your nose."
    t "它说不定会直接啄你的鼻子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13794
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_23954a17:

    # p "Yeah, if anything, it would be an advantage to get rid of it."
    p "是啊，真要能摆脱它，也算是个好处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13800
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_bb921e64:

    # p "Just think, never having to endure the stench of the bilge ever again."
    p "想想看，以后再也不用闻到污水舱的臭味了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13802
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_066237b6:

    # s "Unless it doesn't and blinds me instead."
    s "除非它不啄鼻子，直接把我弄瞎了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13807
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2d1f6a4b:

    # k "Not man enough, got it."
    k "不敢啊，明白了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13817
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d152e582:

    # "The older Lynx joins you lot, arms crossed and a smirk playing on his lips."
    "老林克斯走了过来，加入你们，他抱着胳膊，嘴角带着一丝坏笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13824
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_de62febc:

    # k "First daring the young lad to do it, but then being afraid of a little bird yourself."
    k "一开始怂恿小伙子去，结果自己反倒怕一只小鸟了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13828
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_bf504449:

    # s "A little bird with talons the size of my fingers."
    s "这小鸟的爪子，都快赶上我的手指头大了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13832
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_40fdaa4f:

    # k "You can always run to the surgeon if the widdle bird gives you an ouchie."
    k "要是被这小不点儿啄疼了，随时找医生去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13836
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_549f1a85:

    # "Samuel glares at Konrad and seems to be about to throw the fish at him."
    "Samuel 狠狠地瞪着Konrad，看起来真要拿鱼砸他了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13838
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_aac3ab23:

    # s "Oh fuck off!{w} Fine, I'll show you 'not man enough.'"
    s "滚你的蛋！{w} 行，我就让你瞧瞧，老子到底行不行！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13847
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_fba32e53:

    # "Rather than throwing it, Samuel opens [his] lips and gently takes the fish between [his] teeth."
    "Samuel 没把鱼扔出去，反而张开嘴，轻轻用牙叼住了鱼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13851
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2b0f79a2:

    # s "The things I do for you guys..."
    s "为了你们这群家伙，我真是啥都干得出来..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13853
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9daaea0e:

    # "[His] voice comes out muffled as [he] speaks, careful not to drop the slippery thing."
    "他嘴里叼着鱼，含含糊糊地说着，生怕那滑溜溜的家伙掉下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13855
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d9e8c1fa:

    # p "Just be careful, Sam."
    p "小心点，Sam。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13861
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_12b55fea:

    # s "Careful? No need to, this'll be {i}easy{/i}."
    s "小心？用不着，这事儿{i}简单{/i}得很。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13863
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1fce2d6e:

    # s "It wants the stupid fish so it can have it."
    s "这家伙想要这条蠢鱼，想得都快疯了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13867
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d7f0b0ae:

    # s "Now sit back and watch a master at work."
    s "都给我坐好了，看大爷露一手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13869
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0220b38c:

    # "By now, more of the crew has gathered around the unusual guest."
    "这会儿，更多的船员都围了过来，看稀奇似的看着这位不速之客。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13888
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5b9c88ea:

    # "Samuel inches closer to the osprey, fish first, holding on to one of the lines for balance."
    "Samuel 一点点蹭近鱼鹰，先用鱼引诱，然后抓住绳子保持平衡。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13890
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_324c6eca:

    # "[His] clothes cling soggily to [his] body, rainwater dripping from [his] hair and down along the etched crevices that the determined focus left on [his] face."
    "他的衣服湿淋淋地贴在身上，雨水顺着头发滴落，在他那张因为过于专注而显得线条深刻的脸上蜿蜒流淌。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13897
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ccc82573:

    # "Torres leans in close with a smile on his beak and lowers his voice as much as the noise of the storm will allow."
    "Torres 咧着嘴凑了过来，压低嗓音，但暴风雨的声音太大，压低了也白搭。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13908
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_dbdf796d:

    # t "Watch this. This is gonna be good."
    t "看着吧，有好戏上演咯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13910
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f16cad2a:

    # p "I have a feeling that something is going to go wrong."
    p "我总觉得要出什么岔子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13912
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3d8906a0:

    # p "The thing is way too agitated."
    p "那家伙太躁动了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13914
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ef10698f:

    # t "You know, that {i}is{/i} the part where it gets good."
    t "你懂个屁，精彩的{i}就{/i}是这部分。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13916
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1548c599:

    # t "There's no way Samuel isn't going to get chased away by it."
    t "Samuel 肯定得被它撵得鸡飞狗跳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13918
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c800fba0:

    # k "How far do you think he'll have to run?"
    k "你们说他得跑多远？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13920
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_58997524:

    # t "At least to the main mast, maybe as far as the bow."
    t "至少跑到主桅杆那儿，搞不好得跑到船头去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13922
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3d3e2f85:

    # s "What are you tattling about over there?"
    s "你们在那儿嘀嘀咕咕啥呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13924
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6f9cbd01:

    # "[His] words are muffled by the fish in [his] maw."
    "他嘴里叼着鱼，说话含含糊糊的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13926
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e82a8e18:

    # p "Nothing!"
    p "没啥！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13928
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f7b80101:

    # k "Just keeping our supportive cheers quiet, Sam."
    k "我们这不是在小声给Sam 加油嘛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13930
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3faeb125:

    # k "Wouldn't want to go and scare the lad, would we?"
    k "可不能吓着他，是吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:13932
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_eed0efd0:

    # p "What he said."
    p "他说的对。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13934
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b1ea66e9:

    # p "You can do it Sam...{w} Wooo!"
    p "Sam，你能行的...{w} 喔！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13936
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_49664c90:

    # "The maned wolf rolls [his] eyes in such a wide arc that [his] whole head follows."
    "这只鬃狼翻了个白眼，那眼珠子转的，整个脑袋都跟着动了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13938
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b2235f91:

    # s "I have to concentrate over here. Keep ya gobs shut."
    s "我得集中精神。都别吵吵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13940
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9dc57b54:

    # p "Will do."
    p "好的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13942
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0087679c:

    # s "I said shut."
    s "说了闭嘴！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13944
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ce5d8654:

    # "All of a sudden, you could hear a pin drop as everyone present quieted down to allow Samuel to gather [his] full focus."
    "刹那间，全场鸦雀无声，掉根针都能听得见，在场的所有人都噤了声，好让Samuel能全神贯注。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13946
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d22214af:

    # "The only sound is the steady patter of rain against the wooden planks."
    "周围唯一的声响，便是雨水持续敲击在甲板木条上的噼啪声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13948
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2ac38b92:

    # "It looks like nobody wants to stoke Samuel's ire."
    "看来没人想触Samuel的霉头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13950
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_80191ffe:

    # "Well, almost silent. Every now and then, someone's stifled laugh breaks through the noise of the rainfall."
    "其实也不算完全安静。偶尔，还是能听到有人憋不住笑出声，但很快就被雨声盖过去了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13952
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7c347623:

    # "You watch with bated breath as [he] inches closer, the beast tipping its head to the side as it locks onto the fish's bobbing tail."
    "你屏住呼吸看着他慢慢靠近，那只鸟倾斜着头，锁定在鱼漂动的尾巴上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13954
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_a0c5e8b5:

    # "Barely half a foot now."
    "现在只有不到半英尺的距离了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13956
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e8720dbd:

    # "The line [he] is holding starts to lose its slack, and if [he] goes any further, [he]'ll have to let go."
    "他手里的线开始变松，再往前就得撒手了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13958
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c772f9b3:

    # "You start to get invested yourself, feeling your heartbeat quicken."
    "你自己也不由自主地跟着紧张起来，感到心跳悄然加速。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13960
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_dee7e09c:

    # p "Come on..."
    p "别废话了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13962
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2acbdc41:

    # p "Just take it already."
    p "倒是快吃啊！"

# game/script day12.rpy:13964
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_85351e86:

    # "You will Samuel on with a quiet whisper that's completely drowned out by the ambient noise."
    "你小声地给Samuel加油，声音完全被雨声盖住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13966
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_efe993ad:

    # "Carefully [he] lifts [his] palm from the planks to inch it forward a little more."
    "他小心地将他的手掌从木板上抬起，向前挪动了一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13968
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_fd1a017c:

    # "[His] tail twitched at every suggestion of the bird moving.{w} So much for being a master."
    "[His]的尾巴随着那只鸟的每一次微动而抽动。{w}还吹什么抓鸟行家呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13970
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_175f0df9:

    # "Sam, you scaredy cat."
    "Sam，你个怂货。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13972
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_671bdb74:

    # "Almost."
    "差不多吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13974
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6cc45aff:

    # "Almost..."
    "就差一点了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:13984
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0d62a2b9:

    # p "Ah! Sh-" with hpunch
    p "啊！Sh-" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:13986
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f41cc930:

    # "You feel something on your shoulder."
    "你感觉到肩膀上有什么东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13988
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8aa394f1:

    # "Your feet leave the deck for a moment as you jolt up into the air."
    "你吓得一哆嗦，脚都离了地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13990
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4f7e8122:

    # "A hand, you now realize."
    "是一只手，你现在才意识到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:13994
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_a76bf0f1:

    # p "Why on God's green earth would you-?!"
    p "你他妈想干什么？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14001
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6c645020:

    # "You snap around only to find the towering First Mate behind you, water dripping from the tip of his snout."
    "你猛然回过头，只见身材高大的大副正伫立在你身后，雨水顺着他的鼻尖不断滴落。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14003
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_19a88bd1:

    # p "Ah! Arth- I mean, sir." with vpunch
    p "啊！Arthur——我是说，长官。" with vpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:14005
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_726ba660:

    # a "I see that you and the others are taking it easy."
    a "我看你们都挺闲啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14007
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_73b98c57:

    # "Not him..."
    "不会吧…"

# game/script day12.rpy:14009
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f0595261:

    # "Were it not for the rain weighing it down, your fur would stand on end immediately."
    "要不是雨水打湿了毛，你的毛肯定立刻就竖起来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14011
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e219d3ad:

    # p "My apologies, I was just about to get back to work."
    p "抱歉，我这就回去干活。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14013
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c25ab757:

    # p "The group just was just-um,{w} blocking the cle-"
    p "大伙刚才只是……呃，{w}把羊角系缆栓给挡——"

# game/script day12.rpy:14015
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7852df62:

    # a "Quiet, Mr. [family_name]."
    a "安静，[family_name]先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14017
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9d469299:

    # "Fuck."
    "操。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14022
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_eb891a90:

    # "He turns on the spot and, with a short hand gesture, urges you to follow."
    "他原地转过身，简短地示意你跟上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14026
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_140d2557:

    # "You do, after casting a last glance back at the others."
    "在回头朝其他人投去最后一瞥后，你照他说的做了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14028
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b0d9c5bf:

    # "Everyone seems too caught up to take note of your departure."
    "大家都太投入了，似乎没人注意到你离开了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14030
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_447beb8c:

    # "Arthur leads you along the length of the ship until he finds a corner he deems secluded enough to talk."
    "Arthur 带着你走到船边，找到一个相对僻静的角落才停下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14042
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_22f42548:

    # p "My sincerest apologies, sir."
    p "实在抱歉，先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14044
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8b59d480:

    # p "I was just curious about the commotion."
    p "我只是好奇刚才发生了什么事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14046
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_fbe06ff3:

    # p "T-they gathered around something and-"
    p "他-他们好像围着什么东西-"

# game/script day12.rpy:14048
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7be82d51:

    # p "I would have returned to my work immediately, Sir."
    p "我本该立刻回去工作，先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14050
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d6d02a1f:

    # "He assesses you for a moment."
    "他上下打量了你一番。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14054
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c70a6086:

    # a "Stand up straight, recruit."
    a "站直了，新兵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14056
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7ae3f89d:

    # a "This is no way to present yourself."
    a "像你这样可不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14058
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7b55b3c3:

    # "Suddenly aware of your slumped posture, you square your shoulders and raise your chin, standing at attention."
    "你这才意识到自己站姿不正，连忙挺直腰板，抬起下巴，立正站好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14062
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_70f7d9f1:

    # a "Better."
    a "好多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14064
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2c396f0c:

    # a "This look suits you much more, Mr. [family_name]."
    a "你这样顺眼多了，[family_name]先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14066
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b3e05f81:

    # p "Th-thank you, sir."
    p "谢-谢谢你，先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14068
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_115763b7:

    # "Even over the rain, you can hear the thrumming of your heartbeat in your ears."
    "即使在风雨声中，你也能清晰地听到自己砰砰的心跳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14070
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_27e45245:

    # a "The storm almost makes you look the part of a proper sailor."
    a "这场暴风雨倒是让你有了几分水手的样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14072
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9557d6e6:

    # a "Almost."
    a "差不多吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14076
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_54d34968:

    # a "I would say that you are a little too..."
    a "我该说你稍微有些..."

# game/script day12.rpy:14078
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_cbfa562d:

    # a "How to put it..."
    a "怎么说呢..."

# game/script day12.rpy:14080
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_067499d8:

    # a "Pristine."
    a "太干净了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14084
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_25b287ee:

    # p "I may have brought too fine a set of attire with me, sir."
    p "我可能带了过于精良的行头，先生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14089
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_a2b97b22:

    # "He turns to the gunwale and runs his hand along the coarse fibers of a sheet secured around a belaying pin."
    "他转过身，面向舷墙，用手摩挲着系在系缆柱上的粗糙缆绳。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14093
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b478e3ed:

    # "Evidently dissatisfied with a previous sailor's work, he unties the rope and reattaches it with precise care."
    "他似乎对之前的水手工作不太满意，解开绳索，又一丝不苟地重新系了一遍。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14095
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_38f78db9:

    # p "May I ask why you wish to speak to me, sir?"
    p "我能问一下您找我有什么事吗，先生？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14097
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_119d4979:

    # a "What do you think of our surgeon?"
    a "你觉得我们的外科医生怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14100
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_aaba1473:

    # a "{cps=5000}What do you think of our surgeon?{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}你觉得我们的外科医生怎么样？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:14107
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_adc3e2cf:

    # "He nods."
    "他点点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14109
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_73c23a6c:

    # a "That she is."
    a "她的确是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14111
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_cafaf810:

    # a "You certainly could be making worse friends than her."
    a "你交她这个朋友可不算亏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14113
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_032a25e1:

    # a "A few years ago, I came upon a book most influential to me.{w} An account by a ship's surgeon, detailing the harsh conditions aboard vessels a century ago."
    a "几年前，我读到一本书，对我的影响非常大{w}，是一位船医写的，详细记录了一个世纪以前船上的那些苦日子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14115
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ed891db4:

    # a "Miserable conditions."
    a "真是苦不堪言。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14117
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8318d93e:

    # a "It was not uncommon for ships to lack a dedicated surgeon altogether."
    a "船上没有专门的医生是很常见的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14119
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_bc69f7ed:

    # a "Whoever could convince the crew that they are the most capable would take on that duty when needed."
    a "谁能让船员信服，认为他最有本事，那有需要的时候就得顶上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14121
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_29aac4be:

    # p "I can only imagine."
    p "我能想象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14125
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ecdc20f4:

    # p "When Samuel was injured, she sprang into action the moment I carried him across her doorstep."
    p "Samuel一受伤，我才把他抬进她屋，她就立马开始救治。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14127
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e42d3599:

    # p "She didn't waste a single breath, and it's easy to see what an asset she is to the crew, sir."
    p "她动作麻利得很，一看就知道她对咱们船队来说是多么重要的人才，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14131
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b6753faf:

    # p "She must be a real asset to the crew, sir, judging by how well she handled both Samuel's and Perce's injuries."
    p "看她处理Samuel和Perce的伤势那么熟练，她肯定对咱们船队帮助很大吧，长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14133
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b90cdd6f:

    # a "She is."
    a "那当然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14140
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2fcdbd2f:

    # "He raises an eyebrow."
    "他挑了挑眉毛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14142
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5acb0def:

    # a "Perhaps you should."
    a "也许你应该去认识一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14144
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d1e8ac76:

    # p "There are a lot of men working on this ship, and time has been scarce."
    p "船上这么多人，一直忙得很。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14146
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_de7538ad:

    # p "Unfortunately, I haven't yet had a chance to get to know everyone as well as I would have liked."
    p "不好意思，我还没能像我想的那样，好好地了解大家。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14148
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7572d889:

    # p "Perhaps with more time I would be able to..."
    p "要是能有更多时间，也许我就能..."

# game/script day12.rpy:14150
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_98d40682:

    # a "Perhaps."
    a "也许吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14158
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_adc3e2cf_1:

    # "He nods."
    "他点点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14160
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0f175e49:

    # a "That she does."
    a "她确实很棒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14162
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5e107d24:

    # a "One of the best surgeons I've ever met."
    a "她是我见过的最厉害的外科医生之一。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14164
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8087e72f:

    # a "And one of the best friends one could hope for."
    a "也是可遇不可求的好朋友。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14166
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0eb7653a:

    # "You're not quite sure if that's a smile creeping across his lips."
    "你不太确定他嘴角是不是露出了一丝微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14168
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_13f69a80:

    # p "It sounds like you two must have known each other for a while, sir?"
    p "听起来，你们认识很久了？长官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14170
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2a542ed8:

    # "He acknowledges it with another nod."
    "他点了点头，算是回应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14172
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_bd274b0c:

    # a "Indeed."
    a "确实。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14174
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_09371f44:

    # a "We were acquainted before either of you entered service on this ship."
    a "在你们任何一位上这艘船服役之前，我们就认识了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14176
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d5a4260d:

    # a "In fact, it was I who convinced her to accept this position."
    a "其实，还是我说服她来这儿的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14180
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_80c045c9:

    # "It certainly is a smile, though you are sure only once you see it fade."
    "他的确是在笑，不过只有在他笑容消失的时候，你才敢确定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14182
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_141c11ee:

    # a "To this day, I wonder if I should apologize for it."
    a "我到现在还在想，当初劝她来，是不是做错了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14184
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b5faf5fe:

    # a "Whenever I ask, she claims she needed it at the time, but I'm uncertain whether she means it or if she's just tailoring her words to my ears."
    a "每次我问她，她都说当时是她自己的选择，但我也不知道她是真这么想，还是只是在说好听的哄我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14188
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f70ac0c0:

    # p "She brought it up in conversation with me."
    p "她跟我聊起过这件事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14190
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2e79938b:

    # a "Did she?"
    a "她说了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14192
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_58146fc2:

    # p "She did, and her honesty sounded genuine to me when she mentioned that she needed it."
    p "她说了，而且她说她需要那份工作的时候，听起来挺真诚的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14194
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_19addb3b:

    # "He doesn't answer, just dips his head in a slow nod."
    "他没说话，只是慢慢地点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14196
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_a707882e:

    # p "But- if I may, sir. I still find it difficult to understand why you summoned me."
    p "但是——如果可以的话，长官。我还是不太明白您为什么召见我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14201
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2bc3743f:

    # "Only now does he let go of the sheet he had secured anew."
    "这时，他才放开了手里拉平的床单。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14203
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_62fb755b:

    # "He appears to struggle with his words more than you've ever seen him before."
    "他说话似乎有些吃力，和平时大不一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14205
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_43b1b249:

    # "It takes him a while to respond, clearly searching for the right way to answer."
    "他过了好一会儿才回应，显然是在斟酌妥当的措辞。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14207
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ad948a90:

    # a "Hm..."
    a "嗯..."

# game/script day12.rpy:14211
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_09495a81:

    # a "Nothing that concerns you."
    a "没什么要紧事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14213
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_cc69f7e6:

    # a "I think it's about time for me to return to my quarters."
    a "我想我该回舱房了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14218
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_29034d2d:

    # "He is just about to leave, but catches himself halfway and looks back over his shoulder."
    "他刚要走，走了几步又停了下来，回头看了看。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14220
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7ae45990:

    # a "One more thing.{w} About your future duties."
    a "还有一件事。嗯，关于你未来的职责。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14222
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_852b0f59:

    # a "I have deliberated about what would be an appropriate course of action for the future."
    a "我已经仔细权衡过今后该采取何种恰当的做法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14224
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f63e4b7f:

    # a "As you are well aware, we will soon be coming ashore, where your service aboard the Conway is meant to come to an end."
    a "正如你所知，我们很快就要靠岸了，你在Conway号上的服役也就要结束了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14226
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9ef77e3b:

    # "You swallow."
    "你咽了口唾沫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14228
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d47f5ac8:

    # a "And..."
    a "而且……"

# game/script day12.rpy:14230
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_950b8beb:

    # a "I-{w} well..."
    a "我……嗯……"

# game/script day12.rpy:14232
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_09212e0c:

    # a "I want you to report to me at the end of our stay in the harbor."
    a "我希望我们在港口驻留结束后，你来向我报道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14234
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_dfa41db9:

    # a "You, together with the other two."
    a "你，还有另外两个人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14236
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3e4d2fd5:

    # a "Julian and Wolf."
    a "Julian和Wolf。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14238
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_479d080f:

    # p "At the {i}end{/i} of our stay?"
    p "在我们驻留{i}结束{/i}后？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14240
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9c6c4318:

    # a "Be sure to carry yourself appropriately while we are ashore."
    a "靠岸期间，注意自己的言行举止。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14242
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_fa3cf7d3:

    # a "The status of this ship should be reflected in the very crew who work her."
    a "这艘船的名望与声誉，理应体现在操纵她的每一名船员身上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14244
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e6b974ef:

    # "For the briefest moment, you feel he wants to say more, but the words never leave his lips."
    "那一瞬间，你感觉他欲言又止。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14246
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2b2f8591:

    # a "That is—well, that is all."
    a "就——嗯，就这些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14248
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7e27df71:

    # a "You may return to the others."
    a "你们可以回去了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14250
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ac630ad7:

    # "You are hesitant to even think of asking further questions, afraid that any of them might change the words he has just uttered."
    "你甚至不敢多问，生怕问多了，他会改变主意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14252
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9473598f:

    # "But he did say what you think he just said, didn't he?"
    "他刚才说的，确实是我理解的那个意思吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14258
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4042fa23:

    # "You watch as he retreats along the rain-slicked deck, his form blurred by the rain."
    "你看着他沿着湿滑的甲板走开，雨水模糊了他的身影。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14262
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3c36c9ec:

    # "He turns briefly to watch the group gathered around the osprey before disappearing into the ship's interior."
    "他短暂地转身，看了一眼聚集在鱼鹰周围的人群，随后便消失在船舱内部。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14264
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5800751f:

    # "Following his path, you retrace his words, wanting to make absolutely sure you didn't misinterpret them."
    "你沿着他离开的方向，回味着他的话，想确定自己没有误解。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14266
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_985e9903:

    # "You look out at the vast ocean that surrounds you."
    "你望着周围浩瀚的海洋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14268
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3014cb5d:

    # "Despite the midday hour, the view from the ship is still so dark that it feels as if the sun has barely risen."
    "即使是正午，从船上望出去，天色依旧昏暗，感觉太阳才刚刚升起一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14288
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_fa10dc79:

    # "Turning back to the group of sailors, you just can't help but wear a broad grin."
    "你转过身，看着那群水手，忍不住咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14305
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7e082931:

    # "It is not a graceful entrance as you rush toward Samuel, who is sitting on the deck planks. With a playful shove, you cause [him] to lose [his] footing."
    "你冲向坐在甲板上的Samuel，姿势一点都不优雅，你玩心大起，一把把他撞了个趔趄。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14307
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f0453d6b:

    # p "You stupid idiot, you did it!" with vpunch
    p "你这蠢货，干成了！" with vpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:14313
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5094fade:

    # "Samuel howls as your attack catches [him] off guard, the shove sending [him] flat on [his] back." with vpunch
    "你这一手打得Samuel措手不及，嗷地叫了一声，被你推了个四脚朝天。" with vpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:14317
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_29bc7a65:

    # s "Ah-!{w} Shit, what?!"
    s "哎哟喂！{w} 卧槽，什么情况？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14319
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_54a5e927:

    # s "What did I do now?"
    s "我又咋了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14321
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_392e698b:

    # p "I'm staying, Sam!"
    p "我不走，Sam！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14325
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c8bd9663:

    # p "The first mate—he just told me to stay!"
    p "大副——他刚刚告诉我可以留下！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14329
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3da17d34:

    # p "Whatever you and Rajeeyah did must have convinced him."
    p "看来你和Rajeeyah说了什么管用了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14333
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8e15c46b:

    # p "Rajeeyah must have been able to convince him."
    p "肯定是Rajeeyah说服了他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14337
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2b87c397:

    # "Only now do you notice Samuel cupping [his] cheek, a watery spot of blood seeping down through [his] fur."
    "你这才注意到Samuel捂着脸，血水正从他毛里渗出来，湿乎乎的一片。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14339
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f4bf6885:

    # p "Oh dear, are you all right?!{w} What happened?"
    p "哎呀，你没事吧？！{w} 怎么回事？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14341
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_bb2cca51:

    # "Your ears stiffen and your voice sounds a little higher than you hoped it would."
    "你一下子慌了神，声音都比平时高了几度。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14343
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6972b99c:

    # p "Why are you bleeding?"
    p "你怎么流血了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14347
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b71d6100:

    # "Only now do you notice Samuel cupping an injury on [his] cheek."
    "这时你才看到Samuel捂着脸颊上的伤口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14349
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4b67e96e:

    # p "Oh dear, are you okay?!{w} What happened?"
    p "哎哟，你没事吧？！{w} 咋回事啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14351
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_bb2cca51_1:

    # "Your ears stiffen and your voice sounds a little higher than you hoped it would."
    "你一下子慌了神，声音都比平时高了几度。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14355
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4b7530bd:

    # s "Yes, yes, I'm fine."
    s "没事没事，我好着呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14362
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f010ca48:

    # s "The stupid eagle happened."
    s "还不是那只蠢鹰干的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14364
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b0493cf8:

    # "[He] laughs."
    "他笑了笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14366
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_cc5bec3b:

    # k "The bugger got him good."
    k "那家伙可真够狠的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14368
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_a581b942:

    # p "Oh, I take it that you didn't manage to do it?"
    p "噢，我猜你是没搞定咯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14375
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2101e629:

    # s "What?!"
    s "哈？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14377
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c17c7cd7:

    # s "Is that how little faith you have in me?"
    s "你就这么不相信我？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14379
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5beb6521:

    # s "Look around—the fish is gone, isn't it? As per the bet, I successfully fed it."
    s "看看周围——鱼不见了，对吧？按照赌约，我成功喂了它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14383
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_47cf10ef:

    # t "Normally, I'd probably agree, but you got scared, screamed like a little girl, and dropped the fish, which it then gobbled up."
    t "要是平时我就认了，可你吓得跟个娘们似的，嗷一嗓子就把鱼给扔了，然后它就一口吞了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14385
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d87c65bb:

    # t "That's not what I would constitutes {i}feeding{/i}."
    t "我可不认为那能算得上是{i}喂食{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14387
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6b63fc2a:

    # t "And I doubt anyone else would."
    t "我看谁都不会这么觉得。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14391
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4d7cd816:

    # s "Yes, it does."
    s "算，怎么不算。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14393
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e4be0625:

    # s "Where is the fish now, huh?"
    s "鱼呢，现在在哪儿呢，啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14395
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_831de20f:

    # s "It's in its stomach, isn't it?"
    s "不就在它肚子里待着吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14399
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_34a2295d:

    # t "Technically,{w} yes."
    t "理论上，{w} 是这样没错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14401
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_71a5183c:

    # t "But {i}in spite of{/i} your best efforts, not because of them."
    t "但这是{i}尽管{/i}你帮了倒忙，而不是因为你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14403
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_78c8fe17:

    # t "Or would you call it dinner if Bandile dropped a lump of dog's body on the floor for you to lap up?"
    t "难道Bandile往地上扔坨狗屎让你去舔，你也能管那叫晚饭？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14409
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_33dfd236:

    # s "Well, would I be thrilled? No.{p}But dinner is dinner."
    s "呃，我当然不乐意。{p}但好歹也算是晚饭吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14411
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4eccefe4:

    # s "I'm not just going to leave it there and walk away."
    s "我可不能就这么拍拍屁股走人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14413
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_99a71102:

    # "Torres shrugs disarmingly."
    "Torres不以为然地耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14415
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d36f3d1b:

    # t "Sam."
    t "Sam。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14419
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6cb3db78:

    # t "You're a lost cause."
    t "你真是没救了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14421
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d19bc627:

    # t "But I'm going to be the more gracious man here and, against my better judgment, will let you have this one."
    t "不过，我大人有大量，就破例让你一次。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14425
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9a496abf:

    # t "Let's call it a slight tilt in your favor for humoring us."
    t "就当是看在你逗我们开心的份上，稍微给你点甜头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14429
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ef12904b:

    # s "That sounds to me like the words of someone who knows he's clearly lost and is trying to save face."
    s "听你这话，明明就是输了不认账，想找个台阶下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14431
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9cb1ba0a:

    # s "Hey, [name]? Could you help me up?"
    s "嘿，[name]？你能拉我一把吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14438
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c7dd9ced:

    # "You do, and pull Samuel back to [his] paws when [he] extends the hand of [his] that isn't covered in blood."
    "你依言伸手，拉住Samuel递过来的那只没沾满鲜血的手，将[he]从地上拉站起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14441
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e297eedc:

    # "You do, and pull Samuel back to [his] paws when [he] extends the hand of [his] which isn't nursing [his] cheek."
    "你依言伸手，拉住Samuel没捂着脸颊的那只手，将[he]从地上拉站起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14445
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_43897ec2:

    # s "Thank you, mind if we leave them for a moment?"
    s "谢谢，介意我们先离开一下吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14463
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ac56f945:

    # "Back on [his] feet, Samuel ushers you away from the group, slipping behind the mizzen mast and out of sight of the others."
    "站稳脚跟后，Samuel领着你离开人群，溜到后桅杆后面，避开其他人的视线。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14470
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1b72c3d0:

    # "You hop after [him], barely able to keep your excitement from bubbling over."
    "你跟着他跳过去，几乎压抑不住内心的激动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14477
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2297816b:

    # "Once there, Samuel swings around and pushes you against the hard wood of the mast." with hpunch
    "到了地方，Samuel猛地转身，把你抵在坚硬的桅杆上。" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:14479
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_a9e995d8:

    # s "Are you sure?!"
    s "你确定吗？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14481
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_bd469371:

    # s "{i}Really{/i} sure?!"
    s "{i} 真的 {/i} ？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14485
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_679f8e01:

    # s "What did he say?!"
    s "他说了什么？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14487
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_824782c4:

    # p "Um- I think so, at least. He said that I should be ready 'at the end of our stay.'"
    p "嗯——我想是的，至少。他说我应该在“我们停留期结束”时准备好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14491
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3c2d9438:

    # "Samuel's grin widens."
    "Samuel咧嘴一笑，笑容更大了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14493
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_33286abe:

    # s "Didn't I tell ya?"
    s "我就说吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14495
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_51627547:

    # s "Didn't I tell ya that you'd do it?"
    s "我早就跟你说你能行了吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14497
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9c7723de:

    # p "I doubt it would have happened without you and Rajeeyah talking to him."
    p "要不是你和Rajeeyah跟他谈，恐怕没戏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14501
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_dd5bdf78:

    # p "Thank you."
    p "谢谢你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14503
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ad81c6cd:

    # p "Truly, Sam."
    p "真的，Sam。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14507
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ff96ce97:

    # s "Ah, don't bother thanking me. He didn't listen to a word I had to say."
    s "哎，谢我干嘛。他根本就没听进去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14509
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ae102d0e:

    # "[He] takes a moment to brush the wet hair out of [his] eyes."
    "他拨了拨湿漉漉的头发。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14511
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_83d71fc9:

    # s "Hell, I haven't even had a chance to do it yet."
    s "见鬼，我连试的机会都还没捞着呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14513
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3da2b971:

    # s "He has been in a bad mood.{w} Not exactly the time you want to convince Arthur that he's wrong, ya know."
    s "他心情一直不好。{w} 你也知道，这种时候可不是说服Arthur的好时机。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14515
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_20885c65:

    # s "I had hoped I might be able to catch him in a better mood before we reached our port of call."
    s "我本希望能赶在咱们抵港靠岸前，挑他心情好一点的时候找他谈谈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14519
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7ff7cf36:

    # s "Must have been Rajeeyah who did it then."
    s "那肯定是Rajeeyah搞定的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14521
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f0e5ca5b:

    # s "I suppose I haven't told you this, but the two of them go way back."
    s "我猜我还没跟你说过，他们俩关系匪浅。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14523
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d3dec8bf:

    # s "Before either of them served on this ship."
    s "他们还没上这条船的时候就认识了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14527
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4dede6b1:

    # s "If there's anyone on this ship who could get him to listen, it would be her."
    s "要说这条船上谁能劝得住他，那肯定得是她。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14531
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ff5340a7:

    # s "Well, and the captain, of course."
    s "哦，当然还有船长。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14533
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2a419908:

    # p "Probably. They did have an intense talk before I came up here."
    p "八成是这样。在我上甲板前，他们俩确实激烈争执了一番。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14535
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b67cbee6:

    # p "He came storming into the room and wanted to drag me away for a flogging, but she was the one who stopped him."
    p "他当时气势汹汹地冲进房间，想把我拖出去抽鞭子，多亏她拦着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14537
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1f463614:

    # "Your mind wanders back to it, and you submerge a little too deeply into the still fresh memory, causing a brief surge of tension to flood your body."
    "你的思绪又飘回了那件事，沉浸在这依旧鲜活的记忆里，一股紧张感瞬间涌上全身。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14539
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2e371887:

    # p "If it weren't for her, why, I probably wouldn't be here right now."
    p "要不是多亏了她，哎，我现在指不定早就没法站在这儿了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14546
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_92fb74b4:

    # "Samuel gives you a playful backhanded slap against your shoulder."
    "Samuel没轻没重地拍了下你的肩膀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14548
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_dda4d842:

    # s "Look at you, making influential friends."
    s "哟，不错嘛，都交上有影响力的人物了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14550
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4ce6e4b6:

    # p "I wouldn't have if it wasn't for you, I'm sure."
    p "要不是因为你，我肯定没这本事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14557
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e9a2b298:

    # s "You say that as if you were just lucky that others stepped up for you. But I think it sounds like you did your part to convince Arthur."
    s "你这话说的，好像别人帮你纯粹是你走了狗屎运。我觉得是你自己也努力说服了Arthur吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14559
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d2751c3b:

    # p "How?"
    p "我怎么努力了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14561
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2a28197f:

    # s "By not being a dick, of course."
    s "当然是因为你没犯浑啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14563
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_48604295:

    # s "Trust me, [name], some of the guys on this ship fall short of even {i}that{/i} mark."
    s "哥们儿，信我，这条船上有些人，连{i}不犯浑{/i}都做不到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14565
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_487a394b:

    # s "The open sea draws people from often unsavory corners of society. But you?{w} You seem like a good guy. No wonder she stepped in for you."
    s "公海这地方，什么牛鬼蛇神都能吸引来。至于你嘛？{w} 你看起来人挺好的。 难怪她要帮你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14567
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d3221142:

    # s "So don't sell yourself short. How you carry yourself counts for something."
    s "所以别看轻自己。 你这人怎么样，很重要。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14569
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1c7a59cf:

    # p "Thank you, Sam."
    p "谢谢你，Sam。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14571
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2f7c8d2a:

    # p "I will have to make sure I thank her properly."
    p "我得好好谢谢她才行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14573
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6dc1c59e:

    # "Samuel wags [his] fingers in front of your snout."
    "Samuel在你鼻子前晃着他的手指。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14577
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b7ef4b16:

    # s "You better."
    s "你最好是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14579
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_79c0ac09:

    # s "If I hear that she fought for you and you didn't even have the decency to thank her... Then I will personally see to it that you're left behind in Mogador."
    s "我要是听说她为你出头，你连句谢谢都不说……我就亲自把你扔在莫加多尔喂鲨鱼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14581
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e588ff24:

    # "You watch [his] eyes narrow as [he] focuses on you.{w} [He] means it."
    "你看到他的眼睛眯了起来，死死地盯着你。{w} 他可不是开玩笑的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14583
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d8a3ffd9:

    # p "Of course."
    p "当然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14588
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ad3b1f49:

    # "[His] eyes brighten again as [he] peeks beyond the mast before pumping [his] fists victoriously."
    "他的眼睛又亮了起来，从桅杆后面偷偷一瞄，然后猛地挥舞着他的拳头，像打了胜仗似的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14593
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_167cfc5c:

    # s "Fuck yes!"
    s "操，太棒了！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14595
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f5331508:

    # s "Aaaah! I'm so happy for you!"
    s "啊！ 真为你高兴！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14597
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_67dff00d:

    # s "Yes, yes yes, yesssssss!"
    s "是！是！是！Yes！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14603
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_771fb5d0:

    # "[He] opens [his] arms and grins from ear to ear, a trickle of blood running down [his] cheek."
    "他张开他的双臂，咧着嘴傻笑着，一丝鲜血从他的脸颊上流了下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14607
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4d448aef:

    # "[He] opens [his] arms and grins from ear to ear."
    "他张开他的双臂，咧着嘴笑着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14609
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f606b4d4:

    # s "Can I?"
    s "我能抱抱你吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14611
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d2772d1e:

    # "Judging by [his] tone, you're not sure [he]'s going to take 'no' for an answer."
    "听他的语气，你吃不准他会不会接受“不”这个回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14613
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ed17a074:

    # "Not that [he]'s in danger of being turned down."
    "当然，你也不是怕他会拒绝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14615
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_24616144:

    # "Not now, when it was almost impossible to contain your own excitement."
    "现在可不行，你自己的兴奋劲儿都快压不住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14617
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9a6445fe:

    # "The reality of it all begins to sink in -{w} no more undue pressure,{w} no threat of having to leave this ship behind."
    "一切都开始变得真实起来——{w}没有了不必要的压力，{w}也不用再担心被赶下船了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14619
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_83258485:

    # "Wearing your best smile, you allow Samuel to go ahead with a quick nod."
    "你堆起笑脸，微微点头，示意 Samuel 可以继续说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14627
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3d7979b5:

    # "Without hesitation, [he] throws [his] arms around you, pulling you into a tight embrace. Looking over [his] shoulder, you see how [his] tail sways joyfully from side to side."
    "他毫不犹豫地张开手臂，一把把你抱紧。越过他的肩膀，你能看到他的尾巴欢快地摇来摇去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14634
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c194ff82:

    # "[He] leans back until your paws leave the ground. Water drips from your face onto [his], forcing [him] to close [his] eyes."
    "他向后仰去，直到你的爪子都离开了地面。水珠从你的脸上滴落到他的脸上，让他不得不闭上眼睛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14641
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e7acd38d:

    # "The hug is brief, the landing of your paws unsteady, but you catch your balance with the help of the mizzen mast."
    "拥抱很短暂，你落地的时候有些不稳，好在扶住了后桅才稳住身形。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14643
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_962c62d4:

    # p "Believe me, I couldn't be happier."
    p "相信我，我高兴坏了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14645
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_15e88c9a:

    # p "You wouldn't believe how stressful these past few days have been."
    p "你都不知道这几天我有多难熬。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14649
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ddcdfb3d:

    # p "I- I just hope that from now on he'll actually treat me like anyone else. Not like the sailor he begrudgingly allows to work on the ship."
    p "我——我只希望从现在开始，他能真正把我当普通人对待。而不是像对待他勉强允许在船上工作的水手那样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14651
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0ae2e628:

    # p "He was... very tight-lipped."
    p "他...嘴很严。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14653
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e702f160:

    # p "Didn't say much, just that I am supposed to report when we leave port, along with Jules and Wolf."
    p "他没说什么，只是说离港的时候，要我和 Jules 还有 Wolf 一起去报告。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14655
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_dae7120c:

    # s "Pride,{w} my guess."
    s "估计是面子问题，{w}我猜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14657
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3d6763b4:

    # p "Huh?"
    p "Huh？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14659
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ea42208e:

    # s "The reason why he kept it brief."
    s "他那么简短的原因。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14661
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_acaab57c:

    # s "He had {i}just{/i} told you to high tail it a few hours ago."
    s "他几个小时前{i}才{/i}让你滚蛋。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14663
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4d431d9a:

    # s "Now to have to walk it back?{w} As the first mate to a fresh Landsman?..."
    s "现在又要收回成命？{w}让一个大副向一个新来的旱鸭子水手低头？..."

# game/script day12.rpy:14665
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_052baf96:

    # "Samuel leans [his] arms against the spanker's beam."
    "Samuel 把胳膊靠在后桅横桁上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14667
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_557b9c7c:

    # s ". . ."
    s ". . ."

# game/script day12.rpy:14669
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_bb21de20:

    # s "I'd say you're lucky he even talked to you in the first place, and didn't wait until the last moment."
    s "我觉得你该庆幸他一开始就跟你说话了，而不是拖到最后一刻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14671
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_328d7e1a:

    # s "Can't have been easy for him."
    s "对他来说肯定不容易。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14673
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6654cf92:

    # p "It wasn't easy for me, Sam."
    p "对我来说也不容易，Sam。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14675
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_a3876807:

    # p "None of it."
    p "一切都不容易。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14679
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_97216cce:

    # p "So I'm sorry if I'm not feeling overly sorry for him having to apologize when he was wrong."
    p "所以，他做错了事道歉，我没有觉得特别值得同情，抱歉了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14681
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8dcf61cf:

    # s "I know, I didn't mean it that way."
    s "我知道，我不是那个意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14685
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0302474d:

    # s "What do you say, shall we get back to the others before they get stupid ideas and be starting rumors about us?"
    s "你说呢，咱们是不是该回其他人那边去了？免得他们胡思乱想，开始传咱们俩的闲话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14687
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_26bc312d:

    # "You lean past the width of the mast to look back to the group."
    "你探出身子，越过桅杆，回头看向大家。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14689
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6919ea57:

    # p "We probably should."
    p "我们可能该回去了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14693
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_81176f65:

    # s "Actually..."
    s "不过..."

# game/script day12.rpy:14695
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_bdbd5257:

    # p "Hm?"
    p "嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14699
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_a6f29c65:

    # s "One more."
    s "再抱一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14707
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e814081e:

    # "Samuel doesn't even wait for you to react before [he] throws [his] arms around you and lifts you off the ground once more."
    "Samuel根本没等你反应过来，就再次把你抱起来，举得高高的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14709
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1302c2a8:

    # "It never ceases to amaze you how much strength there is in that little package."
    "真不敢相信，这么个小不点，力气居然这么大。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14711
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8a3d2e68:

    # "And said strength leaves you with nothing to do but to uselessly wiggle your paws in the air until [he] decides to put you down again."
    "你被他弄得没辙，只能没用地在空中挥舞着手脚，等他什么时候想放你下来再说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14713
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3455c295:

    # "Which isn't quite yet."
    "不过，他还没打算放你下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14717
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d1f052f4:

    # s "Any plans for Mogador?"
    s "去莫加多尔有什么打算吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14719
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8a7f8a02:

    # p "Not yet."
    p "还没呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14723
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b2a79c0c:

    # s "I may have something in mind."
    s "我可能心里有点数了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14725
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ebb0494b:

    # p "And you are going to tell me?"
    p "你会告诉我吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14729
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1bfae857_1:

    # s "No."
    s "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14737
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ea294c19:

    # "The word carries a sing-song tone as [he] lowers you down again."
    "他把你放下来的时候，语气带着点儿戏谑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14739
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_70841d4b:

    # s "Wouldn't want to spoil the surprise."
    s "我可不想破坏惊喜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14741
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d8a3ffd9_1:

    # p "Of course."
    p "当然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14747
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_526887d6:

    # p "Although I should probably go and make sure that I thank Rajeeyah for what she did."
    p "不过，我可能得去谢谢Rajeeyah，感谢她做的一切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14766
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4f285856:

    # "You straighten your shirt back into place before leading the way out from behind the mast."
    "你整理了一下衬衫，然后带头从桅杆后面走了出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14768
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_139885d9:

    # "As you slip past Konrad to join the group, he turns to you with a wry smile."
    "你从Konrad身边溜过去，加入人群，他带着一丝嘲讽的笑容看着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14772
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ee490d60:

    # k "Gracing us with your presence again, eh?"
    k "哟，又来赏光了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14777
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14779
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9b3dad4e:

    # p "But not for long. I still have some things to do."
    p "待不长。我还有些事情要做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14783
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_16d19941:

    # t "Keeping your paws busy, eh?"
    t "手头挺忙啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14785
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b223192c:

    # p "It's not strictly work-related."
    p "不全是工作上的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14792
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b5d5ba8a:

    # s "Thank you."
    s "谢谢你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14794
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e7cf5ec4:

    # s "Care to explain yourself?"
    s "要不要解释一下？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14798
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_20ccda69:

    # s "Sorry, I wasn't really listening since {i}someone{/i} thought it would be a good idea to run me over."
    s "不好意思，我刚才没怎么听，因为{i}有人{/i}觉得撞我一下挺好的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14800
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_cb79d7c1:

    # p "The first mate."
    p "大副。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14802
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_154ffdd9:

    # p "He changed his mind, and I'll be staying with the ship."
    p "他改变主意了，我会留在船上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14804
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6bcebb73:

    # p "Um-{w} At least I think so. He said that I should be ready 'at the end of our stay.'"
    p "嗯…{w} 至少我是这么想的。他说我应该在“我们停留结束时”做好准备。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14808
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5bb66734:

    # "You see [his] lips twitch into a smile."
    "你看到他嘴角露出一丝微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14810
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_fcaf298b:

    # s "Oh, did he?"
    s "哦，是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14812
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ef551c33:

    # s "Sweet!"
    s "太棒了！"

# game/script day12.rpy:14816
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_84056012:

    # s "That was a quick turnaround.{w} You must have made quite an impression on him since he made the call."
    s "这转变可真够快的。{w} 你肯定给他留下了深刻的印象，他才会这么做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14820
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d41ca757:

    # t "Made a real sailor out of yourself after all."
    t "看来你最终还是把自己变成了真正的水手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14822
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_50d05425:

    # p "Hardly."
    p "算不上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14826
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d8d8ab5f:

    # p "It's much more likely that it was Rajeeyah who somehow managed to do it."
    p "更有可能是Rajeeyah不知用什么法子说服了他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14828
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_005c8e15:

    # p "I was helping her earlier and the two of them had a rather tense argument about me while I was there."
    p "我之前在帮她，他们两个还因为我的事情吵了一架。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14830
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b67cbee6_1:

    # p "He came storming into the room and wanted to drag me away for a flogging, but she was the one who stopped him."
    p "他当时气势汹汹地冲进房间，想把我拖出去抽鞭子，多亏她拦着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14832
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1f463614_1:

    # "Your mind wanders back to it, and you submerge a little too deeply into the still fresh memory, causing a brief surge of tension to flood your body."
    "你的思绪又飘回了那件事，沉浸在这依旧鲜活的记忆里，一股紧张感瞬间涌上全身。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14834
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6dbe1575:

    # p "He left.{w} She went after him."
    p "他走了。{w} 她追过去了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14836
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_91bebab3:

    # p "If it wasn't for her, why, I probably wouldn't be here right now."
    p "要不是她，我这条小命可能都没了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14840
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_67ba664d:

    # s "If there is anyone who would get him to listen, it would be her."
    s "如果说有谁能让他听得进去劝，那肯定就是她了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14842
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1346c208:

    # s "So it does sound like her."
    s "这么说，这事儿听着确实是她安排的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14844
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_632795d6:

    # p "I'll have to make sure I thank her properly."
    p "我得找机会好好谢谢她。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14848
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_09239161:

    # "Samuel wags [his] fingers in front of your snout"
    "Samuel在你鼻子前晃了晃手指。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14850
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b7ef4b16_1:

    # s "You better."
    s "你最好是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14852
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_79c0ac09_1:

    # s "If I hear that she fought for you and you didn't even have the decency to thank her... Then I will personally see to it that you're left behind in Mogador."
    s "我要是听说她为你出头，你连句谢谢都不说……我就亲自把你扔在莫加多尔喂鲨鱼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14854
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7787c4cf:

    # "[His] eyes narrow a little.{w} [He] means it."
    "他微微眯起眼睛，语气认真。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14858
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d8a3ffd9_2:

    # p "Of course."
    p "当然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14864
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_bb0f3937:

    # s "I'm glad to hear it, though."
    s "不过，听到这消息我真替你高兴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14866
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_96457a4c:

    # s "It wouldn't have felt right to have you dismissed because of what happened."
    s "要是因为之前的事就解雇你，总觉得说不过去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14870
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9ddc7b9a:

    # k "So, you're sticking around for a while longer then, lad?"
    k "这么说，你小子是打算多待一阵子了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14872
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5937a2dc:

    # "You nod with a cheeky grin."
    "你调皮地咧嘴一笑，点了点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14874
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_450f82df:

    # p "Mhm, looks like you're not going to get rid of me quite that easily."
    p "嗯哼，看来你们没那么容易摆脱我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14878
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_afdf94b6:

    # k "I have nothing against you sticking around."
    k "我当然不反对你留下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14880
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_fa6016ed:

    # k "I mean, where else would I get a ration of drink for half a watch?"
    k "不然我上哪儿去找人，用半个班的时间换一杯酒喝？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14884
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2ccd7758:

    # s "Half a watch?"
    s "半个班？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14886
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e989fe7a:

    # s "He let you have it for half a watch?"
    s "他竟然让你用半个班的时间就换了酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14888
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0a9bb3c4:

    # k "Sure did."
    k "千真万确。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14892
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4e037922:

    # s "Next time, make sure to come to me if you need some work taken care of."
    s "下次有活儿需要帮忙，记得来找我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14896
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_fb2125f0:

    # k "Quiet over there. I found the lad first."
    k "你们那边小声点。这小子可是我先发现的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14900
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_26119e2e:

    # "His expression remains firm for only a second before he relaxes and slings his arm over Samuel's shoulder."
    "他的神情仅严肃了片刻便松弛下来，一把搂住Samuel的肩膀。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14902
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6900cf2a:

    # k "All joking aside, I'm glad to hear you're staying."
    k "不开玩笑了，我很高兴你能留下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14906
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d67981b6:

    # k "I'm glad to hear that."
    k "听到你这么说我就放心了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14910
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0f637a32:

    # k "I'm never a fan of people leaving the ship, no matter the reason."
    k "我向来不喜欢有人离开船，不管是什么理由。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14916
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9c7ce0e1:

    # k "Always feels like a loss, ya know?"
    k "总感觉像失去了什么，你知道吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14918
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_6eeb0ffc:

    # k "Like something went wrong somewhere and now we are paying the price."
    k "好像是哪里出了问题，现在要我们来承担后果。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14920
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8c88d33d:

    # k "Not to even mention the price you'd be paying, of course."
    k "更别提你可能会付出什么代价了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14922
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b8b93651:

    # "He adds quickly, rubbing the length of his jaw absently."
    "他迅速补充道，有些心不在焉地摸了摸下巴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14926
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_318857da:

    # k "He was planning to just leave you in Mogador?"
    k "他竟然计划直接把你扔在 莫加多尔？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14928
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_57ee4367:

    # p "That was the plan, yes.{w} If you can even call it a plan."
    p "他的确是这么打算的。如果那也能叫做计划的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14932
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b670ebc8:

    # p "Just drop me off and leave."
    p "直接把我丢下就走人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14934
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ec9ea6a3:

    # p "You know, I am looking forward to seeing Mogador, but that would have been a bit too much of a good thing."
    p "说真的，我确实挺期待去 莫加多尔 看看，但那样的话就有点过头了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14936
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4ecf537c:

    # p "But I guess now I can actually be excited about it again."
    p "不过我想现在我可以重新开始期待 莫加多尔 之行了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14938
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e04c6d70:

    # k "It's a port, what are you expecting from it?"
    k "这儿就是个港口，你还指望有什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14940
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4dcd2227:

    # p "Sure, it's just a port, but it's my first one."
    p "没错，它只是个港口，但这可是我第一次来港口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14942
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8f843954:

    # p "The first time I'll be setting foot somewhere that isn't my home, Konrad."
    p "Konrad，这可是我第一次到家以外的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14944
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8dfdccec:

    # p "Surely you must have been excited about it as well when you entered your first foreign harbor?"
    p "你第一次进外国港的时候，肯定也兴奋得不行吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14946
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f70514ee:

    # p "Just... new impressions, hearing the language, finally some other food than the usual ship fare."
    p "就是…新鲜感嘛，听着不同的语言，吃着不一样的食物，总比船上那些伙食好多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14948
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c7df1b8c:

    # p "Knowing that you're somewhere else."
    p "知道自己身处异地。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14950
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c81c95d3:

    # k "Ah, perhaps."
    k "啊，也许吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14952
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c8657bfb:

    # "He leans back and looks up along the height of the mast."
    "他向后靠，抬头看着桅杆的高度。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14954
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5ab8caf5:

    # k "To tell you the truth, I didn't really have the luxury of thinking like that back then."
    k "跟你说实话，我那时候哪有你这闲情逸致啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14956
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_35d60f6f:

    # k "The Royal Navy has its own set of priorities—far removed from sending us out to enjoy the sights."
    k "皇家海军有自己的一套优先事项——远非派我们出去欣赏风景。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14958
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_5fea8529:

    # k "Certainly back then, when they were desperate to hire fools like me."
    k "当然了，那时候他们到处招人，像我这样的傻子他们也要。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14960
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0f32f824:

    # k "Maybe things are different now that things have calmed down across the Atlantic."
    k "现在大西洋那边平静多了，也许情况不一样了吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14962
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7d14a67b:

    # k "That being said, you know that you can hear their language without leaving the ship, lad?"
    k "话说回来，不用下船你也能听到他们说话，小子，知道吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14964
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_74569ea2:

    # s "From Rajeeyah?"
    s "来自Rajeeyah？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14966
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_edea2f57:

    # "Konrad waves Samuel off."
    "Konrad挥手示意Samuel别说了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14968
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b482c363:

    # k "Her too, but not who I mean."
    k "她也算一个，但不是我说的那个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14970
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_201a42b2:

    # s "Who else does? Alden? No."
    s "还有谁会？是艾尔登？不可能。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14974
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_215b2fa2:

    # k "Think someone in the immediate vicinity."
    k "想想身边的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14976
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b6d24d1d:

    # s "Oh, shut up. It's not you.{w} You barely speak English."
    s "得了，闭嘴吧。又不是说你。{w}你连英语都说不利索。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14978
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_83079ef1:

    # "He just stares at Samuel in disbelief."
    "他只是难以置信地盯着Samuel。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14980
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_79304cc7:

    # k "Not me... Torres here hails from Spain. That you remember, though, right?{w} Specifically the sun-kissed southern side of the country."
    k "不是说我……Torres可是从西班牙来的，这你总还记得吧？{w}确切地说是那个阳光普照的南部地区。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14982
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_64ac007e:

    # k "You really didn't know he speaks Darija, Sam?"
    k "你不知道Torres会说Darija语？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14984
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2e4b596a:

    # k "Tsk, some friend you are."
    k "啧，你这朋友当的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14988
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_37bdb9d3:

    # s "I'm not clairvoyant—he never mentioned it to me."
    s "我又没有透视眼——他从来没跟我提过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14992
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e14f96c6:

    # s "How should I know?"
    s "我上哪儿知道去？"

# game/script day12.rpy:14994
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_ff7ce1e4:

    # t "Don't oversell it, Konrad."
    t "别往自己脸上贴金了，Konrad。"

# game/script day12.rpy:14996
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_27db4244:

    # t "I may have picked up a smattering in the past, but I haven't even gone to visit my homeland in years, let alone take the time to speak Darija with someone."
    t "我以前是学过一点，但我都好几年没回老家了，更别说找人说Darija语了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15002
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_12aaafb8:

    # p "Do you think you can still speak it?"
    p "你现在还记得怎么说吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15004
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e962467a:

    # "He cants his head to the side with a slight shake."
    "他微微歪着头，轻轻摇了摇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15006
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_aecbb707:

    # t "As I said, it's been a good long while."
    t "都说了，太久没用了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15008
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7f151063:

    # p "You must remember {i}something.{/i}"
    p "你必须记住{i}一些事情{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15010
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_1b5167e3:

    # "You can almost see the heat begin to rise through his body as Torres rubs the back of his head."
    "Torres挠了挠后脑勺，你几乎能看到窘迫的红晕从他身上腾起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15014
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d924a847:

    # t "Do I have to?"
    t "我非得说吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15016
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e73a5ca2:

    # t "You're putting me on the spot."
    t "你真让我为难。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15018
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3de084dd:

    # t "Let's see..."
    t "让我想想……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15022
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0c0e8727:

    # t "Ana kanhder...{w} shwiya... dyal darija."
    t "Ana kanhder...{w} shwiya... dyal darija.（阿拉伯语方言，意思是“我懂一点……方言”）"

# game/script day12.rpy:15024
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4201ad80:

    # s "Not too bad."
    s "还行吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15030
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_d5405eb2:

    # s "I think."
    s "我觉得。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15032
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_c665baf3:

    # s "I mean, I wouldn't be able to tell, but I've heard Rajeeyah speak it a couple of times, and those noises sounded vaguely like when she speaks it."
    s "我也说不好，不过我听Rajeeyah说过几次，听起来有点那味儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15034
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_aa3ad344:

    # "You try to repeat them as best as you can, but end up getting lost after a few syllables."
    "你极力试着模仿他的发音，可才跟了几个音节就被彻底绕晕了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15040
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_fa27a93e:

    # "Torres stifles his laugh."
    "Torres憋着笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15042
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8ca35088:

    # t "Almost."
    t "差不多吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15044
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_13f1628e:

    # p "How do you even make that sound...?"
    p "你是怎么发出那种声音的……？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15046
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e651b220:

    # t "Please don't attempt to imitate me. I'd be obligated to apologize to any native speakers within earshot for what comes out of my beak."
    t "饶了我吧，别让我献丑了。我说出来怕污了大家的耳朵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15048
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_e2c70d2f:

    # t "I assure you, it sounds much more pleasant when you hear Rajeeyah say it."
    t "我跟你保证，Rajeeyah说起来好听多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15050
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_b5481303:

    # t "More... melodic, I suppose."
    t "更……有旋律，大概是这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15062
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0b7ecfea:

    # "You could go and thank Rajeeyah for her help, but you still have that bottle of wine from her room as well."
    "你可以去感谢Rajeeyah的帮助，不过你还拿着从她房间里顺来的那瓶酒呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15066
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_294bf882:

    # "Speaking of her, perhaps you should pay her a visit? But you still have that bottle of wine from her room as well."
    "说到她，要不要去拜访一下？不过你还拿着从她房间里顺来的那瓶酒呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15068
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_7243c399:

    # "And Wolf mentioned at some point that he has a taste for wine. Perhaps some celebrations are in order?"
    "还有，Wolf好像说过他喜欢喝酒。要不要庆祝一下？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15070
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_587df7c5:

    # "Or whatever shape of \"celebration\" Wolf will be convinced to partake in."
    "或者说，用什么法子才能让Wolf那家伙赏脸参加“庆祝”呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15072
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f16fdeff:

    # "Somehow you have strong doubts that he's the type to unwind at carefree celebrations."
    "总觉得他不是那种会在没心没肺的庆祝活动上放松的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15087
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2d7827d2:

    # p "You don't mind if I leave, do you?"
    p "我先撤了，你们没意见吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15094
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2d7827d2_1:

    # p "You don't mind if I leave, do you?"
    p "我先撤了，你们没意见吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15096
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f78be76b:

    # p "Will you manage to wrangle the wild beast without me?"
    p "没我帮忙，你们能搞定那只野兽吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15100
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4cf80c6c:

    # "Konrad leans back in a hearty laugh."
    "Konrad仰头大笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15102
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_8e5fad95:

    # k "You're good. Look at it—must've craved the taste of blood."
    k "算你走运。瞧瞧那家伙——肯定是渴求鲜血的滋味了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15104
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_9794813f:

    # k "A craving that only Samuel was able to satisfy."
    k "一份只有Samuel才能喂饱的饥渴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15110
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2dcb7164:

    # "You see Samuel's faint snarl as [he] reaches up to wipe away the remnants of the crimson stain on [his] cheek."
    "你看到Samuel脸上露出不悦的神色，抬手擦去脸颊上残留的血迹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15114
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_abb3778e:

    # "You see Samuel's faint snarl as [he] reaches up to cup [his] cheek."
    "你看到Samuel脸上露出不悦的神色，抬手捧住自己的脸颊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15116
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_57df080e:

    # k "Now look at it.{w} Calm as a kitten."
    k "现在瞧它，{w}像只小猫一样温顺。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15118
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_f9c47194:

    # s "Next time it hungers, we'll feed you to it. Look at you, you'll last it for a while."
    s "下次它饿了，就把你喂给它。看看你，够它吃一阵子的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15120
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_947680fe:

    # "While you were talking, the osprey appears to have retreated to a corner of the ship to seek refuge from the storm."
    "你们说话的时候，那只鱼鹰好像已经躲到船上的角落里避风去了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15122
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_da507a4f:

    # "You wouldn't quite go so far as to call it calm, but at least it's not screaming at anything that moves anymore."
    "要说平静也说不上，但至少它现在不会对着什么东西都大喊大叫了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15126
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_997ac029:

    # t "I think Konrad is safe for now."
    t "我想 Konrad 现在应该是安全的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15130
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_0f10104b:

    # t "Seems like the storm is abating as well. I doubt we'll need to sacrifice anyone else."
    t "风暴好像也小了。 我看我们应该不用再牺牲谁了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15132
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_4d44bdc5:

    # t "Unless someone else wants to volunteer?{w} We could probably borrow another fish from Bandile."
    t "除非有人想主动献身？{w}  我们大概还能从 Bandile 那里再“借”一条鱼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15134
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_3fa1d07c:

    # p "No, thank you. I think I'm good staying as far away from it as I can."
    p "不，谢了。 我还是离那玩意儿越远越好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15136
translate Chinese day12_honest_path_eagle_2a12a54d:

    # p "I'll see you all later."
    p "回头见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15185
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_aff7d356:

    # "Judging by the pile of crumpled papers on her table, Rajeeyah is at work in the ship's infirmary cabin, as you'd figured she would be. She looks up when you step inside."
    "从她桌上那堆揉成团的纸就能看出来，Rajeeyah 果然在船医室里忙活着。 你走进去的时候，她抬起了头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15188
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_25541c6e:

    # r "Mr. [family_name]?"
    r "[family_name]先生？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15191
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_cf07559a:

    # r "[name]?"
    r "[name]？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15198
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fc5dc6f6:

    # p "I wanted to thank you again. For... sticking your neck out for me."
    p "我得再次谢谢你。 谢谢你... 帮我解了围。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15202
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b1f8b240:

    # r "I didn't want..."
    r "我不想..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15204
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_034bcdf2:

    # "She trails off, considering her words."
    "她顿了顿，想了想措辞。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15208
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_abb1a6a6:

    # r "I didn't want {i}either{/i} of you to make a mistake."
    r "我不想你们{i}任何{/i}一个人犯错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15210
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_902853ed:

    # p "Me or... Arthur?"
    p "我... 还是 Arthur？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15214
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_45aa2dd3:

    # r "He's not a bad person, you know?{w} Of course you know."
    r "他不是坏人，你明白的吧？{w}  当然，你肯定明白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15216
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_05b09761:

    # r "Just how sailors are on these ships, I guess. Either you figure rank is next to nobility, or you're just waiting for the next harbor bar so you can work your boredom out in a good brawl."
    r "我猜船上的水手都这样。 要么觉得等级制度比什么都重要，要么就盼着赶紧靠岸，去港口酒吧里打一架，消磨消磨时间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15218
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_414166b9:

    # r "Make me useful by sewing you back up."
    r "让我帮你缝缝补补，也算我有点用处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15220
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0c33f890:

    # p "I don't really think I'm quite either of those. I'm still in one piece, too."
    p "我觉得自己哪个都算不上。不过好歹我也全须全尾，没少胳膊少腿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15224
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d2c075c2:

    # "Rajeeyah smiles at that."
    "Rajeeyah 笑了笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15226
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_af9df325:

    # r "Maybe you haven't picked yet."
    r "也许你还没想好自己要走哪条路。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15228
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_130af74c:

    # r "I hoped you'd be able to get the opportunity."
    r "我是希望你能有机会好好选选。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15234
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_9092fef5:

    # r "Oh. It wasn't really much of sticking my neck out."
    r "哦，其实我也没做什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15236
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c91eff68:

    # r "Arthur values my advice... at least, I like to think he does. And I didn't want him to take things too far."
    r "Arthur 还是听得进我的话的... 至少我是这么想的。 而且我不想让他做得太过分。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15238
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_50a96fe3:

    # p "Still, you didn't have to, and... I think it helped. It must've helped."
    p "就算这样，你也没必要帮我，而且... 我觉得这样挺好的。 肯定有帮助。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15242
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0adabc72:

    # r "Oh?"
    r "哦？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15246
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7dfe62b4:

    # p "I might be making a habit of helping you out around here."
    p "这么下去，以后说不定我会经常帮你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15248
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e963817d:

    # p "After we leave Morocco."
    p "等我们离开摩洛哥之后再说吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15252
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1b48a397:

    # "You have to hope she doesn't see that as a threat."
    "希望她别觉得我这话有什么别的意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15254
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5c8dd01d:

    # "Fortunately, Rajeeyah takes it in the spirit it was offered. Her expression lifts."
    "幸运的是，Rajeeyah 听出了我的意思，没往坏处想。 她看起来放松了一些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15256
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1043ea46:

    # r "'After'?"
    r "“之后”？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15260
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7954c45e:

    # p "But, I came here to say that you won't be able to get rid of me."
    p "不过我来这儿是想告诉你，你甩不掉我的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15264
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8864dc10:

    # "Just saying that does lift your spirits a little."
    "只是说说这些，感觉心情都好了一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15266
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3d31172d:

    # "Rajeeyah seems to pick up on that, tilting her head slightly to one side."
    "蕾吉雅似乎察觉到了什么，微微偏过头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15268
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6d2bec4f:

    # r "You're staying?"
    r "你要留下？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15270
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_bb858862:

    # p "I am. Arthur... well, he didn't... he didn't exactly say {i}how{/i} he'd come to change his mind. But he told me to report back aboard."
    p "嗯。Arthur... 他没说... 他没{i}具体{/i}说他是怎么改变主意的。但他让我回去报到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15274
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d2aee629:

    # r "I'm...{w} genuinely glad to hear that, [name]. And that my words didn't fall on deaf ears."
    r "我... {w}真替你高兴，[name]。看来我的话你听进去了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15278
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5c10dcca:

    # r "Sometimes I think I don't truly understand the life of a sailor. I try to keep everything as organized and proper as it would be in a hospital on land, but my authority ends at that door..."
    r "有时候我觉得我真不了解你们水手的生活。我尽力把这里搞得像陆地上的医院一样，井井有条的，可我的话在这间屋子里还管用，出了这门..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15280
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e4ea63fb:

    # r "And the officers' doesn't."
    r "而军官们的舱室则闻不到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15282
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_dc5d824f:

    # "It does sound a bit contradictory when she says it sitting next to the mess of paper across her table."
    "她这么说的时候，旁边就是她桌子上那堆乱七八糟的文件，听着还真有点讽刺。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15288
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c3436627:

    # r "You know, I think I'm missing a bottle of medicinal wine?"
    r "你知道吗，我好像少了一瓶药酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15290
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e3ff289e:

    # "Shit!" with hpunch
    "糟糕！" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:15292
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ac8ba892:

    # "Your surprise at how quickly your theft was noticed helps to cover up any look of guilt that might otherwise have been apparent."
    "你惊讶于这么快就被发现，倒是帮你掩饰了可能露出的马脚。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15294
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6d53e374:

    # p "Missing?"
    p "少了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15298
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_551be97a:

    # r "I think.{w} I can't tell if someone helped themselves to it, or if I'm just losing my mind. That's what I mean: all I can control is the infirmary, and sometimes not even that. It's why I'm glad Arthur listened."
    r "好像是少了。{w} 我也不知道是被人顺手牵羊了，还是我自己老糊涂了。所以说啊，我能管的就只有这间医务室，有时候还管不了。也幸好Arthur听进去了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15300
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_61808cd7:

    # "She seems a little on edge. You don't know if you're making things better or worse."
    "她看起来有点焦虑。你也不知道自己是帮了倒忙还是雪上加霜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15302
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_16f075f3:

    # p "I didn't mean to distract you. I'm sure you have plenty to do."
    p "我不是故意打断你的。你肯定还有一大堆事情要忙吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15304
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c93da0e1:

    # r "Oh, don't worry. I don't mind the company. I'm just..."
    r "没事儿，我不介意有人陪。我就是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15306
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ca3c8911:

    # "She looks at a sheet of paper in front of her."
    "她看了看面前的一张纸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15308
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e2dac933:

    # r "I'm... planning for Mogador. Finishing up a list of things we should try to acquire while we're in port."
    r "我...在为 莫加多尔 港口之行做准备。想列个单子，看看咱们能在港口搞到些什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15310
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_584b0ebf:

    # p "Is there something I can do to help?"
    p "有什么我能帮上忙的吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15312
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2c3969dd:

    # p "You appear to be struggling with the list."
    p "你好像被这张单子给难住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15316
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fb6859d5:

    # r "Hm..."
    r "嗯..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15320
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0b637372:

    # r "Perhaps you could, yes."
    r "也许吧，你能帮上忙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15324
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b079bbef:

    # p "I know my way around your inventory by now. I mean... not as well as you do, but..."
    p "现在我对你的存货也算门儿清了。当然... 肯定没你清楚，不过..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15326
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_995220a0:

    # p "I can do my best. I owe you, that's for sure."
    p "我会尽力的。我肯定欠你个人情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15330
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ed0b4221:

    # "The cheetah considers this for far longer than you would've expected. Her attention isn't on the bottles and equipment in the little room."
    "这只猎豹思考了很久，比你想象的还要久。她的心思根本不在这间小屋的瓶瓶罐罐上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15332
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_396f208b:

    # "It seems, indeed, to be directed at something much more distant."
    "她的心思，似乎飘向了远方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15334
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1b0e4b9c:

    # p "Er... is something the matter?"
    p "呃... 发生什么事了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15338
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_126af300:

    # r "I might as well be honest with you, hmm?"
    r "我还是跟你说实话吧，嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15340
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_036c3d72:

    # p "Something {i}is{/i} the matter, in that case. How bad is it?"
    p "这么说，{i}确实{/i}出事了。情况有多糟糕？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15344
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1ff7b4aa:

    # r "Well, nothing's being amputated."
    r "放心，还没到要截肢的地步。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15348
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ed303ea1:

    # r "Ah, I shouldn't joke about that—trying to distract myself. I'm not working on the inventory, as you've probably guessed by now. I'm trying to write a letter. Obviously, I haven't had much luck with it."
    r "唉，我不该拿这个开玩笑——纯粹是在转移自己的注意力罢了。你大概早就猜到了，我并没有在清点库存。我是在试着写一封信。很显然，我写得极不顺手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15352
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8de0473b:

    # r "But, strange as it sounds, I feel like you could offer me some advice."
    r "但说来也怪，我觉得你能给我出出主意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15354
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b951bd28:

    # p "Why would that sound strange?"
    p "为什么这么说？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15358
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_620ba894:

    # "She laughs, realizing how that must've sounded."
    "她笑着，意识到自己可能说错了话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15360
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7b32c2e4:

    # r "Oh. That isn't how I meant it. I just don't ask many people for advice. Not the crew, at least."
    r "哦，我不是那个意思。我只是不常和人倾诉，尤其是船上的那些家伙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15362
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_31230413:

    # p "Should I... go?"
    p "我应该... 走吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15364
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f0603244:

    # r "I'd..."
    r "我会..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15368
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_aba1ad50:

    # "The cheetah's laughter has faded, but the faintly hopeful smile she turns on you is genuine."
    "她的笑声消失了，但她转向你时，脸上带着一丝充满希望的真诚笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15370
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_697d3bd7:

    # r "I'd honestly appreciate you staying. I'm trying to come to terms with my thoughts, and you seem like a good person."
    r "说真的，我挺想你留下的。我脑子有点乱，而且...你看起来挺靠谱的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15374
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c3d2b8d4:

    # "You're not quite as certain about that as she appears to be..."
    "你对她所说的“你是个好人”这件事，并不像她那么肯定..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15378
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3ef83fbf:

    # "You're happy to have made a good impression."
    "你很高兴给人留下了好印象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15382
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8d17e77b:

    # p "Is it something serious?"
    p "是出了什么大事吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15384
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2f51e9cf:

    # r "Not life-threatening..."
    r "没有生命危险..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15388
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_73ae705d:

    # r "No."
    r "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15390
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_9c1468dc:

    # "She pauses. Obviously it's not quite that simple."
    "她停顿了一下。显然，事情并没有那么简单。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15394
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_58cddb7c:

    # r "Not really."
    r "也没那么简单。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15396
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ced57f5d:

    # p "Should I-"
    p "我应该-"

# game/script day12.rpy:15398
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_58e93197:

    # r "No, no. It's not you."
    r "没事没事，不是你的问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15402
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f179d325:

    # r "It's just that going home always puts me in a bit of a... it brings out the melancholy in me, if you can believe that."
    r "就是... 怎么说呢，回家总让我有点emo，你懂吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15404
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4a6547d7:

    # "You watch as she rises from her chair and takes a step over to let her fingertips run across the cork of a glass bottle."
    "你看着她从座椅上站起身来，走上前去，纤长的指尖轻轻抚过玻璃瓶口的软木塞。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15412
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1dafc8c6:

    # "Truthfully, while you've come to think of Rajeeyah as a diligent surgeon, you wouldn't have described her as particularly cheerful. Perhaps she's being a little ironic. You try to think of how best to answer."
    "说实话，虽然我觉得Rajeeyah是个很靠谱的医生，但要说她开朗...还真谈不上。她可能是在反讽吧。我得想想怎么回她。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15420
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8f901f47:

    # p "You spend so much time traveling. A little homesickness is understandable."
    p "你成天到处跑，想家也正常。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15422
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2c3cfd88:

    # "Not that you're losing too much sleep over having left {i}your{/i} home behind. But that will doubtless change, the longer you spend on {i}Conway{/i}."
    "虽说你倒不至于为了背井离乡离开{i}自己{/i}的故土而辗转反侧。但在{i}Conway号{/i}上呆得越久，这份心境无疑会悄然转变。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15426
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0e6e5d42:

    # r "Isn't it? I do miss the sun, and the smells..."
    r "不是吗？我确实怀念那里的暖阳，还有那熟悉的香气……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15428
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_92f27388:

    # r "Food spiced with something besides salt and rosemary..."
    r "食物里除了盐和迷迭香之外，还有其他香料的味道..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15432
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_23255442:

    # r "But it's not really that, to tell you the truth."
    r "但说实话，真正的原因不是这些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15436
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ef97e52f:

    # p "Is it something about how you left? Or... someone?"
    p "是因为你离开的方式吗？还是... 某人？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15438
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_bec3b4af:

    # r "Yes."
    r "是的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15440
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6d472085:

    # r "Well...{w} My partner."
    r "嗯...{w} 我的伴侣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15444
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4db77ab0:

    # r "Oh, don't look so surprised. Yes, I had a... {w}have a... partner. Lover?{w} Once, I suppose. It is difficult to know how to put it, exactly."
    r "哦，别这么惊讶。没错，我... 曾经... 有个伴侣。爱人？算是吧。哎，这事儿真不好说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15448
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_9661f819:

    # p "You mean your partner?"
    p "你是指你的伴侣？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15452
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c00edafa:

    # "The change in her expression tells the whole tale."
    "她表情的变化说明了一切。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15454
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_02ea9588:

    # p "You think you might run into him?"
    p "你觉得你可能会遇到他？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15456
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0403b256:

    # r "If only it were that simple. No, I don't think I will. But I'm... well."
    r "要是真那么简单就好了。不，我估计是见不着了。就是... 哎。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15460
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_cb30db28:

    # r "It's more complicated than that. I did not leave my family on the best of terms. But when I write them, and their replies eventually find me, their words are still fond enough. I'm their daughter, after all."
    r "事情没那么简单。我和家人的关系并不好。不过，当我写信给他们，他们的回信几经辗转寄到我手上时，字里行间仍带着关怀。我毕竟是他们的女儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15462
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1cd2e7e0:

    # r "But they are... respectable, in a way that I'm not—leaving as I did. Picking a \"dirty\" profession as I did. Remaining unmarried at my age, as I have. It could all be seen as slightly scandalous. In Safi, they are considered..."
    r "但他们是……体面人家，而我却绝非如此——我那样决绝地离开，选择了这等‘肮脏下贱’的行当，到了我这个年纪还独身未嫁。这一切在世俗眼里都算得上伤风败俗。在萨菲，他们可是备受尊重的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15464
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_57c626b4:

    # "She trails off, as if deciding how best to phrase it, her steps taking her a little closer to the door of the cabin."
    "她说到这里顿住了，似乎在斟酌用词，脚步也微微向船舱门口挪近了些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15472
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a72670a9:

    # r "They are not nobles, but they claim to have been—once. Centuries ago."
    r "他们不是贵族，但声称曾经是——几个世纪前。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15474
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2820a976:

    # p "The... Maghribis?"
    p "那个...马格里比斯家族？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15476
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a3b85601:

    # "You recall her name from all those labels. It stands out—exotic. You know you wouldn't recognize it if it were written in Arabic, but you're curious about that, all the same."
    "你从所有那些标签上记住了她的姓氏。它很突出——充满异域风情。你知道如果写成阿拉伯文你肯定不认识，但你还是对此感到好奇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15480
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6ad0a063:

    # "The smile Rajeeyah gives you when you say it is gentle, but odd. It's not just because you remembered her name, or your awkward pronunciation, you can tell at once."
    "我说出你的名字时，Rajeeyah只是温柔地笑了笑，感觉有点奇怪。我知道这不仅仅是因为我记住了你的名字，或者因为我那蹩脚的发音。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15489
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_80994669:

    # r "{i}al-Maghribi{/i} is my name. My father, Yousef, is a merchant. Mansour, his father, ran the looms that produced the finest textiles in all of Safi, as his father did before him, and generations before that. My uncle owns them today."
    r "{i}al-Maghribi{/i} 是我的姓。我父亲优素福是个商人。他的父亲曼苏尔，也就是我的祖父，经营着织布工坊，生产萨菲最好的纺织品。我的曾祖父，以及更早的先辈们，都是做这个的。现在，工坊归我叔叔所有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15491
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_acfab732:

    # r "I suppose you don't know much of Mogador? Or its history?"
    r "说起来，你对莫加多尔了解多少？或者说，你知道它的历史吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15493
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_331f25e5:

    # p "Er, no. They never taught us things like that. Does it have an especially interesting past?"
    p "额，不太清楚。他们没教过我们这些。它有什么特别的故事吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15495
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_48e0023e:

    # r "Hardly. It's younger than I am."
    r "几乎没有。它比我年纪还小。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15497
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p "啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15499
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_59bc00b0:

    # r "The sultan decided that he wanted a modern city to show off to the world. He hired a Frenchman to plan and build it, a quarter century ago. In our language its name is {i}es-Saouira{/i}: that which is beautifully designed."
    r "苏丹突发奇想，想建一座现代化的城市向世界炫耀。二十五年前，他雇了个法国佬来规划和建造。用我们的语言来说，它叫 {i}es-Saouira{/i}：设计精妙之城。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15501
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c5156370:

    # "In your mind, Mogador is a huge, bustling port city—you can picture the steep walls, and the crowded bazaars, and the sails of a thousand merchant ships in the harbor."
    "在你心目中，莫加多尔是一个巨大、繁忙的港口城市——你可以想象高耸的城墙，拥挤的集市，以及港口里成千上万的商船帆影。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15503
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_46ea4b3b:

    # "Someone really just decided to create it from nothing?"
    "真有人会凭空造出这么一座城？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15505
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_df79eaba:

    # p "I never would've guessed..."
    p "我真没想到..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15509
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c3877462:

    # r "To convince the world to use it, he closed every other harbor. Before that, Safi was the largest and safest seaport in Morocco. My father made our tutors teach us European tongues, so that we would be... cosmopolitan. At ease anywhere."
    r "为了让大家都用这个港口，苏丹把其他港口都给封了。在那之前，萨菲可是摩洛哥最大、最安全的海港。我父亲非要让老师教我们欧洲各国的语言，这样我们才能...走遍天下都不怕。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15513
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e4c8b3c6:

    # r "Even after trade moved to Mogador, he insisted we learn. It was a matter of principle—how we see ourselves. It has worked, I suppose. They are still prosperous."
    r "即使在贸易转移到莫加多尔之后，他也坚持让我们学习。这是一个原则问题——关乎我们如何看待自己。我想，这奏效了。他们依然很富裕。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15515
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f0794f6d:

    # "You can't help but note the term she uses: \"they,\" not \"we.\""
    "我注意到你用了“他们”，而不是“我们”。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15517
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_df8c55a6:

    # p "You didn't want to follow them into the family business?"
    p "你不想子承父业吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15521
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d955211b:

    # r "They were never going to give 'the family business' over to a daughter, [name]."
    r "他们是绝对不可能把“家族生意”交给一个女儿的，[name]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15525
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6786d5c1:

    # r "Especially not... me."
    r "更何况是...我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15527
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_56da8fcb:

    # p "What do you mean? You're a learned woman, you're skilled with people... you must've been everything your father hoped for."
    p "你这话是什么意思？你学识渊博，又擅长交际...你肯定是你父亲的骄傲。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15531
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c4146d4e:

    # r "Oh, I'm afraid not."
    r "哦，恐怕不是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15533
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_15559f87:

    # p "Why? What did he object to?"
    p "为什么？他反对你什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15537
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fe23af20:

    # p "Just because you're a woman?"
    p "仅仅因为我是个女人？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15539
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d60ace2a:

    # r "He could see past that, I think."
    r "我想，他应该不会这么肤浅。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15541
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_90f57893:

    # p "But not past... something else?"
    p "但还是因为...别的原因？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15545
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1ca94e8c:

    # r "Who I consort with. Consorted with, I suppose. What do you know about Morocco in general?"
    r "因为我交往的人，或者说，曾经交往过的人。你对摩洛哥有什么了解吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15547
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fbb0d746:

    # p "Um. Well, nothing, to be honest. I know where it is on a map."
    p "嗯...说实话，一无所知。我就知道它在地图上的哪个位置。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15551
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5ce6015f:

    # "It goes without saying that you only know that because you've seen the {i}Conway{/i}'s course plotted on one."
    "不用说，你也是在{i}Conway号{/i}的航海图上看到的吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15553
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6853b8cf:

    # "Growing up, Morocco was as far away as Massachusetts, or Madrid, or Madagascar—for all intents and purposes, equally distant, beyond a horizon that never extended much past the boundary of your town."
    "在我成长过程中，摩洛哥和马萨诸塞、马德里或马达加斯加一样遥远——从任何实际意义上说，都同样遥不可及，远在从未超出你所在小镇边界的地平线之外。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15557
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4c119ff2:

    # p "I hear the crew talking about it. And you, too; you've mentioned it before. It sounds exciting? They must do a lot of trading..."
    p "我听见船员们在聊起它。你也一样；之前就听你提起过。听起来挺有意思的？他们肯定在那边做不少买卖吧..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15559
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8bfcb82d:

    # p "Er... and they have good tea, you told me that, so I know it has tea..."
    p "对了... 你还说他们有好茶，我记得，所以他们肯定产茶..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15561
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f999db7d:

    # "Unfortunately, you quickly realize that you've forgotten most of what Rajeeyah had said."
    "糟糕的是，你很快意识到，Rajeeyah说的大部分内容你都记不清了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15565
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a4e86aa6:

    # p "I hear the crew talking about it. It sounds exciting? They must do a lot of trading. The cities are quite old."
    p "我听见船员们在聊起它。听起来挺有意思的？他们肯定在那边做不少买卖。那里的城市都挺古老的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15567
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_64db4381:

    # p "It's... hot, probably?"
    p "那边... 应该很热吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15571
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2ce743d2:

    # "You finish rather weakly, but Rajeeyah seems more amused than anything else."
    "你的回答听起来有气无力，但Rajeeyah似乎觉得这有点好笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15575
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7e6b5abb:

    # r "{i}Definitely{/i}. My father claims our lineage traces back to Syria, and the Umayyads. They conquered Morocco ages ago."
    r "{i}那是当然{/i}。我父亲说我们家能追溯到叙利亚的倭马亚王朝。他们很久以前就征服了摩洛哥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15577
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_10e9522e:

    # r "Before that, it was the domain of the Amazigh. The people of the desert—of Numidia, and Carthage, and Mauretania. They nearly conquered Rome... you've heard of Rome, at least, I hope?"
    r "在那之前，那里是阿马齐格人的领地。沙漠的子民——努米底亚、迦太基和毛里塔尼亚的人民。他们差点征服了罗马……你至少听说过罗马吧，我希望？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15579
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f1fd4088:

    # "You must have looked particularly lost. You certainly didn't understand the emphasis she put on the other names, although they sound excitingly foreign and enticing."
    "你当时肯定看起来很茫然。她话里对其他名字的强调，你肯定没听懂，不过那些名字听起来确实充满了异域风情，挺吸引人的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15581
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_66f45abb:

    # "Does the {i}Conway{/i} sail to those places? Maybe Samuel will have something interesting to say on that account. Does it call on Rome, even?"
    "{i}Conway号{/i}会去那些地方吗？或许Samuel能说出点有意思的东西。它甚至会去罗马靠港吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15583
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8d68dd08:

    # p "Where the Pope lives, sure."
    p "当然，就是教皇住的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15587
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_046bce10:

    # "Rajeeyah laughs."
    "Rajeeyah笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15591
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7363114d:

    # r "Now, yes. This was in the time before the Roman Empire, though. But even today, in my homeland, the Amazigh remain objects of... fear, if not respect, in some quarters."
    r "没错，现在是这样。但那可是在罗马帝国之前。即使是今天，在我的家乡，{a=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Berbers}阿马齐格人{/a}在某些地方仍然是让人... 感到恐惧的存在，就算不说是敬畏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15593
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_9fb4c725:

    # p "Fear?"
    p "恐惧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15597
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_987e828f:

    # r "Between the looms of Safi and the bazaars of Marrakesh, a caravan could encounter... difficulties. More dangerous predators than simple asps."
    r "在萨菲的织布机和马拉喀什的集市之间，商队可能会遇到... 一些麻烦。会遇上比毒蛇更危险的掠食者。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15599
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_497704f7:

    # p "Criminals? Gangs?"
    p "罪犯？还是帮派？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15601
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_146d3b24:

    # r "Indeed."
    r "确实。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15603
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_122803cf:

    # p "Did that happen to your family?"
    p "你们家也遇到过这种事吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15605
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_90a23e6f:

    # r "Almost."
    r "差不多吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15609
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b31cda4f:

    # "Silence descends between the two of you. Is she waiting for you to say something?"
    "你们俩之间陷入了沉默。她是在等我说些什么吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15616
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6e84e49a:

    # p "There was some kind of an attack? You escaped, somehow? But... er, but not all of you? Someone in your family-"
    p "发生了袭击？你设法逃脱了？但是... 呃，但不是所有人都逃了出来？你家里是不是有人..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15620
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0ce323c2:

    # r "I assure you, [name], my life is not {i}that{/i} exciting."
    r "我向你保证，[name]，我的生活可没{i}那么{/i}精彩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15622
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f43c410b:

    # r "No. They shared tea with us. Sizing us up, of course, I'm sure. It was my first trip to Marrakesh. I was still a girl, eager to see the world."
    r "不，他们只是和我们一起喝了茶。当然，我肯定他们是在暗中打量我们。那是我第一次去马拉喀什，还是个小姑娘，特别渴望看看外面的世界。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15626
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4cec7cd4:

    # r "One of them was no older than I, and filled with the same kind of spirit."
    r "其中有一个人年纪和我差不多大，也充满了同样的活力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15632
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d87df7e5:

    # r "I don't mean to ramble. I'm surprised to find it's difficult to talk about, even now."
    r "我不是故意要说这些的。我很惊讶，直到现在，说起这些事还是很困难。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15634
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e9681be7:

    # p "I don't want to... make things worse for you, if that's what's happening?"
    p "我不想... 如果真是那样的话，我不想让你更难受？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15636
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0b8f20b6:

    # "Your curiosity is probably painted on your features, though. In any case, Rajeeyah shakes her head."
    "估计你的好奇心都写在脸上了吧。总之，Rajeeyah摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15640
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f9b03ea7:

    # r "The point is that when we encountered them, one of them in particular stood out. A young man, not much older than I was."
    r "关键是，当我们遇到他们的时候，有一个人特别引人注目。是个年轻人，比我也大不了多少。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15642
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_97a62f93:

    # r "He said his name was Arezki. He told my father that they were simply travelers, themselves. Bound for Safi, as it happened. There was no attack. My father posted guards, but they saw nothing."
    r "他说他叫Arezki。他告诉我父亲，他们也只是旅行者，碰巧也要去萨菲。什么袭击也没有发生。我父亲派了守卫，但他们什么也没看到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15644
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_11bec9c3:

    # r "Then again, they could not have been paying {i}too{/i} much attention. {i}I{/i} slipped out, after all."
    r "话说回来，他们当时可能也没{i}太{/i}注意。毕竟，{i}我{/i}自己都偷偷溜出去了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15646
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ce50f3c5:

    # "The revelation of a name starts to bring everything into focus."
    "随着这个名字的出现，一切都开始变得清晰起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15648
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1476089c:

    # p "The person who became your partner. That's Arezki?"
    p "成为你伴侣的那个人，是Arezki？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15650
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_92b924cc:

    # r "He told me such fascinating stories, that night. How they lived—where they'd come from, how far they traveled across the desert. He told me about Tripoli, and seeing great warships sailing through Gibraltar.{w} Was it true?"
    r "那天晚上，他给我讲了许多迷人的故事。关于他们的生活方式——他们来自哪里，他们穿越沙漠走了多远。他告诉我关于的黎波里的事，以及看到巨大的战舰驶过直布罗陀海峡。{w}那是真的吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15654
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a8d3d62a:

    # "Rajeeyah seems to be lost in thought—or reverie. Eventually she shakes her head."
    "拉吉娅似乎陷入了沉思——或者说遐想。最终她摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15658
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_607c6450:

    # r "Who can say? At the time, I believed it. Just before the sun came up, he gave me a silver bracelet, worked in the style of his tribe."
    r "谁知道呢？反正当时我是信了。就在太阳出来之前，他还送给我一个银手镯，说是他们部落的样式。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15660
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_23e6b9ef:

    # r "Well, according to him."
    r "嗯，他是这么说的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15662
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_37a1ee27:

    # r "He told me it was only a loan, and he'd return to find out how I liked it."
    r "他说只是借给我戴戴，过些日子会回来问我喜不喜欢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15664
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_17697e23:

    # p "You saw him again, obviously."
    p "后来你又见过他，那是肯定的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15666
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_cf207963:

    # r "In Safi. Six months later. He was claiming to be a traveling scholar, who happened to have a book I'd been looking for. Nobody remembered him, or else he was so charming that they pretended not to..."
    r "在萨菲。过了六个月。他那会儿自称是个游历四方的学者，正好有本我一直在找的书。没人记得他了，要么就是他太会装了，装得大家都好像不认识他一样……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15670
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_230c1a13:

    # r "And his accent! You'd never know. He spoke our dialect flawlessly."
    r "还有他的口音！你根本听不出来。咱们这儿的方言，他说的溜得很。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15674
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8e9857f5:

    # r "I heard it often... after I fell for him."
    r "我后来经常听到……就是我爱上他之后。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15678
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2875d597:

    # "She regards you, as if trying to see how that revelation has landed. But she isn't telling you anything you didn't already know."
    "她看着你，好像想看看你听了这话是什么反应。不过她说的这些，你早就知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15681
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_593d76c7:

    # "She regards you, as if trying to see how that revelation has landed."
    "她看着你，好像想看看你听了这话是什么反应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15683
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_62a6d8d4:

    # r "Have you ever been in love? You must've."
    r "你谈过恋爱吗？肯定有吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15685
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p "那个..."

# game/script day12.rpy:15695
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6f905c68:

    # "You shift on the stool you are sitting on"
    "你在坐着的小圆凳上挪了挪身子"

# game/script day12.rpy:15697
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f6993090:

    # p "I guess you could say that. Nothing that ever formed into anything serious..."
    p "算是谈过吧。也没什么正经的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15699
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e1654e2a:

    # p "But I had... well, I guess the usual teenage love affairs. Being smitten head over heels for about a few months before it all falls apart because we were both, well, still dumb children at heart."
    p "不过我也有过……嗯，就是那种青春期的小恋爱。每天都晕乎乎的，觉得爱得死去活来，结果没几个月就散了，因为那时候大家都还是小屁孩儿，不懂事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15701
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d6283aed:

    # p "And neither of us really knew who we were yet."
    p "谁都不知道自己到底想要什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15705
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4cae3b6a:

    # p "Though we sure as hell were confident that we did."
    p "虽然那时候我们都觉得自己什么都懂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15707
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3592f045:

    # "She chuckles at your admission, probably just too aware of what you're talking about."
    "听了你的话，她忍不住笑了出来，可能觉得你说的太对了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15715
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fe66771d:

    # "You shift awkwardly."
    "你有点不自在地动了动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15717
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_245f7b4a:

    # p "I don't know? I've been attracted to people before... er, wanted to spend more time with them..."
    p "我也不知道……之前也对人动心过，就是……想跟他们多待一会儿……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15721
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_94ecb7bf:

    # r "He could say things that made me do..."
    r "他会说一些让我……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15725
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_915ecb8f:

    # "Now it is Rajeeyah's turn to hesitate. She gives a soft laugh."
    "这下轮到Rajeeyah犹豫了。她轻轻笑了笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15729
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_23ee3d8f:

    # r "You {i}are{/i} easy to talk to, I must admit. I can't believe I'm saying this."
    r "我得承认，你{i}这人真挺好说话的。{/i}真不敢相信自己会说这些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15731
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3bd5464d:

    # r "Arezki could say things that would make me do foolish things."
    r "Arezki会说一些让我犯傻的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15735
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6d0da104:

    # r "{i}Beyond{/i} foolish, for a young woman like me."
    r "对于我这么个年轻姑娘来说，那些事可{i}远不止是{/i}犯傻那么简单。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15737
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_90898ac5:

    # p "Like... er, like-"
    p "比如……嗯，比如——"

# game/script day12.rpy:15741
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_33fb9a45:

    # r "{i}Yes{/i}, if you must know. But that isn't what I was referring to."
    r "{i}是{/i}，你想知道我就告诉你。不过我说的不是那事儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15745
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8ecdbc90:

    # r "He had me completely under his spell."
    r "我那时候完全被他迷住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15749
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7f0c95fd:

    # r "...No. No, that makes it sound like I was his victim. I wasn't, and he wasn't mine. Others, though..."
    r "……不对。不对，这么说好像我是受害者似的。我不是，他也不是。不过其他人，就不好说了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15751
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2c47fe27:

    # p "Others? Other lovers, or other victims?"
    p "还有别人？是其他的相好，还是……其他的受害者？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15755
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_82071b73:

    # "The cheetah stares at you, and curls her muzzle in the kind of smile you'd come to expect more from someone like Samuel."
    "猎豹盯着你，嘴角一咧，露出那种笑容，你觉得Samuel那家伙才更应该有这种表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15757
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2d895155:

    # p "...Victims. How's that?"
    p "……受害者？这话怎么说？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15761
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2fb0bc73:

    # r "There was a rich trader—a foreigner. Portuguese, I think. Visiting from Mogador. I felt his eyes on me, in a coffee house near the harbor, as if I was just something else he might acquire on his travels. Suddenly Arezki grabbed my necklace and raised his voice."
    r "有个富商——一个外国人。我想是葡萄牙人。从莫加多尔来的。在港口附近的一家咖啡馆里，我感到他的目光落在我身上，仿佛我只是他旅途中可能获得的又一件物品。突然，Arezki抓住我的项链，提高了嗓门。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15763
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ad691c1d:

    # r "{i}\"Fifteen. And don't think I'll hesitate to question your honor, woman. Not the way you're lying to me.\"{/i} I looked at him. He winked. {i}\"Fifteen dirhams—and you're lucky, at that.\"{/i}"
    r "‘{i}十五。别以为我会顾忌你的体面，女人。谁让你满嘴谎话连篇。{/i}’我看着他，他朝我眨了眨眼：‘{i}十五迪拉姆——而且这还是你走运了。{/i}’"
    # 译注: dirham（迪拉姆），摩洛哥传统银币货币单位。

# game/script day12.rpy:15765
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_69c38439:

    # r "It was a bit of glass he'd brought to me from Tunis, barely worth more than a bronze {i}falus{/i} or two. But for some reason, I told him—firmly as I could: {i}\"Eighty.\"{/i} It didn't take more than a few more words before the merchant came over to see what the fuss was about."
    r "那不过是他从突尼斯带给我的一块玻璃料子，顶多值一两枚铜钱{i}法鲁斯{/i}。但不知为何，我却硬着头皮、尽可能坚定地冲他要价：‘{i}八十。{/i}’还没争辩几句，集市摊主便凑过来瞧热闹了。"
    # 译注: falus（法鲁斯），摩洛哥传统铜币铸币。

# game/script day12.rpy:15767
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ef786927:

    # r "Arezki explained that I was lying about its worth. Yes, he said—and he was waving his hand dismissively, like he knew everything in the world. Yes, it {i}was{/i} a Tunisian sapphire, but..."
    r "Arezki解释说，我在谎报它的价值。是的，他说——他一边说一边不屑地挥着手，好像他无所不知。是的，这{i}确实是{/i}一颗突尼斯蓝宝石，但是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15769
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_282280ae:

    # "As she tells the story, you can sense her adopting his mannerisms. An effortless shake of her head; a roll of her eye. A twitch of her swaying tail, as the argument she describes becomes more heated."
    "听她讲述这段往事，你仿佛能感受到她正在模仿对方的举止。不经意地摇头，不屑地翻白眼。她摇摆的尾巴也抽动了一下，似乎正如她所说，争吵变得愈发激烈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15771
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_24bc8058:

    # r "I countered that it was from the workshop of the famous jeweler al-Abassid. A smaller stone had sold for 400 dirhams just the month before."
    r "我反驳说，这块宝石出自著名珠宝匠al-Abassid的工作室。就在上个月，一块小点的同类宝石还卖了 400 dirhams呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15773
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c30620d0:

    # p "What's a dirham?"
    p "dirhams是什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15775
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_9fb9465c:

    # r "A silver coin. The price of a meal, more or less."
    r "一种银币。大概够吃顿饭吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15777
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_74bb0b12:

    # p "A lot of good tea, then."
    p "那能买好多好茶了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15781
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_20a3427e:

    # "Rajeeyah laughs at that."
    "Rajeeyah听了，嗤笑一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15785
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b17ba3b6:

    # r "A great deal of it, indeed. Arezki very patronizingly explained to me, and the merchant, that the other stone was one cut by al-Abassid himself. This was from an apprentice—truly bringing out the luster would take much more work. He offered me 20 dirhams."
    r "确实能买很多。Arezki用一种居高临下的口吻向我，也向那个商人解释说，另一颗宝石是阿巴西德亲自切割的。这颗是出自学徒之手——要真正展现其光泽需要更多工序。他出价20迪拉姆给我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15787
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_430e9102:

    # r "I took the necklace out of his hand and nearly spat in his face."
    r "我一把抢过项链，差点没朝他脸上啐一口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15789
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d2d7679f:

    # "It's hard to imagine the scrupulous cheetah spitting, but by the animated waving of her tail, the memory is an exciting one."
    "真难想象一丝不苟的猎豹会做出啐人这种事，不过看她兴奋地直摇尾巴，就知道这事儿让她多来劲。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15791
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4c0a9b72:

    # r "He said he could give me 40, but that he'd have to return to the {i}souk{/i} where his servants were guarding his stall. The merchant produced a gold coin from his own realm. I gave him the necklace."
    r "他说最多给40，他还得回{i}市场{/i}，让他的仆人继续守摊。那个商人倒是阔气，直接掏出他们国家的金币。我就把项链给他了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15793
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1734fba2:

    # p "What was the coin worth?"
    p "那枚金币值多少？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15797
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d0543e96:

    # r "A hundred dirhams, perhaps? He overpaid, because he desired me. Arezki stormed off in a huff. The merchant went back to his residence."
    r "大概一百dirhams吧？ 他是看上我了，所以才多给的。Arezki气得鼻子都歪了，哼了一声就走了。 那个商人就回他住的地方了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15803
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f486b045:

    # "You think about the story Julian told, at dinner on your first night at sea. It was just a boyish escapade for him, something to be joked about."
    "你想起Julian在出海第一晚的晚宴上讲的故事。对他来说，那不过是少年时的一场胡闹，一件能拿来当笑话说的事儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15805
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_bdd50db5:

    # "Rajeeyah seems more conflicted about this one, as the story comes to its conclusion. You're pretty certain you know why. She doesn't want to admit the truth."
    "Rajeeyah似乎对这件事有些纠结，故事都快讲完了，她还是这样。你很清楚她在顾虑什么，她是不想承认真相。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15807
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_11b667a4:

    # "For all her mild-mannered, serious demeanor, she recalls it just as fondly as Julian did."
    "别看她平时那么温和严肃，提起这件事，她回忆起来的样子和Julian一样，带着喜爱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15811
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_91525f7f:

    # "She seems conflicted about the story. You're pretty certain you know why. She doesn't want to admit the truth."
    "她似乎对这个故事有些纠结，你很清楚她在顾虑什么，她是不想承认真相。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15813
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_45523a5e:

    # "She enjoyed every moment of it."
    "她很享受那段时光。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15815
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_547e0e8d:

    # r "That night, Arezki put it back around my neck. He'd slipped it from the merchant without the man noticing."
    r "那天晚上，Arezki又把它给我戴了回去。他从那个商人那里顺走的，那家伙根本就没注意到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15819
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_368f903e:

    # r "I felt very clever."
    r "我当时觉得自己可机灵了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15821
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7c34e9a3:

    # "A part of her, you sense, knows that she should feel guilty about the theft. It's not quite enough to hide the ghost of a quirky smile."
    "你能感觉到，她心里其实知道自己应该为盗窃感到内疚，但这还不足以掩盖她脸上那一丝若有若无的古怪笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15825
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_efeb0e11:

    # r "That wasn't the only time. There was a romance to it, you must understand."
    r "可不止那一次。你必须明白，那其中带着几分浪漫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15827
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a96eadce:

    # p "It seems... er, I mean... well. If you don't mind me saying, it doesn't really seem like you."
    p "好像...嗯，我是说...这个嘛。如果你不介意我直说，这真不像你会做的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15829
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_32d1bfc3:

    # r "It wasn't. It was a different me. And the only time that I could be that woman."
    r "并不是。那是另一个我，也是我唯一能变成那样的自己的时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15831
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_612d6b14:

    # r "I still don't know what we were.{w} Accomplices?{w} Lovers?"
    r "我到现在还是不明白我们算什么… {w} 是同谋？{w} 还是情人？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15835
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fba92034:

    # "She looks around her, at the neat assortment of boxes, adorned with her delicate handwriting. Briefly, you perceive it through her eyes at that moment. How featureless they are, like the identical brown apothecarist's bottles the boxes protect."
    "她环顾四周，那些整齐的箱子上，是她秀气的字迹。那一刻，我仿佛透过她的眼睛看到了这些东西——多么平淡无奇，就像那些装着药品的棕色药瓶，一个样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15837
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8fab7c49:

    # "Instead of the product of hard work and skill, a lifetime's accomplishment, the rules they impose seem to bound an existence just as featureless."
    "他们强加的规矩，与其说是辛勤付出和精湛技艺的结晶，一辈子的成就，倒不如说是对人生的束缚，同样是平淡无奇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15839
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_953ef14c:

    # r "He told me that I could be anything. He looked at my hands and said they could be a scribe's hands. Or a surgeon's hands. He said that I was no more bound to one form, one destiny, than the sand dunes were bound to one form, or destiny."
    r "他跟我说，我能成为任何我想成为的人。他看着我的手，说这双手可以握笔为文，也能执刀行医。他说，我不该被一种形式、一种命运束缚，就像沙丘不该被一种形状或命运限定一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15841
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_60c07821:

    # r "And{w}... I... believed him."
    r "然后{w}… 我… 我相信了他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15845
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1ca08dac:

    # r "I {i}believe{/i} him."
    r "我 {i}相信{/i} 他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15847
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ad52c7d1:

    # r "In spite of everything, when he says it, I believe him. That's why I..."
    r "就算经历了这么多，当他这么说的时候，我还是相信他。所以我才…"

# game/script day12.rpy:15849
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0e21f1aa:

    # "She trails off, looking at the piece of paper."
    "她看着手中的纸，声音越来越小。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15851
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e44a31ea:

    # p "But you could. You {i}did{/i} become a surgeon. I know I'm never going to be able to do that. So... he was right, wasn't he?"
    p "可是你做到了啊。你{i}真的{/i}成了外科医生。我知道我这辈子是没希望了。所以… 他说的是对的，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15853
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_31755fd6:

    # r "Nearly. I could be {i}nearly{/i} anything.{w} I just couldn't be his."
    r "几乎无所不能。我{i}几乎{/i}可以成为任何角色，{w}唯独无法成为专属于他的女人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15856
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_455649d8:

    # r "{cps=5000}Nearly. I could be {i}nearly{/i} anything.{w} I just couldn't be his.{/cps}" nointeract
    r "" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:15862
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d633307a:

    # r "Sometimes I did. I..."
    r "有时候我的确是这么想的。我…"

# game/script day12.rpy:15864
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0f15fad2:

    # "She looks away, her face momentarily darkening."
    "她躲开了我的目光，脸色瞬间阴沉了下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15866
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ce9a2155:

    # r "Sometimes I do. But what {i}I{/i} wanted was never going to be the only factor."
    r "有时候我的确这么想。但是，想做什么，并不能只考虑{i}我{/i}自己的意愿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15868
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2dd079d0:

    # p "What mattered more than that?"
    p "还有什么比这更重要？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15874
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f2df5c96:

    # r "I did. Look where it's gotten me."
    r "我就是太任性了。你看看我落得个什么下场。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15876
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fdb479e7:

    # p "But you didn't know you were going to end up on a ship like the {i}Conway{/i} then, right?"
    p "但你当时也不知道自己会登上{i}Conway号{/i}这样的船吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15878
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_25cd8f54:

    # r "No. And it wouldn't have solved my problems. Just as it hasn't now."
    r "是啊。而且就算知道也没用，问题还是解决不了，就像现在这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15880
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5f815775:

    # p "What do you mean?"
    p "你这话什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15884
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_904db670:

    # r "In my culture, family is everything. Rajeeyah bint Yousef means Rajeeyah, the daughter of Yousef. Do you know your great-grandfather's name? Or his father's?"
    r "在我们那儿，家庭就是一切。Rajeeyah bint Yousef，意思是 Rajeeyah，Yousef 的女儿。你知道你曾祖父的名字吗？还有他父亲的名字？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15886
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_53976138:

    # "You shake your head."
    "你摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15888
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4d973063:

    # r "My father is Abu Khalid Yousef ibn Mansour ibn Said ibn Nassif ibn Jarrah al-Malihah. I could keep going, but... well."
    r "我父亲是 Abu Khalid Yousef ibn Mansour ibn Said ibn Nassif ibn Jarrah al-Malihah。我能一直说下去，不过… 还是算了吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15892
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_54c6837e:

    # r "What it comes down to is this: my family would never permit me to marry an outsider. A Berber, at that. Do you know the word 'barbarian'? It is the same word. That's what they call the Amazigh."
    r "归根结底就是：我的家人绝不允许我嫁给外人，更别说是柏柏尔人了。你知道“野蛮人(barbarian)”这个词吗？就是同一个词根。他们就是这么称呼阿马齐格人(Amazigh)的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15894
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_050bc01d:

    # r "Arezki told me that I did not need my family. And I believed him about that, too."
    r "Arezki告诉我，我不需要我的家人。关于这一点，我也深信不疑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15898
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fc7975a0:

    # r "One day a letter came to me from Rabat, a town in the north. A European order there said they were pleased to accept me as a student—recommended, as I was, by an eastern sultan."
    r "有一天，我收到一封来自北部城镇拉巴特的信。那里的一家欧洲机构表示，他们很高兴接纳我为学生——正如我所料，是由一位东方苏丹推荐的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15900
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_938c6880:

    # r "He was unknown, but of great largesse. He even included a... gift to demonstrate his sincerity."
    r "他名不见经传，出手却很阔绰，甚至还送了礼物来表示诚意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15902
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_11d44f8d:

    # p "A gift, or a bribe?"
    p "是礼物，还是贿赂？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15906
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_bdffc786:

    # "Rajeeyah smiles knowingly."
    "Rajeeyah意味深长地笑了笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15908
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6acd6a66:

    # p "Arezki?"
    p "Arezki？"

# game/script day12.rpy:15912
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_799ba32e:

    # r "Yes. My father was unhappy—maybe he guessed? He let me go, though. I learned medicine there."
    r "是的。我父亲很不高兴——也许他猜到了？不过他还是让我去了。我在那里学习了医学。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15914
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8795558e:

    # r "Even after the sultan stopped writing, they let me continue."
    r "即使后来那位苏丹不再来信，他们还是让我继续学下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15916
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_814cb89f:

    # r "When I saw Arezki again, he was... sincerely proud of me, I think. But he also suggested that, with what I'd learned, I could be a masterful alchemist. They're always in demand."
    r "后来我再次见到Arezki，我觉得他是真心为我感到骄傲。但他也暗示，凭我学到的本事，完全可以成为一个出色的炼金术士，这种人可是很抢手的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15920
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_56584745:

    # r "Or a peddler of nostrums and cure-alls. Or the inventor of an elixir of youth—you get the idea."
    r "或者成为兜售万灵药和特效药的江湖郎中。或者发明青春灵药的人——你明白我的意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15922
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3087ccce:

    # r "And if I wanted to travel, well... think of how convincing we could be. Two mysterious travelers from North Africa, bearing our ancient texts and wisdom? Any number of European courts would've hosted us, it was true."
    r "而且如果我想去旅行，你想想我们能有多唬人？两个来自北非的神秘旅行者，带着古老的典籍和智慧？随便哪个欧洲宫廷都会款待我们，那可是真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15924
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c35d4220:

    # r "I just didn't... I didn't want to {i}be{/i} that. Not anymore."
    r "我只是不想……我不想{i}变成{/i}那样的人。再也不想了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15928
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5fb95ed8:

    # r "{cps=5000}I just didn't... I didn't want to {i}be{/i} that. Not anymore.{/cps}" nointeract
    r "{cps=5000}我只是不想……我不想{i}变成{/i}那样的人。再也不想了。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:15934
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6c7dc72c:

    # r "I wanted to be able to stay in a town even after people learned who I was."
    r "我希望就算人们知道我是谁，我也可以继续待在一个地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15936
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0ad6fdf1:

    # r "And it turned out that I was good at being a surgeon—as good as I ever was at being a swindler."
    r "而事实证明，我擅长做一名外科医生——就像我当初擅长做骗子一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15940
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4db47513:

    # r "But sometimes..."
    r "但有时候……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15944
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_52997a86:

    # p "You still miss him."
    p "你还是会想他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15950
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b8c8bd52:

    # "Rajeeyah laughs sadly."
    "Rajeeyah 悲伤地笑了笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15954
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_525d95af:

    # r "Yes. I guess... that's what we were, really."
    r "是的。我想……说到底，我们当初确实就是那样的关系。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15956
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1284e1f8:

    # r "I wish that I could say I regret all of it, or that... that what bothered me was something more meaningful than fearing I might never have one place to call home with someone."
    r "我真希望我能说我后悔做过的一切，或者说……困扰我的不该仅仅是害怕永远无法拥有一个能和某人一起称之为家的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15958
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_745780f3:

    # r "He's never been able to settle down. Always a new scheme, a new adventure..."
    r "他就没安定下来过。永远都是新的计划，新的冒险……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15960
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2c076cf3:

    # r "When we needed money, he made it appear."
    r "只要我们缺钱，他总能弄到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15962
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_69ac1be7:

    # p "I can see why it would be exciting.{w} And frustrating."
    p "我能想象那有多刺激了。{w} 但也很让人抓狂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15967
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_59a7a760:

    # r "I think he does care about me. He would disappear, or be on the run, but... more than that, he cares about those close to him... in his own way."
    r "我觉得他心里有我。他总是会玩失踪，或者东躲西藏，但……更重要的是，他会用自己的方式关心那些亲近的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15969
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_84b1f94e:

    # r "I think I told you this already, but..."
    r "我觉得我应该跟你说过，但是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15971
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2249045f:

    # r "Sometimes, when he left, it was because they needed help. Money to bribe a local official who was detaining them, or... something more direct. Someone quick with a blade."
    r "有时候他离开，是因为有人需要帮忙。可能是要花钱贿赂扣押他们的当地官员，或者……更直接的，需要一个身手利落的刀客。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15975
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7a99c84b:

    # r "I can respect that, somewhat. Even if it put us at odds at the time."
    r "我多少能理解他，就算当时我们因此闹翻了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15977
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a40b910f:

    # r "But we try."
    r "但我们都在努力维系。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15981
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_92396b59:

    # r "And well, now I guess it is at the point where I am unsure where we stand..."
    r "现在嘛，我开始不确定我们之间到底算什么了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:15983
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_69d5ccef:

    # r "Whether it still is a relationship, or if it ever truly was, I don't know."
    r "这算不算一段感情，或者说，它曾经真的存在过吗？我也不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15985
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_eecb412a:

    # r "I guess it's just making me nervous being this close to setting my paws back on Moroccan soil.{w} Back home. And I'm feeling the need to get this off my chest."
    r "也许是因为要重新踏上摩洛哥的土地了，{w} 回家了，这让我有点紧张，所以才想跟你倾诉一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15987
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6fb7a72c:

    # r "I'm sorry."
    r "我错了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15989
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4c883017:

    # p "It would make anyone nervous.{w} Don't apologize."
    p "换作任何人都会紧张的。{w}用不着道歉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15993
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6e392d6f:

    # p "If talking about it helps, then I can take over the role of the ship's doctor for a moment."
    p "要是说出来会好受点，我不介意暂时扮演一下船医的角色。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15995
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c5768715:

    # p "Though I don't have it in my power to hand you the rum."
    p "虽然我没法给你来一杯朗姆酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15997
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5a9eca42:

    # "You try to bring some levity into it."
    "你想让气氛变得轻松一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:15999
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_9796605e:

    # "It lands without much of a reaction."
    "这话递过去并未激起太大的反应。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16001
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_508f82a3:

    # r "I think he does care about me. He told me he would do whatever I wanted."
    r "我觉得他心里有我。他说他会为我做任何事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16003
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0d719d51:

    # r "I told him to stop."
    r "我让他别这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16005
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_482e0178:

    # r "But, again and again he would disappear, or be on the run, but... more than he cared about me, he cares about those close to him... in his own way."
    r "可是，他还是会一次又一次地消失，或者东躲西藏，而且……比起我，他更关心那些亲近的人，用他自己的方式。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16007
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e9aa260b:

    # r "Sometimes, when he left, it was because they needed help. Money to bribe a local official who was detaining them, or...{w} something more direct. Someone quick with a blade."
    r "有时他会突然离开，是因为家里需要帮忙。可能是需要钱去贿赂扣押他们的当地官员，或者...{w} 更直接的手段——比如找个用刀子够快的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16009
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_74a51214:

    # r "At some point I told him that I had a brighter future, that we would never speak again."
    r "我曾经跟他说过，我会有更好的前途，我们以后都不要再见面了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16013
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0e493581:

    # "She shakes her head."
    "她摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16017
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_11c799fd:

    # r "I suppose I meant all of it—at the time."
    r "我想当时我是真心的——所有的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16019
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_689cde29:

    # p "I'd probably feel the same if my partner kept on disappearing again and again."
    p "如果我的伴侣总是动不动就消失，我大概也会有一样的感觉吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16021
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5bf73ac9:

    # p "He never told you why?"
    p "他没告诉你原因吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16025
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_bf645566:

    # r "No, but I knew."
    r "没有，但我知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16027
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8b6d8ce7:

    # r "He never made it too much of a secret to me that when his family comes calling he comes to help."
    r "他从不对我掩饰这一点：只要家里人一声招呼，他必定会全力施以援手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16029
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8463469b:

    # p "It does sound like it hasn't been smooth sailing for you."
    p "听起来你这一路走来，并不顺利啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16033
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_328330f4:

    # p "I guess at least you two are keeping in touch."
    p "我想至少你们还保持着联系。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16035
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ebcf0df9:

    # "Your eyes linger on the crumpled papers."
    "你的目光停留在那些揉皱的纸上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16037
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c920b70a:

    # p "With some difficulty, it seems."
    p "看来你们之间有些困难。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16039
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1860fb7a:

    # r "You know that by now. I wouldn't have left if there weren't difficulties."
    r "你现在应该明白了吧。如果不是迫不得已，我也不会离开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16041
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_875ce35a:

    # p ". . ."
    p ". . ."

# game/script day12.rpy:16043
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_55c43c87:

    # p "I guess relationships always require some effort."
    p "我想，所有的关系都需要付出努力才能维持吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16045
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e304ada5:

    # r "I suppose."
    r "也许吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16049
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ffcef0bf:

    # r "I've written him hundreds of letters since then, if not more."
    r "从那以后，我给他写了几百封信，说不定还不止。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16051
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b5342f5e:

    # "Her attention shifts to the table again."
    "她的注意力再次回到桌面上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16053
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ab44f23e:

    # p "That's good, isn't it? You've been on this ship for a few years, so that sounds like, what?{w} Probably a letter every other week if not mor-"
    p "这不是挺好的吗？你在这艘船上待了也有几年了，听起来你大概每隔一周都会写一封信，说不定更多。{w} -"

# game/script day12.rpy:16055
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2e7e26af:

    # r "I haven't sent a single one of them."
    r "我一封都没寄出去过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16057
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_078c5a26:

    # p "Oh..."
    p "哦..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16059
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fd57272f:

    # p "Not even one?"
    p "一封也没有吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16061
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_915ea3a0:

    # "She just shakes her head."
    "她只是摇摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16063
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3a6bdb46:

    # r "Even this one..."
    r "连这封也是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16067
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_daa6c6e8:

    # "She takes the sheet of paper and lifts it from the table, reading it in silence."
    "她拿起桌上的那张纸，默默地读了起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16071
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e9d527c8:

    # r "I have written this letter a hundred times, maybe more. Yet I cannot get it right."
    r "这封信我写了不下百遍，可总觉得不对。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16073
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_334c98d4:

    # r "It almost feels like there's something in me that doesn't {i}want{/i} to get it right."
    r "感觉好像我身体里有个声音，不 {i}想{/i} 让我把它寄出去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16075
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ced6ba65:

    # p "Hm..."
    p "嗯..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16077
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_23dd50ab:

    # p "I wish I knew the solution."
    p "我真希望知道该怎么办。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16081
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b03aaa43:

    # r "I don't expect you to, [name]."
    r "我也没指望你能知道， [name]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16083
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8fd7c198:

    # r "I just—I appreciate the set of ears."
    r "我只是——很感谢有双耳朵倾听。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16085
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_187abcff:

    # p "Still..."
    p "还是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16087
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_794e31b0:

    # "All of a sudden you realize how tense you have become, and you take a slow breath."
    "你忽然意识到自己有多紧张，于是缓缓地吸了一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16091
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_10606fdc:

    # r "I think that I should visit him again even after how long it's been."
    r "即使已经过了这么久，我想我还是应该再去看看他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16093
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_48294562:

    # r "If only to ask how he's doing."
    r "哪怕只是想问问他最近怎么样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16097
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_48f5546d:

    # r "But..."
    r "但是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16099
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_eed415c1:

    # p "You're afraid of what he might say..."
    p "你是怕他会说出什么吧…"

# game/script day12.rpy:16101
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_cc4fae5a:

    # r "Mm..."
    r "嗯…"

# game/script day12.rpy:16103
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4faebce2:

    # r "Or rather, what he might not say."
    r "更准确地说，是怕他什么都不说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16105
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5a3204d7:

    # "She leans back in the chair, staring at the ceiling."
    "她向后倚在椅子里，眼睛望着天花板。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16107
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e2d045f2:

    # r "Ah, if only he could simply be waiting there when we arrive and take the decision from me."
    r "唉，要是咱们到的时候，他就在那儿等着，直接替我拿主意就好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16109
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0ec17e20:

    # p "Does he write to {i}you{/i}?"
    p "他有给你写信吗，{i}你{/i}？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16111
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1d53767a:

    # r "Well..."
    r "那个..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16115
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3f4e4052:

    # r "Between the two of us, I travel further—at more inconvenient times, and in more inconvenient fashions. Who knows what port I'll call at next?"
    r "我们两人之间，我走得更远——在更不方便的时间，以更不方便的方式。谁知道我下一个会停靠哪个港口？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16117
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_24905052:

    # r "I can't expect him to write."
    r "我也不敢指望他能来信。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16120
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f0e92d43:

    # r "{cps=5000}I can't expect him to write.{/cps}" nointeract
    r "{cps=5000}我也不敢指望他能来信。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:16126
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_24b97460:

    # p "You should try to find him. Maybe you'll get lucky, and he'll be in port for some reason—or close enough to travel before we sail again."
    p "你应该试着去找他。也许你会走运，他因为某种原因就在港口——或者离得足够近，能在我们再次起航前赶过去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16128
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_40bd9be1:

    # p "Or..."
    p "还是说…"

# game/script day12.rpy:16130
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_154172cc:

    # p "You're not thinking of leaving the ship, though, are you?"
    p "你可别是想撂挑子不干了吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16134
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_73ae705d_1:

    # r "No."
    r "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16136
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2296e486:

    # p "Thank God. Arthur {i}really{/i} wouldn't forgive me, then."
    p "谢天谢地。不然Arthur{i}真{/i}饶不了我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16140
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_febd98bd:

    # r "I'm still thankful for my work on the {i}Conway{/i}. This is something that occupies my mind, but I don't think it will ever replace my duties."
    r "我依然十分感激能在{i}Conway号{/i}上谋得这份差事。那些私事固然占据了我的思绪，但我绝不会让它耽误我的本职工作。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16142
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_15dcbe5e:

    # r "I mean to write the letter, at least. I'm just not sure what to say."
    r "至少我打算先写封信。就是不知道该从何说起。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16144
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4323af42:

    # p "Do you still have feelings for him?"
    p "你心里还有他吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16148
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_05c85da1:

    # "Rajeeyah takes a long time to gather her thoughts. Her eyes seem to be searching, although not for anything in the room. Something deeper."
    "Rajeeyah沉默了很久，似乎在搜寻着什么，但不是房间里的东西，而是更深处的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16150
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_99403903:

    # r "My father's name, as I said, is Yousef al-Malihah. That should be mine."
    r "我父亲的名字，我说过，是尤瑟夫·马利哈。我也该用这个名字。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16154
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_33ac2e5b:

    # p "Not al-Maghribi?"
    p "不是马格里比？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16158
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2687c109:

    # "You try harder to pronounce it the way she does. Rajeeyah's muzzle cracks in a brief grin at the attempt."
    "你努力模仿着她的发音。Rajeeyah见状，嘴角露出了一个浅浅的笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16160
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_73ae705d_2:

    # r "No."
    r "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16164
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f3a65a3b:

    # r "{i}al-Maghribi{/i} means \"of the Maghreb.\" The desert."
    r "{i}al-Maghribi{/i}的意思是“来自马格里布”，也就是沙漠。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16166
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_faf3dcc2:

    # p "Is that..."
    p "难道是…"

# game/script day12.rpy:16170
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_47aa772a:

    # r "Arezki's? No, their naming customs are different.{w} But I thought that it might be the one we adopt, some day. I didn't mean it as an alias, but it felt... {i}better{/i}, when I was studying. And traveling. Over time, it simply became who I am. Closer to him than not."
    r "Arezki家的？不，他们的命名习惯不一样。{w} 但我曾经想过，也许有一天我们也会用这个名字。我倒不是想把它当成假名，只是觉得……{i}更好{/i}，尤其是在学习和旅行的时候。时间长了，它就成了我的一部分。让我想起他，胜过其他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16172
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ecf7596d:

    # r "He brings out the worst in me. And the best."
    r "他能激发出我最坏的一面，也能激发出我最好的一面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16174
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_62cd976f:

    # p "You should tell him that, then. Obviously, you haven't forgotten him. Perhaps there's a way that things could work out for you."
    p "你就该把这些都告诉他。很明显，你还没忘了他。说不定你们还有机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16176
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_595fe262:

    # r "You really think so? Despite everything? All the... the times we've gone our separate ways. How long we've spent apart..."
    r "你真这么觉得？就算经历了这么多？就算我们…我们分开了这么久？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16178
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7ddd0f23:

    # p "I don't know. But I'd say that you owe it to yourself to try. If he doesn't realize what he's doing, then... well, at least you know."
    p "我说不好。但我觉得，为了自己，你也该试一试。如果他还没意识到自己的心意，那…起码你也能死心了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16180
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c7287280:

    # p "Er. Don't take my advice {i}too{/i} seriously. It's not like I know what I'm talking about."
    p "额。也别太把我这建议当回事儿。{i}我{/i}也不懂这些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16182
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6dd3a854:

    # "The cheetah dispenses with that in a gentle shake of her head."
    "猎豹轻轻摇了摇头，打消了这个念头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16184
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_57458be7:

    # r "It's still reasonable advice. I appreciate you giving it to me."
    r "这建议还是挺中肯的。谢谢你跟我说这些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16186
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b5774063:

    # r "And I have been thinking of trying to catch him again. Even if just to see how he is doing."
    r "而且我一直在考虑再去见他一面，看看他近况如何。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16188
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_224ee0f0:

    # r "I suppose I should try once again and see what happens. We'll be tying up soon enough, and then there'll be plenty to do..."
    r "我想我应该再努力一次，看看会发生什么。我们很快就要靠岸了，到时候事情可就多了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16190
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5b9d25af:

    # p "I'm looking forward to it, now."
    p "我现在很期待。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16196
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_df08051d:

    # r "Samuel was right about you, you know."
    r "你知道吗，Samuel 对你的评价很正确。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16198
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6000efd3:

    # p "Samuel?"
    p "Samuel？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16200
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8af79a89:

    # "Her smile widens a nick."
    "她的笑容更深了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16202
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2af9d183:

    # r "[He] told me how kind you were that time when [he] pulled you aside after the first night."
    r "[He]告诉我，第一晚之后[he]把你拉到一边时，你是多么善良。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16204
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d06d50c2:

    # r "Said that [he] felt so silly opening up to you but you were nothing but kind despite how silly [he] thought it was."
    r "说[he]觉得自己向你吐露心声显得傻透了，可即便[he]自己觉得荒唐，你却始终温柔相待。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16206
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a80920ec:

    # p "Oh... that. It wasn't silly of [him]."
    p "哦... 那件事。 他那样做并不傻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16208
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2da51463:

    # p "I'd never dare to think that about Samuel, or anyone for that matter, being vulnerable with me."
    p "我才不会觉得Samuel那样，或者任何人跟我掏心窝子是傻事呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16210
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_09260582:

    # p "If anything, I really enjoyed the morning with [him]."
    p "如果说有什么的话，我真的很喜欢和他在一起的那个早上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16212
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8dba9ccd:

    # "You rub the back of your head."
    "你揉了揉后脑勺。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16214
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7f0532e3:

    # r "[He] did as well, [he] said."
    r "他也一样，他说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16216
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6bedbcfd:

    # r "Try to enjoy yourself, too. Thanks for lending an ear, [name]. I really am happy that you'll be leaving with us when we sail again."
    r "尽量让自己也开心点。 谢谢你倾听，[name]。 我真的很高兴你会在我们再次航行时和我们一起离开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16218
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1bbef4c6:

    # p "My pleasure, and believe me, I am as well."
    p "我的荣幸，而且相信我，我也是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16226
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_21244030:

    # p "I don't know how to say this nicely, or if I should at all."
    p "我不知道这话该不该说，也不知道怎么说好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16228
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3d3f06fe:

    # p "But, you deserve that I am honest with you, and... well, it seems like he's not really been there for you."
    p "但我觉得你值得我跟你说实话... 他好像没怎么替你考虑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16230
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fc1544cc:

    # p "Maybe you should tell him that you need to move on."
    p "也许你应该告诉他，你需要继续前进了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16234
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5cd42471:

    # "You can see that she's thinking about what you just said, one of her canines catching her lip."
    "你能看出来她正在琢磨你的话，甚至咬起了嘴唇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16236
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ad99fee2:

    # r "I... I have been thinking about it. I just don't know if I can."
    r "我……我一直在考虑这件事。 我只是不知道我是否能做到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16238
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6e58d5c2:

    # p "Because you still... love him?"
    p "因为你仍然……爱着他？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16240
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_af7fa88c:

    # "Rajeeyah doesn't answer immediately, although you're not sure if that means it's something she needs to think about."
    "Rajeeyah没有立即回答，也不知道她是不是在犹豫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16244
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_fb7f1266:

    # r "I don't know."
    r "不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16246
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0d0df4b9:

    # r "I said my father's name is Yousef al-Malihah. That's who I was, too. Rajeeyah bint Yousef al-Malihah."
    r "我说我父亲的名字是Yousef al-Malihah。 我也一直是这样。 Rajeeyah bint Yousef al-Malihah。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16248
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_929363fa:

    # r "The Maghreb is the desert that spans the whole north of Africa. {i}al-Maghribi{/i} means \"of the desert.\" It's not Arezki's, either, if you were wondering."
    r "马格里布就是横跨北非的沙漠，{i}al-Maghribi{/i}是‘沙漠的’的意思。省一省，这名字也不是Arezki的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16250
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8af396e8:

    # r "I just... chose it. When I left home. At first, I told myself I simply didn't want to sully my family's reputation, if something were to happen."
    r "我只是……选择了它。 当我离开家的时候。 起初，我告诉自己，如果发生什么事，我只是不想玷污我家族的声誉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16252
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_784a5d13:

    # r "But it made me feel closer to him. For better or worse. So what do I tell him?"
    r "但它让我感觉离他更近了。 不管好坏。 那么我该告诉他什么呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16254
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ba8fd9fa:

    # p "If it's the truth, tell him that you've changed. It isn't his fault... necessarily..."
    p "如果那是真相，告诉他你已经改变了。 这不一定是他的错……"

# game/script day12.rpy:16256
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f1c937b0:

    # "Although, from what Rajeeyah has said, you honestly think it is."
    "虽然，从Rajeeyah所说的话来看，你真的认为是他的错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16258
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_bd127ae6:

    # p "You're not the person you used to be. You can't wait for him to change, and if he... if he's expecting {i}you{/i} to stay the, er... the person selling fake jewels in a coffee house..."
    p "你又不是以前的你了。 你不能指望他改变，要是他…要是他还以为{i}你{/i}是那个在咖啡馆卖假首饰的…"

# game/script day12.rpy:16262
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_82cfd21e:

    # r "I can't? That makes sense. Or I still am the person I used to be... but so much more of my life has been written, now. Our stories are leading towards different endings."
    r "我做不到吗？...也对。或者说，我还是过去的那个我，只不过现在已经历了太多事情。我们的故事注定会走向不同的结局。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16266
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ffe3e255:

    # p "Exactly."
    p "就是这个意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16270
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_17a64a64:

    # r "I like that. Yes."
    r "我喜欢这样。嗯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16272
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e89874f5:

    # "She looks down at the page with fresh determination, and takes a deep breath before looking up at you."
    "她再次下定决心，低头看向书页，深吸一口气后抬眼看着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16274
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_52df8c42:

    # r "Thank you for being honest with me."
    r "谢谢你对我说实话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16276
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_63c1a400:

    # r "I suppose I should sit down and try once again.{w} Thank you for your advice, [name]. I guess I needed to hear it from outside my own head."
    r "我想我应该坐下来再试一次。{w} 谢谢你的建议，[name]。 我想我需要听听别人的意见，才能想明白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16280
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_df08051d_1:

    # r "Samuel was right about you, you know."
    r "你知道吗，Samuel 对你的评价很正确。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16282
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6000efd3_1:

    # p "Samuel?"
    p "Samuel？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16284
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8af79a89_1:

    # "Her smile widens a nick."
    "她的笑容更深了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16286
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d59ecf6a:

    # r "[He] told me how kind you were that time when he pulled you aside after the first night."
    r "他说，那次在第一个晚上把你拉到一边后，你特别友善。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16288
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a7926f17:

    # r "Said that [he] felt so silly opening up to you but you just were nothing but kind despite how silly [he] thought it was."
    r "说[he]觉得向你敞开心扉很傻，但尽管[he]觉得那很傻，你却只是善良。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16290
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a80920ec_1:

    # p "Oh... that. It wasn't silly of [him]."
    p "哦... 那件事。 他那样做并不傻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16292
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2da51463_1:

    # p "I'd never dare to think that about Samuel, or anyone for that matter, being vulnerable with me."
    p "我才不会觉得Samuel那样，或者任何人跟我掏心窝子是傻事呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16294
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_09260582_1:

    # p "If anything, I really enjoyed the morning with [him]."
    p "如果说有什么的话，我真的很喜欢和他在一起的那个早上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16296
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8dba9ccd_1:

    # "You rub the back of your head."
    "你揉了揉后脑勺。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16298
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f8e6548c:

    # p "Well, I'm glad I could offer an open ear and perhaps even help..."
    p "嗯，我很高兴能倾听你的烦恼，甚至能帮上忙......"

# game/script day12.rpy:16300
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ad72e5c0:

    # r "You did. I'm glad I could, too."
    r "你帮到了。我也很高兴能帮到你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16302
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_26946869:

    # r "It's good for everyone that you'll be staying aboard."
    r "你能留在船上对大家都好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16304
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c465ff88:

    # p "Thank you, Rajeeyah."
    p "谢谢你，Rajeeyah。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16310
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_56c606f3:

    # p "If he's not going to write back, maybe you shouldn't bother. I mean. You could do better than him, right?"
    p "如果他不回信，也许你就不该再理他。我是说，你值得更好的人，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16314
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_64477fc3:

    # "Rajeeyah gives you a curious look, the tip of her tail twitching slowly."
    "Rajeeyah好奇地看着你，尾巴尖轻轻地摆动着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16318
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5bf4de93:

    # r "Maybe I could.{w} But not here."
    r "也许吧。{w} 但不是在这里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16320
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_844b2cb4:

    # p "Sure you could! What about..."
    p "当然可以！比如说......"

# game/script day12.rpy:16324
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_71bc2b67:

    # p "{cps=5000}Sure you could! What about...{/cps}" nointeract
    p "{cps=5000}当然可以！比如说......{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:16331
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1b4efd5a:

    # p "Well-what about Arthur? You two have a history."
    p "要说嘛......Arthur怎么样？你们俩可是老相识了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16335
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8fe092ff:

    # "Rajeeyah blinks, taken more by surprise than you would've expected. Then she laughs, unable to hide her astonishment."
    "Rajeeyah眨了眨眼，惊讶程度超出了你的预料。然后她笑了出来，完全掩饰不住她的诧异。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16339
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3ff8f6f1:

    # r "Don't be ridiculous. We have a history, yes.{w} But we're friends. Nothing more."
    r "别犯傻了。我们是有过一段历史，没错。但我们是朋友。仅此而已。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16341
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b2555f4d:

    # p "Well... you never know, but..."
    p "哎......这事儿谁说得准呢，不过......"

# game/script day12.rpy:16345
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c1afe6cf:

    # r "But what?"
    r "不过什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16353
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6ecce0c6:

    # p "What about Samuel? You two already seem rather close."
    p "Samuel怎么样？你们俩看起来挺亲近的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16357
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e77d5f61:

    # "She blinks, before her lips curl into a laugh."
    "她眨了眨眼，嘴角忍不住露出了笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16361
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c7d0247c:

    # r "Sam? Oh don't be silly. If anything, Sam has been talking more about you than anyone else recently."
    r "Sam？哦，别开玩笑了。最近Sam满嘴都是你，比说任何人都多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16363
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1b640dae_1:

    # p "What?"
    p "啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16365
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_59da9947:

    # p "I doubt that. Or, well [he] certainly won't be after what happened today."
    p "我不信。或者，好吧，发生了今天的事，他肯定不会再那样了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16367
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e1293cb5:

    # r "Do believe me, [name]. [He] has been talking up your company almost every time we had a moment to chat recently."
    r "相信我，[name]。 最近我们只要有机会聊天，他几乎每次都在夸你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16369
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_96867f5d:

    # r "When checking how [his] wound is healing.{w} When having dinner."
    r "检查他的伤口恢复情况的时候，{w} 吃晚饭的时候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16371
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f735d6cd:

    # r "Even after what happened to you today Samuel came by to see if I knew what to do and how to help."
    r "就算今天你出了事，Samuel还是跑来问我知不知道该怎么办，怎么才能帮上忙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16373
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a60b1933:

    # p "I... uhm, well don't even know what to say."
    p "我......呃，我、我都不知道该说什么了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16375
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a04239c2:

    # p "But, about Arezki..."
    p "不过，说到Arezki......"

# game/script day12.rpy:16377
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_638d6422:

    # r "Hm?"
    r "嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16381
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6ecce0c6_1:

    # p "What about Samuel? You two already seem rather close."
    p "Samuel怎么样？你们俩看起来挺亲近的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16385
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e77d5f61_1:

    # "She blinks, before her lips curl into a laugh."
    "她眨了眨眼，嘴角忍不住露出了笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16388
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_55eb624b:

    # r "Sam?{w} Oh don't be ridiculous, [name]."
    r "Sam？{w} 别开玩笑了，[name]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16390
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d11f8728:

    # r "[He]'s a sweetheart but I don't think [he] would ever think about me in that way."
    r "[He]确实是个贴心人，但我深知[he]绝不可能以那种男女之情来看待我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16394
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_28477573:

    # p "What about Samuel?"
    p "Samuel怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16398
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_e77d5f61_2:

    # "She blinks, before her lips curl into a laugh."
    "她眨了眨眼，嘴角忍不住露出了笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16402
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d02d50eb:

    # r "Samuel?{w} Oh don't be ridiculous, [name]."
    r "Samuel？{w} 噢，别胡说了，[name]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16406
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6d9a4944:

    # r "I don't think [he] would ever view me in that way. No, no, and even if [he] would, it would be a bad idea to get too close to someone of the crew."
    r "我不认为[he]会动那种心思。绝不会的。而且退一步讲，就算[he]有意，跟同船的水手走得太近也是件极其不理智的事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16408
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_61be069f:

    # r "It always brings problems with it."
    r "总是会惹麻烦的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16410
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b2555f4d_1:

    # p "Well... you never know, but..."
    p "哎......这事儿谁说得准呢，不过......"

# game/script day12.rpy:16412
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c1afe6cf_1:

    # r "But what?"
    r "不过什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16419
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_aea6dd92:

    # p "Well, I mean... These last couple weeks, I think we've gotten to know each other a bit..."
    p "哎，我的意思是... 最近这几周，我觉得咱俩也算认识了吧..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16423
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_69ea8163:

    # r "You're suggesting that if I wanted to find a partner, I should look no further than... you?"
    r "你是说，如果我想找对象，最佳人选其实是你？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16425
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_4e7220e5:

    # r "Our newest sailor, who's made such a good impression so far?"
    r "咱们这位新来的水手，目前为止表现得还挺好？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16428
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_15dbefb9:

    # r "{cps=5000}Our newest sailor, who's made such a good impression so far?{/cps}" nointeract
    r "{cps=5000}咱们这位新来的水手，目前为止表现得还挺好？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:16434
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_38574005:

    # "Rajeeyah's scowl makes it clear she's among those unimpressed. You scramble to save your reputation."
    "Rajeeyah皱着眉头，显然她对你印象也不怎么样。你赶紧想办法挽回自己的形象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16436
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c8e77af4:

    # p "Obviously I wasn't being serious. I was making a point."
    p "哎，我开玩笑的。我只是想说明一个问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16438
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c2f20942:

    # r "Which was?"
    r "什么问题？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16445
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_f82a7966:

    # p "You don't know everything I can do. I'll bet I could make a better impression."
    p "你根本不了解我。我保证我能让你刮目相看。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16447
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_0d8fa5c8:

    # "She rolls her eyes."
    "她翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16449
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7db1a747:

    # r "Just when I think you sailors are capable of focusing on more than one thing."
    r "亏我还以为你们水手的脑子里能同时装得下两件事呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16451
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_10b1d7be:

    # r "Don't let anyone ever accuse you of being {i}under{/i}-confident."
    r "没人会说你{i}不{/i}自信。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16461
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_5aed3de9:

    # p "I don't know. I just know that... well. You're right—not on the {i}Conway{/i}. But Arezki's not on the ship, either."
    p "我不知道。我只是知道……嗯。你说得对——在{i}Conway号{/i}上不行。但Arezki也不在船上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16463
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_9b9ca06e:

    # p "Even if there are things you like about what he brings out in you, you deserve better than someone who leaves you wondering what the two of you even mean to one another."
    p "就算你喜欢他带给你的感觉，你也值得拥有更好的人，而不是一个让你琢磨不透的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16465
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8d70164c:

    # p "One day, you will leave the ship. And then... well, anyone would be lucky to know you. But one of {i}those{/i} people will be someone {i}you're{/i} lucky to know."
    p "总有一天你会离开这艘船。到那时... 谁要是能认识你，那可真是太幸运了。当然，你也会很幸运能认识{i}那{/i}个人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16467
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d265ee81:

    # "She nods, contemplatively."
    "她若有所思地点点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16476
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3476bd72:

    # p "Can I be honest? Look at how much you struggle to say something to him. If you're going to be with anyone, you wouldn't have to wonder what you should say. You'd know."
    p "我能跟你说句实话吗？你看你跟他说话都这么费劲。如果真的喜欢一个人，你根本不用想该说什么，你会自然而然地知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16480
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_43b85353:

    # p "You {i}will{/i} know. But that means you also already know..."
    p "你{i}会{/i}知道的。但这也意味着你已经知道..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16482
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_31a4b571:

    # r "...That it's not him."
    r "...那个人不是他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16484
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_72a3f656:

    # "She takes a deep breath, then sighs. But she seems to have relaxed, too; her tail sways gently."
    "她深吸一口气，然后叹了口气。不过她好像也放松了下来，尾巴轻轻地摇了摇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16488
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_7feae15f:

    # r "You're perceptive. Thank you. I'm glad I asked you for advice."
    r "你真敏锐。谢谢你。能听听你的意见真是太好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16490
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_cb35757e:

    # p "I'm glad you trusted me enough to ask. It means a lot. These have been some... challenging days. It's good to have friends."
    p "我很荣幸你愿意信任我。这对我很重要。最近真是... 充满挑战。有朋友真好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16494
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_78e25cb2:

    # r "It is."
    r "的确晚了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16496
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3ab92639:

    # "Her smile suggests the feeling is mutual."
    "她笑了笑，看来她也有同感。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16498
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8aa1340c:

    # p "I guess that's part of what I mean."
    p "我想我就是这个意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16504
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_98e85913:

    # p "I know you've left lots of things behind. Maybe you don't want one more."
    p "我知道你已经放弃了很多东西。也许你不想再放弃更多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16506
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b38b4651:

    # r "No. But you're right... it would be for the best."
    r "是啊。但你说得对... 这样是最好的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16508
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c8561b3a:

    # p "I think so, at least. And... don't take this the wrong way, please, but..."
    p "至少我是这么觉得的。而且... 别误会我的意思，但是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16512
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_c1afe6cf_2:

    # r "But what?"
    r "不过什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16516
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_daca8ce7:

    # p "Anyone would be better than a confidence man. No matter what."
    p "谁都比骗子强，无论如何。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16518
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_813bf3da:

    # p "Maybe I don't like everyone on this ship, but... at least I know where I stand with them. And they're not going to lie to me."
    p "或许我不是喜欢船上的每一个人，但至少我和他们相处起来心里有数。而且他们也不会骗我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16520
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_85c4c2c5:

    # p "Or try to sell me fake jewels and then steal them back from me."
    p "或者企图把假珠宝强卖给我，然后半夜再偷偷溜回来给盗走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16526
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_13a2fb04:

    # r "Don't be so sure. My bottle of wine went missing {i}somehow{/i}, after all..."
    r "可别这么肯定。毕竟，我的那瓶酒还不是{i}莫名其妙地{/i}不见了……"

# game/script day12.rpy:16528
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_205c8a77:

    # "The cheetah laughs when she says that, but the sound is tinged with melancholy."
    "猎豹说出这话时轻笑了一声，但笑声里却染上了一层抹不掉的忧郁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16532
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_bf4a1218:

    # r "I hear what you're saying, [name]."
    r "我明白你的意思，[name]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16536
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6c90e4fe:

    # r "I wouldn't put it past some of them, but I hear what you're saying."
    r "我不排除他们中有人会做这种事，但我明白你的意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16538
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_09fb9c1e:

    # r "My past is just..."
    r "我的过去嘛......"

# game/script day12.rpy:16540
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_63d552cb:

    # r "I didn't call attention to it, but my father's name is Yousef al-Malihah. I'm Rajeeyah bint Yousef al-Malihah."
    r "我没怎么跟人提起过，我父亲名叫Yousef al-Malihah，我是Rajeeyah bint Yousef al-Malihah。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16542
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_33ac2e5b_1:

    # p "Not al-Maghribi?"
    p "不是马格里比？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16544
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_bbf81e4b:

    # r "al-Malihah is a city in Syria, where we claim to be from. The Maghreb is the desert. al-Maghribi is someone from the desert."
    r "al-Malihah是叙利亚的一座城市，我们对外都说自己是那里人。马格里布是沙漠，al-Maghribi就是从沙漠来的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16546
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_8a7a582a:

    # p "Arezki's name?"
    p "你说Arezki这个名字？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16548
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_13e8ed48:

    # r "No. I chose it for myself, when I left for my studies and wanted to start a new life. But I always thought it could be a name we shared."
    r "不，那是我离开家去求学，想要开始新生活的时候自己选的。但我一直希望能和你共用这个名字。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16551
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2c288c93:

    # r "{cps=5000}No. I chose it for myself, when I left for my studies and wanted to start a new life. But I always thought it could be a name we shared.{/cps}" nointeract
    r "{cps=5000}不，那是我离开家去求学，想要开始新生活的时候自己选的。但我一直希望能和你共用这个名字。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day12.rpy:16555
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_ed0a8ade:

    # p "You could return to your old name, if you wanted."
    p "你要是愿意，也可以改回原来的名字。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16559
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_2faa78b9:

    # r "I don't. That's the point. I'm different now, even if Arezki's not. It was never his name, anyway."
    r "我不要。我就是这个意思。我已经和以前不一样了，就算Arezki还是老样子。再说，那个名字本来也不是他的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16563
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_94b30564:

    # p "Even if you don't share it with anyone, I'd say you've earned your name. Whatever it means to be an al-Maghribi, {i}you{/i} get to decide that."
    p "就算没有人和你分享这个名字，我觉得你也配得上它。要我说，al-Maghribi意味着什么，那还不是{i}你{/i}说了算。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16567
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_78a677fd:

    # "The thought clearly strikes a chord with her."
    "显然，她被这句话触动了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16569
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_a756cdb2:

    # r "With or without him? It would be nice to think so."
    r "有他没他都一样吗？要是能这么想就好了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16573
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_d3ebc91f:

    # p "Nobody on the {i}Conway{/i} has to know. Most of us can't even pronounce it... either of them."
    p "在{i}Conway号{/i}上，没必要让别人知道这些。我们大多数人连这些名字都念不清楚......无论是哪个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16579
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3b8ae102:

    # r "I'm sure you'll get it, [name]. With enough practice."
    r "我相信你肯定能学会的，[name]。只要多加练习。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16583
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_60ce1f1c:

    # r "That's not saying too much."
    r "这话可没啥说服力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16585
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b8a5da14:

    # p "But I'm saying that..."
    p "但我想说的是......"

# game/script day12.rpy:16590
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_6287e894:

    # "She cuts you off, shaking her head. Her mood has lifted."
    "她摇摇头，打断了你的话。心情似乎好多了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16594
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_caabf850:

    # r "I understand what you're saying. You've helped a lot. I just needed to hear someone say it, I think."
    r "我明白你的意思。你帮了我很多。我想我只是想听别人亲口说出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16596
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_3c607905:

    # r "I should let you get back to work. Even without the letter, I have plenty to do. But..."
    r "我不耽误你工作了。就算没有那封信，我也还有一大堆事情要做。不过......"

# game/script day12.rpy:16601
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_1f4bb3ef:

    # "Rajeeyah puts her hand on yours, and smiles."
    "Rajeeyah把手放在你的手上，对你一笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16603
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_letters_b5058e1e:

    # r "Thank you. I'm very glad you'll be coming with us."
    r "谢谢你。你能加入我们，我真的很高兴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16613
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_malus_d57d4e00:

    # p "I'm just saying-"
    p "我是说——"

# game/script day12.rpy:16615
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_malus_b0d705c4:

    # r "I don't care. What was I even thinking, asking you for advice?"
    r "我才不在乎呢。我真是昏了头了，居然会问你这种问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16617
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_malus_97a6d9b9:

    # "She shakes her head, the look of disgust evident on her angular features."
    "她摇了摇头，厌恶之情全都写在了她那棱角分明的脸庞上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16619
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_malus_2189fd68:

    # r "Get out."
    r "滚出去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16621
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_malus_b875af24:

    # p "Fine."
    p "知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16623
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_malus_532916c1:

    # r "{i}Now{/i}."
    r "{i}现在{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16625
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_malus_6bd743a3:

    # "Her muzzle curls, showing off fangs. For someone who spends her time fixing people up, her hiss has a singularly threatening demeanor."
    "她口鼻部卷起，露出獠牙。这样一个平时为人排忧解难的人，发出的嘶嘶声却格外具有威胁性。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16627
translate Chinese day12_rajeeyah_malus_e8b68c66:

    # "It's probably for the best to make your escape before she tries to do anything with those teeth."
    "最好在她用那些牙齿对你做什么之前，赶紧开溜。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16648
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f49cc592:

    # "In the shadow of one of the jolly boats lies Wolf."
    "在其中一艘救生艇的阴影下，躺着Wolf。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16650
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_64785546:

    # p "There you are."
    p "你可算来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16652
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_42881713:

    # "His head is resting on the intertwined fingers of his hands. He almost looks comfortable, and were it not for the weather you might be inclined to believe that he was."
    "他头枕着十指交错的双手，看起来几乎很舒服。要不是这鬼天气，你真要觉得他很舒服了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16654
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4a1b43b2:

    # "On the other hand, Wolf has always been a bit of an odd one. You squat down on the deck to get a better look."
    "不过话说回来，Wolf一直有点怪。你蹲下身子，想看得更清楚些。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16656
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_02bd2eb9:

    # p "But...{w} Why in the world are you under here?"
    p "但是...{w} 你到底在这下面干什么呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16658
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b878b7f8:

    # "With one hand you hold the bottle, hastily covered by your shirt, steady against your stomach, and with the other you lean against the jolly boat."
    "你一只手拿着瓶子，赶紧用衬衫盖住，紧紧抵在肚子上，另一只手撑着救生艇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16662
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_132a2f7f:

    # "He dips his snout towards you, giving you a once-over."
    "他鼻子凑过来，上下打量着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16664
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_61b63439:

    # w "Because it's raining."
    w "因为下雨了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16666
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1e41d056:

    # "He is soaked from head to toe."
    "他浑身都湿透了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16668
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a83bfa7e:

    # "Even with the weather slowly improving, it's impossible to stay dry anywhere on this ship."
    "就算天气渐渐好转，在这艘船上也没法保持干燥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16670
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9ed45e61:

    # p "You do know that this ship has several decks down below, right?"
    p "你知道这船有好几层下层甲板吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16672
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_21595eac:

    # p "All of them enclosed."
    p "全是封闭的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16676
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_57339dd6:

    # w "It's quiet here."
    w "这儿安静。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16678
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_48dfe291:

    # w "Why do you care?"
    w "你管得着吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16682
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_118bfce1:

    # "You decide Wolf might accept a bit of ribbing..."
    "你觉得跟Wolf开个玩笑应该没问题..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16684
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d44f131e:

    # p "Here and all, I thought we were friends."
    p "我还以为咱俩是朋友呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16686
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_15c345ac:

    # "...Just a bit though. Sure enough, he rolls his eyes."
    "…稍微开一下。果然，他翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16688
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bdafe684:

    # w "Let's not take it too far, now."
    w "别太过分了啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16690
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_611aa9de:

    # "He hasn't actually snarled at you yet, though. That counts as progress, right?"
    "不过他还没真朝你龇牙咧嘴。这算进步了吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16692
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a7e0aeb3:

    # p "Yeah, I wouldn't want to think we'd bonded, or anything.{w} I care because I'm curious, that's all."
    p "是啊，我可不想咱俩之间有什么交情，或者别的什么。{w} 我只是好奇而已。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16694
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_60dec7d1:

    # p "I understand wanting to be by yourself, but..."
    p "我理解你想一个人待着，但是..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16696
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0cb9f33c:

    # w "But? You want to offer some helpful suggestions for my seating arrangements.{w} Out of the goodness of your heart."
    w "但是什么？你是想出于好心，给我的位置安排提点建议？{w}"

# game/script day12.rpy:16698
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_994644a3:

    # p "No. Actually..."
    p "不是，其实..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16700
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bdad9b50:

    # p "Do you mind if I join you?"
    p "你介意我加入吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16704
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2e450641:

    # p "Because I am fascinated by the way your mind works."
    p "因为我太好奇你脑子里都在想什么了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16706
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_436d27ec:

    # w "Here we go again..."
    w "来了来了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16708
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_09b21949:

    # p "Just to make sure I get it right: you sit out here and regularly get drenched by the waves because there are too many people down below?"
    p "我再确认一下：你就是因为下边人太多，才宁愿坐在这儿， регулярно被海浪浇成落汤鸡？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16712
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_358fffde:

    # "His muzzle wrinkles as he pulls it into a subtle snarl."
    "他嘴角微微一咧，露出了一个不明显的怒容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16714
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_68f5a28f:

    # w "Are you trying to make fun of me?"
    w "你是想耍我吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16716
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_abe3900b:

    # p "Not in the slightest."
    p "绝无此意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16718
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_45d8f217:

    # p "Actually, may I join you?"
    p "其实，我能加入吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16722
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_aefc058f:

    # "His teeth flash from behind his lips as he puts further emphasis on the snarl."
    "他怒吼着，龇牙咧嘴的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16724
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4309ad3a:

    # w "No."
    w "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16726
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_468e2fd2:

    # p "What? What do you mean?"
    p "什么？你这话什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16728
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9eb66e4f:

    # w "What's not to understand?! I didn't invite you, so find someone else who you can chew the ears off of."
    w "这还不够明白吗？！我没请你来，找别人唠嗑去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16730
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_212a4753:

    # "You sigh, already feeling defeated before you remember that you have a lever to pull."
    "你叹了口气，本已经觉得没戏了，突然想起自己还有筹码。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16732
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4142d7d7:

    # p "Fine, I guess I'll leave you alone then."
    p "行吧，那我还是不打扰你了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16736
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_604fbf15:

    # w "Good."
    w "知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16738
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f78b1f71:

    # p "And I guess..."
    p "我看..."

# game/script day12.rpy:16740
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f971b5de:

    # "You pause, trying to gauge his interest and to arrange the words in your mind."
    "你顿了顿，想看看他有没有兴趣，也在心里琢磨着措辞。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16742
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8a39e42f:

    # p "I guess then I'll have to drink this whole bottle by myself."
    p "我看那我只能自己把这瓶都喝光了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16744
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d64b5b07:

    # "You undo two of the buttons on your shirt, fish out the bottle from under it, and turn it so that the label is facing you."
    "你解开衬衫的两颗扣子，从里面掏出瓶子，转过来，亮出标签。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16746
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_46dc8272:

    # p "Finest one I could find."
    p "我能找到的最好的货色了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16748
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6e40652d:

    # "You side-eye him, waiting for him to change his mind and invite you in."
    "你偷偷瞥了他一眼，等着他回心转意，请你进去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16750
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_358a2508:

    # w "I guess you will."
    w "我看你会的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16752
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_76a12e21:

    # p "That's right, I'll be coming right down—wait?! You said no?"
    p "没错，我这就下来——等等？！你说了“不”？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16758
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f1069d8d:

    # w "I did. What's not to understand?"
    w "我就是这个意思，很难懂吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16760
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_10fb5a59:

    # w "Have you {i}ever{/i} tried listening to other people?"
    w "你有没有{i}哪怕{/i}听听别人的意见？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16762
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5fc8056f:

    # p "I just... {w}You really don't want any of it? I-"
    p "我只是……{w}你当真一口都不要吗？我——"

# game/script day12.rpy:16764
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_05760ba4:

    # w "Go. {w}Away."
    w "滚。{w}开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16768
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_dc430181:

    # w "I did."
    w "我走了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16770
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e5eb788f:

    # p "You really don't want any of it?"
    p "你真的一点都不想要？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16772
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5ba8a6a2:

    # "He lets out a long, exasperated exhale."
    "他长长地、烦躁地叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16774
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_acaf9969:

    # w "No, and if you don't make yourself scarce now, I will."
    w "不要！你要是再不从我眼前消失，我就不客气了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16776
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1f8e6de6:

    # w "Leave."
    w "滚！"

# game/script day12.rpy:16778
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c075ab08:

    # "His stern features don't leave much room for interpretation.{p}He means it."
    "他那张严肃的脸，明摆着没啥商量的余地。{p} 他是说真的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16780
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0d9c6f15:

    # "Whatever sense of defeat you felt before has been confirmed."
    "你之前那点可怜的希望，彻底破灭了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16782
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_44bee87b:

    # "You don't try to fight him anymore. Instead, you hide the bottle again and leave him alone, just as he asked."
    "你也不想再跟他争了，默默地把酒瓶藏好，像他要求的那样，让他一个人待着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16784
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9d53e857:

    # "The hammock it is, then. You sigh, but begin to make your way back below deck..."
    "看来只能睡吊床了。你叹了口气，不情不愿地往甲板下面走……"

# game/script day12.rpy:16790
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2aad7696:

    # w "If you must."
    w "随你便吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16792
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_237491df:

    # "By now you are aware that this is as good an invitation as you're ever going to get, and you're used to his reluctance."
    "你也知道这是他能给出的最大方的邀请了，而且你也习惯了他那副不太情愿的样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16794
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2d11c7a1:

    # "He pulls his legs up, making room for you to sit next to him."
    "他收起双腿，腾出地方让你坐在他旁边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16810
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3500b68d:

    # "Once under the jolly boat, the sound of rain becomes the steady, soothing drum of raindrops echoing through the wood around you."
    "一钻到翻倒的小艇下，雨声就变成了稳定的、舒缓的鼓点，雨滴在周围的木头中回响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16812
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_97d9447b:

    # "Perhaps there {i}is{/i} something to this spot."
    "或许，这个地方真的有那么点特别。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16814
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_01ff08d4:

    # "He could have just admitted enjoying the soothing sound. Maybe he thinks that would make him sound soft?"
    "他完全可以直接承认自己喜欢这舒缓的雨声。 也许他觉得那样会显得自己太软弱？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16816
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6f8c9d4d:

    # "Or he genuinely doesn't care enough to even notice it.{w} It's always hard to tell with him..."
    "或者他真的压根就没注意到。 真是搞不懂他……"

# game/script day12.rpy:16818
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1b8eb59f:

    # p "Perhaps I was a bit quick to judge.{w} It's rather pleasant here."
    p "也许我之前判断得太快了。 这儿其实还挺舒服的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16820
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_109eb205:

    # "You tilt your head back and run your hand over the wood of the small jolly boat."
    "你向后仰了仰头，用手摩挲着小艇的木头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16822
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_71f0f2ae:

    # "Even though it's overturned, the inside still feels wet."
    "虽然是翻过来的，里面摸起来还是潮乎乎的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16826
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bf6cc751:

    # w "I told you."
    w "我就说吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16828
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0f33cc74:

    # p "You said you were here because it's raining and it's quiet."
    p "你说你在这儿是因为下雨，而且安静。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16832
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b75b8e59:

    # w "And this is?"
    w "所以呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16834
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cc01136a:

    # p "Neither?"
    p "都不是？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16836
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_042356b0:

    # w "Which makes it..."
    w "所以说……？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16838
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_30539a76:

    # "He expects you to answer, judging by the tone of the question."
    "听他的语气，他是在等你回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16840
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f2f7fab0:

    # p "Pleasant?"
    p "令人愉快？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16844
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0404abea:

    # w "See? Your head is good for something, after all. {w}Not just there to keep out the rain."
    w "看吧？你的脑袋总算有点用了。 不只是用来挡雨的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16846
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b5af812d:

    # p "I'm sorry, what?"
    p "你说什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16848
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b2dc603e:

    # w "I said your head is good for something after all, not just there to keep out the rain."
    w "我说了，你的脑袋总算有点用了，不只是用来挡雨的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16850
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_27f99c42:

    # "You groan. Even without looking you can hear the grin in his words as he repeats himself."
    "你嘟囔了一声。 就算不看他，光听他重复这句话，你都能想象到他那得意的笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16852
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ef80ce0e:

    # p "I don't remember you being so sassy. Who taught you that?"
    p "我怎么不记得你这么牙尖嘴利了？ 谁教你的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16856
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_10219e6c:

    # w "A lovely Hanoverian lady by the name of Luisa."
    w "一位名叫Luisa的，可爱的汉诺威女士。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16858
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_586a1ef9:

    # w "You should have met her; she was a delight."
    w "你真该见见她的，她可太有趣了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16860
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0c713a78:

    # p "Hanoverian?"
    p "汉诺威人？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16864
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1eb3e069:

    # w "A lady from the state of Hanover.{w} In the Empire."
    w "一位来自汉诺威邦的女士。 在神圣罗马帝国境内。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16868
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5b398d09:

    # w "Mhm."
    w "嗯哼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16870
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_49301991:

    # p "Would be perfect without the spray, you know. But I guess you can't have everything."
    p "要是没这些水雾就更好了，不过，人总不能什么都想要。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16872
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_05485f5a:

    # w "Precisely."
    w "确实。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16874
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_97710ffe:

    # w "For example: I have yet to have someone come here and drag you away."
    w "比如说，到现在还没人来把你从这儿拖走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16876
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_44e39899:

    # p "Oh, you wouldn't want that, Wolf. I'd be screaming and kicking..."
    p "哦，你肯定不想那样，Wolf。 我会又叫又闹的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:16878
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bcebdba1:

    # "You wait, in vain, for Wolf to show any sign that he might regret this."
    "你徒劳地等着，希望 Wolf 能露出哪怕一丝后悔的意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16880
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d3e54825:

    # p "Putting a real end to your peace and quiet, believe you me. Oh, my—you'd never hear the end of it."
    p "彻底终结你的宁静，相信我。哦，天哪——你会永远不得安宁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16884
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0e5f83bf:

    # w "I can endure your cries of distress quite well, for I know they are but a temporary obstacle on the way to the promised land."
    w "你的哭爹喊娘我倒是受得了，我知道这只是通往美好前程的绊脚石。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16886
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_82d533c7:

    # p "The promised land? You equate my absence with a gift from God? Even for you, Wolf, that's harsh."
    p "美好前程？你把我的离开当成是上帝的恩赐？我说 Wolf，你也太狠了吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16888
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c0c350ab:

    # w "A brief bit of fuss in exchange for a blissful voyage free of your... {i}company{/i}? I can manage."
    w "只要能摆脱你，短暂的吵闹又算得了什么？我能搞定。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16890
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_88af04f4:

    # p "You really are sassy. Who in the world did you get that from?"
    p "你这人，嘴是真损。跟谁学的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16892
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2643e91e:

    # "You can see his subtle grin in the periphery of your vision."
    "你眼角瞥见他一丝不易察觉的微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16894
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_784bb043:

    # w "A Hanoverian lady would be my guess. Luisa was her name."
    w "我猜是汉诺威的哪位小姐吧。好像叫 Luisa。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16896
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_240095fc:

    # p "You know, I didn't expect you to actually have an answer to a rhetorical question."
    p "没想到你还真能回答上来？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16898
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_df29c71c:

    # w "And now you've learned something."
    w "这下长见识了吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16900
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_039c9b29:

    # w "She was a sassy ol' bitch.{w} Must have been her who made me appreciate it."
    w "她当年可是个泼辣刁蛮的老泼妇。{w}肯定是因为她，我才懂得欣赏这玩意儿的滋味。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16902
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_48dc96f6:

    # p "Hanoverian, did you say?"
    p "汉诺威？你是说？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16906
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_978b4257:

    # w "Yes, a lady from the state of Hanover.{w} In the Empire."
    w "没错，汉诺威来的小姐。{w} 在帝国里面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16908
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_87aac92b:

    # "You have never particularly concerned yourself with the intricacies of the internal politics of other European kingdoms, let alone the overwhelming number of place names."
    "你啊，从来就没关心过欧洲那些王国的破事儿，更别提那些数不清的地名了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16910
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1d68e1bf:

    # "Especially not the mess that is the Holy Roman Empire."
    "尤其是神圣罗马帝国那一堆烂摊子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16912
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1edfba7a:

    # "They feel neither holy to you, nor especially Roman."
    "在你看来，他们跟神圣和罗马可一点儿都不沾边。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16914
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d604825b:

    # p "Hanover, huh."
    p "汉诺威，是么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16918
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_07adc0bc:

    # w "Have you never heard of it?"
    w "你都没听说过？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16924
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_df07456f:

    # w "Your small-town farmer-boy charm really does have its limits, [name]."
    w "你那点小镇土包子的魅力，也就到这儿了，[name]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16926
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a8f9d7ec:

    # w "There is a whole world out behind your door, you know."
    w "外面的世界大着呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16928
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_910fb132:

    # p "Why else am I here?"
    p "不然我来这儿干嘛？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16930
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_101d08fd:

    # w "Trying my patience?"
    w "你是来这儿挑战我耐心的吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16932
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_dc9022c8:

    # "He does, though, allow himself the briefest of smiles."
    "不过，他还是咧开一丝微笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16936
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_037d714a:

    # w "Never mind. I can guess the answer from the look of confusion on your face."
    w "没事儿。看你一脸懵逼的样子，我就知道答案了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16938
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1b79eb1f:

    # w "It's one of the states along the North Sea. One of many."
    w "这是北海边上的一个邦。多如牛毛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16944
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b5760fe5:

    # w "The whole area is a small, fractured jumble."
    w "那一带就是个小地方，乱得一塌糊涂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16946
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e8760bc7:

    # w "Small principalities and smaller princes, all fighting to be the last one standing atop whatever's left."
    w "小公国啊，小王子的，都想争当老大。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16948
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_aa5e6688:

    # w "Fodder for gleeful discussion by a few fat bastards around a platter overflowing with the finest cakes.{w} And all of them, ankle-deep in the blood of common folk who couldn't care less where the border of one {i}electorate{/i} ends and the next begins."
    w "几个肥头大耳的家伙，围着摆满蛋糕的盘子，在那儿高谈阔论。{w} 他们倒是吃得满嘴流油，可老百姓呢？{w} 谁又在乎什么选区的地界在哪儿？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16950
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a30c45f2:

    # "He fairly spits the word. It's more bitter than you've seen him before, but even before you can ask for clarification he somehow keeps going."
    "他几乎是咬牙切齿地说出这个词。语气比之前更恶劣了，不过还没等你问，他就自顾自地说了下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16952
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a01eee2f:

    # w "They think they have the blessing of God guiding them. No. No, just the good fortune that their subjects haven't turned against them."
    w "他们还真以为自己是受上帝庇佑。{w} 屁！{w} 不过是老百姓还没起来造反，让他们走了狗屎运罢了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16954
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_128392eb:

    # w "Yet."
    w "不过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16961
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_313952e2:

    # "You lower your head to look carefully under the boat, and fortunately find no one within earshot."
    "你低下头仔细观察船下，还好，附近没人能听见。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16968
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c704dc63:

    # p "Wolf, you speak sedition!"
    p "Wolf，你这话可是大逆不道啊！//character: Wolf"

# game/script day12.rpy:16972
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2761df77:

    # w "Fluently."
    w "真了解。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16974
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_38170d5f:

    # "You look over and see the smirk along his snout."
    "你抬头看去，看到他正咧着嘴，一脸得意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16976
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2a0dda93:

    # p "But... perhaps not so openly?"
    p "不过... 这种话还是别乱说吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16980
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a1866789:

    # w "What, you take me for a mutineer? I don't intend to speak it \"openly.\""
    w "怎么，你当我是反贼啊？ 我可没打算“公开”说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16982
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0bb1640f:

    # w "Nor do I intend to join any grand revolution. All I'm saying is that, in my eyes, they have it coming."
    w "我也没兴趣搞什么大革命。 我就是觉得，他们活该。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16986
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2feef147:

    # w "And I recommend that you won't carry it out in the open either."
    w "我也劝你别明着来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16988
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0dcb91dd:

    # "You get the message."
    "你明白了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16990
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5a3cdf42:

    # p "So, uh, {w}how was it?"
    p "所以，{w}说说看，Hanover 怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:16994
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ddc81cd9:

    # w "It doesn't matter that much if you don't know one in particular. All any of them have been good for throughout the centuries is spilling blood, anyway."
    w "不知道具体是谁也无所谓。反正几百年来，他们就知道打仗流血。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16996
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_61e2a1d6:

    # w "Their own. Their neighbor's. The borders don't matter too much."
    w "自己人打，邻居也打。反正他们眼里没边界。"

# game/script day12.rpy:16998
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2a80257e:

    # "Now it's your turn to offer nothing more than a vague, affirmative hum."
    "这回轮到你只能含糊不清地从鼻子里嗯了一声附和。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17000
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_45ca1c83:

    # "You have heard little of the region's past, but you can imagine it."
    "你对那个地方的过去不太了解，但也大概能猜到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17002
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_890e2553:

    # p "Sadly, it feels like it is all too common."
    p "唉，感觉这种事儿哪儿都有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17006
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_17b16e6f:

    # p "I remember when I was younger, our town became the new home for a family fleeing from somewhere."
    p "我记得小时候，我们镇上来了一户逃难的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17008
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_71abf438:

    # p "I was too young, so I don't remember where they came from, just that their children were... different, you know? I don't know how to explain it, but I had trouble getting along with them."
    p "我那时太小，不记得他们是哪儿的了，就记得他们那些小孩... 跟咱们不一样，你知道吧？ 我也说不上来，反正就是玩不到一块儿去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17010
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_70940058:

    # w "I understand what you mean."
    w "我明白你的意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17012
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a56d64a2:

    # w "Scarred.{w} That's what they were."
    w "心里有伤。{w} 他们就是那样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17014
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bdc2cd19:

    # "You shrug your shoulders and lean back a little further, slumping together."
    "你耸耸肩，往后一靠，俩人都懒洋洋的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17016
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c916b044:

    # p "Mhm..."
    p "嗯..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17018
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_98d3ce65:

    # p "Perhaps I should have tried harder, but it's not something you really think about when you're 6, maybe 7 years old."
    p "可能我当时应该试着了解他们，但那时候才六七岁，哪懂那么多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17020
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d45bdc4d:

    # p "Anyway, sorry to bring it up. I didn't want to sour the mood. {w}Uhm, let's see, how was it?"
    p "不管怎么说，抱歉提起这个扫兴的话题。我可没想破坏气氛。{w}呃，言归正传，那儿到底怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17024
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_273d44be:

    # w "How was what?"
    w "什么怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17026
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c863d1c7:

    # p "Hanover. I don't know, what's the landscape like? Any interesting towns? Perhaps something else there that sticks in your mind?"
    p "Hanover 啊。 我也不知道，那儿的风景怎么样？ 有啥好玩的地方吗？ 还是说，有什么特别让你记得的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17028
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0346b6dd:

    # p "Things like that."
    p "随便什么都行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17032
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_252387e3:

    # w "Same as everywhere."
    w "跟其他地方一样呗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17034
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4e73b0d9:

    # w "Flat. Villages, towns. Fields, where those villages and towns aren't."
    w "平坦。村庄，城镇。凡是没有村镇落脚的地方，就全是一望无际的农田。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17036
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_26fcae6c:

    # p "That's it?"
    p "就这些？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17038
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0779bd26:

    # w "Trees."
    w "树。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17042
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bf0d56c0:

    # "He shrugs, stretching one of his legs."
    "他耸耸肩，伸出一条腿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17044
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1be81e2b:

    # p "So absolutely {i}nothing{/i} about it stuck out to you?"
    p "就{i}真{/i}没啥特别的，能让你记住的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17050
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e6b194b2:

    # p "First France, now Hanover. You seem to get around a lot, but you don't even care about the places you go?"
    p "先法国，后汉诺威。你倒是到处乱跑，可压根不在乎去的是哪儿，是吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17052
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1145ac51:

    # w "I didn't go there to see the sights, I just passed through."
    w "我可不是去那儿玩的，就是路过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17054
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3d18391c:

    # w "That's why I didn't pay much attention to it."
    w "所以没怎么上心。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17058
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0a1ecf57:

    # w "Did I not mention the river that runs with cider? I guess I didn't."
    w "难道我没提过那儿流淌着苹果酒的河流吗？看来我是给漏掉了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17060
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_af90e582:

    # p "You know... you make fun of me for being sheltered, but..."
    p "你知道吗……你老笑话我没见过世面，可..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17062
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e9af4726:

    # p "You've traveled all over and the only thing you can think to say is that it's the same as everywhere."
    p "你走南闯北的，到头来就憋出一句“都一样”。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17064
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e6ad7198:

    # w "It {i}is{/i} the same as everywhere, [name]. That's the secret."
    w "{i}本来{/i}就都一样，[name]。这就是真相。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17066
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4ba7cfc1:

    # p "I don't believe that. {w}Come on. One thing, Wolf."
    p "我才不信。{w} 哎，说一个嘛，Wolf。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17070
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_da9987ec:

    # w "Not really. Just another place. Different accent."
    w "没啥好说的。换了个地方而已，口音不一样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17072
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e092057d:

    # p "Humor me."
    p "满足一下我的好奇心呗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17074
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d9e59aba:

    # w "Hm..."
    w "嗯..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17076
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bdbd5257:

    # p "Hm?"
    p "嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17080
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c7859369:

    # w "I'm thinking, give me a moment."
    w "我想想，让我想想。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17084
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_67df6569:

    # w "I'm thinking, shut up."
    w "我在想，你闭嘴吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17091
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3b82afb5:

    # "You wait patiently, finding a sudden interest in a stream of water dripping from the edge of the boat."
    "你耐着性子等，突然对船边滴下来的水珠来了兴趣。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17095
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4331b0b5:

    # w "Have you ever walked to an island?"
    w "你有没有走到过岛上？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17102
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_76d2a732:

    # p "I don't think I follow. I can't walk on water, if that's what you're asking?"
    p "我没明白你的意思。你问我能不能水上漂啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17104
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c4a4ed0b:

    # p "And just to get it out ahead of time, if you expect me to believe that you {i}can{/i}, well-"
    p "我先说好，你要是觉得我{i}会{/i}信你那一套——"

# game/script day12.rpy:17108
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9086204b:

    # w "No, that's not what I mean.{w} I could convince you, though. You're a naive sort."
    w "不是那意思。{w} 不过我能说服你，你这个人挺好骗的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17110
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a663249f:

    # p "Not {i}that{/i} naive."
    p "也没{i}那么{/i}好骗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17112
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_70142141:

    # w "Could've fooled me."
    w "我看未必。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17116
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_dda02815:

    # w "What I {i}meant{/i} was: there were a couple of islands you could walk to at low tide."
    w "我{i}是说{/i}，有几个岛退潮的时候能走过去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17118
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2cfffb2d:

    # w "There.{w} Is that interesting enough for you?"
    w "这事儿。{w} 够不够意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17120
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_71cddb03:

    # "He frees a hand from the tangle of fingers behind his head and lays it out from under the cover of the jolly boat to catch the rain in his palm."
    "他把搁在脑后的手抽出一只，伸到小艇外面，手心朝上接雨水。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17122
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6c9d3b99:

    # p "It is-"
    p "这..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17124
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1e9a4242:

    # w "And yes, before you ask, I have walked there."
    w "还有，别问了，我走过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17128
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_31cf7ddf:

    # p "I wasn't going to. You really {i}are{/i} sassy today."
    p "我又没想问。你今天嘴是真{i}毒{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17130
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0bbbc13b:

    # w "And {i}you{/i} are choosing to be here. In {i}my{/i} personal space."
    w "{i}你{/i}还不是自己要在这儿待着。在{i}我{/i}的地盘上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17132
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f5debd6e:

    # "You make a show of looking around the boat."
    "你就装模作样地四处打量这条船。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17134
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_de0f77c4:

    # p "It doesn't have your name on it.{w} Fine. What's it like to walk to an island?"
    p "这上面又没写你的名字。{w} 行吧。 走到岛上是什么感觉？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17136
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6e672310:

    # p "The same as walking anywhere else, I'm sure..."
    p "我觉得嘛，和其他地方一样..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17138
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d664c946:

    # w "No. Although I don't know if I would recommend it. Muddy, wet, and you'll probably have to wash your breeches when you get there."
    w "别去。 虽然我不太推荐。 又泥泞又潮湿，到了那儿你还得洗裤子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17140
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_838754b5:

    # p "Sounds like it would be quite an adventure, though."
    p "听起来倒像是挺刺激的冒险。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17144
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7348b296:

    # w "Something like that."
    w "差不多吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17146
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b7d1ea00:

    # w "A friend of mine got his paw stuck crossing one of the streams that run through the tidelands."
    w "我有个朋友，穿过潮滩上的一条小溪时，爪子卡住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17148
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7f66b3ac:

    # w "Not sure how he managed to..."
    w "我也不知道他怎么搞的..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17150
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_02ccd5f5:

    # w "I looked away for one moment, heard a yelp, and he was just... gone."
    w "我才刚转开眼，就听见他“嗷”一嗓子，然后就... 没了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17152
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3b6541d5:

    # w "A second later, the fool sprang up from the water, completely soaked, muddy, gasping for air."
    w "结果下一秒，这傻小子就从水里窜了出来，浑身湿透、满身泥巴，直喘粗气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17156
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_57b32a52:

    # w "You should have seen him, though."
    w "你该看看他当时那熊样儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17158
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_60b389e0:

    # "His muzzle splits into a subtle grin."
    "他的嘴角咧开一丝不易察觉的笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17160
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_24d92f07:

    # w "He usually had this thick, soft fur, which made him look like quite the broad guy.{w} I never saw him so thin before with his fur stuck to himself."
    w "他平时顶着一身厚实蓬松的浓密软毛，整个人瞧着格外魁梧威风。{w}我打从没见过他被雨水淋得毛发贴身时那副干瘪瘦削的寒碜样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17162
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b2fb58d6:

    # w "The guy's frame must have been half fur, if not more."
    w "那家伙的身架，估计一半都是毛撑起来的，说不定还多。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17164
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7e120f42:

    # "You can imagine all too well how he must have looked, and it draws a chuckle out of you."
    "你完全能想象出他那副狼狈相，忍不住扑哧笑出了声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17166
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f3ec3ccf:

    # "It's not like the crew of the good ship {i}Conway{/i} is any less bedraggled, after all."
    "说到底，咱们这艘优秀的{i}Conway{/i}号上的船员也好不到哪儿去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17170
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_191006d5:

    # p "I hope you managed to rescue the poor guy."
    p "希望你们把他救上来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17172
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d0937fd2:

    # w "Oh, we did, don't worry."
    w "害，那肯定救了，放心吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17176
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b5f60c8a:

    # w "After a while."
    w "过了一会儿才救的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17178
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_363266d4:

    # w "We were a tiny bit too busy laughing at his expense.{w} I'm sure he understood."
    w "当时我们光顾着嘲笑他了。{w} 他肯定能理解的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17180
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c184cd1c:

    # "The poor guy..."
    "那家伙，真可怜..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17182
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b3a4abc6:

    # w "I would argue he was the one in the best position."
    w "我觉得他才是最舒服的那个。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17184
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fcd08d91:

    # p "How do you even figure that?"
    p "你咋这么觉得？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17186
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a80f9408:

    # w "It was a scorching day. There he was, up to his hips in a stream of cool water."
    w "那天热得要命。 他呢，泡在凉飕飕的小溪里，水都到屁股了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17188
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8e2256b0:

    # w "Imagine this, but... you know."
    w "你想象一下那个画面，不过... 你懂的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17190
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f2f7fab0_1:

    # p "Pleasant?"
    p "令人愉快？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17192
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_73317686:

    # w "You {i}can{/i} learn."
    w "你{i}能{/i}学会的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17196
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ed6caf92:

    # p "Occasionally. So, who did you get the fife from?"
    p "偶尔吧。 话说回来，你这横笛是哪儿来的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17198
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_792e4e4e:

    # w "Why do you think it was one of them?"
    w "你咋就觉得是他们给的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17200
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0e3b1d69:

    # p "Just a guess."
    p "我猜的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17202
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_721f2227:

    # p "Unless you had several groups of friends you traveled with, but you don't strike me as someone who would have countless friends. Instead, I'd say you keep the few you have pretty close."
    p "除非你有很多伙一起旅行的朋友，不过你看上去也不像是有很多朋友的人。 我倒觉得，你有的那几个朋友，关系肯定铁得很。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17204
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a8650ba4:

    # "You watch his nose twitch ever so slightly before he reaches up to scratch it."
    "你注意到他的鼻子不易察觉地抽动了一下，然后抬手挠了挠。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17206
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_98ddf5ea:

    # w "It was, um, Eleanor."
    w "那是，嗯，Eleanor。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17208
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_90e7c16d:

    # w "She gave it to me. Wanted to teach me too, but we never found the time for it. Although it was well after my time in the Empire."
    w "是她给我的。她也想教我，可惜一直没抽出时间。而且那都是我离开帝国之后很久的事了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17210
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c0b75841:

    # w "We had made it and settled down in France for a longer while by then."
    w "那时候我们已经在法国定居很久了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17212
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8360f36e:

    # p "Eleanor? I like her name."
    p "Eleanor？我喜欢她的名字。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17214
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e8e2d8a4:

    # p "And a fine lady like her was fine with you ruffians just laughing at him?"
    p "像她那样一位女士，能受得了你们这些家伙嘲笑他？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17216
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_80f58725:

    # w "Of course she was! She was the first one who couldn't hold it in anymore."
    w "可不是嘛！她第一个就绷不住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17218
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6fddd354:

    # "You chuckle."
    "你轻笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17220
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e0616bc4:

    # p "What a ruthless lady."
    p "真是个狠人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17222
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a830800a:

    # w "Oh, you can say that again."
    w "那可不。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17224
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ed74c1a1:

    # w "She was the funniest person I've ever met, which is probably what you had to be to make it as a lady surrounded by the rest of us assholes."
    w "她是我见过最逗的人，估计也得这样才能在一个全是咱们这种混球的环境里当个淑女。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17226
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_29aac4be:

    # p "I can only imagine."
    p "我能想象。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17230
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cb35b885:

    # "Sounds a bit like Samuel."
    "听起来有点像Samuel。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17232
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fc491d5f:

    # p "Why did you visit the island? And why did you walk there instead of just taking a boat to cross?"
    p "你们为什么要去那个岛？而且为什么你们要走过去而不是直接乘船过去？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17236
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1dc017bd:

    # w "Novelty."
    w "新鲜感。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17238
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e6359327:

    # w "Stupidity too, I guess."
    w "也挺蠢的，我觉得。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17242
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1c548cee:

    # w "We were too cheap to hire a local to guide us."
    w "我们太抠门了，舍不得雇当地人给我们带路。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17244
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1af61c37:

    # w "We could see the island, you know? {w}I guess we figured: how hard could it be?"
    w "我们都能看见那岛，你知道吧？{w}当时就寻思：能有多难啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17248
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ebf1285e:

    # w "But I guess if you're stupid and the tide comes back in, it's just... you know."
    w "但你想啊，要是又蠢，又赶上退潮...那可就...不好说了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17250
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_eb7aff4c:

    # "You swallow, avoiding the thought of the likely outcome."
    "你咽了口唾沫，避免去想可能发生的后果。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17252
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a3b19e46:

    # p "Luckily, that didn't happen."
    p "万幸，事情并没闹到那一步。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17256
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1ad228eb:

    # w "Yeah..."
    w "是啊……"

# game/script day12.rpy:17258
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0aa53f9b:

    # w "Thankfully it didn't."
    w "谢天谢地，那没有发生。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17260
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cd29f9aa:

    # "Wolf tilts his head to the side and stares blankly at the deck."
    "Wolf把头歪向一边，茫然地盯着甲板。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17262
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_33b7a730:

    # "The familiar silence settles between you."
    "熟悉的沉默又降临了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17264
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_be7c05b5:

    # "One you've grown accustomed to by now."
    "你都习惯了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17268
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9b36ef31:

    # "It takes you a while to find your words, but just as you're about to speak, Wolf shakes his head."
    "你花了很长时间才找到话说，但就在你即将开口时，Wolf摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17270
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_adc0ef85:

    # w "The island wasn't very interesting."
    w "那个岛没什么意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17272
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6449780f:

    # w "I wasn't sure what we were expecting. It's just another piece of land."
    w "我也不知道当时期待啥。不就是块地嘛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17274
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a04cf6a3:

    # p "Same as everywhere?"
    p "和所有地方一样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17276
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6bc81623:

    # w "Same as everywhere. A village with a few fisherman's houses."
    w "和所有地方一样。一个有几间渔民小屋的村庄。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17278
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fc1a010f:

    # w "That's it."
    w "就这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17280
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fb872bca:

    # p "But it's stuck with you."
    p "但就是忘不掉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17282
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bf5522f4:

    # "You can't tell if he's considering that or not, but Wolf doesn't say anything for another long spell."
    "你也看不出他有没有在琢磨，Wolf又陷入了长久的沉默。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17284
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4c7d102c:

    # "Once again, as you're about to break the silence, he keeps going."
    "眼看你就要打破沉默，他又自顾自地说了下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17286
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_50f0a83f:

    # w "They call the island Baltrum, because when you walk it you're Baltrum."
    w "他们叫那座岛Baltrum，因为当你走在岛上，你就是Baltrum。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17288
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c10b3d92:

    # "His eyes meet yours briefly before he lets his head drop again."
    "他的目光和你短暂交汇，随即又垂下了头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17290
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e5578507:

    # w "I have no idea what they mean by that."
    w "我也不知道他们这话是什么意思。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17292
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_87456a4b:

    # w "Maybe because it's so boring that you need rum to make it entertaining? I've no idea."
    w "也许是因为那地方太无聊了，得靠朗姆酒才能找点乐子？我也不知道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17294
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_432f3b1d:

    # p "Konrad is from the region, isn't he?"
    p "Konrad是本地人吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17298
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_07cf5b3f:

    # p "Maybe he can explain it."
    p "没准他能解释。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17302
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9f97e261:

    # w "I'm not going to ask him..."
    w "我可不打算问他……"

# game/script day12.rpy:17304
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4489c529:

    # p "Why not?"
    p "为什么不问？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17306
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_279d01c5:

    # "Stupid question."
    "问了个蠢问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17308
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2e1a1808:

    # "You know that he wouldn't ask anyone."
    "你知道他是不会主动问别人的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17310
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3f63bbfc:

    # "And he knows that you know."
    "而且他也知道你是知道的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17315
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_732276a9:

    # "He looks at you wordlessly for a moment before lowering his head back down."
    "他无声地看了你片刻，然后再次垂下了头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17317
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_95fc20cd:

    # w "We were done with the island in an hour or two."
    w "我们一两个小时就走完了那座岛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17319
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6b3fc65a:

    # w "Didn't even have a place to wet your muzzle."
    w "连口水都没得喝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17321
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e5c09943:

    # w "The fish they had was all right, though, even if we had to hassle one of the fishermen for it."
    w "不过他们那儿的鱼倒还算鲜美，虽说我们不得不找当地渔夫费了番口舌才弄到手。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17325
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4e2b4757:

    # w "No, nothing."
    w "不，什么都没有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17327
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4fc1ce7d:

    # p "Oh, don't be an idiot. Of course you remember something about it."
    p "别犯傻了。你肯定记得点什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17334
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a8948cd4:

    # p "Where did you stay?"
    p "你住哪儿了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17336
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_29738039:

    # w "A house."
    w "一间房子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17338
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e0dd9795:

    # p "Oh, you're learning to be truly specific."
    p "哦，你现在倒是越来越会说了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17340
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_30c5547d:

    # w "What? It was a house."
    w "什么？就是一间房子啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17342
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c15c54ec:

    # p "I assumed you stayed in a house, Wolf. What did it look like? Was it big? Comfortable? What town was it in? Who did it belong to?"
    p "我当然知道你住房子里，Wolf。说说看，那房子长什么样？大不大？舒不舒服？在哪个镇上？是谁的房子？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17346
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f6301937:

    # p "Come on, this isn't that difficult. Picture me being there, far away from you."
    p "拜托，没那么难吧。你就想象我住在那里，离你远远的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17348
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5c8a2548:

    # p "You'd like that."
    p "你肯定乐意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17350
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3f7cdfa2:

    # w "True. Fine: it had straw beds and no windows in the room I was in."
    w "没错。好吧：我住的房间里只有草铺，而且没有窗户。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17352
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_22d0ea74:

    # w "Noisy."
    w "吵死了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17354
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f0faa460:

    # w "Reeked like the stalls."
    w "一股牲口棚的臭味。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17356
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fa0838a8:

    # p "So, you're saying it was pretty much like this ship?"
    p "所以说，你觉得那地方跟这艘船差不多？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17360
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7f6fb4cd:

    # "He chuckles and scratches the side of his jaw."
    "他轻笑一声，挠了挠腮帮子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17362
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7466db8d:

    # w "Pretty much, yeah."
    w "差不多，是这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17366
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6156c127:

    # w "What are you smuggling, anyway?"
    w "你到底在偷偷摸摸运啥呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17368
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_39c9acea:

    # "Your breath catches in your throat."
    "你一下子屏住了呼吸。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17370
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8f3241f2:

    # p "What?!"
    p "哈？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:17372
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4338194e:

    # w "Whatever it is that you've got in your shirt. You know: the thing you're smuggling. Subtlety isn't one of your strengths, is it?"
    w "不管你衬衫里藏了什么。你知道的：你走私的东西。你这人就没打算遮掩一下，是吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17374
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_54f6da1e:

    # w "Unless you're hoping that people will just assume you're pregnant?"
    w "除非你指望别人以为你怀孕了吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17376
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_23c92b9d:

    # w "If so, I think I have an important lesson to teach you about how bodies work."
    w "真要是那样，我倒是可以好好给你上一课，讲讲这身体构造是怎么回事儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17380
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5bfdd614:

    # p "I just wasn't trying very hard."
    p "我压根就没想好好藏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17388
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7d12a426:

    # "You fish for the buttons on your shirt and open two of them—just enough for you to guide the bottle through."
    "你伸手摸向衬衫纽扣解开了两颗——刚好够把酒瓶顺畅地塞进去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17395
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c1167e54:

    # "Rolling it in your hands, you find the label and hold it out to Wolf."
    "在手里转动着瓶子，你找到了标签，把它递给 Wolf。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17397
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0562a7fb:

    # p "Here."
    p "给你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17399
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e159722a:

    # "He looks at you, almost motionless except for a small flick of his ear."
    "他看着你，几乎纹丝不动，只有耳朵尖微微动了一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17401
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7ec961b1:

    # "His pupils slide down to the bottle you hold in front of him, then back to meet your eyes."
    "他的瞳孔向下移到你手里的瓶子上，然后又回到你的眼睛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17403
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_24898f12:

    # w "Why?"
    w "为什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17405
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_df71ccb3:

    # w "And from where?"
    w "从哪弄来的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17407
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b2c34c00:

    # p "Oh, {i}now{/i} you want to have a conversation. Does it matter?"
    p "哟，{i}现在{/i}才想起来问了？很重要吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17411
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_55891092:

    # w "I'll know when I get the answer."
    w "拿到答案我就知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17419
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cc51d444:

    # p "The passenger gave it to me."
    p "乘客给我的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17423
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7624fde2:

    # w "Why would he?"
    w "他为什么要给你？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17425
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_585c3ac6:

    # p "Because I asked him."
    p "因为我问他要了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17429
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_04909d00:

    # w "I get that. What I don't understand is why he'd just hand it over without a second thought."
    w "那点小九九我懂。我不明白的是他怎么会连眉头都不皱一下就把酒拱手交给你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17431
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3599b7f9:

    # p "Well, Wolf, that's what people usually call {i}friendship{/i}. You should try it sometime. It's great—when you're in a bind, a {i}friend{/i} might be around to help you out."
    p "这个嘛，Wolf，这通常就是人们所说的{i}友谊{/i}。你有时也该试试。这很棒——当你陷入困境时，一位{i}朋友{/i}可能就在身边帮你一把。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17433
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_62b0a0aa:

    # "He narrows his eyes, scanning you briefly. You work hard to keep your expression neutral."
    "他眯起眼睛，飞快地扫视着你。 你努力保持面无表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17435
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3d163312:

    # w "Hilarious."
    w "真好笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17437
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7f1c9948:

    # p "So, do you want some or not?"
    p "所以，你到底要不要来一口？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17439
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_49fcf938:

    # w "Hand it over already."
    w "拿过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17441
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fc0c532a:

    # "A satisfied smile spreads across your muzzle as he takes the bottle from your paws."
    "你得意地咧开嘴，笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17443
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d9c35b93:

    # w "What kind of wine is this, anyway?"
    w "这到底是什么酒啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17445
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d6d692fa:

    # p "What does it say on the label? I'm no expert, but it looks expensive."
    p "标签上写了什么？ 我不是专家，但它看起来很贵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17447
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_03291d9f:

    # w "It does..."
    w "确实..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17451
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b88dad53:

    # "With a soft pop, the cork releases as he twists it off and raises the bottle to his muzzle, taking a tentative sip."
    "随着“啵”的一声轻响，他扭开瓶塞，举起瓶子凑到唇边，小心地抿了一小口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17453
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_33ccf796:

    # "After a moment, he lowers it into his lap, savoring the taste before swallowing."
    "片刻之后，他把酒瓶放回腿上，在吞咽前细细品味。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17457
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e3ed45ae:

    # w "Not bad."
    w "不错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17459
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_14a4b70b:

    # "He pauses, then gives a nod of approval."
    "他停顿了一下，然后赞许地点点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17461
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6ad7adcc:

    # w "Very good actually. Looks like the guy has decent taste."
    w "“确实不错。看来这家伙还挺有品味。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17463
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_16077068:

    # "Your smile widens."
    "你的笑容更深了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17465
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d36d8451:

    # p "I'm no fool, Wolf. I figured he'd have the best wine on board—outside of maybe the Captain's storage."
    p "我不是傻瓜，Wolf。我料到他船上会有最好的酒——也许除了船长储藏室里的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17467
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8fd54e14:

    # p "Getting the Captain to lend me one, though? That would've been a stretch."
    p "“不过，想让船长赏我一瓶？那可就有点异想天开了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17469
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d452f523:

    # w "No doubt."
    w "“那是当然。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17471
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c08f1c00:

    # p "Go ahead, have another. I got it for both of us, so drink as much as you like."
    p "“别客气，再来点。我可是为咱俩弄的，想喝多少喝多少。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17476
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c149e7ef:

    # "Wolf hesitates for a moment. Whether it's genuine or he's just trying not to seem too eager, you're not sure. But after a few seconds he raises the bottle for another sip and passes it back to you."
    "Wolf犹豫了一下。你也不知道他是真客气，还是不想显得太猴急。但过了几秒钟，他还是举起瓶子又喝了一口，然后递回给你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17478
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_162519a2:

    # "You bring it to your nose and take a curious sniff. It smells rich, and Wolf has already given his approval. All that remains is to see how it tastes."
    "你把瓶子凑到鼻子前，好奇地闻了闻。气味浓郁，而且Wolf都说好了。剩下的就是尝尝味道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17480
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9fe941d6:

    # "Slowly, you lower the bottle and press your lips to it and take a sip."
    "你缓缓地放下瓶子，嘴唇贴上去，抿了一口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17482
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bcd4d9dc:

    # "The first hint of flavor is subtle, but as it spreads across your tongue, the full richness of the wine reveals itself."
    "第一丝味道很微妙，但当它在你的舌头上蔓延开来时，葡萄酒的全部醇厚都显现了出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17484
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_003e2a21:

    # "Smooth, a delicate sweetness, well-balanced, and clearly a cut above anything you've had before. Though admittedly you didn't have too many opportunities to savor wine in the past."
    "口感顺滑，带着一丝恰到好处的细腻清甜，回味醇和，显然远胜你以往尝过的任何粗劣水酒。虽说平心而论，你过去也根本没多少品尝葡萄酒的际遇。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17486
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a4df64b5:

    # p "Mhm... definitely beats that grog they usually give us."
    p "“嗯……绝对比他们平时给咱们喝的劣质酒强多了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17490
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c989158d:

    # w "Ain't that the truth."
    w "“可不是嘛！”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17492
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0c6355bd:

    # p "All that we're missing are those glasses they say you're supposed to use."
    p "咱们眼下唯一的遗憾，就是缺了他们说喝这种高档货该讲究的高脚玻璃杯。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17494
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a97f8e88:

    # w "Screw the glasses. This is how you drink wine—none of that foppish nonsense."
    w "去他的酒杯。这才是喝葡萄酒的正确方式——才不要那些花花公子的做派。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17498
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e066a6db:

    # p "Perce offered me some of his stash too, but I doubt his swill holds a candle to this."
    p "“Perce也说要给我弄点他的存货，但我看他那些泔水估计连这酒的边都沾不上。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17500
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_30699b2b:

    # "You glance down at the swirling liquid inside the bottle as you talk."
    "你说话时，瞥了一眼瓶子里摇晃的酒液。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17504
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_37706b98:

    # p "I originally got this to bribe the First Mate into letting me stay, but I think I can convince him without it."
    p "“我本来是想用这瓶酒贿赂大副，让他同意我留下来的，不过现在看来，不用这招也能搞定他。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17506
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f8b71a2a:

    # p "Besides, it's way too good to waste on his sorry ass, so why not celebrate a bit with you instead?"
    p "“再说，把它浪费在他那个倒霉蛋身上也太可惜了，不如和你一起庆祝一下？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17510
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f7da5522:

    # "You chuckle, taking another sip.{w} The second taste is just as exquisite as the first, and you allow it to linger on your tongue, savoring the flavor before handing the bottle back to Wolf."
    "你轻笑一声，又小酌了一口。{w}第二口与第一口同样妙不可言，你任由酒液在舌尖盘旋回味，细细品味之后才将酒瓶递还给Wolf。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17514
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_462c6962:

    # p "The surgeon gave it to me."
    p "“是船医给我的。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17516
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bed6e569:

    # w "The surgeon."
    w "“船医？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17518
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_23dbb9e5:

    # p "Rajeeyah, yes. Because I... helped her earlier."
    p "“Rajeeyah，对。因为我……之前帮了她一把。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17522
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1942a108:

    # "He scans you for just a second or two, and you try your best to keep your expression neutral."
    "他上下打量了你一两秒，你竭力保持面无表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17526
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7909a23f:

    # w "And why would the surgeon do that?"
    w "“船医干嘛要送你这个？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17528
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c45f3cee:

    # p "Because I asked nicely."
    p "“因为我好好求她了呗。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17530
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e503d4d9:

    # p "And because she's a generous should."
    p "而且因为她是个慷慨的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17532
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a8cbb203:

    # w "You've got a silvered tongue, don't you?"
    w "“你可真能说会道，嗯？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17534
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_80a25b50:

    # p "I begged."
    p "我恳求道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17536
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9aa0d5d2:

    # p "More or less."
    p "“差不多吧。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17540
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a191c085:

    # "Wolf can't quite suppress a soft chuckle that escapes him."
    "Wolf 忍不住轻笑了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17542
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_76ce983b:

    # p "So? Do you want some or not?"
    p "“所以？想来一口不？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17546
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9f93d118:

    # w "You're a dreadful liar."
    w "“你这谎撒得也太拙劣了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17548
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f0fd4781:

    # w "That could land you in real trouble. You do know that, right?"
    w "“你这样可是会惹上大麻烦的，知道吗？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17550
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ac72cd63:

    # p "Conversation {i}and{/i} concern for other people? I'm surprised."
    p "“{i}嘘寒问暖{/i}？真是太阳打西边出来了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17554
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6345d11f:

    # w "It's not concern."
    w "“我才不是关心你。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17556
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d7faebbc:

    # p "It sounds like concern."
    p "“听着就是关心。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17560
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5cd3b240:

    # w "I'm just saying it because I think sometimes you don't realize when you're doing something stupid."
    w "“我只是觉得你有时候犯傻都不知道。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17562
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e1a6b089:

    # p "Please don't sound like you think too highly of me..."
    p "“可别说得好像你很看得起我似的……”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17564
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e22afb6d:

    # p "Now: do you want some or not?"
    p "“现在：到底喝不喝？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17568
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b46b57cc:

    # w "If I were caught drinking with you, I would be in danger of being accused of theft. Do you even realize what the punishment would be? Lashes, at the very least."
    w "“要是我被发现跟你一块儿偷喝酒，搞不好会被当成小偷。你知道那是什么下场吗？轻则挨鞭子，重则...”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17570
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4a7c74d9:

    # w "They don't take kindly to theft on ships like this. Especially not from their own stores."
    w "“在这船上，偷东西可是重罪。尤其是偷仓库里的东西。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17572
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ef168ce0:

    # p "Doesn't sound pleasant."
    p "“听着就不好受。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17574
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_af9783c2:

    # w "And you came here to try and drag me into it?"
    w "“你来这儿是想拉我下水？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17578
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0b752141:

    # p "Can hardly bring it back now, can I? Even if I wanted to."
    p "“现在就算我想还回去，也难了不是？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17580
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f3fc0a25:

    # p "The best way to hide it is by making sure the evidence is gone.{w} And the best way to make sure the evidence is gone is by drinking it and tossing the bottle..."
    p "“想藏好东西，最好的办法就是让它彻底消失。{w} 而让它彻底消失的最好办法，就是喝光它，然后把瓶子一扔……”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17582
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_02a8f8e1:

    # p "Besides, isn't it said that stolen wine is the sweetest?"
    p "“再说，不是说偷来的酒才更香吗？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17584
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d8966b3b:

    # w "Water."
    w "“水。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17586
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_080b0d69:

    # p "Whatever."
    p "“随便你。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17590
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_57ce0382:

    # p "Good memory for someone who said he isn't religious."
    p "“记性不错啊，不像个不信教的人。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17592
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e3ee60e0:

    # w "Not anymore. With my ledger of sins, redemption is not a luxury I can afford to gamble on."
    w "“我已经不信教了。我罪孽深重，可不敢拿救赎做赌注。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17596
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c567f7c1:

    # p "Didn't take you for the religious type."
    p "“看不出来你还信教。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17598
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cc1e0fad:

    # w "I'm not. I decided I far prefer chasing sins. With that ledger of sins, redemption is not a luxury I can afford to gamble on."
    w "“我不信教。我更喜欢及时行乐。我罪孽深重，可不敢拿救赎做赌注。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17600
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_683f61f7:

    # w "I prefer to live without that burden."
    w "“我更喜欢无债一身轻。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17602
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4dd0d59b:

    # p "In that case, adding another one to the list will hardly be a problem."
    p "“既然这样，多添一笔也无所谓吧。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17604
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_62152fd4:

    # p "So...?"
    p "“所以呢……？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17606
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_44b74fd9:

    # "You tilt your head, resting it on your shoulder, watching him with quiet patience as you wait for his answer."
    "你歪着头，靠在肩膀上，耐心地看着他，等他回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17610
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f2c2950c:

    # "Out of the corner of your eye, you catch the gleam of his teeth as he curls his lips into a smirk."
    "你眼角瞥见，他嘴角勾起一丝假笑，牙齿也跟着闪了闪。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17612
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_49fcf938_1:

    # w "Hand it over already."
    w "拿过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17614
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7df3be5b:

    # "The cork makes a satisfying pop as he twists it off and brings the bottle to his muzzle for a sip."
    "他拧开瓶塞，一声令人愉悦的轻响，然后便将瓶子凑到嘴边，抿了一口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17618
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c046c68b:

    # p "I knew I could count on your help to make it disappear."
    p "我早就知道，这玩意儿肯定得靠你才能解决掉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17622
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a227d509:

    # "His face twists into a grimace as he lowers the bottle, having downed a mouthful."
    "他咽下一大口，放下瓶子，脸都扭曲了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17624
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_895a254b:

    # w "What in the world is this?"
    w "这究竟是什么鬼东西？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17626
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7021f0e9:

    # p "It says on the label, doesn't it?{w} There: wormwood wine."
    p "标签上写着呢，{w} 看：苦艾药酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17628
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f8dffc0a:

    # p "The surgeon mentioned it's what they hand you when you have stomach worms."
    p "外科医生说，这玩意儿是专门给肚子里长虫子的人准备的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17630
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cb8a9da1:

    # w "And you stole it for our... merriment. I do not understand how you survived to adulthood."
    w "你就偷了这玩意儿来... 给咱们助兴？我真搞不懂你到底是怎么活到现在的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17632
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_695a81c7:

    # p "Wine is wine, right?"
    p "酒不就是酒嘛，对不对？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17638
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ee1dc70f:

    # w "I guess they always say it has to taste like shit to be good medicine..."
    w "他们不都说，良药苦口嘛..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17642
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_53c5cf05:

    # w "You couldn't have stolen something better?"
    w "你就不能偷点儿好东西？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17644
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_956ef5e2:

    # p "Oh, yes. Please complain, Wolf.{w} I apologize that I didn't have a vineyard nearby to perhaps peruse their selection. Would the good sir have preferred the 1786 Vincent du Volf?"
    p "哎呦，Wolf狼，您就别抱怨了。{w} 我还想找个葡萄园好好挑挑呢，这不是没找着嘛。要不，来瓶1786年的 Vincent du Volf？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17648
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_93410de3:

    # "You hear him chuckle."
    "你听见他轻笑了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17650
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_24197697:

    # w "Point taken... I should shut up."
    w "算我说错了... 我闭嘴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17652
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_adac08aa:

    # "He leans over and hands the bottle back to you. You watch the leaves of what you assume to be the wormwood swirl within the colored liquid."
    "他倾身将瓶子递还给你。你看着瓶子里彩色的液体中，那些你觉得应该是苦艾的叶子在轻轻飘动。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17654
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5bcdc3bf:

    # "You bring the bottle to your nose and take a sniff, though the smell doesn't seem offensive. Rather minty, you'd guess."
    "你把瓶子凑到鼻子底下闻了闻，味道倒是不冲， 感觉有点像薄荷。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17658
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_805f9276:

    # "Is it really that bad? It can't be that bad, surely. Right?"
    "真的有那么难喝吗？不至于吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17660
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2a1ae5c9:

    # "You lower the bottle to your lips and take a sip of your own."
    "你把瓶子放到嘴边，也喝了一口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17662
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4b62c4aa:

    # "The initial swell that hits your lips isn't particularly offensive, but as the wine spreads across your tongue, the full bitterness emerges."
    "酒刚一涌上嘴唇，感觉还不算太糟糕，但当它在你的舌尖蔓延开来时，那股苦涩味儿就彻底爆发了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17664
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4adadd34:

    # "Just like Wolf before, you can't help but grimace as you pull the bottle from your lips and force yourself to swallow."
    "你也像Wolf狼刚才那样，忍不住皱紧眉头，把瓶子从嘴边拿开，硬着头皮咽了下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17666
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_abc80e72:

    # "It can, in fact, be that bad."
    "确实，就是这么难喝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17668
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e58c2099:

    # p "Ugh, I didn't expect it to be {i}this{/i} bitter."
    p "靠，真没想到会{i}这么{/i}苦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17670
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_423274dd:

    # p "If I had known, I would have gone for something else..."
    p "早知道我就不选这玩意儿了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17676
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8d590533:

    # p "And Perce even offered me some, but here I am, drinking... whatever this is."
    p "之前Perce还请我喝一杯呢，我却在这儿喝... 这是个什么玩意儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17678
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0784a9ad:

    # p "I should have taken him up on it..."
    p "我就该领他那份情的..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17680
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a92b6f2a:

    # "You watch the leaves float gently inside the bottle and examine the label, as if expecting to find some instruction on how to mitigate the bitterness."
    "你看着瓶子里的叶子轻轻飘动，又仔细研究了一下标签，希望能找到点儿缓解苦味的方法。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17684
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e874b56e:

    # p "But what the hell, now that the first mate has rescinded my dismissal and let me continue working on the ship, I thought it'd be nice to celebrate with you, Wolf."
    p "不过现在也管不了那么多了，既然大副已经收回成命，让我继续留在船上，那我和你庆祝一下也好，Wolf狼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17686
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_71c5369f:

    # p "I think after that scare I can survive some bitter wine."
    p "我想经历了上次那事儿，这点苦酒我还是能扛得住的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17689
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_76cb317c:

    # p "I still have to convince Arthur somehow, but whatever. I figured some celebration with you is in order, lest I won't have the chance anymore."
    p "我还得想办法说服ArthurArthur呢，不过也无所谓了。总觉得应该和你庆祝一下，免得以后都没机会了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17691
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fb0b06be:

    # "You take another sip, and hand the bottle back to him.{w} The second one isn't any better than the first..."
    "你又抿了一口，把酒瓶递还给他。{w}第二口的味道也并没比第一口好到哪儿去……"

# game/script day12.rpy:17695
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6180f0d0:

    # p "I got it from Perce."
    p "我从Perce那儿搞来的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17699
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_62b0a0aa_1:

    # "He narrows his eyes, scanning you briefly. You work hard to keep your expression neutral."
    "他眯起眼睛，飞快地扫视着你。 你努力保持面无表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17703
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fc7804ef:

    # w "So you took him up on the offer?"
    w "所以你真接受了他给的好处？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17705
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_675d3507:

    # p "Yep."
    p "那是。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17707
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0c66f63e:

    # w "Awfully kind of him."
    w "他可真够意思的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17709
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_124950e2:

    # p "Ain't it?"
    p "谁说不是呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17711
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4e84c4bd:

    # w "You don't strike me as someone who would be prepared enough to bring something along for you to trade."
    w "我看你也不像会提前准备好东西跟人交易的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17713
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_46851b95:

    # "You swallow hard, that wolf is too perceptive for his own good."
    "你费劲地咽了口唾沫，心想这家伙鼻子真灵。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17715
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_06aa62ba:

    # p "We, um... Came to an agreement after some back and forth."
    p "我们... 讨价还价了一番，最后说定了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17719
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_456d3047:

    # w "That guy?"
    w "就那家伙？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17721
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_650b7404:

    # p "He mentioned that he could trade me something, and so here we are."
    p "他说能跟我换点东西，所以我就来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17723
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_75959a67:

    # p "So, I didn't steal it or nothing.{w} What do you say? Do you want some or not?"
    p "总之我没偷没抢啊。{w} 你喝不喝？给句痛快话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17725
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_49fcf938_2:

    # w "Hand it over already."
    w "拿过来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17727
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fc0c532a_1:

    # "A satisfied smile spreads across your muzzle as he takes the bottle from your paws."
    "你得意地咧开嘴，笑了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17729
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f03eb197:

    # w "Rum, huh? Fancy yourself a pirate, or why did you go for rum?"
    w "朗姆酒，哈？把自己当海盗了还是怎么着，为什么挑了朗姆酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17731
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b19acbe1:

    # p "I'm sorry, Wolf, I didn't think to peruse his entire selection... {w}Wolf, I went with rum because that was what he had."
    p "抱歉了Wolf，我当时可没那闲工夫把他全部藏品挑拣个遍……{w}Wolf，我拿朗姆酒是因为他手头就只有朗姆酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17733
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2723476a:

    # p "We're on a ship. I'm astonished that I even managed to get something in the first place."
    p "咱可是在船上。能搞到点喝的就不错了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17735
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_93410de3_1:

    # "You hear him chuckle."
    "你听见他轻笑了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17737
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_24197697_1:

    # w "Point taken... I should shut up."
    w "算我说错了... 我闭嘴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17739
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b88dad53_1:

    # "With a soft pop, the cork releases as he twists it off and raises the bottle to his muzzle, taking a tentative sip."
    "随着“啵”的一声轻响，他扭开瓶塞，举起瓶子凑到唇边，小心地抿了一小口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17741
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e7113a5a:

    # "After a moment, he lowers it into his lap, savoring the taste briefly before swallowing."
    "过了一会儿，他把它放回膝盖上，在吞咽前短暂地品味了一下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17743
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e3ed45ae_1:

    # w "Not bad."
    w "不错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17745
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_14a4b70b_1:

    # "He pauses, then gives a nod of approval."
    "他停顿了一下，然后赞许地点点头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17747
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a859c3da:

    # w "Had better, but it'll do in the current circumstances."
    w "凑合喝吧，现在这情况有的喝就不错了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17749
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_16077068_1:

    # "Your smile widens."
    "你的笑容更深了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17751
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_56ba1853:

    # p "I'll take that. As far as rum that is available on this ship is concerned, I doubt you'll find much better outside of the captain's cabin."
    p "这瓶我收下了。要说这船上的朗姆，除了船长那份，估计找不着更好的了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17753
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8fd54e14_1:

    # p "Getting the Captain to lend me one, though? That would've been a stretch."
    p "“不过，想让船长赏我一瓶？那可就有点异想天开了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17755
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d452f523_1:

    # w "No doubt."
    w "“那是当然。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17757
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c08f1c00_1:

    # p "Go ahead, have another. I got it for both of us, so drink as much as you like."
    p "“别客气，再来点。我可是为咱俩弄的，想喝多少喝多少。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:17759
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c149e7ef_1:

    # "Wolf hesitates for a moment. Whether it's genuine or he's just trying not to seem too eager, you're not sure. But after a few seconds he raises the bottle for another sip and passes it back to you."
    "Wolf犹豫了一下。你也不知道他是真客气，还是不想显得太猴急。但过了几秒钟，他还是举起瓶子又喝了一口，然后递回给你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17761
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c1952c89:

    # w "I have to be careful.{w} I'd rather not end up three sheets to the wind."
    w "我得省着点喝。{w} 还是别喝断片儿了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17763
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_162519a2_1:

    # "You bring it to your nose and take a curious sniff. It smells rich, and Wolf has already given his approval. All that remains is to see how it tastes."
    "你把瓶子凑到鼻子前，好奇地闻了闻。气味浓郁，而且Wolf都说好了。剩下的就是尝尝味道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17765
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9fe941d6_1:

    # "Slowly, you lower the bottle and press your lips to it and take a sip."
    "你缓缓地放下瓶子，嘴唇贴上去，抿了一口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17767
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_23b74d77:

    # "The flavour of it comes on strong immediately, as does the burn of its alcohol."
    "它的味道立刻变得浓烈，酒精的灼烧感也是如此。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17769
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4916bf04:

    # "Not the smoothest rum, quite sharp, and you swallow the little gulp you had quickly to clear your throat from the burn."
    "算不上多顺喉的陈年朗姆，烈度极冲，你赶忙把咽进嘴里的一小口酒水咽下肚，以缓解喉咙里火辣辣的灼痛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17771
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_914edcba:

    # p "Not sure I'm a fan of it."
    p "不太对我的胃口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17773
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_570484ab:

    # w "Too strong?"
    w "太冲了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17775
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2a4db863:

    # "You nod and hold the bottle back over to him."
    "你点点头，把瓶子递还给他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17777
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_40e4be01:

    # p "I still have to convince Arthur somehow, but whatever. I figured some celebration with you is in order, lest I run out of time."
    p "我还得想办法去说服Arthur，不过算了。我觉得理应先跟你庆祝一番，免得我回头连时间都没了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17779
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_512bf739:

    # "You take another sip and hand the bottle back to him.{w} The second one isn't any better than the first..."
    "你又喝了一口，把瓶子还给了他。{w} 这第二口，也没比第一口好到哪儿去..."

# game/script day12.rpy:17781
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9b8d0e1f:

    # "You hold on to the bottle a moment longer than necessary, fearing it might drop as he clumsily reaches for it, his claws clinking against the glass."
    "你捏着瓶子没松手，有点怕他手脚笨，没拿稳给摔了，爪子碰在玻璃上，叮当作响。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17783
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_45a0c08f:

    # p "I don't expect you to {i}actually{/i} celebrate, though."
    p "不过我{i}也没指望{/i}你真能庆祝起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17785
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_386cb7ad:

    # p "It's probably not your thing, which is why I didn't bring Sam or Jules."
    p "这玩意儿估计不合你口味，所以我就没叫Sam和Jules。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17787
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_454f4b32:

    # p "I just thought it would be nice to share something to drink with you when I realized I had the chance."
    p "就是想着难得有机会，能跟你喝点啥，也挺好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17789
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_55382d84:

    # p "Since you mentioned how you enjoyed sitting together with some of your friends, watching the sun set behind the trees."
    p "你之前不是说，喜欢跟朋友一块儿，看太阳落山嘛。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17791
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_92305efa:

    # p "It just stuck with me."
    p "我一直记着呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17793
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e36818a0:

    # "Sadly, you wouldn't get a sunset for this moment, nor an especially beautiful day."
    "可惜啊，今天既没日落也没好天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17795
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_287a8cfa:

    # p "I wonder if that'll be us someday."
    p "我在想，将来我们也会变成那样吗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17797
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f3564337:

    # p "Old salts sitting by the gunwale watching the sun sink below the horizon."
    p "老伙计们坐在船舷边，看着太阳一点点没入地平线。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17799
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_70a89755:

    # "The mental picture makes you smile. It's one you could get used to. How old would you have to be for it?"
    "光是想想那个画面，我就忍不住笑了。感觉还不错，我可以接受。你说得活到多大岁数才能这样啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17801
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6972cd7f:

    # "Maybe when you are sporting a full beard like Konrad?"
    "要等到像 Konrad 那样，胡子拉碴的时候吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17803
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_50142b8d:

    # "You chuckle to yourself. But hopefully it won't take that long."
    "我偷偷笑了出来。但希望不用那么久。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17805
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4f59a05d:

    # "Deep down, you hope you won't have to wait longer than... how about this evening?{w} Would that be asking for too much?"
    "其实我心里想，要是不必等到……就今晚，怎么样？{w} 是不是有点太贪心了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17807
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ef18df4b:

    # p "Perhaps by then, Julian will have calmed down a bit, and you won't despise him with every fiber of your being."
    p "说不定到那时候，Julian 也能消停点，我也就不用浑身上下每个细胞都那么讨厌他了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17809
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bc6cc52b:

    # p "Energy of youth, I suppose."
    p "年轻气盛嘛，我懂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17811
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_76191257:

    # p "Then again, I'm hardly much older than him. You probably think the same about me..."
    p "不过话说回来，我也没比他大多少。没准你心里也觉得我挺烦的……"

# game/script day12.rpy:17815
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_87ada79c:

    # "A sharp, ragged exhale escapes his nose at the mention of Julian, loud enough to catch your attention."
    "一提到 Julian，他就从鼻子里重重地哼了一声，那声音大的，想不注意都难。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17817
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fc4d3f27:

    # "You think you catch a glint of his teeth in your periphery. He really does not like him..."
    "我好像瞥见他呲了一下牙。看来他是真不喜欢 Julian 啊……"

# game/script day12.rpy:17821
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_45f179e0:

    # p "He's not so bad, Wolf. You should give him a chance."
    p "他也没那么糟糕，Wolf。你就该给他个机会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17823
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5184b1ee:

    # p "Sure, he can be a little bit silly, even stupid, and sometimes overshoots the mark, but deep down he's a good cookie."
    p "没错，他有时候是挺傻的，笨手笨脚的，也容易过头，但人挺好的，心眼不坏。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17828
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9df08ab5:

    # p "And don't worry. I understand."
    p "放心吧，我都明白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17830
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c4d87caf:

    # p "He can be annoying at times, but we're all new here. I think it's important to make the best of it and things will go smoother once we know each other better."
    p "他有时候是挺烦人的，不过咱们都是新来的嘛。我觉得好好相处才是最重要的，等大家彼此熟悉了，一切都会更顺利的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17832
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b02f12d2:

    # "You lean back and let your head rest against the wooden support of the jolly boat."
    "你往后一靠，让脑袋枕在小艇的木头支撑上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17834
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_027ce1dd:

    # "The bitter taste in your mouth begins to fade from your tongue, and your eyes wander aimlessly along the curves of the wood grain above you."
    "嘴里的苦味渐渐淡去，你百无聊赖地看着头顶上方的木头纹路。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17836
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_40d300d8:

    # p "You know... You don't have to, of course, but if you'd like, I'd love to do this again sometime."
    p "那个…… 当然，你不用勉强，不过你要是愿意，我倒是很想以后有机会再这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17838
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_444a17b0:

    # p "With a proper sunset and a proper drink."
    p "找个好点的日落，再来点像样的酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17842
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2210a7ca:

    # p "If you want, that is. I don't expect you to answer right away, but..."
    p "只是如果你愿意的话。我也不指望你立刻答应，不过……"

# game/script day12.rpy:17844
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_14decbbe:

    # p "I've enjoyed hanging out with you, you know? I wouldn't be here, otherwise."
    p "跟你待在一块儿，我挺开心的，你知道吧？不然我也不会在这儿了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17846
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_be7d52c1:

    # p "Anyway... that's for another time, I suppose."
    p "算了…… 以后再说吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17848
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8b6d5087:

    # p "Wolf?"
    p "Wolf？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17850
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_739ce26a:

    # "His paws tremble as he clutches the bottle, as if it were his only lifeline to safety."
    "他死死地抱着酒瓶，爪子都开始哆嗦了，好像那是他唯一的救命稻草。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17852
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8758c7bf:

    # "Has he even taken another sip yet?"
    "他…他又喝了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17854
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_42b01cbe:

    # p "Hey."
    p "喂。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17856
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e0a4f5c6:

    # p "You don't have to actually shut up."
    p "你其实不用非得闭嘴的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17858
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_afbbb353:

    # "His jaws part slightly as he draws in a breath, but you're still left waiting for a response."
    "他好像想说点什么，嘴唇动了动，可还是什么都没说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17867
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_48f6a17b:

    # "You raise your paw and reach out carefully, your fingertips brushing over his arm before you gently rest your palm on it."
    "你抬起爪子，小心翼翼地伸出去，指尖轻轻碰了碰他的手臂，然后温柔地把手掌放在上面。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17869
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_70c777c9:

    # "You can feel the tension in his muscles beneath his fur."
    "你能感觉到毛发下他的肌肉绷得紧紧的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17871
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cd30ec79:

    # w "{alpha=0.5}You should go.{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.5}你该走了。{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:17878
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ee1e7532:

    # p "Wolf? Are you all right?"
    p "Wolf？你没事吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17880
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e09451e2:

    # "You hear the concern in your voice."
    "你听得出自己声音里带着担忧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17882
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3234e4dd:

    # p "Should I get the surgeon?"
    p "我去找医生来？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17884
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4f1b8d6f:

    # p "Wolf, talk to me."
    p "Wolf，跟我说说话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17886
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cd30ec79_1:

    # w "{alpha=0.5}You should go.{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.5}你该走了。{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:17893
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c844fc17:

    # "Your ears droop and your gaze falls to the deck, giving him the space he seems to need."
    "你垂下耳朵，目光也落到了甲板上，给他留下他似乎需要的空间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17895
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cd30ec79_2:

    # w "{alpha=0.5}You should go.{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.5}你该走了。{/alpha}"

# game/script day12.rpy:17897
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c9f3e03a:

    # "You jerk your head up, ears pricked back to attention."
    "你猛地抬起头，耳朵也竖了起来，重新集中了注意力。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17899
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bba908e7:

    # "His words are mumbled to the point of being difficult for you to hear."
    "他声音含糊不清，你得费劲才能听清。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17901
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p "啊？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17903
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_096e8975:

    # "With a weary movement, he raises his hand to support his head, covering his eyes with his fingers as he leans into them."
    "他疲惫地抬手撑着额头，手指遮住了眼睛，身子也跟着靠了上去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17905
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_30fa9c96:

    # w "[name].{w} Just leave..."
    w "[name]……{w} 走开……"

# game/script day12.rpy:17907
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0c249c31:

    # "You search what little you can of his expression from behind his hand, desperately searching for some hint to help you understand."
    "你想尽力看清他藏在手后的表情，拼命想从中找到些什么，好让你明白发生了什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17909
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4360bec1:

    # p "W- why? What did I do?"
    p "为……为什么？我做错了什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17913
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_04ccb6e0:

    # w "I said {cps=3}{color=#ea5f5f}{i}leave!{/i}{/color}{/cps}"
    w "我叫你 {cps=3}{color=#ea5f5f}{i}滚！{/i}{/color}{/cps}"

# game/script day12.rpy:17915
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_99cabeaa:

    # p "{cps=10}But why? Please tell me wha-{/cps}{nw}"
    p "{cps=10}可……为什么？求你告诉我到-{/cps}{nw}"

# game/script day12.rpy:17922
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5b6a3589:

    # w "{vspace=50}{space=1000}{size=+40}{color=#D22B2B}NOW!{/color}{/size}" with hpunch
    w "{vspace=50}{space=1000}{size=+40}{color=#D22B2B}现在就滚！{/color}{/size}" with hpunch

# game/script day12.rpy:17926
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1e69acb6:

    # "{color=#ea5f5f}Bared teeth snap together, his visage twisted into a vicious snarl.{/color}"
    "{color=#ea5f5f} 他呲着牙，面孔扭曲，凶狠地咆哮着。{/color}"

# game/script day12.rpy:17928
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d7b1ac9a:

    # p "Wolf..."
    p "Wolf……"

# game/script day12.rpy:17932
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5741427f:

    # "He turns away, his icy gray eyes darting frantically to avoid your gaze."
    "他转过身去，冰冷的灰色眼睛慌乱地躲闪着，不愿与你对视。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17934
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_078098ef:

    # p "What in the world has gotten into you?"
    p "你到底发什么疯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:17936
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d6793a77:

    # "His paw slams against his face, claws digging into the bristly fur on his head. When he speaks, his voice is a low, threatening growl."
    "他的爪子狠狠地拍在脸上，深深地抓挠着头上粗硬的毛发。他低吼着，声音低沉而充满威胁。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17938
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a354cf02:

    # w "I told you to leave!"
    w "我叫你滚！"

# game/script day12.rpy:17940
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cf8dadd4:

    # w "Leave!"
    w "滚！"

# game/script day12.rpy:17942
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_65ebc866:

    # w "Or I will tear your damn throat out!"
    w "否则我就撕烂你的喉咙！"

# game/script day12.rpy:17944
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4f5cf0ba:

    # w "Never speak to me again!{w} I don't care about what you have to say. {w}I don't care about your damn game of playing sailor.{w} And I don't care about you. Do you understand?"
    w "永远别再跟我搭话！{w}我根本不在乎你有什么屁话要说。{w}我不在乎你那套过家家一样的扮水手游戏。{w}我更不在乎你这个人。你听懂了没有？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:17948
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9fee47c0:

    # w "Do you understand?!"
    w "你听明白了没有？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:17952
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e97b8667:

    # "His words drip through his sharp teeth like vile poison. You stare at him, lost for words, as you inch closer to the open deck."
    "他的话语像剧毒一样从牙缝里挤出来。你茫然地看着他，一句话也说不出来，只能一点点地向着敞开的甲板边缘挪去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17956
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_34faa75a:

    # "The tips of your fingers brush the wet planks until you feel the cold rain begin to land on your bruised knuckles."
    "你的指尖拂过潮湿的木板，直到你感到冰冷的雨水落在了你受伤的指关节上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17960
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_212f039f:

    # "The tips of your fingers brush the wet planks until you feel the cold rain begin to kiss the back of your hand."
    "你的指尖拂过潮湿的木板，直到你感到冰冷的雨水轻柔地亲吻着你的手背。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17962
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d7b1ac9a_1:

    # p "Wolf..."
    p "Wolf……"

# game/script day12.rpy:17964
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b73e5072:

    # p "I- well, a- yes."
    p "我-好吧，呃-是的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17966
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_09d9bba3:

    # p "I understand. I'll leave you alone."
    p "我明白了。我不会再打扰你了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17968
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6b75b5b3:

    # "You're not sure you truly understand."
    "你并不确定自己是否真的明白。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17970
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_74c89555:

    # "But it's beginning to feel warm out here, and the rain provides a soothing respite."
    "但这里开始变得暖和起来，雨水也带来了一丝慰藉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17972
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5fbba5aa:

    # "Or so you tell yourself."
    "也许只是我的一厢情愿吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17979
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f267ac28:

    # "You crawl out from under the jolly boat to give him the distance he wants."
    "你挪动身体，从那艘小艇底下爬了出来，想给他一点空间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17984
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_99c2690e:

    # "His eyes barely follow you, and before long he brings himself to turn his head to the side, avoiding you altogether."
    "他几乎没怎么看你，很快就扭过头去，干脆不理你了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17997
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_63f72883:

    # "Once you're able to stand, you rise to your paws, staring at the immobile hull of the jolly boat."
    "等到双腿重新找回力气，你站起身来，呆呆凝望着一动不动的小艇艇身。"

# game/script day12.rpy:17999
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_37e64042:

    # "Thoughts race through your head, trying to find the reason for his reaction."
    "你脑子里乱哄哄的，拼命想找到他这样对你的理由。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18001
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_dcebbd5e:

    # "Did you do something wrong?"
    "是不是我做错了什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18003
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1758c116:

    # "Did you offend him somehow?"
    "我哪里惹到他了吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18005
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7b381622:

    # "For a moment, you consider going back to ask him, but..."
    "有一瞬间，你都想回去问个清楚，可是......"

# game/script day12.rpy:18007
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d7b1ac9a_2:

    # p "Wolf..."
    p "Wolf……"

# game/script day12.rpy:18009
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f493c630:

    # "Your voice barely escapes your lips, a whisper so faint that even you struggle to hear it."
    "你的声音轻得几乎听不见，像一阵微弱的耳语。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18011
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_22d5d7eb:

    # "The first step is the hardest."
    "迈出第一步，是最难的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18016
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_91986aaa:

    # "You hope."
    "但愿如此吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18021
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b0cc3927:

    # "But none that follow become any easier."
    "可接下来的每一步，都一样艰难。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18026
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f3bc2272:

    # "You don't even know where you're going."
    "你甚至不知道自己要去哪儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18035
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ec20a5e1:

    # "Eventually you find yourself on the stairs leading to the stern of the ship, your head resting against the gunwale."
    "不知不觉，你发现自己已经走到通往船尾的楼梯上，头抵着舷墙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18037
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8cc4280c:

    # "The deck is laid out in front of you, somehow feeling more constricting than you remember."
    "甲板就在眼前，不知怎么的，感觉比记忆中更加压抑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18039
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_039e1b8d:

    # "Minutes drag by as you watch the boat he is under, silently wishing him to emerge and to come to you."
    "你默默地望着他藏身的小艇，盼着他能出来，朝你走来，时间一分一秒地流逝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18041
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5ebe0166:

    # "Busy paws scurry past, occasional complaints for you to move thrown your way."
    "有些水手匆匆跑过，嫌你碍事，嘴里嘟囔着让你让开。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18043
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9da12ae2:

    # "There is enough space."
    "明明地方还很宽敞。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18045
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ed0561b9:

    # "Though it has probably been half an hour or less, it feels like the whole day has passed you by. But you see movement. A black paw emerges from under the boat, followed by the rest of him."
    "也许只过了不到半个小时，却感觉像过了一整天。 终于，你看到他动了。一只黑色的爪子从船底下伸了出来，然后是他整个人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18047
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4d8ac624:

    # "His steps are unsteady as he stumbles toward the gunwale."
    "他脚步虚浮，摇摇晃晃地走向舷墙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18049
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_72902017:

    # "It doesn't take long for the bottle to go flying out into the sea, vanishing into the depths below."
    "没过一会儿，一个酒瓶就被他扔进了大海，消失在深不见底的海里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18055
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fede333d:

    # "An angry throw.{w} Aimless.{w} Sloppy enough that he has to catch himself against the gunwale."
    "带着怒气，胡乱地一扔。{w} 他扔得太没准头了，不得不扶着舷墙才能稳住自己。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18057
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d3206d14:

    # "It takes a lot to resist going over to him, but you fear it will only make things worse."
    "你拼命忍住才没跑过去，但你害怕那样只会让情况更糟。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18059
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a7bba136:

    # "Whatever it is..."
    "不管是因为什么......"

# game/script day12.rpy:18061
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6db12a94:

    # "Maybe tomorrow he'll have forgotten about it?"
    "也许明天，他就会把这件事忘了吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18063
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_853b21a3:

    # "Your eyes meet for a fleeting moment as he makes his way below deck, surprise flickering in his before they harden into their usual stoic mask."
    "他走向船舱的时候，你们的目光短暂地交汇了一下，他眼中闪过一丝惊讶，但转瞬即逝，又恢复了往常那副冷漠的样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18065
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_05ec01a1:

    # "Through the gaps in the railing, you watch as he opens the hatch and descends into the ship."
    "你透过栏杆的缝隙，看着他打开舱门，走进了船舱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18067
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f7c716cd:

    # "Ignoring you."
    "他还是不理你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18069
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    ". . ."

# game/script day12.rpy:18071
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_dde1dc75:

    # "Rising from your spot takes a monumental effort, with your heavy heart weighing you down. But eventually you too find your way below deck."
    "心头沉重的负荷让你连站起身来都需要付出巨大的心力。但最终，你也同样拖着步子走向了下层甲板。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18081
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_462c6962_1:

    # p "The surgeon gave it to me."
    p "“是船医给我的。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18085
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_aec4b7cb:

    # p "The surgeon gave it to me because I helped her earlier."
    p "是之前我帮了外科医生，她才给我的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18089
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8c8fdc3f:

    # "He scans you for a second or two, and you try your best to keep your expression neutral."
    "他上下打量你，目光扫来扫去，你竭力板着脸，不露破绽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18093
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7909a23f_1:

    # w "And why would the surgeon do that?"
    w "“船医干嘛要送你这个？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18095
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c45f3cee_1:

    # p "Because I asked nicely."
    p "“因为我好好求她了呗。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18097
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bc396cb6:

    # p "And because she's a generous soul."
    p "而且还因为她是个心地宽厚慷慨的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18099
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a8cbb203_1:

    # w "You've got a silvered tongue, don't you?"
    w "“你可真能说会道，嗯？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18101
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_80a25b50_1:

    # p "I begged."
    p "我恳求道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18103
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9aa0d5d2_1:

    # p "More or less."
    p "“差不多吧。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18107
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_a191c085_1:

    # "Wolf can't quite suppress a soft chuckle that escapes him."
    "Wolf 忍不住轻笑了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18109
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_76ce983b_1:

    # p "So? Do you want some or not?"
    p "“所以？想来一口不？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18116
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_44b74fd9_1:

    # "You tilt your head, resting it on your shoulder, watching him with quiet patience as you wait for his answer."
    "你歪着头，靠在肩膀上，耐心地看着他，等他回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18121
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9f93d118_1:

    # w "You're a dreadful liar."
    w "“你这谎撒得也太拙劣了。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18123
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c9b85c20:

    # w "This could get me into serious trouble, you know that, right?"
    w "你知道的，这事儿要是真捅出去，我可要吃不了兜着走，明白吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18125
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f1f23d02:

    # p "Same goes for me, doesn't it?"
    p "我也是一样，好不好？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18129
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7d75e4af:

    # w "Do I care what you do? No.{w} At least not until it starts to affect me. And if I were caught drinking with you, I would risk being accused of theft if they find out where you got it from."
    w "我管你做啥？才懒得管呢。{w} 除非是惹到我头上。再说了，要是我跟你一块儿喝酒的事儿被人撞见，他们再顺藤摸瓜查出这酒是哪儿来的，我非得被扣上个偷窃的罪名。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18131
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8532044b:

    # w "Do you even know what the punishment would be? Lashes, at the very least. They don't take kindly to theft on ships like this, especially not from their own stores."
    w "你知道偷东西会怎么样吗？轻则挨鞭子。在这船上，偷东西可不是闹着玩的，特别是偷仓库里的东西。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18133
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ef168ce0_1:

    # p "Doesn't sound pleasant."
    p "“听着就不好受。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18135
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_45fe201e:

    # w "And now you come here trying to drag me into it?"
    w "现在你倒好，自己惹了麻烦，还想拉我下水？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18139
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0b752141_1:

    # p "Can hardly bring it back now, can I? Even if I wanted to."
    p "“现在就算我想还回去，也难了不是？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18141
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f3fc0a25_1:

    # p "The best way to hide it is by making sure the evidence is gone.{w} And the best way to make sure the evidence is gone is by drinking it and tossing the bottle..."
    p "“想藏好东西，最好的办法就是让它彻底消失。{w} 而让它彻底消失的最好办法，就是喝光它，然后把瓶子一扔……”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18143
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_02a8f8e1_1:

    # p "Besides, isn't it said that stolen wine is the sweetest?"
    p "“再说，不是说偷来的酒才更香吗？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18147
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0cc93caf:

    # w "Water..."
    w "水..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18149
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_080b0d69_1:

    # p "Whatever."
    p "“随便你。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18153
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_57ce0382_1:

    # p "Good memory for someone who said he isn't religious."
    p "“记性不错啊，不像个不信教的人。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18155
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2ffb1908:

    # w "Not anymore. I just relished sinning too much."
    w "早就不喝那玩意儿了。我啊，就喜欢这股子使坏的劲儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18159
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c567f7c1_1:

    # p "Didn't take you for the religious type."
    p "“看不出来你还信教。”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18161
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bf65a481:

    # w "I'm not. I decided I prefer chasing sins."
    w "我可没打算回头。我这辈子就爱追着刺激跑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18163
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7b5d073d:

    # p "So?"
    p "所以呢？/那又怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18165
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7f3dc36c:

    # p "Want to add one more to the list?"
    p "要不要再给我的“犯罪记录”上添一笔？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18172
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_546f1451:

    # "You turn your head and allow it to rest on your shoulder while you patiently wait for his answer."
    "你侧过头把脑袋靠在肩头上，耐心地等待着他的回答。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18174
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_088a000a:

    # w "I'm afraid I've run out of ink."
    w "恐怕我没那个“墨水”了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18178
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_98f90c41:

    # "He pauses for a moment, and you notice that he looks at you briefly out of the corner of his eye."
    "他顿了顿，你瞥见他用眼角偷偷瞄了你一眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18180
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_778c8342:

    # w "What kind of wine is it?"
    w "这是什么酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18187
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_652a39b6:

    # p "Wormwood wine."
    p "苦艾药酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18189
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c9bbadcf:

    # p "The surgeon mentioned it's what you're given if you have stomach worms. But wine is wine, right?"
    p "船医提过这是给肚子里生蛔虫的人喝的药酒。不过酒总归是酒，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18193
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_778d1dca:

    # "He lets out a noisy snort and waves off your offer."
    "他鼻子不是鼻子，脸不是脸地哼了一声，摆手拒绝了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18199
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_770690e6:

    # w "I'll pass. Doesn't sound very appetizing."
    w "算了吧，听着就没啥胃口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18203
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d4609e9c:

    # w "I can already see you shitting your guts out after you drank it, or whatever weird side effect a surgeon's brew would have."
    w "我都能想到你喝完之后上吐下泻的样子，或者说，谁知道那老军医酿的玩意儿还有啥古里古怪的副作用。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18205
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9da7677f:

    # w "If you're so desperate for that, go ahead, but without me."
    w "你要是真馋这口儿，自己喝去，别拉上我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18207
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c2fa18b9:

    # p "It can't be that bad. I told her it would be a gift, and I doubt that she would hand me something that would cause... that."
    p "应该没那么邪乎吧。我跟她说这是送人的礼物，她总不能拿会让人闹肚子的东西糊弄我吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18209
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_905deaf6:

    # "You give the bottle a swirl, watching the dark leaves of wormwood move within the colored liquid. For a moment, you toy with the idea of opening it and trying a sip yourself."
    "你晃了晃瓶子，看着深色的苦艾叶在酒液里翻滚。一时间，你甚至想打开尝一口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18211
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c0026fd0:

    # "But do you really feel like drinking on your own right now?"
    "但你现在真的想一个人喝闷酒吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18213
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ae8df725:

    # "Nah..."
    "不想……"

# game/script day12.rpy:18215
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_82890e2b:

    # p "You sure?"
    p "你确定？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18219
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f66fe157:

    # w "I said no..."
    w "说了不想就是不想……"

# game/script day12.rpy:18221
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_396e5bf9:

    # "You shrug; it doesn't sound like he is going to budge. Oh well, you gave it a shot and instead tuck the bottle back under your shirt."
    "你耸了耸肩；听起来他根本没有退让的打算。算啦，至少你尽力试过了，于是把酒瓶重新塞回衬衫底下掖好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18223
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_74e004d7:

    # p "I guess I can't do much more than ask."
    p "看来我也只能问问了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18227
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f419a23c:

    # "Does it really look that obvious when you try to hide it?"
    "我藏东西的时候，就这么容易被人看出来？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18229
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2459ec34:

    # "You glance down and adjust your clothes, trying to hide the bump as discreetly as you can."
    "你低头看了看，整理好衣衫，尽可能不动声色地遮掩住凸起的轮廓。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18231
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bac805c6:

    # "It doesn't look {i}that{/i} obvious... {w}At least you think so."
    "看起来没{i}那么{/i}明显…… {w}至少你是这么觉得的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18235
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bad710a8:

    # w "Loosen your shirt more."
    w "再把领口拉开点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18239
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ab27b8a6:

    # "Following his advice, you pull your shirt out a little more, letting it hang more loosely around you."
    "你听他的，又扯了扯衬衫，让它松垮地挂着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18241
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c40a4dd3:

    # "You respond while still fiddling with the fit, trying to hide the bottle."
    "你一边摆弄着衣领，一边含糊地应付着，想把酒瓶藏好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18243
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8631b911:

    # p "Like this? It's barely holding it up anymore."
    p "这样？感觉都要兜不住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18245
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f393c613:

    # p "Look, if I move the wrong way, it'll fall out."
    p "我说，我稍微一动，它就要掉出来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18247
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5b594c1d:

    # "You turn your chest from side to side, demonstrating how precariously the bottle is tucked beneath your shirt."
    "你左右转了转身子，示意酒瓶就这么勉强地塞在衬衫里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18251
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_72b5f615:

    # w "Then be more careful and it won't."
    w "那就小心点，不就没事了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18253
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f2b8ce83:

    # w "Next time, think ahead—wear an overcoat or a jacket."
    w "下次，提前想好——穿件大衣或夹克。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18255
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fd856198:

    # p "Well, that's hardly helpful right now, is it?"
    p "拜托，现在说这些有什么用？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18259
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_66af135a:

    # "He snorts, exhaling sharply through his nose."
    "他鼻子不是鼻子，眼睛不是眼睛地哼了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18261
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_339ebd03:

    # w "Are you planning on sneaking it back to your hammock?"
    w "你不会是想偷偷摸摸地把这玩意儿带回吊床吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18263
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d2e20684:

    # p "No. If you're not interested, I'll take it to the First Mate. That's why I got it in the first place."
    p "不。你没兴趣就算，我去找大副。我一开始就是为了这个才搞到手的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18265
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ac82e3f9:

    # p "I don't want to carry it around for too long—someone's bound to notice, and I'd rather avoid getting into more trouble."
    p "我不想带着它太久——肯定会有人注意到，我宁愿别再惹麻烦了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18267
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_dafe2798:

    # w "And bribing the first mate isn't going to cause trouble?"
    w "贿赂大副就不会惹麻烦了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18269
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_354f872e:

    # "You give a casual shrug."
    "你无所谓地耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18273
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1011daf6:

    # p "You heard what Perce said—and it's all I have to go on."
    p "你听到Perce说的了——而我也只能照做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18277
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e97e0127:

    # p "Perce mentioned it when I talked with him, and it's all I have to go on."
    p "Perce和我闲聊的时候提了一嘴，我也只能指望这个了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18279
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_82f4899d:

    # p "Wish me luck, I guess."
    p "祝我好运吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18283
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_934525f4:

    # "Wolf gives you a nod and shifts aside, making space for you to crawl out from under the jolly boat as gracefully as you can manage."
    "Wolf点了点头，挪开身子，让你尽可能体面地从救生艇底下爬出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18287
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fb019d27:

    # w "I'll pass. I'm not risking my fur for that."
    w "别，我可不趟这浑水。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18291
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_710d1a77:

    # w "If you're so desperate for punishment, go ahead, but count me out."
    w "你要是嫌日子太舒服了想找点罪受，自己去，别拉上我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18295
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_892b0e5e:

    # "He shifts his weight forward and begins to exit your little hiding place."
    "他重心一 shift，就要爬出咱们这小小的藏身之处。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18302
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2c962696:

    # "You don't intervene and watch him crawl out from under the boat, immediately undoing what little progress he had made towards getting dry."
    "你也没拦他，眼睁睁地看着他从船底下爬出去，之前为了弄干衣服做的那点努力瞬间白费。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18304
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c2c22d56:

    # p "You really don't want even just one sip?"
    p "真的一点都不想来一口？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18306
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4309ad3a_1:

    # w "No."
    w "不行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18308
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3796bb40:

    # w "I'm not here to make a fool of myself.{w} Risking everything?"
    w "我到这儿来可不是为了出洋相的。{w}拿自己的身家性命去冒这种险？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18310
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_73dc7b1d:

    # w "Not for that."
    w "不值得。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18312
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_983c9e30:

    # w "...And not for you."
    w "……而且，不为你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18317
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b94280ba:

    # "He leaves without so much as a goodbye, and you are left alone with only a bottle of wine to contemplate."
    "他头也不回地走了，只留下你独自对着一瓶酒发呆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18319
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1290f7b9:

    # "You give the bottle a swirl, watching the dark leaves of wormwood move within the colored liquid. With a quick pull, you open the cork with a satisfying pop. Leaning in close, you take a curious whiff."
    "你晃了晃酒瓶，看着瓶中彩色的液体里，苦艾的黑色叶片在微微荡漾。 你用力一拔，随着“砰”的一声，瓶塞被打开了。 你凑上前，好奇地闻了闻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18323
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b56f3137:

    # "The smell is quite nice. Rather like mint, if you had to guess."
    "这味道真不错，要我说，有点像薄荷。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18325
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d298926c:

    # "But do you really feel like taking a sip?"
    "但你真想来上一口？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18327
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ae8df725_1:

    # "Nah..."
    "不想……"

# game/script day12.rpy:18332
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0e406687:

    # "You're not exactly in the mood to start drinking on your own, so you push the cork back in and tuck the bottle back under your shirt."
    "你现在也没啥心情独酌，把瓶塞重新塞好，又把酒瓶掖回了衬衫里头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18334
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_39f7b891:

    # "Did it really look that obvious?"
    "这么明显吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18336
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9ba99544:

    # "You look down at yourself and adjust your clothes this way and that, trying to hide the bump as best you can."
    "你低头打量自己，又是拉衣角又是拽下摆，想尽量把鼓起来的地方遮住。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18338
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fabf6234:

    # "It doesn't look {i}that{/i} obvious..."
    "应该没{i}那么{/i}明显吧…"

# game/script day12.rpy:18340
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_db04b97e:

    # "At least you think so."
    "你自己觉得是这样。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18342
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d5e75aa5:

    # "Well, it better not be, because you still have to get the bottle back to your hammock."
    "最好是别被看出来，还得把这瓶玩意儿弄回吊床去呢。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18351
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5719495f:

    # p "Wait!{w} Stay here."
    p "等等！{w} 你就在这儿待着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18359
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_42356d30:

    # "You hold his tail to stop him before you crawl out from under the boat yourself."
    "你一把抓住他的尾巴，阻止他乱动，自己先从船底下爬了出去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18361
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_9f38232b:

    # "With a swift motion, you unbutton your shirt and retrieve the wine bottle, hurling it into the sea in a wide arc without a second thought."
    "你麻利地解开衬衫扣子，拿出酒瓶，想都没想，直接在空中划出一道弧线，把它扔进了大海。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18368
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_11fb6117:

    # "It spins through the air as you step up to the gunwale and watch it plunge into the dark, churning water below. Turning back to Wolf, you earn an exasperated sigh from the black canine."
    "你走到船舷边，看着酒瓶在空中旋转着坠入下方黑暗翻涌的海水之中。转过身，看到的是Wolf无奈地叹了口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18370
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2aa84211:

    # p "There, no more bottle."
    p "喏，这下没瓶子了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18375
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f132357c:

    # "He doesn't even dignify you with a response, simply turning to make his way below deck, leaving you standing in the rain, now without the canine and without the wine."
    "他连搭理都懒得搭理你，直接转身朝下甲板走去，把你一个人丢在雨里，没酒，也没狗。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18377
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f7be4a24:

    # "You know better than to try to keep him around at this point."
    "你心里清楚，现在最好别想着留住他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18379
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_78d7c942:

    # "Though he's probably right."
    "不过，他说的可能也没错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18381
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_361360df:

    # "Getting rid of it was probably for the best. What were you even thinking in the first place? Haven't you had enough trouble already? Why risk it?"
    "扔了也好。你一开始到底是怎么想的？ 惹的麻烦还不够多吗？ 干嘛冒这个险？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18383
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_03596abd:

    # "Well...{w} It doesn't matter now."
    "算了…{w} 现在说这些也没用了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18385
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7ab4ce24:

    # "You follow him to escape the rain yourself and try to make the most of your remaining break."
    "你也赶紧跟着他去躲雨，抓紧时间，好好享受剩下的休息时间吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18391
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_cc51d444_1:

    # p "The passenger gave it to me."
    p "乘客给我的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18395
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_7624fde2_1:

    # w "Why would he?"
    w "他为什么要给你？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18397
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_585c3ac6_1:

    # p "Because I asked him."
    p "因为我问他要了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18401
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_52fbaa0a:

    # w "I get that. What I don't understand is why he'd just hand it over without a second thought?"
    w "我搞不懂他凭什么这么痛快就给你了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18403
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3599b7f9_1:

    # p "Well, Wolf, that's what people usually call {i}friendship{/i}. You should try it sometime. It's great—when you're in a bind, a {i}friend{/i} might be around to help you out."
    p "哎呀Wolf，人们通常把这叫作{i}友情{/i}。你真该找机会体验一回。这很棒的——当你身陷绝境时，会有一位{i}朋友{/i}挺身而出拉你一把。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18405
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_62b0a0aa_2:

    # "He narrows his eyes, scanning you briefly. You work hard to keep your expression neutral."
    "他眯起眼睛，飞快地扫视着你。 你努力保持面无表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18407
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3d163312_1:

    # w "Hilarious."
    w "真好笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18411
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_778c8342_1:

    # w "What kind of wine is it?"
    w "这是什么酒？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18413
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2c1237ab:

    # p "Says Chambertin on the label. But I don't know enough to know anything about it."
    p "瓶子标签上写着Chambertin，可惜我也不懂酒，看不出个所以然。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18415
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_2b55db68:

    # p "Do you want some or not?"
    p "想来点儿不？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18417
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_0e72b20e:

    # "You tilt your head and rest it lazily on your shoulder, waiting patiently for his response."
    "你歪着头，懒洋洋地靠在肩膀上，耐心地等他回话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18421
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_03188a45:

    # w "I'll pass. I'd rather not risk showing up three sheets to the wind while on watch."
    w "我还是算了吧，我可不想值班的时候醉醺醺的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18423
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_15319f43:

    # w "Not sure what the punishment would be, but I have no desire to find out."
    w "不知道会怎么罚，我可不想去试试。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18425
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_6a8c8616:

    # p "Really? Not even just a sip?"
    p "真的？ 一小口也不行？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18427
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5b8ad560:

    # "He hesitates, clearly mulling it over, but eventually shakes his head."
    "他犹豫了一下，明显是在考虑，但最后还是摇了摇头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18429
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_b40fb173:

    # w "I appreciate the offer, but no."
    w "谢了，不过我还是不喝了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18431
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_74e004d7_1:

    # p "I guess I can't do much more than ask."
    p "看来我也只能问问了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18433
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_aa369f3d:

    # "You move the bottle in your hand, watching the wine swirl in the dark glass. For a moment, you toy with the idea of opening it and trying a sip yourself."
    "你摆弄着手里的酒瓶，看着深色的酒液在瓶中摇曳。 有那么一瞬间，你很想打开尝一口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18435
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_87712b5e:

    # "But do you really feel like drinking right now?"
    "但你现在真的想喝酒吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18437
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ae8df725_2:

    # "Nah..."
    "不想……"

# game/script day12.rpy:18439
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_82890e2b_1:

    # p "You sure?"
    p "你确定？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18443
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f66fe157_1:

    # w "I said no..."
    w "说了不想就是不想……"

# game/script day12.rpy:18445
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_d32a19d6:

    # "You shrug, not exactly in the mood to drink alone and it doesn't sound like he is going to budge. Oh well, you gave it a shot and instead tuck the bottle back under your shirt."
    "你耸了耸肩，一个人独饮实在提不起兴致，而且他听起来毫无松口的迹象。好吧，好歹你尝试过了，于是把酒瓶重新塞回衬衫底下。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18449
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_dfdab410:

    # "Does it really look that obvious?"
    "这事儿看起来真有这么明显？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18451
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_74499779:

    # "You glance down, adjusting your clothes, trying to hide the bump as discreetly as possible."
    "你赶紧低头，拽了拽衣服，小心翼翼地想要遮掩住鼓起来的地方。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18453
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bac805c6_1:

    # "It doesn't look {i}that{/i} obvious... {w}At least you think so."
    "看起来没{i}那么{/i}明显…… {w}至少你是这么觉得的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18457
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_bad710a8_1:

    # w "Loosen your shirt more."
    w "再把领口拉开点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18461
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ab27b8a6_1:

    # "Following his advice, you pull your shirt out a little more, letting it hang more loosely around you."
    "你听他的，又扯了扯衬衫，让它松垮地挂着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18463
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_c40a4dd3_1:

    # "You respond while still fiddling with the fit, trying to hide the bottle."
    "你一边摆弄着衣领，一边含糊地应付着，想把酒瓶藏好。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18465
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_8631b911_1:

    # p "Like this? It's barely holding it up anymore."
    p "这样？感觉都要兜不住了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18467
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f393c613_1:

    # p "Look, if I move the wrong way, it'll fall out."
    p "我说，我稍微一动，它就要掉出来了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18469
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_5b594c1d_1:

    # "You turn your chest from side to side, demonstrating how precariously the bottle is tucked beneath your shirt."
    "你左右转了转身子，示意酒瓶就这么勉强地塞在衬衫里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18473
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_72b5f615_1:

    # w "Then be more careful and it won't."
    w "那就小心点，不就没事了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18475
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_f2b8ce83_1:

    # w "Next time, think ahead—wear an overcoat or a jacket."
    w "下次多动动脑子——套件长大衣或者夹克衫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18477
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_fd856198_1:

    # p "Well, that's hardly helpful right now, is it?"
    p "拜托，现在说这些有什么用？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18481
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_66af135a_1:

    # "He snorts, exhaling sharply through his nose."
    "他鼻子不是鼻子，眼睛不是眼睛地哼了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18483
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_339ebd03_1:

    # w "Are you planning on sneaking it back to your hammock?"
    w "你不会是想偷偷摸摸地把这玩意儿带回吊床吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18485
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_3bd82009:

    # p "No. If you're not interested, I'll take it to the first mate. That's why I got it in the first place."
    p "没事儿。你要是不想，我就给大副送去了。我一开始就是这么打算的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18487
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ac82e3f9_1:

    # p "I don't want to carry it around for too long—someone's bound to notice, and I'd rather avoid getting into more trouble."
    p "我可不想一直揣着这玩意儿到处晃悠——早晚会被人撞破的，我宁愿少惹点麻烦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18489
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_dafe2798_1:

    # w "And bribing the first mate isn't going to cause trouble?"
    w "贿赂大副就不会惹麻烦了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18491
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_354f872e_1:

    # "You give a casual shrug."
    "你无所谓地耸耸肩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18495
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_1011daf6_1:

    # p "You heard what Perce said—and it's all I have to go on."
    p "你也听到Perce说的话了——这是我唯一的突破口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18499
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e97e0127_1:

    # p "Perce mentioned it when I talked with him, and it's all I have to go on."
    p "Perce和我闲聊的时候提了一嘴，我也只能指望这个了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18501
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_82f4899d_1:

    # p "Wish me luck, I guess."
    p "祝我好运吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18505
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_934525f4_1:

    # "Wolf gives you a nod and shifts aside, making space for you to crawl out from under the jolly boat as gracefully as you can manage."
    "Wolf点了点头，挪开身子，让你尽可能体面地从救生艇底下爬出来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18511
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_13856cda:

    # "No amount of luck can ease the anxiety of actually confronting the first mate..."
    "再多的侥幸心理也无法驱散当面同大副交涉时那股令人窒息的焦虑……"

# game/script day12.rpy:18513
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_ad643128:

    # "An hour later you manage to go as far as to stand in front of the door, but you don't have it in you to actually knock."
    "一个小时后，你磨磨蹭蹭地站到了门前，可就是没胆儿敲下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18515
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_4d705b17:

    # "You just can't get your arm to move, no matter how hard you try."
    "使出吃奶的劲儿，胳膊也抬不起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18517
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_e7fe4713:

    # "What if this'll make it worse?"
    "要是弄巧成拙了咋办？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18519
translate Chinese day12_wolf_wine_09eac890:

    # "Instead you watch the day pass with the bottle sitting among your belongings."
    "你只能眼睁睁看着天黑，那瓶酒就扔在你的东西堆里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18558
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_ef5f4f99:

    # "You remember once, as a kitten, you stole some bread from Karl Frank, the neighborhood baker."
    "你记得小时候，你还是个小猫崽子的时候，从街口的面包师傅 Karl Frank 那儿偷了点面包。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18560
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_b17c3d50:

    # "You hadn't even meant to. It was out with the other rubbish, baked the day before and never sold."
    "其实也不是故意的。那是前一天卖剩下的，和垃圾堆在一块儿。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18562
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_96be1873:

    # "Hell, Karl probably {i}had{/i} thrown it away."
    "没准 Karl 他{i}早就{/i}扔了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18564
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c5f5267b:

    # "But the moment he saw you take the stale half-loaf, suddenly it was his again. He hadn't said anything, of course."
    "结果他一瞅见你叼走那半块硬面包，立马就又当成自己的了。当然，他啥也没说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18566
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_34c5de87:

    # "Later that evening, he stopped by, and without thinking about it you'd told your mother you had no idea what he was talking about."
    "傍晚的时候，他溜达了过来，你压根没过脑子，就跟你妈说不知道他在说啥。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18568
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_793f6f36:

    # "That wasn't wrong. The only memory you had was that you were no longer so achingly hungry."
    "你也没说谎。你只记得自己不饿了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18570
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_5efa81a0:

    # pb "Were you going to say anything, or just stare at me like an idiot?"
    pb "你打算说点啥，还是就搁那儿傻愣着？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18572
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_75d6189e:

    # "Karl came back the next day, with a constable. He described the outfit you were wearing, down to the unmended tear on the sleeve."
    "第二天 Karl 带着个巡警来了。他把你的穿着打扮描述了个遍，连袖子上没补好的口子都说了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18574
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_3a4804de:

    # "Feeling the constable's glare, his judgment, you thought you would never feel so trapped again in your life."
    "感觉到巡警的眼神，他那审视的目光，你觉得自己这辈子都没这么憋屈过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18576
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_60203cd8:

    # "You have the same feeling now."
    "你现在又是这感觉。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18584
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_af7b8d72:

    # p "You..."
    p "你..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18588
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_02a59c61:

    # pb "Yeah? Good job—we've established that there are two people talking..."
    pb "是吗？干得好——我们已经确认有两个人在说话……"

# game/script day12.rpy:18590
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_69876215:

    # p "I need your help."
    p "我想求你帮个忙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18594
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_7fd1dda4:

    # pb "So?"
    pb "所以呢？/那又怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18596
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_ced4d97a:

    # p "You said you had some alcohol. Something I could use to..."
    p "你不是说你有酒吗。我想弄点..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18598
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_177d9e62:

    # "From the way he's looking at you, Perce already knows exactly where this is going."
    "Perce 瞅你的眼神，就知道你打的什么主意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18600
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_f4714920:

    # "It's not even like he's playing coy; it's like he just wants to enjoy making you say it out loud."
    "他甚至不是在故作矜持，纯粹是享受着逼你亲口把那羞耻条件说出来的戏弄快感。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18602
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_819cca78:

    # "You sigh heavily."
    "你长叹一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18604
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_96e4652f:

    # p "Something I could use to bribe Arthur."
    p "我想用它来贿赂 Arthur。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18606
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c0240da3:

    # "The corner of his muzzle turns, ever so slightly, in a telling sneer."
    "他的嘴角微微一撇，带着点嘲讽。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18608
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_354cdadf:

    # pb "Oh, come now. I didn't say that. All I said was that you might want to smooth things over."
    pb "哎呀，得了吧。我可没那么说。我只是建议你最好把关节打通、把关系抹平。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18610
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_76f75041:

    # pb "Show you're a... a valued member of this crew."
    pb "好让别人知道你是个...是个对船队有用的人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18612
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_cf50b712:

    # p "Right. So let's talk... straight. What do you want from me in exchange? What would it take?"
    p "行吧。那咱们打开天窗说亮话。你想要啥好处？要我怎么做才行？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18614
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_7e458339:

    # pb "Hmm. What you're really asking is..."
    pb "嗯...你其实是想问..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18616
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_292584b7:

    # pb "What do I have to {i}offer{/i}?"
    pb "我手头能拿来{i}交换{/i}的有什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18618
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_13425e6b:

    # "A certain seaminess oozes off the jackal, almost as tangible as the smell of everyone on the {i}Conway{/i}, in such close quarters."
    "这只豺狼浑身散发着一股子猥琐劲儿，跟这挤成一团的“Conway号”号上，大伙儿身上的汗臭味儿都快一个味儿了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18620
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_cdd8dbfb:

    # "But different. More tawdry."
    "但又不太一样，更下作。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18622
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_7ae4291f:

    # p "You know what I'm offering, too."
    p "你也心知肚明我能给你什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18624
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_a7331368:

    # pb "Or maybe I've heard?"
    pb "还是说，我已经“听”说了什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18628
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_611e0363:

    # "You have to wonder if this is the way that you acquire a bit of a... {i}reputation{/i}."
    "你是不是寻思着，这就是你“挣”下这份...{i}名声{/i}的法子？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18630
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_a27e83c7:

    # "You didn't take Nomax for much of a gossip. Julian, on the other hand..."
    "你可别跟我说Nomax那家伙会嚼舌根。Julian嘛，那可说不准..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18632
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_77dee6c9:

    # p "Look, I... I don't know what you might've heard, Perce. But... you wouldn't {i}say{/i} anything, right?"
    p "听着，我...我不知道你都他娘的听了些什么，Perce。但是...你肯定不会{i}乱嚼舌根子{/i}吧，对不？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18636
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_3b777920:

    # pb "Me? My lips are sealed, kitten. Look at this muzzle."
    pb "我？我嘴严实的很，小乖乖。你瞅瞅我这张嘴。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18640
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_e8865bbd:

    # "He reaches up and pushes it closed theatrically."
    "他抬起手，做作地顺手将门一把合上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18642
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fafcfcaf:

    # "Then he looks at you, his brow arched, as if to ask: \"so, what do you want to do about it?\""
    "接着，他挑着眉毛看着你，那意思好像在问：“怎么样，你想怎么着啊？”"

# game/script day12.rpy:18646
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_b8aa792f:

    # p "I guess."
    p "知道了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18648
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_1784f6d0:

    # "What else can you do?"
    "还能怎么着？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18650
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_82fa611f:

    # p "Fine. It's just a simple trade, right?"
    p "行吧。就当是个简单的买卖，成了吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18652
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_be96c6ca:

    # "He gives an equally sneering chuckle."
    "他也跟着阴阳怪气地笑了两声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18654
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_e6fcf9b2:

    # pb "Yeah, sure. Hey, we're almost in port anyway. Gotta be worth some watered-down rum."
    pb "成啊，没问题。嘿，反正咱也快靠岸了。怎么着也值几杯掺水朗姆。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18658
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_0e64e445:

    # p "And you won't tell anyone?"
    p "你可不能跟别人瞎咧咧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18660
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_1bcc0b67:

    # pb "Nah."
    pb "放心，不会。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18662
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_f0cc4356:

    # "He pauses, as if to reconsider."
    "他顿了顿，好像又在盘算什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18666
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_1f87f6c3:

    # pb "Well. Maybe if you're {i}really{/i} good. But something tells me I ain't gonna be too surprised..."
    pb "没准你要是{i}真{/i}够厉害的话，我就...不过我估计也八九不离十..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18668
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_a6c384f0:

    # "Perce is not the kind of jackal you really intend to waste your best work on. You roll your eyes."
    "你可没打算在这种叫Perce的豺狼身上浪费手艺。你翻了个白眼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18670
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_711a9f13:

    # p "When?"
    p "什么时候？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18672
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_638561f6:

    # pb "Hey, time's a-wastin'. Ain't doin' anything now. And I bet there ain't nobody in the afterpeak, either."
    pb "嘿，别磨蹭了。反正你现在也没事儿。我跟你说，后舱肯定也没人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18676
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c7fb5aaa:

    # "Well, you think: it's a small ship. Gossip travels faster than any mail carriage back on land."
    "你心里犯嘀咕：这船就这么大点儿地方，八卦传得比陆地上的马车还快。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18678
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_781c92dc:

    # "On the other hand, you don't need {i}everyone{/i} talking."
    "但话说回来，你也不想让{i}人尽皆知{/i}啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18682
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_5ec6990c:

    # p "I have no idea what you've \"heard,\" Perce. But..."
    p "我根本不知道你‘听说’了些什么风声，Perce。但是……"

# game/script day12.rpy:18684
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_2cd037e5:

    # pb "Yes?"
    pb "是？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18686
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_83713bdd:

    # p "But if you can keep your muzzle closed, I can... open mine. How's that?"
    p "这样，你要是能把嘴闭紧点，我就能...让你好好乐呵乐呵。怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18690
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_858d2a70:

    # pb "Oh, that might be worth some watered-down rum..."
    pb "噢，那说不定还真值几杯掺水的朗姆..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18694
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_4c09dfd5:

    # "He leans back, as if he had to seriously consider the offer, although you suspect both of you knew it was never actually in doubt."
    "他往后一靠，装模作样地好像在认真考虑，其实你知道，他早就答应了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18696
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_ea0873d6:

    # p "If it was..."
    p "要是这样的话..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18698
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_db786283:

    # pb "I'm not doing anything now, am I, kitten? Neither are you. And I bet there ain't nobody in the afterpeak, either."
    pb "我现在闲着也是闲着，小乖乖，你也是。而且我敢说，后舱现在肯定没人。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18702
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_468e2fd2:

    # p "What? What do you mean?"
    p "什么？你这话什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18704
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fa984d99:

    # pb "Y'know, I don't even know why you feel like stickin' around, if you haven't learned that by now."
    pb "我说实话，要是你到现在还没摸清这层规矩，我真搞不懂你干嘛还非赖在船上不走。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18706
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_859b3cb6:

    # "He jerks his head towards the ship's stern."
    "他朝船尾用力一甩头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18710
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_7c055de0:

    # pb "The afterpeak hold. We stuff it full of ropes and other shit. Sometimes the officers try to hide some of their good stuff down there."
    pb "是艉舱。我们把那儿塞满了绳子和其他破烂玩意儿。有时候那些军官老爷会偷偷把他们的好东西藏到下面去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18712
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_3a7a934b:

    # pb "Not this time."
    pb "这次可没有。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18714
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_e7008226:

    # "You don't bother to ask how he knows that."
    "你懒得问他怎么知道这些的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18716
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c9c668af:

    # p "And it would be empty?"
    p "那里面应该是空的吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18718
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_10b60ec1:

    # pb "It's not {i}empty{/i}. We're just not going to have an audience."
    pb "没 {i}空{/i}着。只是不会有外人围观罢了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18724
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_e59f120e:

    # pb "Hell, I don't know. Maybe you want one. Get yourself some nice—whatcha call it? Word of mouth."
    pb "见鬼，我不知道。也许你想要观众呢。给自己弄点好听的——叫什么来着？口碑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18726
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fbb43c60:

    # "Well. He promised to stay quiet. You hope you can trust him."
    "好吧。他答应会闭紧嘴巴。但愿我能信得过他。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18728
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_aa25c465:

    # p "That's alright."
    p "没问题。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18732
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_4bbeb14b:

    # p "That sounds fine. I'd... prefer to avoid an audience, yes."
    p "听起来不错。我... 还是不想有观众，没错。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18736
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_8a8bde23:

    # "The jackal gives you the kind of smirk you expect you're about to see a lot more of."
    "那只豺狼露出了那种笑容，你估计以后会经常看到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18738
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_4c63a918:

    # pb "Hey, now. It's your future we're talking about, right? Don't look shocked, [name]."
    pb "嘿，我说。这可是你的前程，对吧？别那么吃惊 [name]。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18740
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_ecaa6872:

    # "You don't bother dignifying his tone with a reply, and Perce snickers."
    "你懒得搭理他那副腔调，Perce 就在一旁偷笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18742
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_24ccfc67:

    # pb "See, I remembered. C'mon, let's go."
    pb "瞧，我可一直记着呢。麻溜点，咱们走吧。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18746
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c53b4445:

    # "The jackal stares at you expectantly."
    "那只豺狼正眼巴巴地盯着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18748
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_2933855d:

    # pb "Yeah? You know my name. What do you want?"
    pb "喔？你知道我的名字啊。你想要什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18750
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_69876215_1:

    # p "I need your help."
    p "我想求你帮个忙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18752
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fc8cf9d9:

    # "Getting the words out only makes the sense of being trapped that much more acute."
    "话说出口，受困感就越发清晰。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18754
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_7fd1dda4_1:

    # pb "So?"
    pb "所以呢？/那又怎么样？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18756
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_eacc5d47:

    # p "You said you had some alcohol. You know, something I could use as..."
    p "你说你有些酒。你知道的，就...能让我用来..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18758
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_558692a8:

    # "The only thing that helps is that Perce is nowhere near as threatening as the constable. You know his type. You remember watching them gang up on the weaker kids, back at home."
    "还好，那个Perce没警官那么吓人。你了解他是什么货色。你记得小时候在家乡，他们是怎么以强凌弱的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18760
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_11b7167d:

    # "But, just like asking for his help, the words you need to say tighten like a snare around you."
    "可是，就像求他帮忙一样，想说的话就像被套索扼住了一样，怎么也说不出口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18764
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_0cfda79c:

    # p "As a bribe."
    p "当做贿赂吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18766
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_7e53b603:

    # "The jackal laughs raucously at that. It is not, you think, an especially pleasant laugh."
    "豺狼听了，发出一阵难听的笑声。你觉得这笑声真是让人不舒服。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18768
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_a67c9058:

    # pb "I didn't say anything like that."
    pb "我可没那么说。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18770
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_4f406c2c:

    # pb "I just said I knew how you might smooth things over. And hell, y'know... it's a long journey."
    pb "我只是说，我知道怎么能帮你把事情摆平。而且，你知道的……路途漫漫啊。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18772
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_579b68a5:

    # "He looks at you pointedly, almost leering."
    "他别有深意地看着你，脸上带着一种下流的笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18774
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_19af2c44:

    # pb "Some alcohol would definitely smooth things over, yeah. You arguing?"
    pb "要是能来点酒，事情肯定好办多了，是吧。你有什么意见吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18776
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_1abd1b81:

    # p "I'm not arguing, no. I'm just wondering what... what I'd need to do for it."
    p "我没意见。我只是想知道...我得做些什么才能换到。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18780
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_15e319a3:

    # "He leans back, looking over you like he was sizing up a hanging side of meat at a butcher's shop."
    "他向后一靠，就像屠夫在肉摊上挑肉一样把你上下打量。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18782
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_a9d9b394:

    # "It's not a gaze that makes you feel particularly like you're negotiating from a position of strength."
    "这种眼神，可不像是跟你平等谈判的样子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18784
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c95249fd:

    # "The tone of his voice only confirms it."
    "他那语气，就差直接写在脸上了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18788
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_27309e92:

    # pb "What's that mean?"
    pb "什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18792
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_2d0ee436:

    # pb "Oh. You mean your little... seamstress act? I heard about that one."
    pb "哦，你说你那点... 缝缝补补的把戏？我早听说了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18794
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_cc92f9c7:

    # p "Fine, then. Maybe you don't exactly need your clothes mended."
    p "行吧，看来你也不是非要我给你缝衣服。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18798
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_01926fdc:

    # pb "Or I can do it myself."
    pb "我自己也能缝。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18800
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_72dc9d57:

    # p "Or that. But..."
    p "或者那样。但是......"

# game/script day12.rpy:18802
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_973e6e69:

    # "You steel yourself; rally."
    "你深吸一口气，强迫自己冷静下来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18804
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_4edcf921:

    # p "I'm not {i}stupid{/i}. You wouldn't have mentioned it if it wasn't on the table, somehow. So: what would it take? What are you looking for?"
    p "我可不{i}傻{/i}。要不是事关重大，你犯得着跟我提这事儿？说吧，你想要什么？你到底在打什么算盘？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18806
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_202c0a3b:

    # pb "You to make it worth my while, that's all. You're not much for standing watch, of course. And those delicate little hands of yours..."
    pb "我要你拿出点让我心动的筹码，就这么简单。当然，你肯定不擅长站岗放哨。还有你那双娇滴滴的小手......"

# game/script day12.rpy:18810
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_f94a2d91:

    # "He looks at the way you favor yours."
    "他盯着你护着的那只手，眼神意味深长。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18812
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_03a64588:

    # pb "Well, maybe it's best we find something that spares 'em, what do you think?"
    pb "看来咱们得找点能让它们少受罪的活儿，你说对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18814
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c398411e:

    # p "My hands are... fine."
    p "我的手... 没事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18816
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_a31fd751:

    # "It still hurts, of course. Mostly, you're only protesting because the jackal's smirk is so grating."
    "疼肯定是疼的。我只是不想让你这只豺狼看笑话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18818
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fe5d8463:

    # "What in the hell does he want?"
    "他到底想干什么？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18820
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_21dc8312:

    # pb "Uh huh. Maybe we'll test that theory later. I don't want your hands, cat."
    pb "呵呵。没准咱们回头可以试试。我对你的手没兴趣，小猫。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18824
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_171a77b0:

    # p "What about them?"
    p "我的手怎么了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18826
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_6fba1af4:

    # "For a moment, he almost seems like he has some idea in mind, something less debauched than his demeanor would suggest."
    "有那么一瞬间，我甚至觉得他心里有点别的盘算，不像他表现出来的那么下流。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18828
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_371deff8:

    # "But then he shakes his head."
    "但他随即摇了摇头，打消了这个念头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18830
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_51ebd53d:

    # pb "They're nice, but not what I'm really after, y'know?"
    pb "长得是不错，但不是我想要的那种，懂吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18832
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_4ec3f9ed:

    # pb "Not like I'm going to slack off and let you handle the sails, either. So what else do you have?"
    pb "我又不可能自己偷懒让你去拉帆。说说吧，你还有什么能耐？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18836
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_69e2d528:

    # pb "Something I {i}can't{/i} do by myself."
    pb "有些事，我{i}自己{/i}做不了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18838
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_5ad27904:

    # p "And that isn't a needle and thread."
    p "别跟我说是缝衣服。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18842
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_9a392f39:

    # p "There must be something you want, right? Or some way I could be helpful?"
    p "你肯定有什么想要的吧？或者我能帮上什么忙？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18844
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_30ad6d33:

    # pb "You? Helpful?"
    pb "你？帮得上忙？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18846
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_b8a83e3c:

    # "You turn up your hands, abruptly aware that they're a long way from acquiring a sailor's callouses."
    "你摊开双手，这才意识到，这双手离水手的老茧还差了十万八千里。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18850
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_deaf8bd1:

    # "You're not exactly salivating at the thought of having to do much precise work with them. Your hand still hurts from where..."
    "要是真用它们干那些精细活儿，想想就头疼。而且这只手还疼着呢，因为......"

# game/script day12.rpy:18852
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_9850d5c1:

    # "...From where you, like an impulsive kid and not like an experienced crewman, chose to punch an inanimate, rather {i}sturdy{/i} object. How productive of you."
    "......因为你像个愣头青，不像个有经验的船员，一拳砸在了个{i}硬{/i}邦邦的玩意儿上。真是成事不足，败事有余。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18856
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_e19eeae9:

    # "He smirks."
    "他咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18858
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_83e5149d:

    # pb "Surely you can think of other ways to be useful, kitten."
    pb "你肯定能想到别的用处，小家伙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18860
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fb14cc64:

    # "And the jackal stares at you, again, until you finally realize what he's talking about."
    "豺狼又开始盯着你看，这次你终于明白他是什么意思了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18862
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fd5f55ba:

    # p "Oh."
    p "哦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18864
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_dd1c7ab8:

    # "The jackal's smirk twists into a sneering grin."
    "豺狼得意地坏笑，扭曲成一副嘲弄的狞笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18866
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_0e405c8f:

    # p "{i}Oh{/i}."
    p "{i}哦{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18868
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_6b3982c7:

    # pb "As I said: it's a long journey. Don't tell me you haven't considered it."
    pb "我早就说过，这可不是一朝一夕的事。别告诉我你压根就没考虑过。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18870
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_88292478:

    # p "And the audience? Where would we even..."
    p "那...客人怎么办？我们去哪儿找..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18872
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_8e3f7a9f:

    # pb "You don't got no imagination? What else you think the afterpeak is for?"
    pb "你脑子不好使吗？你以为船尾舱是干什么用的？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18874
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_bf567591:

    # "You tilt your head, uncertain if you've misunderstood him or if he's trying to make a joke."
    "你疑惑地歪着头，不知道是他话里有话，还是在跟你开玩笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18876
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_5f815775:

    # p "What do you mean?"
    p "你这话什么意思？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18878
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_5f5b7d82:

    # pb "The afterpeak hold. Might change in port, but right now we're just keeping some ropes there. Hell..."
    pb "后尖舱。等靠了港可能另有用处，不过现在那里只堆了些备用缆绳。见鬼……"
    # 译注: afterpeak hold（后尖舱），帆船最靠近船尾下方的狭窄水密隔舱。

# game/script day12.rpy:18880
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_06e4287a:

    # "Showing teeth, he leers at you."
    "他咧开嘴，色眯眯地盯着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18882
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_9634c70b:

    # pb "Worst that could happen is I gotta chase somebody else out first. But, now, I bet that little mouth of yours'll be worth it..."
    pb "顶多也就是我得先去把占地盘的别人撵出去罢了。不过眼下，我敢打赌你那张小嘴绝对值回票价……"

# game/script day12.rpy:18884
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_d3fb708a:

    # "Without intending to, you glance aft, towards the hatches that lead into the ship's holds."
    "你没来由地向后瞥了一眼，看向通往船舱的舱口。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18886
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_b1c92649:

    # pb "Hey, it's your future, [name]. You came to me, didn't you? Don't look so shocked."
    pb "嘿，[name]，这可是你的前程。是你自己来找我的，不是吗？别摆出这副吃惊的表情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18888
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_356037b1:

    # pb "Now, what are we waiting for?"
    pb "还在等什么呢？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18890
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_4b90b62a:

    # "You're not sure if you really like this. It's clear what he expects of you, but... are you really willing to sink this low?"
    "你开始有点不喜欢这样了。他想让你做什么，简直再明显不过了，可你...真要堕落到这个地步吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18892
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_2b191847:

    # "Is this the right moment to develop second thoughts? Do you even have another option?"
    "现在反悔还来得及吗？你还有别的选择吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18921
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_612f5395:

    # "With the hatch closed, only a faint sliver of daylight streams in through the deck prism."
    "随着舱盖合拢，仅有一缕微弱的天光透过甲板采光棱镜洒入幽暗的舱内。"
    # 译注: deck prism（甲板采光玻璃柱/甲板棱镜），嵌在帆船甲板上的厚玻璃棱镜，用于在无明火隐患下将自然光折射进下层暗舱。

# game/script day12.rpy:18927
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_b2b02829:

    # "You want to stay on the ship."
    "你想留在船上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18929
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_bb21ac27:

    # "Yes, of course you do. But you never thought you'd have to go this far for it."
    "是的，你当然想。可你从没想过，为了这个目标，你竟然要付出这么大的代价。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18931
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_55657829:

    # p "Uh, you know what, Perce..."
    p "那个，Perce..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18935
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_4709fadc:

    # "He perks up, his grin fading as he senses where this is going."
    "他一听这话，立刻来了精神，脸上的笑容也渐渐消失，似乎已经猜到了你要说什么。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18937
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_2cd037e5_1:

    # pb "Yes?"
    pb "是？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18939
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_821aa492:

    # pb "Don't tell me you're getting cold feet."
    pb "别告诉我你现在想打退堂鼓了？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18941
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_9cb47f99:

    # pb "You're getting cold feet..."
    pb "你想打退堂鼓了..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18943
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_2f79a62a:

    # "He shrugs theatrically, leaning back against the wood behind him."
    "他夸张地耸耸肩，向后靠在木板上。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18945
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_89d469b3:

    # pb "Well, if you have the desire to explore Morocco a little longer, just don't come crawling back to me when you change your mind again."
    pb "行啊，要是你那么渴望在摩洛哥多晃荡几天，等哪天改了主意可别哭丧着脸爬回来求我。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18947
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_f2a8caee:

    # pb "This is a one-time offer, kid."
    pb "机会只有一次，小子。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18949
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_6102ffa2:

    # "You swallow and nod meekly. You'd rather take your chances with anything but {i}this{/i}."
    "你咽了口唾沫，有气无力地点点头。你宁愿冒任何风险，也不想{i}这样{/i}。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18951
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_d474a6c5:

    # "Perce waves you off with an annoyed shake of his head as you leave the jackal behind as you make your way across the deck."
    "在你转身穿过甲板离开时，身后的豺狼不耐烦地摇了摇头朝你挥手打发。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18953
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_1ec70c1e:

    # "The question now is... was that really a good idea?"
    "现在的问题是……这真算得上是个明智的主意吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18955
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_dc9b5eac:

    # "Now you're left here empty-handed, with your problem still looming on the horizon."
    "眼下你两手空空呆立在原地，头顶悬着的危机却依旧挥之不去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18957
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_bc536097:

    # "You suppose you can always get back to Sam and do it the old fashioned way. {i}If{/i} that could ever prove enough for Arthur."
    "你想着大不了回Sam那儿按老规矩办。{i}假如{/i}那招在Arthur面前真能奏效的话。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18959
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_9ceae96e:

    # "Otherwise... Alcohol... Alcohol... surely Perce can't be the only one on this ship who has something."
    "不然呢...除了Perce，难道船上就他有酒吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18969
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_78079a15:

    # "Easier said than done..."
    "说起来容易做起来难..."

# game/script day12.rpy:18971
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_94040a3b:

    # "You know his cabin, but actually overcoming the anxiety to confront him is a completely different challenge."
    "你知道他住哪个舱，但要鼓起勇气去找他对峙，完全是另一码事。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18973
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_ad643128:

    # "An hour later you manage to go as far as to stand in front of the door, but you don't have it in you to actually knock."
    "一个小时后，你磨磨蹭蹭地站到了门前，可就是没胆儿敲下去。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18975
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_4d705b17:

    # "You just can't get your arm to move, no matter how hard you try."
    "使出吃奶的劲儿，胳膊也抬不起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18977
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_e7fe4713:

    # "What if this'll make it worse?"
    "要是弄巧成拙了咋办？"

# game/script day12.rpy:18979
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_71fb3fc4:

    # "Instead you watch the day pass, worrying about what comes next."
    "于是你只能眼睁睁看着时光流逝，为接下来的命运忧心忡忡。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18993
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_7a11e752:

    # "You halt your steps as you discard one idea after the other."
    "你停下脚步，脑子里否决了一个又一个主意。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18995
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_2bda9ff2:

    # "None of them seem to be the solution. You needed this bottle."
    "似乎没有一个能解决问题。你需要这瓶酒。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18997
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_522a7959:

    # "Turning once again you hurry around the corner and back to him. By now Perce looks visibly annoyed, thin eyes glaring back at you."
    "你再次转身，匆匆绕过拐角，回到他身边。现在Perce看起来非常恼火，细长的眼睛 злобно 瞪着你。"

# game/script day12.rpy:18999
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_e96cecea:

    # pb "Did you not listen to what I {i}just{/i} said?"
    pb "你没听见我{i}刚才{/i}说的吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19001
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_f8da750a:

    # pb "One-{w}time{w} offer."
    pb "仅此{w}一次的{w}特价。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19003
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_3c48757c:

    # p "Perce, come on. It was an honest mistake. I thought..."
    p "Perce，别这样。那纯粹是无心之过。我以为……"

# game/script day12.rpy:19005
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_459cb9fb:

    # pb "I know what you thought. I just don't care."
    pb "我知道你是怎么想的。但我就是他妈的不在乎。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19007
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_f962868d:

    # p "I'll do what you asked, Perce. Without complaints."
    p "我会照你说的做，珀西。毫无怨言。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19009
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c6ea290e:

    # "He disregards what you say and instead makes a show of adjusting the cuffs of his breeches, neatly undoing some of the folds that developed on them."
    "他对你的话置若罔闻，反而慢条斯理地理了理马裤的裤脚，细致抚平上面的褶皱。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19011
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_eb6a0ec9:

    # pb "The deal is off."
    pb "交易告吹。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19013
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_11883a21:

    # p "Perce, please. I don't think I have any alternative."
    p "Perce，算我求你。我实在没别的办法了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19015
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_b5a15c4e:

    # pb "Should have thought of that before, shouldn't you?"
    pb "早该想到的，不是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19017
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_61b24c5c:

    # pb "But you know what, I like you. You've got something about yourself. Maybe it is your clumsiness? Or that cute, cute face of yours?"
    pb "不过说真的，我挺喜欢你的。你身上有股劲儿。可能是你那股傻气？或者你这张人见人爱的脸？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19019
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_9122f485:

    # "You feel the wave of relief that washes through you as it sounds like he's reconsidering his stance."
    "听起来他好像在重新考虑自己的立场，你感到一股轻松感涌上心头。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19021
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_bf656a47:

    # p "Oh, thank you, Perce."
    p "哦，谢谢你，Perce。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19023
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_d6599d63:

    # "He raises his hand to halt your eagerness."
    "他举起手来阻止你的热情。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19025
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_519dea2f:

    # pb "Ah—I like you, but we are only doing this under one condition. Unfortunately for you, the price has just increased."
    pb "啊——我挺中意你的，但要干成这桩买卖只有一个条件。对你来说不幸的是，现在的要价刚刚翻番了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19027
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_72be5cd4:

    # pb "Demand seems to be high."
    pb "需求似乎很高。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19029
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_178c1bf6:

    # "He drags out the words with an awfully smug smirk."
    "他用一种非常自鸣得意的假笑拖长了语调。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19031
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_0ec7117f:

    # "You barely even dare to ask."
    "你都不敢问，是吗？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19033
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_9a1e7786:

    # p "By how much?"
    p "涨了多少？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19035
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_14ecb790:

    # pb "It's about doubled. If you want it, we'll go now, and on top of that I'll have free access to you on another day."
    pb "价格差不多涨了一倍。要是你想要，咱们现在就过去，除此之外改天我还得额外享受你一整天。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19037
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_8f3241f2:

    # p "What?!"
    p "哈？！"

# game/script day12.rpy:19039
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_2b16c6a7:

    # pb "You heard me. I get to make the call when I like, and you come by with a damn spring in your step and a smile across your muzzle."
    pb "听明白了？老子想上你的时候就上你，你他妈的就得夹着尾巴，笑嘻嘻地滚过来伺候。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19041
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_b0a62496:

    # pb "Though I guess you do look just as cute when you're hesitant."
    pb "不过说真的，你扭扭捏捏的样子也挺带劲的。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19043
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_dc921eda:

    # "He leers at you, his smirk growing ever larger, and you hate it with every fiber of your being."
    "他色眯眯地斜睨着你，嘴角的奸笑愈发肆无忌惮，这让你浑身上下每一个毛孔都感到由衷的厌恶。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19045
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c788da4e:

    # "But you feel like you have no other choice..."
    "但你觉得自己别无选择..."

# game/script day12.rpy:19047
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_74bda7ed:

    # pb "Well, get to it then. You don't have to be into it, just get me off."
    pb "那就别他妈的废话了，赶紧的。不用你投入感情，给老子泻火就行。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19049
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_cee9dcbb:

    # p "Fine..."
    p "行吧..."

# game/script day12.rpy:19051
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_612f5395_1:

    # "With the hatch closed, only a faint sliver of daylight streams in through the deck prism."
    "随着舱盖合拢，仅有一缕微弱的天光透过甲板采光棱镜洒入幽暗的舱内。"
    # 译注: deck prism（甲板采光玻璃柱/甲板棱镜），嵌在帆船甲板上的厚玻璃棱镜，用于在无明火隐患下将自然光折射进下层暗舱。

# game/script day12.rpy:19056
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_e04ccc99:

    # "It's enough to illuminate Perce, though, and the expectant look he's giving you."
    "不过，这足够你看清Perce那充满期待的眼神了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19060
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_f91a1307:

    # "He unfastens his pants, and the loose fabric falls away. The fur of his thighs is coarse, but less nicked than his arms."
    "他解开了裤子，宽松的布料顺势滑落。大腿上的毛发很扎手，但比胳膊上的伤疤要少。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19062
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_f4833e89:

    # "That's not what you really need to focus on, though. The tawny fur of the canine's sheath looks much softer. Velvety."
    "不过，现在还不是想这些的时候。那玩意儿包皮上的黄褐色绒毛看起来柔软多了，像天鹅绒一样细腻。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19064
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_5acb47aa:

    # "The bit of slick, pink-and-black flesh already poking from it provides a characteristically obscene punctuation to the scene. Perce snorts at your hesitation."
    "从衣缝间探出的那点粉黑相间、湿漉漉的嫩肉，为这副光景增添了一记绝妙而下流的注脚。看着你的迟疑，Perce从鼻子里冷哼了一声。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19066
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_05070340:

    # pb "Your idea. I'm sure I don't have to give you step-by-step instructions about that, too."
    pb "这是你出的主意。我想不用我手把手教你怎么做吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19068
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_ccf0ebab:

    # p "No. I... know what I'm doing."
    p "不。我...知道该怎么做。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19070
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_7e5260a6:

    # pb "Yeah? Experienced, I bet. Make it worth my while, then, eh?"
    pb "真的？经验很丰富嘛。让我好好享受享受，嗯？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19072
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_44ad526e:

    # "The jackal's chuckle is not especially mirthful. Nor is the smirk he gives you when you settle down on your knees."
    "这只胡狼的笑声听不出什么愉悦。当你跪在他面前时，他脸上也只有一股得意的坏笑。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19076
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_62f3279e:

    # "The {i}Conway{/i}'s timbers seem to creak more loudly; with the next roll, you have to put out a hand to steady yourself."
    "{i}Conway{/i}号的船身似乎发出更大的吱嘎声；随着船身摇晃，你不得不伸手扶住甲板，稳住身形。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19080
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_cd5b65a7:

    # pb "Careful, now."
    pb "小心点，别摔着了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19082
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_36805b32:

    # pb "And watch the teeth, mind."
    pb "还有，注意你的牙。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19086
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_94e62535:

    # "Over the last few weeks, you've gotten used to the smell of the ship."
    "这几个星期下来，你已经习惯了船上的味道。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19088
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_856db10f:

    # "All those men, working in close quarters... leagues from shore, a change of clothes, a bathhouse..."
    "这么多男人挤在狭小的空间里劳作……远离海岸，没有换洗的衣服，也没有澡堂……"

# game/script day12.rpy:19090
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c67a2861:

    # "But with the jackal's pants unbuttoned and around his knees, and your nose inches from his crotch..."
    "但现在，胡狼的裤子已经褪到膝盖，你的鼻子几乎要贴到他的裆部……"

# game/script day12.rpy:19106
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_1dfed1b3:

    # pb "You know you do gotta put in the work, right?"
    pb "你知道得卖力点才行，对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19108
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_13f6ccd8:

    # "His drawl is unconcerned, superior, as if he was above it all."
    "他的腔调漫不经心、高高在上，仿佛一切都在他的股掌之间。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19110
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_b3c46efb:

    # "But then, he's already started to stiffen from his sheath, and his downward glance has a certain... hunger."
    "但他的家伙事已经开始硬起来了，而且他往下看的眼神里带着一丝...渴望。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19112
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_9826acd8:

    # "You lean forward, and run your tongue along the bit of exposed flesh he's showing. The taste is salty. Slightly bitter."
    "你向前凑近，用舌尖轻舔着他露出的部分。味道是咸的，带着淡淡的苦涩。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19114
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_ced984f9:

    # "Not altogether unpleasant."
    "倒也不算难受。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19116
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fb8e967c:

    # "You lap him again, watching him swell before your eyes, pulse by pulse, as you become less tentative."
    "你再次舔舐，注视着它在你眼前一点点胀大，一下一下地跳动着，你也不再那么拘谨。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19118
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_0981b214:

    # pb "Fuck..."
    pb "靠..."

# game/script day12.rpy:19120
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_88d8de43:

    # "He gasps, and you can hear his teeth grit with his tense exhalation, as the texture of your tongue works over him."
    "他倒吸一口凉气，你能听见他咬紧牙关，随着你的舌尖拂过，他紧张地呼出一口气。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19122
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_c8e83a6c:

    # "He {i}has{/i} to be fully hard now, you're sure of it. Perce twitches, and his scent intensifies with a trickle of slick, clear liquid running from the tip of his shaft."
    "他现在{i}肯定{/i}完全硬了，你无比确信。Perce颤抖了一下，一股滑腻的液体从顶端渗出，他的气味也变得更加浓烈。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19124
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_e817f481:

    # "It's the same taste as before, just more of it, gradually filling your senses."
    "还是之前的味道，只不过更加浓郁，渐渐充斥着你的感官。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19158
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_993c0bf9:

    # "You know the jackal doesn't really care about you, exactly. You know there's going to be consequences, later."
    "你知道这只豺狼并不真的在乎你，确切地说。你知道以后会有后果。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19159
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_55df469b:

    # "But at the same time, if you {i}are{/i} committed to it, you don't have to make yourself suffer."
    "但与此同时，如果你{i}确实{/i}决定要做，也不必让自己受苦。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19160
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fe6a60ae:

    # "Especially if you're going to have to do this again... there's no harm in enjoying yourself—right?"
    "尤其是如果你以后还得再做一次……让自己享受一下也无妨——对吧？"

# game/script day12.rpy:19161
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fb47df24:

    # "You clean Perce's length a little more slowly than you really need to—taking your time. Savoring it."
    "你清理珀西那物的速度比实际需要的更慢——不慌不忙。品味着它。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19164
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_fb47df24_1:

    # "You clean Perce's length a little more slowly than you really need to—taking your time. Savoring it."
    "你舔弄清理Perce柱身的速度比实际需要的慢得多——好整以暇，细细品尝着。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19170
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_113371ba:

    # pb "Alright, kitten. Time to- "
    pb "好啦，小猫咪。该... "

# game/script day12.rpy:19178
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_41ef6a3b:

    # "A slow, dragging lick, all the way from his bunched sheath to that drooling tip, is enough to send him back into growling silence."
    "你用舌头从他紧实的包皮根部一路慢条斯理地舔到前端那湿淋淋的顶端，这足以让他再次陷入压抑的低吼。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19180
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_7a7fbde0:

    # "You glance upwards. His eyes are shut. He can't see your grin."
    "你抬眼望去，他的眼睛紧闭着，看不到你的笑容。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19182
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_8ce0f218:

    # "But you figure it's time to take things the rest of the way, anyhow."
    "但你觉得也该进行到下一步了。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19190
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_413f3a55:

    # "Carefully, mindful of your teeth, you settle your lips over him, and start to suck gently."
    "你小心翼翼地，注意着自己的牙齿，用唇含住他，轻轻地吮吸起来。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19196
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_bb6f0dd2:

    # "And then, when Perce gives you a hoarse groan, a little less gently."
    "然后，当Perce发出低哑的喘息时，再粗暴一点。"

# game/script day12.rpy:19198
translate Chinese day12_perce_alcohol_2ba75b33:

    # "You bob your head, taking more of him into your muzzle each time. He is a mouthful, after all. But you're sure you can manage."
